window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1601,"title":"Chapter 1601 - 841: The Choice","paragraphs":["This Brother Ma, indeed has some issues.","The Evil God aura on him originally was acquired aboard the Rouge Boat.","Is the \"Young Master\" Hua Ruyu mentioned this Brother Ma?","Mo Hua thought for a moment and shook his head.","This Brother Ma probably doesn’t qualify...","Based on his status, he probably doesn’t match the identity of a Young Master.","On the other side, Hua Ruyu said something else to Brother Ma, who nodded and then turned to leave.","Hua Ruyu pondered for a moment and cautiously looked around before walking in another direction.","The two of them went left and right, in opposite directions.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and didn’t follow Hua Ruyu, instead choosing the path Brother Ma took, quietly following him.","Brother Ma, tall and thin, walked like the wind, but his alertness was not high, and he did not notice someone secretly following him.","He probably never imagined that given the heavy fog and the secretive nature of the Rouge Boat, someone else could mingle in.","After a moment of walking, Brother Ma came to a secret chamber.","After a brief moment of thought, he knocked on the door.","After a while, the door opened, Brother Ma went in, and closed the door behind him.","Time was tight, and Mo Hua couldn’t clearly see who was inside the room.","But this was not a problem for him.","Climbing windows, breaking formations, and eavesdropping were things he had done twice before, and it was just another repeat now.","Mo Hua skillfully climbed outside the window, repeating his old tricks, and soon could see and hear the situation in the room.","This secret chamber was different from before.","The room where Hua Ruyu and Senior Sister Qianqian were held was all pink, clearly a boudoir.","But this secret chamber had an elegant layout, more like a study.","All around were landscape ink screens, blue and white porcelain, freehand paintings, and plain rugs; there was a tea table in the middle of the room.","At this moment, a man was sitting at the table.","This man, wearing an elegant yellow robe, had an upright build, sword-like brows and starry eyes, with a composed demeanor.","At first sight, Mo Hua sighed silently in his heart.","He recognized this man again.","A direct lineage member of the Tai’a Sect, among the outstanding disciples of his year, highly reputable, and also the immediate elder brother of Little Wood’s...","Ouyang Feng.","Mo Hua had a good relationship with him, always calling him \"Senior Brother Feng\". When he first entered the Taixu Gate, it was Ouyang Feng, with profound cultivation, who led him in earning rewards and accumulating merit points.","Mo Hua felt somewhat conflicted in his heart and his gaze grew a little heavy.","\"Senior Brother Feng is actually on the Rouge Boat...\"","Brother Ma entered the room, walked straight to Ouyang Feng, and sat down without a word.","Ouyang Feng ignored him, and Brother Ma didn’t mind.","The room fell silent for a moment, and after a while, Brother Ma spoke, \"Everything’s arranged.\"","He placed a jade token on the table and slowly pushed it in front of Ouyang Feng, \"The person is in the room, this is the secret order to open the door.\"","Ouyang Feng did not take the jade token or look at Brother Ma and continued drinking tea silently, his expression blank.","Brother Ma sighed, \"Brother Feng, this is a good thing. We have the bond of being in the same sect, our ties are not shallow, how could I harm you?\"","Ouyang Feng suddenly looked up, his gaze sharp, and sneered, \"You still remember the bond of the same sect?\"","Brother Ma said, \"Brother Feng, this is all for your own good. Others want to board this ship, enter this circle, or be part of that Pavilion, but they don’t have the qualifications.\"","\"Even if they exhaust themselves begging everywhere, the Young Masters wouldn’t spare them a glance.\"","\"But Brother Feng, you’re different. The Young Masters value you, they invited you with all means, giving you this opportunity to enter the circle, into the inner sanctum. In the future, you might become a member of the ’Young Masters’ Pavilion.’","Ouyang Feng showed a look of disdain.","Brother Ma sighed, \"Brother Feng, I know you have integrity, but what use is integrity? Can integrity exchange for Spirit Stones? Can it revive the sect?\"","\"Others may not understand, but Brother Feng, you should know that the Young Masters’ Pavilion isn’t just an ordinary organization for the young masters of families and sect disciples to entertain themselves.\"","\"This Young Masters’ Pavilion has existed for a very long time. In almost every generation of disciples at the Qian Learning State Boundary, many Heaven’s Chosen Sons have entered this ’Pavilion,’ becoming Young Masters.\"","\"Now, these former Young Masters have long since left the sect, entering various great families, great sects, upper echelons of the Taoist Court Official, and even the core of the Taoist Court.\"","\"Their cultivation is at least Golden Core, with many having achieved Feather Transformation, and some even possibly reaching Heaven Void...\"","\"What a tremendous help this is!\"","Brother Ma said in a deep voice.","\"Brother Feng, as long as you join this circle, you’ll open a pathway to the true upper echelons of the Cultivation World. Our Tai’a Sect will also be considered ’one of our own’ by the Young Masters, receiving care from all sides. You and the Tai’a Sect will both prosper.\"","\"And with Brother Feng’s current status, once you take over as the sect leader of Tai’a Sect, and seize some opportunities, allowing Tai’a Sect to progress further and grow, directly advancing to the Four Great Sects is not impossible.\"","\"The success or failure of an individual, the rise and fall of the sect, all lie within your Thought, Brother Feng.\"","Brother Ma’s expression was fervent, and his tone a little excited.","Ouyang Feng remained unmoved.","Seeing this, Brother Ma sighed and his voice grew a bit colder:","\"Conversely, if Brother Feng doesn’t appreciate favors, doesn’t enter this circle, naturally, you’ll be an ’outsider,’ and consequently, the Tai’a Sect too will face exclusion in all respects. In the future, even if you become the sect leader of Tai’a Sect, you’ll undoubtedly be single-handedly fighting alone, restricted in every action.","\"Moreover, not only that, if you stubbornly go your own way, not only you, but even your family and friends around you might face unexpected dangers...\""]},{"number":1602,"title":"Chapter 1602 - 841: The Choice (2)","paragraphs":["Ouyang Feng’s gaze turned cold, \"Is this a threat?\"","\"This is not a threat,\" Brother Ma shook his head, \"It’s a fact, like your good brother who is dull-witted but easily trusts others...\"","Ouyang Feng’s eyes were as sharp as a sword, exuding traces of killing intent.","\"Was it your hand in the last incident? Did you send Little Wood to the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons?\"","\"You truly cannot fool Brother Feng,\" Brother Ma smiled slightly, not denying it, \"But Brother Feng, you should be clear that it’s fortunate I acted, so I can still remember some old ties. If it had been someone else, Junior Brother Mu would likely have met a bad end by now.\"","Ouyang Feng said nothing, just looked coldly at Brother Ma.","Brother Ma paused for a moment, then sincerely advised:","\"Brother Feng, the power of the Young Masters’ Pavilion is too great and fathomless, even you don’t know exactly what figures are inside. Any Elder, Supervisor, or Taoist Court Inspector you encounter might secretly be from the Young Masters’ Pavilion. If they truly target you, you won’t be able to defend against it.\"","Ouyang Feng’s face looked increasingly unpleasant, \"So, even the legitimate lineage from Hundred Flower Valley, you dare to touch?\"","Brother Ma said helplessly, \"Her situation... is somewhat special. Originally, we didn’t dare to act against her, but she was unaware of her own good fortune and fell into this quagmire herself. We can’t be blamed for it. Furthermore, this is the fate between you two...\"","Brother Ma glanced at Ouyang Feng, \"You two are familiar, your family statuses match, and you are a talented pair. In this Rouge Boat, it just happens to serve as your ’bridal chamber’ for sealing the union.\"","\"As for parental orders and the words of matchmakers, these formalities can be arranged later.\"","\"After tonight, you will be a perfect match, and the Ouyang and Hua families will certainly be pleased to see it happen.\"","Ouyang Feng appeared indifferent, \"Qianqian and I have known each other since childhood, I only see her as a sister, and I don’t want to harm her.\"","\"How can this be harm?\" Brother Ma frowned, \"With a groom like Brother Feng, she should be delighted, how do you know she doesn’t secretly wish for it?\"","\"Those who know the times are wise, Brother Feng, why be so stubborn...\"","No matter how he spoke, Ouyang Feng remained determined, unmoved.","Seeing he could not sway him, Brother Ma said helplessly, \"Fine... \"","He shook his head and placed a Pill on the table, \"I know you have reservations, so I specially prepared this Pill for you.\"","\"Take this Pill, and you’ll forget everything, without any worries, surrendering your mind and body to instinct, and enjoying the night.\"","\"Upon waking tomorrow, you’ll have a Golden Jade Marriage, limitless prospects, and many ’like-minded’ Taoist Friends...\"","\"Like-minded?\" Ouyang Feng sneered, \"More like to wallow in the mire together, right?\"","\"It doesn’t matter,\" Brother Ma said, \"In this world, what justice is there really? As long as people come together, they all seek their own interests, and so-called like-mindedness is merely wallowing in the mire together.\"","Ouyang Feng was slightly angry.","Seeing this, Brother Ma lost patience, his attitude gradually cooled, and he said lightly:","\"Brother Feng, don’t blame me for not reminding you, the Young Master favors you, but you aren’t indispensable.\"","\"The matter with Junior Sister Hua is the same, if you don’t want to be the ’groom’ tonight, naturally someone else will step in.\"","\"A legitimate daughter of the Great Sect, with good talent, looks, pure as jade.\"","\"Such beauty, who knows how many desire her, such an opportunity, who knows how many vying for it.\"","\"Listen to me, take the Pill and do what’s needed, it benefits everyone, otherwise...\"","Brother Ma coldly laughed, \"This delicate flower might be picked by someone else, enduring who knows how much humiliation tonight.\"","Ouyang Feng’s face turned pale.","\"I’ll give you an hour to consider it, swallow the Pill, and everything will naturally fall into place, or else you will regret it for a lifetime.\"","After speaking, Brother Ma turned and left.","Inside the room, only Ouyang Feng was left.","He sat desolately at the tea table, staring at the Pill on the table, as if he’d lost his soul.","He knew in his heart, tonight’s matter was a \"pledge of allegiance.\"","As long as he took this Pill, from now on he would walk down another path, one he could never return from.","Seemingly glamorous but corrupt.","Seemingly with bright prospects but devoid of righteousness, betraying his own heart, reduced to a dog, doing unclean things for others all his life.","How can one without a Taoist Heart ever ascend the Great Dao?","Ouyang Feng’s mood grew increasingly bitter.","But if he does not take it...","The gigantic Young Masters’ Pavilion, numerous unknown dangers, the revival of the Sect, the safety of his relatives, and Junior Sister Qian...","One after another, each weighed upon Ouyang Feng’s heart.","Ouyang Feng’s face grew even paler, his originally rigid back bent slightly.","He is Heaven’s Chosen Son, bearing the expectations of the Sect and his parents, normally maintaining the role of \"Big Senior Brother,\" caring for his peers, nurturing Junior Brothers and Sisters.","Starting from childhood, he resolved to carry the revival of the Sect upon his shoulders.","But he is also just a youth of twenty-five or six, burdened with too many expectations and responsibilities, he too feels exhausted and unable to cope, yet he cannot express them.","Now, matters of the Young Masters’ Pavilion weigh upon his heart, leaving him powerless, even unable to reveal a hint of it to others.","This matter feels like the last straw crushing his heart.","Ouyang Feng’s mindset began to gradually collapse.","Meanwhile, the faint aura of the Evil God permeating around began to exploit the void, corroding his will, clouding his Taoist Heart."]},{"number":1603,"title":"Chapter 1603 - 841: Choice (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Ouyang Feng’s eyes, unknowingly, began to turn slightly red.","His expression was numb, yet tears unknowingly streamed down from the corners of his eyes.","\"Forget it... there’s no escape...\"","Perhaps this is all fate...","Ouyang Feng let out a bitter laugh, tightly closed his eyes, his expression filled with despair. Then he opened his eyes, and with trembling hands, picked up the Pills on the table and slowly brought them to his mouth...","The redness in his eyes deepened.","His Taoist Heart was gradually becoming obscured, and his state of mind was slowly crumbling...","The Evil God’s desires were slowly taking root.","Just at this moment, a crisp voice sounded.","\"Senior Brother Feng...\"","This voice was like a clear spring, flowing through his heart, bringing him a touch of Clarity.","Ouyang Feng was startled, his hand stopped mid-motion while taking the pills.","He was dazed for a moment before looking around, but no one was there, causing Ouyang Feng’s brows to furrow slightly.","\"I seemed to hear a voice... who is calling me ’Senior Brother Feng’?\"","This voice was very pleasant and familiar, a bit like...","Junior Brother Mo?","Ouyang Feng bitterly smiled and shook his head.","Even at a time like this, I can hear Junior Brother Mo calling out to me.","But I have fallen into depravity, strayed from the path, and am no longer worthy of being called ’Senior Brother’ by him.","Ouyang Feng’s expression was bitter, and he continued to take the Pills.","\"Senior Brother Feng!\"","Mo Hua called out again.","But this time, his voice seemed to be blocked by layers of mist, not reaching Ouyang Feng’s ears at all.","In Ouyang Feng’s ears, it seemed as if the Evil God’s Evil Thoughts were acting as a barrier, deepening the redness in his eyes.","And just at that moment, sword light flashed in Mo Hua’s eyes.","A pure golden beam of light pierced directly through the mist, breaking the Evil Thoughts, and shone into Ouyang Feng’s eyes.","Ouyang Feng felt as if his Divine Soul had been lightly pricked by a sword, causing a stinging pain, but it was followed by an even more thorough Clarity.","It was as if a drowsy person had suddenly awakened.","The shadows in his eyes disappeared, and the murkiness around his ears dissipated as well.","A crisp voice became clearer.","\"Senior Brother Feng, it’s me!\"","Upon hearing this, Ouyang Feng’s heart trembled, and he suddenly stood up. After looking around, he gazed outside the window.","There was a small hole in the window, which had been cut even larger.","Outside the hole, there was a pair of glittering eyes.","Ouyang Feng’s heart was shaken. Could it really be...","\"Junior Brother Mo?!\"","Mo Hua hurriedly shushed him and then whispered, \"Open the door a crack and let me in.\"","Ouyang Feng paused for a moment, then dumbly nodded his head.","He went to the door, saw that no one was outside, and quietly opened it a crack.","A moment later, the crack automatically widened, as if an invisible figure had entered the room.","Ouyang Feng closed the door, turned around, and saw Mo Hua sitting nonchalantly at the tea table, pouring himself a cup of tea from a clean cup.","Ouyang Feng’s thoughts were a bit scattered; he stood there for a while, unable to comprehend before finally asking in confusion:","\"Junior Brother Mo, how... are you here? Did those gentlemen also invite you?\"","Mo Hua slowly sipped some tea, shaking his head with a sigh:","\"I would have liked them to invite me, but they didn’t. I even offered to pay, but they wouldn’t let me on their ship. I found another way and snuck on by myself.\"","\"Then you...\"","\"That’s a long story, and time is tight now, so let’s not talk about it,\" Mo Hua said.","Ouyang Feng was slightly dazed, then he nodded his head.","He then realized that since Mo Hua had been on the ship for a while, he might have seen everything happening in the room, making him feel slightly embarrassed.","\"I...\"","\"Senior Brother Feng,\" Mo Hua interrupted before he could speak, \"there are limits to human ability, and some things are simply beyond what you can solve.\"","Ouyang Feng was taken aback.","\"Therefore,\" Mo Hua continued, \"for things you can’t solve, temporarily let them go and focus on Cultivation. Once you’re strong enough, try to solve them again. Otherwise...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze darkened, \"You’ll be crushed by burdens you simply can’t bear.\"","This matter was the same for both Senior Brother Feng and him.","There were many things he wanted to do, but with his current meager Dao cultivation, he couldn’t do anything.","He could only set everything aside, focus on Cultivation, and wait for the day when he has the power to defy heaven and rewrite fate, then do the things he wanted but couldn’t achieve.","Ouyang Feng slightly understood Mo Hua’s meaning; his expression was thoughtful, but there was still evident confusion in his heart.","\"I don’t know...\"","\"Senior Brother Feng,\" Mo Hua’s gaze was clear and firm, and he added, \"if you choose the right path, no matter how difficult it is ahead, you just need to work wholeheartedly to overcome the difficulties.\"","\"But if you choose the wrong path, even if it’s smooth sailing, it holds no meaning.\"","Ouyang Feng was shocked; he felt that these simple words unraveled the knot in his heart, a mix of astonishment and helplessness, and couldn’t help but sigh:","\"Junior Brother, you indeed... have a naturally intuitive nature, a unique Taoist Heart. Though I’m older than you, I don’t see things as clearly.\"","It’s easy to come by a Top-Grade Spiritual Root, but a Top-Grade Dao Heart is nowhere to be found.","No wonder the Ancestor of Taixu Gate holds Junior Brother Mo in such high regard...","Mo Hua modestly said, \"Those involved are confused, and those outside see clearly. If that horse-faced senior brother tempted me with benefits, I might not have been able to hold onto myself either.\"","Ouyang Feng chuckled, \"Junior Brother Mo, you’re still so good with words.\"","Mo Hua narrowed his eyes and smiled.","Originally feeling isolated and helpless, almost lost in his mind and losing his Taoist Heart, Ouyang Feng suddenly felt enlightened at this moment.","He let out a long, relieved breath, the confusion in his heart vanished, and he couldn’t help but gratefully glance at Mo Hua.","Then he remembered something, frowning, \"Qianqian... she might be in danger.\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded and straightforwardly said, \"Let’s save Sister Qianqian first, and then think about what to do next.\"","\"Alright.\" Ouyang Feng nodded.","After the two discussed for a while, there was movement outside the door, it seemed like someone was coming over.","Ouyang Feng and Mo Hua exchanged a glance, nodded, and then Mo Hua once again used the Stealth Technique, disappearing without a trace.","As if he had never been there.","Ouyang Feng secretly sighed, then solemnly stood up and went to open the door."]},{"number":1604,"title":"Chapter 1604 - 842: Vicious Scheme","paragraphs":["The door opened, and it was still Brother Ma outside.","Upon seeing Ouyang Feng, he asked: \"Brother Feng, have you made a decision?\"","Ouyang Feng remembered Mo Hua’s words, and his expression was hesitant. Then he sighed slowly, as if resigned to fate, and said helplessly:","\"I agree.\"","Brother Ma was delighted upon hearing this and cupped his hands: \"Brother Feng, advancing now, boundless prospects await, and the prosperity of our Tai’a Sect is just around the corner.\"","Ouyang Feng cupped his hands but said nothing.","\"That sister from the Hundred Flower Valley can be considered a ’gift’ for Brother Feng’s bright future, a night of passion is worth its weight in gold, I won’t delay Brother Feng’s good fortune.\"","Brother Ma said with a smile, suddenly scrutinizing Ouyang Feng’s expression with a slightly strange look, \"Brother Feng...haven’t consumed the pill?\"","Ouyang Feng said lightly: \"I wish to remain clear-headed.\"","Brother Ma furrowed his brow, thought briefly, then nodded:","\"That’s true, being unaware makes it less interesting, but without taking the pill, Brother Feng...might not fully enjoy it.\"","Ouyang Feng frowned, his face turning cold instantly, and his gaze toward Brother Ma was somewhat hostile.","Brother Ma felt a chill in his heart, understanding that Ouyang Feng’s thoughts were upright and that he viewed Hua Qianqian as a sister, disliking jokes filled with frivolous language, so he immediately offered a sheepish smile.","If Ouyang Feng didn’t follow the young master’s arrangement, he had some confidence.","But now that Ouyang Feng agreed, and would work for the young master in the future, elevating his status to possibly being one of the ’young masters’ with power and influence, Brother Ma dared not be negligent.","As for that pill...","As long as things proceed, when raw rice becomes cooked rice, whether the pill is taken or not is not important.","Or perhaps, once they taste the pleasure and indulge in their desires, someday he will consume the pill himself.","Brother Ma cupped his hands and said: \"Beautiful scenery shouldn’t be wasted, let me lead the way, please, Brother Feng.\"","Ouyang Feng nodded slightly.","He turned back, glanced inside the room, then around, knowing Mo Hua was likely nearby, only then did he exhale lightly.","\"Let’s go.\"","Brother Ma led Ouyang Feng, along with Mo Hua unseen in the shadows, toward Hua Qianqian’s room.","Soon, they arrived at the door of Hua Qianqian’s room.","\"Brother Feng, please proceed; I will not disturb your good fortune.\" Brother Ma said.","Ouyang Feng nodded, his expression calm, and walked directly into the room.","\"Brother Feng...\" Before Ouyang Feng entered, Brother Ma suddenly stopped him, his eyes slightly narrowed:","\"Don’t blame me for not warning you... In life, you only walk one path. Once the path is chosen, if you waver or hesitate, you end up being neither here nor there, with no way forward, harming yourself in the end.\"","Ouyang Feng looked at Brother Ma indifferently, \"This principle doesn’t need you to teach me.\"","Brother Ma’s brow twitched slightly, \"As long as Brother Feng understands.\"","Ouyang Feng ignored him, opened the door, deliberately waited for a moment, then walked into the room, turning back to close the door.","Brother Ma caught a glimpse inside the room from the corner of his eye but saw nothing, feeling slightly regretful.","Hua Qianqian’s beauty and demeanor even made his own heart flutter with admiration, but such good fortune wasn’t meant for him.","A woman like her was someone he could never touch in his lifetime.","Brother Ma felt both envy and resentment for a moment, then turned away and walked to a secret room, knocking on the door.","The door opened, and Hua Ruyu came out, seeing Brother Ma, she asked: \"How did it go?\"","\"It’s done.\"","\"Did he take the pill?\"","\"He didn’t take the pill, but his heart is set, and he has entered the room. With beauty at hand, in this Rouge Boat filled with desires, no man can resist, and success is assured.\"","Hua Ruyu nodded, then slightly furrowed her brow, \"Though true, without taking the pill, it’s not entirely secure.\"","Brother Ma contemplated briefly, shook his head: \"It’s not good to push too hard now.\"","\"Alright...\"","Hua Ruyu also knew the danger of excess, considering Ouyang Feng’s disposition, the willingness to agree was already commendable, pushing too hard could have adverse effects.","As long as he experiences pleasure and step by step indulges, this lifetime offers no turning back.","\"Let’s leave it for now, check the situation after a few hours. As long as something really happens between them, everything falls into place, and this scandal will keep these star-crossed lovers in our grasp for life.\"","Brother Ma nodded, though he didn’t quite understand, \"But a fleeting romance, even if something happens between them, isn’t it just a romantic tale, nothing significant?\"","\"What do you know?\" Hua Ruyu gave him a cold look, \"To you men, it might be a romantic tale, but it’s different for women.\"","\"Moreover, Ouyang Feng isn’t just any man, he is the Big Senior Brother of Tai’a Sect, almost the appointed Sect Leader, even if he doesn’t become Sect Leader, he will be a Powerful Elder in the future. He needs reputation, to act with integrity to command respect. Such romantic tales are but dirty water to him, not beneficial at all.\"","\"Furthermore...\"","Hua Ruyu smiled darkly, \"This romantic tale can happen anywhere, but absolutely not on this Rouge Boat.\"","\"Why?\" Brother Ma didn’t understand.","Hua Ruyu snickered coldly, face full of ridicule:","\"What is this Rouge Boat? And who are the visitors? Anywhere else, it may be mutual affection, uncontrollable passion. But on this Rouge Boat, any little impurity is just the activity of ’clients’ and ’courtesans.’\""]},{"number":1605,"title":"Chapter 1605 - 842: Poisonous Scheme (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"How could a philanderer become a Sect Leader? How could a prostitute ever be wed in a respectable marriage? Behind their backs, God knows how many whispers and rumors they would suffer. That’s why I say, with their identities, if anything truly happened, it would be a disaster from which they’d never recover, unable to lift themselves for the rest of their lives.\"","Hua Ruyu’s expression was cold, \"If Ouyang Feng were on his own, he might not sincerely work for us, but as long as Hua Qianqian is involved, he has a weakness. For this sister whom he grew up with, he has to endure humiliation and bear heavy burdens; there’s absolutely no way he could cause an uproar...\"","Brother Ma was secretly alarmed upon hearing this, thinking to himself that, indeed, the heart of a woman is the most venomous.","This seemingly ordinary romantic encounter actually harbored such malicious intent and schemes.","This Hua Ruyu, who knows how many people she has ensnared with this trick...","Thinking of this, when he looked at Hua Ruyu’s fair and delicate face again, any romantic thoughts he had were gone, only feeling a chill in his heart.","\"Alright,\" Hua Ruyu continued, \"no matter what, tonight is a good night for Young Master Ouyang; let him enjoy it to the fullest, and we can consider our task done...\"","\"Yes.\" Brother Ma nodded slowly.","...","Inside the boudoir of the red-draped bed.","Hua Ruyu was tied up, her mouth gagged. When she looked up and saw Ouyang Feng entering, she was first startled, then delighted.","But then she suddenly stiffened, gradually realizing something, her face turned slightly pale, her eyes filled with disappointment, anger, pain, and disdain.","This change in emotion was observed by Ouyang Feng, whose feelings were complex and difficult to describe, even feeling a sense of shame and self-loathing.","If it weren’t for Mo Hua, due to a moment’s lapse in judgment, he could very well have become someone who invoked disappointment, anger, and disdain.","Ouyang Feng untied the cloth from Hua Qianqian’s mouth.","Hua Qianqian, like a startled deer, screamed sharply:","\"Don’t come any closer!\"","Ouyang Feng was taken aback, then sighed, \"Qianqian, I’m here to save you.\"","\"I don’t believe you!\" Hua Qianqian’s eyes reddened slightly, her pretty face filled with anger, \"Don’t take me for a fool, what kind of place is this? How could you just walk in like this? For you to walk in so boldly, you must be in league with those villains, you, you want to...\"","Hua Qianqian was both anxious and angry, breaking into tears at the corners of her eyes by the end.","\"Really...\" Ouyang Feng sighed.","Hua Qianqian simply wouldn’t believe him.","No matter what Ouyang Feng said, she refused to believe.","Just then, a clear voice rang out, \"Senior Sister Qianqian, we really are here to save you.\"","This voice was very familiar, and Hua Qianqian suddenly froze.","With tears still in her eyes, she dumbly turned her head to see a familiar figure suddenly appear beside her.","\"Mo...Junior Brother Mo?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded, then said, \"Don’t worry, Senior Sister, I will first unlock the chains on you.\"","The Spirit-binding Lock on Hua Qianqian used three of the Spirit Binding Array from the Taoist Court’s twelve formations.","Mo Hua had often dealt with the Taoist Court and had a particular interest in these Spirit-binding Locks, even \"borrowed\" a few from Gu Changhuai for research, thus he was skilled in unlocking formations and locks.","Of course, the borrowed Spirit-binding Locks were thoroughly dismantled, so Mo Hua didn’t dare return them.","Mo Hua took out an iron pen the size of a needle, dipped it in Spiritual Ink, and carved several Formation Patterns on the chains, unlocking the Spirit-binding Lock on Hua Qianqian.","As soon as the Spirit-binding Lock was released, before Mo Hua could say anything, a fragrant scent hit him.","Hua Qianqian directly threw herself at him, embracing him fully, crying like a pear blossom in rain.","\"Mo...Junior Brother Mo, I was so scared...\"","Since childhood, she had been pampered and was not a person of strong character. Previously, she had been in a dangerous situation, isolated and helpless, forcing herself to hold onto a glimmer of hope, barely keeping herself together.","Seeing Mo Hua now, she felt as if she had seen a family member, and all her fear and grievances suddenly welled up, unable to contain herself, holding Mo Hua tightly, rubbing tears and snot all over him.","Mo Hua only felt the sweet fragrance all over, held tightly by a soft body, almost unable to breathe.","Somewhat helpless, he could only pat Hua Qianqian’s back, gasping, \"Alright, Senior Sister Qianqian, it’s okay now...\"","Hua Qianqian sobbed for a while, then realized she was holding Mo Hua and had even wet his clothes, her cheeks reddened slightly, and she slowly released Mo Hua, sitting quietly.","Mo Hua then gently said, \"I’ve discussed with Senior Brother Feng, he’ll act in the open while I remain hidden. We will manage to get you out, you can rest assured.\"","\"Okay,\" Hua Qianqian nodded obediently.","Ouyang Feng, seeing Hua Qianqian calming down, also breathed a sigh of relief. Then he stood up, checked around, and perceived at the doorway for a moment, ensuring no problems, he said:","\"We’ll think of a way to escape from this Rouge Boat. Others are less important, but Qianqian must be sent out without being discovered, preferably not letting anyone know she ever appeared on this Rouge Boat...\"","Even though it was his first time on this Rouge Boat, he knew more about it than anyone else.","This filthy place is not one where a lady should be, should not even touch a single corner of it, otherwise, it would tarnish one’s name and never cleanse in a lifetime.","Perhaps ordinary cultivators wouldn’t mind, but the more reputable and prominent the family, the more they cared about such reputation.","What’s more, Hua Qianqian was the legitimate daughter of the Hua family of the Hundred Flower Valley.","Mo Hua, though not very knowledgeable about family matters, was subtly aware of the severity of this issue.","But now, it seems it might be difficult to rescue her.","He himself could conceal and was proficient in formations, having less of an issue, but Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian couldn’t, especially since both were being watched."]},{"number":1606,"title":"Chapter 1606 - 842: Poisonous Plot (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Even if we escape the Rouge Boat, outside is the vast Mistwater River, and we still can’t escape.","Ouyang Feng thought for a moment, then turned to Mo Hua, \"Junior Brother Mo, did you... board the boat alone?\"","\"I boarded alone,\" Mo Hua said, \"but someone followed me later.\"","\"Someone?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, whispering, \"It’s the Taoist Court.\"","Ouyang Feng was astonished upon hearing this.","Junior Brother Mo indeed has a deep connection with the Taoist Court.","Moreover, the Taoist Court...","Ouyang Feng frowned; he hadn’t expected that the Taoist Court would actually dare, and even manage, to investigate the Rouge Boat, right at this precise time tonight.","He felt a bit of discord in his heart.","\"The Taoist Court will make a move on the Rouge Boat tonight?\"","\"That’s the plan,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"but the waterways of the Gui Water Sect are well hidden, and this Rouge Boat is shrouded in a heavy fog, so the Taoist Court lost their way; I was just lucky to mix in.\"","\"Even though I provided clues, this fog is too thick, they might not find us...\"","Saying this, Mo Hua suddenly said, \"Wait, let me ask again.\"","Earlier he had been busy keeping watch back and forth, never having a moment of leisure, but now with some free time, he took out the Letter Token again, sending a message to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, have you found the way?\"","Quite a while passed, but Gu Changhuai did not reply.","\"Could this thick fog even obscure the Original Magnet’s sensing?\" Mo Hua muttered.","Just at this moment, the Letter Token trembled, Mo Hua’s heart skipped a bit, and as he checked it, he saw Gu Changhuai sending a message:","\"Found it.\"","Mo Hua sighed in relief, but at the same time, felt a bit incredulous, \"Did they really find it?\"","Gu Changhuai simply said: \"The Xia family’s connections run deep...\"","The Xia family...","Mo Hua nodded slightly.","Inside the Gui Water Sect, there must be someone acting as a mole for the Xia family, jumping to shore before the boat sinks.","Apparently, there are many details he is unaware of in this matter.","\"Where are you now?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai said: \"The Taoist Court has mobilized its personnel, splitting into seven water routes, following the route of the Rouge Boat, but the Mistwater River is vast, and there’s a strange thick fog obscuring it, making divine sense perception limited, so they don’t know the exact location.\"","\"I see...\" Mo Hua pondered, then said, \"I’ll see if I can create a commotion to give you a clue.\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, then said: \"Be careful, there should be a Golden Core from the Gui Water Sect on the Rouge Boat.\"","\"Golden Core?\" Mo Hua was startled.","But upon reflection, it seemed normal.","Although the Rouge Boat is only of Second Grade, mainly entertaining Foundation Establishment Disciples, and its route only lies in the Second Grade Territory, there still needs to be a Golden Core to hold the situation steady.","\"Is there only one?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai helplessly said: \"What are you thinking? Golden Cores aren’t really cabbages, in a Third Grade family, a Golden Core could be an Ancestor.\"","\"What the Gui Water Sect is doing is something not presentable, so it’s naturally better to involve fewer people. Moreover, this is in the Second Grade Territory, if nothing happens, one Golden Core is enough, if something does happen, even Feather Transformation won’t help.\"","Mo Hua nodded in agreement and asked:","\"Do you know who this Golden Core is?\"","Gu Changhuai: \"Can’t find it for now. Most of the elders of Gui Water Sect are under watch, checking around revealed no suspicious individuals.\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"That’s strange...\"","\"Anyway, be careful,\" Gu Changhuai said, \"I’m holding the Letter Token, if anything happens, tell me immediately.\"","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment, then added: \"If the situation becomes truly dangerous, don’t restrain yourself, act with abandon, cause a big commotion; as long as we see something unusual and discern the direction, we’ll rush over immediately...\"","Mo Hua thought those words were a bit odd.","What does it mean to not restrain yourself and cause a big commotion?","He’s always been low-key in his actions, where would such a big commotion come from?","Nevertheless, Mo Hua still agreed: \"Okay.\"","Afterwards, their conversation ended, and Mo Hua dwelt in thought, while Ouyang Feng silently watched Mo Hua, eventually asking: \"How is it going?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment and said: \"The Taoist Court’s people are on their way, but the thick fog is pervasive, and they can’t find the direction, so I need to think of a way to lead them here...\"","Ouyang Feng, however, pondered for a moment, his expression grave as he said:","\"Can we take the opportunity to send Qianqian out?\"","The personnel of the Taoist Court are very complex, and if they surround the Rouge Boat, finding Hua Qianqian during their investigation, this could become a scandal.","Even if it could be explained, with so many people and loose tongues, it’s impossible to control what others might say.","There’s a kind of crime called others thinking you are guilty.","Mo Hua glanced at Hua Qianqian, whose delicate face still bore tear stains, and nodded: \"Alright.\"","Mo Hua had considered it; the Rouge Boat situation was not something he could resolve.","Involving the so-called Young Masters’ Pavilion, various families, and sects, the waters are too deep, he couldn’t manage it, nor was there any need to wade into this trouble.","What he needed to do was lend a small helping hand, use one’s wits to pit one’s enemies against each other.","Drawing the Taoist Court, this tiger, to devour the Rouge Boat, this wolf, and then slip away amidst the mess.","As for the schemes of various forces behind the scenes, he was outside the situation, knew little, couldn’t see through them clearly, and for now, there was no need to concern himself with these matters.","Protecting Senior Sister Qianqian and, if the chance arises, finding that altar would be sufficient.","Mo Hua discussed with Ouyang Feng a bit more, and they roughly formed a plan.","He cloaked himself, stealthily moving outside the Rouge Boat, and laid a Fireworks Formation around the boat’s perimeter, intending to seize a chance to release fireworks and draw the Taoist Court over.","But after setting it up, Mo Hua suddenly recalled Uncle Gu’s words to \"not restrain himself\"...","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and then decided to \"follow the current,\" also setting up High-level Second Grade Fierce Fire Formation, Li Fire Formation, and Gold Blade Formation outside the Fireworks Formation.","These formations were powerful killing formations, and if they exploded, it would likely sink the ship.","These high-rank formations were ones Mo Hua had just learned not long ago and hadn’t yet had the chance to test their power.","In the sect, there was nothing to explode, making these formations useless.","But now it was perfect, having a Spirit Boat ready for him to ruin.","Mo Hua also wanted to see how powerful these formations would be upon detonation and whether there was anything he needed to improve.","He set up Fire-series Killing Formations on not just the central Flower Boat but also some surrounding Spirit Boats.","And most of the cultivators on the boat were busy attending to \"serious matters,\" with no time to notice anything else, hence they hadn’t even realized what terrible things had been set on the ship.","After setting it up and checking again, Mo Hua nodded.","These formations didn’t need to be detonated in a hurry; detonating them too early would alert the enemy.","Once Uncle Gu’s side sent a message, he would time it perfectly to detonate everything in tandem with them, and while the chaos was afoot, the Taoist Court would close in, hopefully without issue.","After preparing everything, Mo Hua doubled back to the ship.","He planned to find a way to send Senior Sister Qianqian out before detonating the formations and the Taoist Court’s encirclement.","He still remembered the location of Hua Qianqian’s secret chamber, but when he arrived unobstructed at the chamber’s entrance, his expression suddenly changed.","The door was open, and there was an air of killing intent.","Moreover, there was also... a scent of blood.","Mo Hua’s gaze darkened, and he immediately went invisible, his steps light as a feather, slowly entering the secret chamber.","The room was in disarray; the screen shattered, sword marks everywhere, as if it had just undergone a fierce battle.","On one side of the room, Hua Qianqian’s face was as pale as death, fear evident in her eyes.","Ouyang Feng stood in front of Hua Qianqian, holding a longsword, full of killing intent, but his aura was somewhat weak.","Blood was at the corner of his mouth, a whip mark stretched from his shoulder, blood dripping all the way to his chest...","And standing opposite them was another person.","This person wore a sullen face, eyes radiating evil light, holding a long whip in one hand while the other arm hung empty, exuding intense evil qi.","It was none other than Water Yama."]},{"number":1607,"title":"Chapter 1607 - 843: All Here","paragraphs":["But at this moment, Water Yama seemed somewhat off.","The Evil Qi around him was heavier than before, his aura somewhat violent, and deep in his eyes was a lustful thought, seemingly due to his lost arm and wounded Vital Energy, causing the Evil Qi cultivated midway through killing to become chaotic.","And this thick mist took advantage of the situation, stirring up the Evil Thoughts buried deep in his heart.","He now looked covetously, his snake-like gaze lingering over Hua Qianqian’s delicate body.","Hua Qianqian shivered all over under his gaze.","Ouyang Feng’s expression turned solemn as he shielded Hua Qianqian behind him.","But his injuries were not light, blood seeping from the wound bit by bit, soaking the sword’s hilt, his hand gripping the sword feeling somewhat numb.","This evil cultivator was a formidable foe!","Up until now, he hadn’t encountered such a powerful Evil Path cultivator with such strong cultivation and Taoist Skill methods.","In direct confrontation, he was completely at a disadvantage.","And this person had even lost an arm.","If not for that, his strength would be even greater!","Ouyang Feng felt heavy-hearted.","Water Yama saw Ouyang Feng blocking Hua Qianqian, unable to see the captivating beauty, he became temporarily angry before laughing out loud instead.","\"Good! A haggard beauty and a flower-protecting talent, very good! I have always enjoyed doing this kind of thing in my life.\"","\"In front of a woman, torment her beloved; in front of a man, humiliate his beloved woman.\"","\"And then watch the two of them die with hearts aching, in utter desolation, unwilling even in death...\"","Water Yama laughed somewhat neurotically, \"Isn’t it a bit perverse?\"","\"I can’t help it either, having practiced the Demon Path spells, cultivating Evil Qi. This Evil Qi accumulates inside me, and if I don’t find some amusement, torment others to disperse this accumulated Qi, I myself will go mad first.\"","As Water Yama spoke, his eyes began to show Blood Threads:","\"Lately, things have been going poorly for me, this Evil Qi... has weighed heavily deep in my heart for a long time, with no way to relieve it. You pair of Heaven’s Pride young lovers are just right to become my ’woman’ for cultivation venting.\"","\"Moreover...\" Water Yama looked at Hua Qianqian’s faintly visible delicate body behind Ouyang Feng, feeling as if his heart was being gnawed by ants, unbearably itchy,","\"Such a pure and tender little piece... \"","\"Blame it only on your poor luck...\"","Water Yama’s eyes turned red, his body transforming into Water Shadow, like a yaksha in the water, ferocious and terrifying, rushing towards Ouyang Feng.","Ouyang Feng remained grim, wielding the Sword light, engaging Water Yama in battle.","His first encounter with Water Yama led to an unfamiliarity with his strange methods, and having to care for Hua Qianqian behind him made him inevitably flustered, relying solely on solid cultivation and exquisite Swordsmanship to support himself.","Mo Hua observed all this, eyes slightly cold, thinking:","\"This Water Yama seems somewhat unstable, must find a way to kill him...\"","A shred of killing intent emerged in his heart.","But just as this killing intent emerged, the Evil Qi invaded the mind, and Water Yama’s exceptionally keen Perception immediately startled.","He immediately ceased his actions, leaping aside, glaring viciously towards the Concealed location of Mo Hua, coldly asking:","\"Who?!\"","Mo Hua was somewhat surprised.","Had Water Yama suddenly become this alert?","Mo Hua naturally wouldn’t reveal himself.","But Water Yama refused to let it go, almost certain that a faint killing intent had surfaced, making him feel stabbed in the back.","He had suffered losses before and thus would not be careless.","Without waiting for Mo Hua to act, Water Yama took out a Blood Pearl and crushed it directly.","A spray of Blood Mist exploded instantly, permeating the room and engulfing Mo Hua within.","Mo Hua’s form was like water, hurriedly retreating, but the Blood Mist was too thick, a vast expanse, some still clinging to him.","Blood Mist inherently had no killing power, but once adhered, couldn’t be washed off quickly, exposing Mo Hua’s whereabouts.","Mo Hua furrowed his brow slightly.","This Blood Pearl seemed to be some kind of special Evil Artifact.","Water Yama had learned from a previous misstep, having his beloved Water Prison Forbidden Box stolen right before him due to Concealment, thus in agony from the setback, he specifically prepared this Blood Pearl to limit cultivators skillful in Concealment.","This time, it was just used against Mo Hua.","Mo Hua had no choice but to slowly reveal his form.","Water Yama saw his method worked, the sneak being forced to reveal his form, leading him to coldly sneer.","Yet upon seeing Mo Hua’s face, his pupils involuntarily shrank.","Too young.","Like a youth under twenty.","To be adept at Concealment Technique, mastering Invisibility, none were not old and cunning after years in the martial world.","How could he be like this?","Moreover, he didn’t recognize this little imp...","Water Yama frowned, \"Who are you?\"","Mo Hua’s expression was somewhat nuanced.","This Water Yama, his waterside camp captured by the Taoist Court under himself, his prized Forbidden Box snatched by himself, yet he did not recognize him...","Mo Hua turned his thoughts and roughly understood.","At the dock during the first encounter with Water Yama, he intentionally masked his face, so his appearance wasn’t seen.","The second time, he was lurking in the dark, making a quick move to grab his Water Prison Forbidden Box.","Actions were too quick, leaving too swiftly, the interior dimly lit, he didn’t see clearly again.","But Water Yama was keen of mind, quickly coming to realization despite moments had passed, his pupils suddenly trembled, exclaiming incredulously:","\"It’s you!\"","He has recognized it!","This face didn’t ring a bell, but this figure, he wouldn’t forget even in death!","The silhouette of Mo Hua before him gradually merged with that of the scoundrel he wished to slaughter a thousand times and grind the bones to dust."]},{"number":1608,"title":"Chapter 1608 - 843: All Present_2","paragraphs":["\"It’s you, that remnant of the Water Prison Sect, that damn dog thief!\"","Water Yama said through gritted teeth.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian were both stunned.","Wasn’t Mo Hua the Junior Brother of Taixu Gate?","How did he become a remnant of the Water Prison Sect?","Moreover, this sinister and powerful one-armed cultivator looked at Mo Hua with bloodshot eyes and seemed ready to burst with rage, as if there was a deep vengeance between him and Junior Brother Mo.","Saying it’s a vendetta for killing his father or taking his wife doesn’t seem too much...","What exactly did Junior Brother Mo do?","The two were a bit confused.","\"Alright, I never thought you would dare appear in front of me...\"","At this time, Water Yama’s eyes were fierce as he questioned Mo Hua, \"Where are my things? Where?\"","Mo Hua played dumb, \"What things?\"","Water Yama was so furious at his attitude that he laughed in his rage:","\"You damned little brat, I’ll break your limbs right now and torture you bit by bit, let’s see if your mouth stays sharp...\"","Mo Hua glanced at his empty sleeve and said crisply:","\"I don’t know if my limbs will break, but one of your limbs is already broken, and it probably can’t be reattached, can it? No wonder you’re always thinking of breaking others’ limbs. Turns out, your arm was chopped off by someone, but you’re too cowardly and incompetent to get revenge, so you just take it out on others...\"","Water Yama felt a surge of blood qi, rushing straight to his forehead, and the evil qi around him almost couldn’t be suppressed.","He didn’t dare talk to Mo Hua anymore.","Water Yama directly drew out the bloody Water Punishment Whip and attacked Mo Hua with vicious water force.","Mo Hua’s movement was like water, dodging with ease.","Seeing Water Yama attacking Mo Hua, Ouyang Feng immediately invoked the sword qi and came forward.","Hua Qianqian, having experienced many changes, was shaken in spirit, but seeing the enemy in front of them, with Ouyang Feng striving to fight and the much younger Junior Brother Mo also maneuvering against the fearsome demon, courage welled up within her as she gathered her spiritual power to restrain Water Yama with Hundred Flower Valley’s embroidered spirit needles.","While Mo Hua dodged, he used various spells to assist from the side.","His Water Prison Technique couldn’t trap Water Yama, but its limiting effect was still there.","Occasionally, he’d use the Concealment Technique along with the Water Passing Step, appearing and disappearing around Water Yama with his form stained with blood mist, not launching any killing move but still putting tremendous pressure on Water Yama.","Water Yama couldn’t figure out Mo Hua’s abilities and didn’t know his true power.","But he clearly remembered that on Water Island, in that secret room, there was a strange glow with a chilling murderous intent that made his heart tremble, so he dared not act carelessly.","Whenever he acted, he had to make sure of Mo Hua’s position and never expose a flaw before him.","Water Yama, distracted by three fronts, felt the pressure from Ouyang Feng lessen sharply.","Ouyang Feng, inherently smart with profound cultivation and high talent in the Sword Dao, only lacked experience compared to Water Yama.","In a previous accidental encounter, he suffered a great loss.","But now the pace slowed, and after exchanging dozens of moves with Water Yama, he gradually became familiar with Water Yama’s various techniques, responding more and more skillfully.","More importantly, he had Mo Hua, who understood Water Yama thoroughly.","Water Yama’s eyes turned red, and Mo Hua reminded, \"Don’t look at his eyes.\"","When Water Yama used the Water Shadow Step, Mo Hua directly cast a fireball to his true body, breaking his Water Shadow Step.","Without these two special moves, with all the restrictions, head-on with Ouyang Feng, Water Yama couldn’t gain any advantage.","Water Yama’s heart was filled with hatred, especially towards Mo Hua.","\"This damn brat, when on earth did he see through all the skills I painstakingly cultivated my whole life?\"","This brat absolutely cannot be spared!","Otherwise, how can I continue in the Dao world in the future?","I must kill him...","A sinister look flickered in Water Yama’s eyes.","At the same time, Mo Hua thought the same.","\"The time is almost ripe, I feel like I can kill...\"","A person like Water Yama should be dealt with early for peace.","Right now, his evil qi was in disorder, his divine soul was violent, and although he appeared ferocious and terrifying, in Mo Hua’s eyes, he was just bluffing and full of weaknesses.","A single Soul-Shocking Sword should be able to resolve this.","But Mo Hua was a bit uncertain...","Especially after fighting the Sect Leader’s watchdog, Big White, in Taixu Gate, Mo Hua suddenly lost a lot of confidence in the power of his Soul-Shocking Sword.","One should never underestimate any opponent.","Moreover, Water Yama had been cultivating this pupil skill for at least a hundred years.","Although he took shortcuts using demon evilness, he must not be underestimated.","Mo Hua thought for a moment and decided to try it out first.","Use Water Yama for a sword test.","As a cultivator who proved the Dao with divine sense, the painstakingly cultivated Soul-Shocking Sword of his should at least be better than Water Yama’s...","Even if it can’t achieve complete victory, in this three-on-one mixed battle, even a small disturbance could determine the outcome and decide life and death.","Mo Hua made up his mind.","But before that, there was one thing he had to confirm.","Mo Hua cast a fireball to distract Water Yama and then retreated to widen the distance, asking Water Yama in a deep voice:","\"Was it you who harmed Senior Sister Ye Jin from Hundred Flower Valley?\"","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian were both stunned.","\"Ye Jin?\" Water Yama was perplexed, then grinned, \"The number of women I’ve played with, I can’t even count. Those I killed after getting bored with, I can’t even remember which one you’re talking about!\"","Mo Hua’s gaze turned cold.","Hua Qianqian was even more shocked and angry, gritting her teeth, \"So it was you... You killed Jin Er, and I... I want you to pay with your life!\""]},{"number":1609,"title":"Chapter 1609 - 843: The Gathering (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Hua Qianqian flicked her sleeve, a few silver needles shot out with colorful light, heading straight for Water Yama’s face.","Water Yama looked disdainful, snapping his whip, knocking down all the silver needles, and sneered:","\"You still have the nerve to worry about others; this is the Rouge Boat, surrounded by the Mistwater River, you can’t escape. Sooner or later, you will fall into my hands, and then you’ll know what it means to wish you were dead...\"","After Water Yama finished speaking, he looked at Mo Hua and suddenly gave a sinister smile:","\"I almost forgot, you are a remnant of the Water Prison Sect, the whole Yu Family’s water fort was killed, those are all your ’relatives’. I will go all the way as a good man and send you down to reunite with them later.\"","Water Yama intended to use these words to unsettle Mo Hua’s mind, then take the opportunity to attack him.","But Water Yama was mistaken.","Mo Hua remained calm inside, not affected at all.","Because he wasn’t a remnant of the Water Prison Sect at all.","The people of the Yu Family water fort had nothing to do with him...","On the contrary, Water Yama’s mention of the Yu Family water fort made Mo Hua’s heart stir, he pretended to be furious and said:","\"You heartless beast! I will kill you and sprinkle your blood before the graves of the Yu Family to commemorate their dead souls!\"","Water Yama heard this, indeed gave a sinister smile, \"Naive little ghost, do you even know where they died? Where have their souls gone? No grave, no soul, what are you commemorating? What a joke.\"","Water Yama laughed loudly in sarcasm.","Yet Mo Hua’s eyes lit up.","As expected, this Water Yama knows the altar’s location.","After the cultivators of the Yu Family water fort were slaughtered, they were very likely sent to the altar by Water Yama himself, offered to the Evil God.","It’s just...","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","In this way, killing this Water Yama impulsively would be unwise.","At least he has to \"make the most of\" him, and extract the altar’s location before he dies.","\"First use the Soul-Shocking Sword to disorient his divine soul, and while he is mentally confused, subdue him, break his limbs, no, three limbs, then put him on the interrogation board, and slowly torture him...\"","\"Just need to control the power of the Soul-Shocking Sword...\"","Having planned in his mind, Mo Hua’s eyes narrowed slightly, golden light flowing at the bottom of his eyes, about to try the true power of the Soul-Shocking Sword on Water Yama, a skill he had painstakingly honed.","Just at this moment, he suddenly sensed something, his expression paused, and he slowly restrained the golden light in his eyes, turning to look towards the door.","There was a person standing outside the door, who knows when.","It was a woman, dressed flamboyantly, with a face full of thick makeup.","It was Hua Ruyu.","She stood at the doorway sneering, \"Such a lively scene in here while I was gone for just a while.\"","As she spoke, everyone stopped what they were doing.","Water Yama’s gaze flickered slightly, restrained his killing intent, and said, \"Miaoer, why have you come?\"","\"Why?\" Hua Ruyu gave him a cold glance and sneered, \"Am I not allowed to come? Did I spoil your fun?\"","Having mingled with Water Yama for so long, she knew his nature well.","With just a glance, she could tell what unsavory thoughts Water Yama had in mind to be here.","\"Sweet words just a moment ago, and now trying to sneak behind my back, truly disgraceful character!\"","After all, Water Yama was in the wrong, and he harbored feelings for Hua Ruyu, despite being scolded, he could not retort, but instead forced a smile and said:","\"Miaoer, don’t misunderstand, you were always the only one in my heart. It’s just... you know, my superior spell point, cultivation is extremely difficult. Every so often complications arise, need to vent a bit. You are merciless, unwilling to give me that, I can only resort to such desperate measures, it’s not really my intention...\"","Hua Ruyu sneered, \"So, this is all my fault then?\"","\"How could I blame you,\" Water Yama said softly, \"I only think about how to treat you well.\"","Hua Ruyu snorted coldly, \"A man’s words, all are lies, nothing but sweet-talking nonsense.\"","After speaking, she turned to look at Ouyang Feng, likewise sneered:","\"Young Master Ouyang, you are the same. I went through so much trouble to create such a good opportunity for you, to enjoy a night of bliss, but you don’t appreciate my good intentions, instead you deceive me, talking all sweet while pulling these little tricks behind my back...\"","She could tell at a glance that Ouyang Feng had not touched Hua Qianqian at all, and he never intended to submit to the Young Masters’ Pavilion.","Ouyang Feng had already figured it out.","At this moment, his gaze was like a sword, his aura imposing, and he said in a deep voice:","\"Our paths are different, we can’t work together. The threshold of the Young Masters’ Pavilion is too high for me. But you...\"","Ouyang Feng’s gaze was icy, \"As an instructor of the Hundred Flower Valley, a role model, doing such a heinous deed, aren’t you afraid of divine retribution?\"","\"Divine retribution?\" Hua Ruyu was taken aback when she heard this, and then laughed so hard she shook like a blooming flower, \"Where’s the divine retribution? I’ve been an instructor at the Hundred Flower Valley for so many years, brought countless girls to this boat, and yet I’m doing quite well and alive. Where’s the retribution?\"","Hua Qianqian’s face was pale, her eyes slightly red, filled with both disappointment and pain, she shouted in anger:","\"Hua Ruyu! You will die a horrible death!\"","Hua Ruyu chuckled lightly, indifferent, but still avoided Hua Qianqian’s gaze.","Her eyes swept around, finally landing on the last person in the room, Mo Hua, and couldn’t help but light up as she praised:","\"What a handsome and innocent young man, truly pitiable...\"","Mo Hua snorted coldly, looking disgusted.","Hua Ruyu liked him even more, her eyes filled with enchanting waves.","On the side, the Water Yama’s heart felt like swallowing a fly, unable to help but feel sour, and looked at Mo Hua as if wanting to devour him.","\"Wait...\"","Hua Ruyu’s smile slightly froze, scrutinizing Mo Hua’s face, feeling some familiarity, and suddenly she remembered, exclaiming:","\"You are that little beauty who entered the Hundred Flower Valley that day...\"","Mo Hua’s face darkened.","He had entered the Hundred Flower Valley for convenience, simply wearing a Taoist robe, no makeup, relying on his \"natural beauty,\" which made his appearance almost the same as before.","Moreover, he was now saving Hua Qianqian, standing together, the connection made Hua Ruyu easily recognize him.","Ouyang Feng, though feeling the timing was not right, couldn’t help but feel shocked in his heart.","Entering the Hundred Flower Valley?!","Junior Brother Mo had actually entered the Hundred Flower Valley?!","Could the Hundred Flower Valley be a place where men could enter?!","Ouyang Feng silently looked at Mo Hua, his gaze unknowingly mixed with a hint of admiration.","Seeing Hua Ruyu’s eyes fixated on Mo Hua, Water Yama became even more unsettled and said:","\"Miaoer, it’s getting late, we can’t delay any longer.\"","Hua Ruyu glanced at him lightly and said coldly, \"Fine, let’s first join forces to capture them, then I’ll settle accounts with you.\"","Water Yama said, \"I’ll do as you say.\"","After speaking, the two joined forces and fought against Mo Hua and the others once more.","As a result, Mo Hua felt the pressure surge suddenly.","Hua Ruyu was also at the peak of Foundation Establishment, not far from the Golden Core Realm, with a body of inheritance from the Hundred Flower Valley, adept at using pink, poisonous Spirit Needles, which was quite tricky.","Adding the two of Water Yama, the situation became quite unfavorable.","Mo Hua frowned.","The clues to the altar would have to be found later.","Should he just kill this pair of wretches... directly?","Given the current situation, with Hua Ruyu as a hindrance, capturing Water Yama alive was nearly impossible.","This was inside the Rouge Boat, and dragging this out would only make the situation increasingly perilous.","Additionally, Hua Ruyu, being not only malicious and wicked, but also aware of his \"dark history,\" could not be spared.","Mo Hua made up his mind, just as he was about to take action, suddenly halted.","He sensed a strong aura.","Not only him, but everyone present felt this oppressive force, and they all silently stopped, looking towards the door.","At that moment, a person stood outside the door, expression cold, but with a cultivation that was exceptionally deep, exuding an aura completely distinct from ordinary Foundation Establishment.","Golden Core!","Mo Hua’s pupils contracted, his heart sank.","The Golden Core on the Rouge Boat, he too had arrived!"]},{"number":1610,"title":"Chapter 1610 - 844: Grand Fireworks","paragraphs":["\"Dare to cause trouble on the Rouge Boat, you have a lot of nerve...\"","This Golden Core Cultivator looked indifferent, with a cold tone.","The room instantly fell silent, and the atmosphere was somewhat heavy.","Even Water Yama and Hua Ruyu stopped and cupped their hands in salute.","\"Elder.\"","Gui Water Sect Elder?","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","This Golden Core Cultivator was stern-faced, dressed in a water-blue Taoist Robe, with hidden water power and threads of sharp Sword Qi surrounding him.","At this moment, his expression was solemn as he stood with hands behind his back, fully embodying the demeanor of a master.","It seems he has indeed learned the Swordsmanship of Gui Water Sect and gained the inheritance of the Gui Water Sword from an Elder...","\"Trouble...\"","Mo Hua frowned.","The Golden Core Elder’s gaze wandered over the few people in the room, landing on Ouyang Feng who was injured but still steady-faced, then on Hua Qianqian who, despite being scared, had a stubborn look in her eyes, and finally setting on Mo Hua, momentarily dazed.","Then he broke his composure.","His face filled with shock, his previous calm demeanor gone, he pointed at Mo Hua with trembling fingers, exasperatedly exclaiming:","\"It’s you?!\"","Everyone present was a bit stunned.","Mo Hua was too.","\"Why is it me again?\"","He frowned and took a closer look at this Golden Core. Only then did he realize with surprise that he also knew this Golden Core!","Xie Liu from the Gui Water Sect!","That Golden Core Sword Cultivator.","Back then, he caught a thief with Crossing River Dragon and went into a small teahouse, capturing evidence against Jin Yicai, only to be discovered by Xie Liu at the Golden Core Realm.","Xie Liu wanted to kill him but was subdued by Uncle Gu.","Because his Swordsmanship seemed rather poor, utterly no match for Uncle Gu, and was quickly dealt with.","So Mo Hua didn’t have a deep impression of him—didn’t recognize him at first sight.","Mo Hua silently sighed in relief.","\"I thought it was another Golden Core from Gui Water Sect. Turns out it was Uncle Gu’s defeated opponent, acting like a master, made me tense for nothing...\"","Mo Hua felt slightly more at ease.","But Xie Liu at the Golden Core Realm could no longer stay calm. Pointing at Mo Hua with a face full of killing intent, he snarled:","\"You little brat, I remember you! You’re a disciple of Taixu Gate, a little dog of the Taoist Court, Gu Changhuai’s little follower. Were it not for you using yourself as bait, cunningly trapping, I wouldn’t have fallen into Gu Changhuai’s trap, ending up in such a state!\"","\"Now, I’ve been expelled from Gui Water Sect, working in secret, doing dirty deeds that can’t see the light of day—I owe it all to you and that Gu!\"","As these words fell, the other people in the room showed a change in their expressions.","A dog of the Taoist Court, Gu Changhuai’s follower?","This little brat actually had these identities?","If he was on this ship, does it not mean...","Hua Ruyu and Water Yama exchanged glances, their faces turning slightly pale.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian were also a bit shocked.","Within this short period, Mo Hua’s identity had changed several times, once a remnant of the Water Prison Sect, then a dog of the Taoist Court.","Why did he have so many identities...","Mo Hua felt somewhat vexed.","It’s over; his \"alias\" is almost entirely exposed.","He never thought that on this Rouge Boat, there would be so many acquaintances that happened to be gathered here.","Right now, Xie Liu had already drawn his sword, pointing at Mo Hua and shouting:","\"Seize this little brat!\"","Water Yama and Hua Ruyu now deeply realized the severity of the situation.","Mo Hua’s identity wasn’t simple at all.","Tai Xu Sect origin, Gu family follower, dog of the Taoist Court—a person like this on the Rouge Boat meant the ship was in deep trouble!","Water Yama’s eyes turned red as he swung the Water Punishment Whip, charging at Mo Hua.","Hua Ruyu’s pretty face was fierce as she activated the Hundred Flowers Spirit Array, striking directly at Mo Hua’s heart veins.","Xie Liu also unleashed Gui Water Sword Qi, piercing towards Mo Hua’s Heavenly Gate.","Once the fight commenced, Mo Hua immediately felt immense pressure.","Two Foundation Establishment Peaks, one Golden Core joined forces—even if this Golden Core could only exert Foundation Establishment Peak strength, it was completely beyond what someone his age and his cultivation level could bear.","No matter how poor Xie Liu was, he still appeared weak only in the Third-Grade State Boundary in the face of Uncle Gu who could fully exert his Golden Core strength.","To him, Xie Liu remained a powerful Golden Core.","For him, the type of Spiritual Cultivator skilled in Concealment Technique and movement techniques could still maneuver a bit.","But Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian, they were Serious Cultivators.","Without Concealment Technique, unable to hide, and although their movement techniques weren’t bad, they were at a disadvantage in front of Xie Liu and the others. It is estimated they wouldn’t last more than ten rounds before being captured.","No way!","Mo Hua, being pursued awkwardly by Xie Liu and the three, finally caught his breath and immediately shouted:","\"Stop!\"","Xie Liu and the three paused slightly.","Mo Hua said with a serious expression: \"I advise you, it’s better to be moderate; let’s just give some face to each other. Don’t force me to go all out; otherwise, you’ll regret it!\"","Xie Liu and the three were stunned, then laughed at Mo Hua’s words.","\"You think you can make us regret it?\" Hua Ruyu sneered.","Water Yama gave a sinister chuckle, \"Overestimating yourself.\"","Even Xie Liu showed a cat-catches-mouse playful expression, snickering: \"Fine, let me see how you make us regret it?\"","Mo Hua glanced at the seriously injured Ouyang Feng, then at Hua Qianqian whose pretty face was pale, realizing they nearly reached a desperate situation.","If the fight continued, in no time, Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian would surely fall into Xie Liu and the group’s hands.","And he was constrained, unable to use many techniques.","Although the timing wasn’t great, and Uncle Gu plus the Taoist Court’s personnel whereabouts were unknown, when it came to this, he could only flip the table first then seek a way out."]},{"number":1611,"title":"Chapter 1611 - 844: Grand Fireworks (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua let out a cold snort, his face full of arrogance as he said:","\"I only need to give the order, and this Rouge Boat will be reduced to ashes! You’d better behave yourselves.\"","Xie Liu mocked, \"Alright, today I want to see how a little Foundation Establishment brat like you will turn my Rouge Boat into ashes?\"","Hua Ruyu also had a smile on her face.","Only Water Yama suddenly felt a tinge of unease in his heart.","He was different from the other two.","Both Xie Liu and Hua Ruyu, although they knew Mo Hua, hadn’t really crossed paths with him.","In Xie Liu’s eyes, Mo Hua was just a \"little dog\" of the Taoist Court.","In Hua Ruyu’s view, Mo Hua was just a \"little junior sister\" from the Hundred Flower Valley.","But Water Yama was different, he had suffered numerous hidden losses at Mo Hua’s hands.","He knew well that this little brat Mo Hua seemed ordinary, but his skills were peculiarly strange.","No one knew what hidden cards he had.","Water Yama said in a deep voice, \"Don’t be careless, this brat is not simple. Keep a close eye on him, and never give him any opportunity.\"","Seeing Water Yama acting so wary of the little cultivator Mo Hua, Xie Liu and Hua Ruyu were somewhat surprised, but then they also put away their contempt.","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow.","This Water Yama was truly sharp and cautious, but it was already too late.","Mo Hua smiled lightly.","Seeing the expression on Mo Hua’s face, Water Yama immediately felt a chill in his heart and said,","\"Not good.\"","He lashed his long whip, drawing a bloody water light, the iron chain like a venomous snake, attacking directly at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua used the Water Passing Step, barely dodging it, and before he had even stabilized, Xie Liu’s Gui Water Sword Qi and Hua Ruyu’s Hundred Flowers Spirit Needle had already struck, leaving Mo Hua no time to breathe.","Water Yama also seized the opportunity to use the Water Shadow Step, trying to get close to Mo Hua.","But just at this moment, the ground suddenly flashed.","Several light cyan beams materialized into a Wooden Prison, momentarily blocking the Sword Qi and Spirit Needle, also holding back Water Yama.","\"Second Grade Wood Prison Formation? When was it set up?\"","The expressions of Water Yama and the others slightly changed.","But this formation, although it was a Second Grade High-Level Formation, couldn’t hold against a Golden Core and two at Foundation Establishment Peak.","In just a moment, the Wood Prison Formation was broken.","However, this brief delay gave Mo Hua the time needed; he had already reached Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian, taking out a Storage Bag and tossing it to Ouyang Feng.","\"Senior Brother Feng!\"","Ouyang Feng caught the Storage Bag, found inside an exquisitely forged iron Shield, and then without any hesitation, took out the Shield, setting it on the ground, standing before them, also shielding Mo Hua and Hua Qianqian.","Water Yama and the others, seeing this, were a bit puzzled.","\"Just one iron Shield to stop the three of us? That’s wishful thinking, isn’t it?\" Xie Liu sneered.","But before his voice fell, he heard Mo Hua softly say,","\"Explode!\"","As soon as the word was spoken, the formation responded.","Outside the boat, a dazzling light suddenly lit up, red and green intertwining, magnificently splendid, streams of fireworks shot into the sky.","The three of Xie Liu were stunned, and then they all understood.","Fireworks!","This brat was setting off fireworks, sending a signal!","The people of the Taoist Court must be nearby!","Xie Liu was mildly annoyed.","He knew that once the people from the Taoist Court arrived, the matter of the Rouge Boat would definitely not end well.","When the Taoists came to investigate before, he had guessed that this day might come.","But he hadn’t expected it to come so quickly and hastily, catching him without any preparation.","In his urgency, Xie Liu could only say: \"Capture these three as hostages, deal with the rest later...\"","At this moment, he also didn’t know how many people from the Taoist Court had come, or where they were ambushed.","He could only make the worst assessment.","If the situation couldn’t be salvaged, then keeping these three as hostages would be his bargaining chip.","With bargaining chips, there might be a slim chance for a turnaround.","Hua Ruyu and Water Yama thought so too.","However, Water Yama, knowing a bit more about Mo Hua’s disposition, thought one step further.","\"Why set up a Shield?\"","\"To guard against fireworks?\"","\"Impossible...\"","\"So what’s it guarding against?\"","The deck beneath their feet began to tremble, Water Yama recalled Mo Hua’s words about making them \"turn to ashes,\" his pupils shrank, instinctively stepping back.","But Xie Liu and Hua Ruyu took a step forward.","Just at this moment, a loud rumble abruptly sounded.","A formation aura, more intense and overwhelming than before, emerged.","This time it wasn’t fireworks. It was truly Second Grade High-Level Li Fire, containing immense destructive power and filled with slaughtering energy!","Flames surged instantly.","The fierce flames, like a flood dragon, engulfed the entire boat.","Moreover, the Spirit Boat itself had numerous formations inscribed during its construction.","The explosion of the Fire Formation was quite powerful, also obliterating these formations inside the Spirit Boat, causing spiritual power to go chaotic, uncontrolledly spreading outwards, crossing and clashing with one another, further augmenting the explosion’s power.","The outsides of the Rouge Boat were blasted into pieces.","A genuine bright red flame, rose to the sky, spreading outwards, in the night sky, resembling a fire dragon.","And the Rouge Boat itself was linked with iron chains.","The range of Mo Hua’s formation setup wasn’t that large initially.","However, once the formation exploded and the Spirit Boat burned, the Li Fire rapidly spread, igniting all the Spirit Boats.","The Rouge Boat, from the front to the back, caught fire.","Through the dense mist, one could see the astonishing firelight, as if it were a sea of fire.","In the distance, on the ship of the Taoist Court.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, who were tracking the Rouge Boat but couldn’t find its whereabouts, were staring blankly at the scene before them.","Even from so far away, they could feel the intense fluctuations of spiritual power.","Fireworks rose, followed by a beam of fire into the sky.","The overwhelming surge of spiritual power swept through, and the sound of explosions rang out continuously."]},{"number":1612,"title":"Chapter 1612 - 844: Grand Fireworks (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The vibrations of the Rouge Boat chain explosions even transmitted through the water surface of Mistwater River to the vicinity of their Spirit Boat.","Ripples spread across the water, causing even the cabin beneath their feet to tremble slightly.","Xia Canonical Official was somewhat lost, opening his mouth, unable to find the right words, finally exclaiming in disbelief:","\"Is this... the commotion caused by Mo Hua?\"","\"Probably...\" Gu Changhuai was similarly stunned, \"He said he would give us a ’hint’...\"","Xia Canonical Official took a shallow breath.","\"He’s just a Foundation Building Middle Stage cultivator, how on earth did he manage such a big disturbance, it’s too outrageous...\"","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment and sighed helplessly: \"That’s how it is when he doesn’t restrain himself...\"","Xia Canonical Official: \"...\"","With the fire as a clue, the position of the Rouge Boat was exposed.","Time was of the essence, and the two did not delay any further.","Xia Canonical Official ordered all the Spirit Boats of the Taoist Court to surround the Rouge Boat from all directions, determined to catch all the cultivators on the Spirit Boat.","If there is any resistance, no matter who they are, they should be killed without mercy!","On Mistwater River, the Spirit Boats of the Taoist Court surged through the dense fog, surrounding the burning Rouge Boat...","At this point, the cultivators on the Rouge Boat were already in a complete state of chaos.","Mo Hua had detonated his own array formation, causing the Spirit Boat to explode.","Those with bad luck, who were near the center of the explosion while engaged in activities, were suddenly blown away by the spiritual power fluctuations.","Those who were farther away were also affected by the aftermath of the explosion, fleeing in panic.","Many men and women, either unclothed or wrapped in sheets, ran around on the boat.","In an instant, the Rouge Boat turned into a sea of fire, and the \"gentle boat\" became a \"nightmare.\"","Meanwhile, Mo Hua, the mastermind, had already grabbed a small boat and was paddling towards the shore with Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian.","Everything was calculated.","Their location was the \"Life-gate\" of the formation explosion, pre-planned by Mo Hua.","Being in the killing formation he set, it’s fundamental for a Formation Master to leave a \"Life-gate\" for oneself, a line of survival.","As the formation exploded, he had Senior Brother Feng raise a large shield.","This large shield was designed by Mo Hua for Taixu Sect Disciples, particularly for a big guy like Cheng Mo, used for hunting Fire-series Monster Beasts.","The shield was covered with various Fire Formation arrays, protecting against spiritual power impacts and fire-series burns.","During Monster Hunting, a Body Cultivator lifting the shield could withstand many attacks from fire-series Monster Beasts directly.","Mo Hua had kept one spare, just right for the occasion.","Occupying the Life-gate, plus the fire-shield defense.","Thus, even though the Rouge Boat exploded with a huge commotion, none of Mo Hua’s group were harmed.","And at this moment, with the Rouge Boat in chaos, Mo Hua took advantage of the situation to escape.","The formation exploded, the Spirit Boat destroyed, appearing mighty, yet such killing power certainly couldn’t kill that Golden Core of Gui Water Sect named Xie Liu.","There was no time to waste; it was time to run.","Ouyang Feng was also aware of the urgency, hastening the Spirit Boat away from the Rouge Boat.","Along the way, some cultivators who had fallen into the water tried to seize their boat but were repelled by Mo Hua and Hua Qianqian using Fireball Technique and Spirit Needles.","After escaping a certain distance and almost getting away, suddenly a deadly wave arose, and a water-blue sword light struck.","Mo Hua quickly used his movement technique to dodge away.","But the Spirit Boat wasn’t a cultivator; it couldn’t use movement techniques, couldn’t turn, and was split open by the water-blue sword light.","Water began flooding into the boat.","The small boat wouldn’t last long before sinking, and there wasn’t enough time to reach the shore.","Mo Hua had no choice but to abandon the small boat with Ouyang Feng and board another Rouge Boat nearby.","This Rouge Boat was farther from the central Flower Boat, lightly impacted, receiving minor damage, but because it was locked together, it was dragged along and caught fire everywhere.","The moment Mo Hua and the others steadied themselves on deck, they saw someone standing opposite them.","It was Xie Liu.","Not only that, suddenly the sound of water surged, and a white figure emerged from the river, it was the extremely aquatic Water Yama.","The two blocked Mo Hua’s group.","But at this moment, their expressions were unspeakably grim.","Xie Liu’s body was bleeding, his water-blue Taoist robe blown to tatters, his skin charred and red in patches.","The second-grade high-level Killing Array explosion, along with the Spirit Boat detonation, had hit him directly.","If not for his Golden Core foundation, he would probably have half his life gone.","Water Yama was also injured but fared much better.","He was sharp-witted and wary of Mo Hua. Thus, when Mo Hua activated the formation, he almost instinctively stepped back a few paces.","Those few steps made all the difference.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t possibly be standing here intact.","Regarding Hua Ruyu, Mo Hua didn’t see her.","But she, at Foundation Establishment Peak, attacking Mo Hua together with the Golden Core Xie Liu, might have been blasted half-dead if not killed outright.","Three enemies became two, but the situation remained dire.","Senior Brother Feng was injured, and Senior Sister Qianqian’s cultivation and strength were far below Water Yama.","The pre-setup formation had been used.","Xie Liu and Water Yama wouldn’t give them time to set up a new formation.","Mo Hua could conceal, use the Water Passing Step, and knew some Water Avoiding Demon Extermination Skills, possibly escaping.","But Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian wouldn’t be able to get away.","In the distance, shadows of boats loomed; people of the Taoist Court were rushing in.","But distance couldn’t save the immediate burning crisis...","Right now, there was no one to help."]},{"number":1613,"title":"Chapter 1613 - 844: Grand Fireworks (Part 4)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua’s thoughts raced, and he quickly understood the situation; he immediately waved his hand and said:","\"I surrender.\"","This move left Xie Liu and Water Yama confused.","\"What do you mean by this?\" Xie Liu frowned and asked.","Mo Hua said, \"Weren’t you trying to negotiate for hostages? We will be your hostages. Otherwise, when the Taoist Court arrives, with Golden Core Realm Supervisors leading them, they will unhesitatingly slaughter all of you.\"","Xie Liu’s face twitched, \"You really know how to think for us...\"","Mo Hua sighed and said, \"I can’t help it; I have a kind heart.\"","Xie Liu paused, looking at the shattered Rouge Boat around, the spreading sea of flames, and the cultivators struggling amidst the fire, then glanced at Mo Hua, the instigator in front of him, with a twitching expression, left speechless.","Water Yama didn’t believe him, narrowed his eyes, and said, \"What do you intend to do?\"","\"Not doing anything. Those who know when to yield are wise. I’ve used all my tricks; I can’t defeat you, so naturally, I surrender. Otherwise, should I recklessly fight to the bitter end and be slain by you?\"","Mo Hua spoke with an air of inevitability.","Water Yama furrowed his brows even tighter.","\"Of course, I have conditions,\" Mo Hua continued, \"Though we will be hostages, you must not harm a single hair on us.\"","Water Yama couldn’t help but mock, \"Why?\"","Mo Hua declared resolutely, \"Because I hold the Water Prison Forbidden Box!\"","Water Yama’s eyes turned red, while Xie Liu was taken aback, \"What Forbidden Box?\"","Mo Hua’s expression became somewhat odd.","Water Yama, at the Foundation Establishment Peak, was aware of the Forbidden Box, yet Xie Liu, at the Golden Core level, knew nothing?","He knew less about the Gui Water Sect’s secrets than Mo Hua, an outsider...","No wonder despite being at the Golden Core level, he would be assigned to such dirty work.","If faced with a real issue, he would likely just be a \"scapegoat\"...","Mo Hua pondered inwardly.","The significance of the Water Prison Forbidden Box was something Xie Liu didn’t understand, but Water Yama definitely did. Despite his cold and dark demeanor, his gaze noticeably wavered.","The Water Prison Forbidden Box was extremely crucial.","Its importance even surpassed killing Mo Hua.","However, dealing with Mo Hua was akin to making a deal with a cunning fox, leaving Water Yama unsure.","Mo Hua glanced back, then said, \"Consider wisely; the Taoist Court’s people are approaching fast, we don’t have much time.\"","\"Agree to my terms; with hostages, you gain bargaining chips for escape, and a chance of obtaining the Water Prison Forbidden Box.\"","\"Otherwise, it will be a do-or-die situation.\"","\"We die here, and the arriving Supervisors kill you. Even if you are lucky enough to survive, you will never get the Water Prison Forbidden Box.\"","Mo Hua’s demeanor was composed, logical and convincing.","Xie Liu and Water Yama exchanged a glance, faces darkened in silence, finally, it was Water Yama who gritted his teeth and said:","\"Fine, I won’t kill you, but you must behave as ’hostages’, or don’t blame me for being ruthless.\"","\"Alright!\" Mo Hua nodded.","Water Yama felt increasingly uneasy; why was this brat suddenly so agreeable?","But with the Taoist Court’s spirit boat drawing nearer, he didn’t have the luxury to ponder.","\"Let’s go!\" Water Yama said in a deep voice.","\"Where to?\" Xie Liu frowned.","Water Yama glanced at Xie Liu, then lowered his voice, \"At this point, we can only retreat to that place...\"","Xie Liu’s eyes trembled, face paling slightly, seemingly fearing that place greatly.","Yet at this juncture, there was no other choice, he could only silently nod.","\"That place...\"","Behind them, Mo Hua, who overheard their conversation, couldn’t help his eyes brightening, and subtly nodded as well.","\"Junior Brother Mo...\" Hua Qianqian’s voice trembled slightly.","\"It’s okay,\" Mo Hua reassured, \"Senior Sister, don’t worry.\"","Hua Qianqian nodded but looked at Mo Hua with worry and self-blame.","Beside her, Ouyang Feng also displayed an embarrassed expression.","He knew Mo Hua excelled in concealment, and could escape if he wanted to, but he stayed to negotiate and delay these two villains all for him and Qianqian.","They were the ones holding Junior Brother Mo back.","Ouyang Feng sighed inwardly.","Then Xie Liu used a token to open a storage box aboard the Rouge Boat, and from it, took out a brand-new, small spirit boat.","Xie Liu boarded the boat first.","Water Yama cast a dark glance at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua calmly said, \"Let’s go.\"","Then he took the lead, jumping onto the spirit boat, and Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian followed him onboard.","Water Yama piloted the spirit boat, gradually distancing them, and any cultivators who approached were repelled by Xie Liu with a single sword strike.","Thus, the group, aboard the small spirit boat, departed from the fire-filled Rouge Boat, heading toward the thicker fog in the distance.","After they left, the Taoist Court’s men also arrived, drawing swords, gripping Spirit-binding Locks, beginning to capture the cultivators on the Rouge Boat..."]},{"number":1614,"title":"Chapter 1614 - 845: Dragon King Temple","paragraphs":["Mistwater River, thick fog, on a small Spirit Boat.","The Water Yama was rowing at the bow, Xie Liu held his sword, standing at the stern, glaring menacingly at the three of Mo Hua.","Ouyang Feng was healing his wounds, Hua Qianqian pressed her lips together, her gaze somewhat uneasy.","Mo Hua, however, looked curious, glancing left and right, as if enjoying the riverside scenery on a leisurely trip.","However, it was nighttime, and the fog was thick.","There was nothing in the surroundings for him to see.","Mo Hua asked: \"Hey, where exactly are we going?\"","Xie Liu’s forehead twitched.","Mo Hua’s casual and somewhat joyful demeanor sparked anger within him.","As if amongst this group of people, the Water Yama was a boatman rowing, he was a guard holding a sword, and Mo Hua was a young master out on a trip, asking where they were headed.","That damned little fool, does he not understand his current situation at all?","Does he have no sense at all?","Xie Liu wished he could slash him with one sword.","But he couldn’t kill him just yet.","He really needed a few hostages, and going to that place required bringing a few living beings, just in case.","Xie Liu suppressed the killing intent in his heart and could only temporarily let Mo Hua prance around in front of him.","Seeing Xie Liu ignoring him, Mo Hua turned his head towards the bow.","The Water Yama was rowing.","Mo Hua stared at the Water Yama for a moment and said: \"You only have one arm, yet you row quite well. Have you often rowed for others before?\"","The Water Yama took a deep breath and said coldly:","\"You’d better shut up.\"","Mo Hua said: \"It’s so oppressive here. Don’t you feel bored if you don’t talk?\"","The Water Yama was somewhat puzzled. How has this little fool survived so long in the Cultivation World?","Has no one wanted to kill him from childhood till now?","The Water Yama calmed his mind and continued rowing.","Mo Hua, bored stiff, leaned on the boat’s edge, stretching his hand in the water, trying to see if a Little Silver Fish would encounter him and tell him some secrets.","Ouyang Feng silently watched Mo Hua, sighing in his heart.","A firm Taoist Heart, composed in the face of important matters, undisturbed amid changes and dangers.","Perhaps this is the spirit someone seeking the Dao should possess.","Among three people traveling together, there would be one who can teach you something.","Although Junior Brother Mo is young, there are quite a few things in him worth learning...","Beside him, Hua Qianqian also glanced at Mo Hua, feeling unexpectedly more at ease.","The group traveled quietly within the thick fog.","Only the sound of Mo Hua’s hand splashing the water echoed in silence.","After an unknown amount of time, Mo Hua, who had yet to summon a Little Silver Fish, suddenly felt uneasy and looked up, seeing a vast, shadowy silhouette looming in the dense fog ahead.","An unusual aura slowly spread out.","\"This is...\"","Mo Hua’s pupils contracted slightly, his heart tightening a few notches.","Sensing the aura ahead, the Water Yama hesitated for a moment but, remembering the Rouge Boat incident was exposed and a large number of Cultivators from the Taoist Court were pursuing them, knew that in the boundless Mistwater, this place was the only true place to hide.","The Water Yama gritted his teeth and drove the Spirit Boat to continue forward.","After thirty minutes, as the Spirit Boat moved closer and closer, the vast silhouette in the thick fog gradually revealed itself.","It was an expanse of a temple.","A lone, colossal temple built on the water, resembling a giant water beast.","Mo Hua displayed a \"shocked\" expression and nervously asked the Water Yama:","\"What is this place? How could such a large temple be built on the water?\"","The Water Yama sneered.","Now the little brat understands fear.","What place is this?","This grand temple is a place where this damn brat will never return from.","The Water Yama thought, still maintaining an indifferent appearance on the surface, \"Once you go in, you’ll know.\"","Then the Water Yama guided the Spirit Boat to the front of the temple. There was a long stairway extending from the temple gate down to the water’s edge.","The Water Yama leaped onto the steps and looked back at the three of Mo Hua.","Mo Hua did not move.","Xie Liu pointed his sword at him and ordered: \"Go up quietly.\"","\"I’ll go, I’ll go... Uncle Gu’s defeated subordinate, can’t fight a Golden Core, but bullying a Foundation Establishment is quite easy...\" Mo Hua muttered.","Xie Liu’s face twitched.","Seeing Xie Liu about to lose his temper, Mo Hua quickly leapt ashore.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian naturally followed Mo Hua.","Lastly was Xie Liu, who securely tethered the Spirit Boat and ascended the steps.","Then, still with the Water Yama leading, Xie Liu, the Golden Core, followed, \"escorting\" the three of Mo Hua along the long steps toward the grand temple interior.","Upon reaching the temple entrance, Mo Hua looked up and saw red walls and golden tiles weathered by countless storms, and a large plaque hanging above the high eaves and tall doors.","On the large plaque, the script was ancient and dignified, inscribed with three big characters:","Dragon King Temple.","Dragon King...","Mo Hua was in awe.","He had only heard of many Divine Beasts in this world, such as True Dragons, True Phoenixes, Qilins, and other mythical creatures.","But he only regarded these as ancient cultivation legends, never witnessing them in person until now.","Now before him stood a \"Dragon King Temple.\"","Even if not a True Dragon, but just a river dragon, it would undoubtedly be extraordinary.","While lost in thought, the Water Yama glanced around and frowned, saying: \"Where is the temple guardian?\"","Xie Liu expanded his Divine Sense, his gaze also sharpening, \"Diverted?\"","The Water Yama shook his head slightly, \"Not likely... this is a critical place, how could there be no one guarding it?\"","Xie Liu nodded slightly.","The Water Yama surveyed the temple gate again, his eyes turning slightly solemn, \"I always feel that this temple seems different from before, the Yin Qi and Evil Qi are heavier...\""]},{"number":1615,"title":"Chapter 1615 - 845: Dragon King Temple (2)","paragraphs":["Sure, here is the translation based on your provided guidelines:","```html","Xie Liu sensed for a moment, but he did not practice Pupil Skill and knew nothing about Divine Soul, so he didn’t sense anything unusual and frowned, saying:","\"At this point, let’s go in and take a look. The fog outside the temple is thick; we can’t stay long.\"","\"Hmm.\" Water Yama nodded.","He took out a Fish Bone Token, cut his finger, dripped blood on the token, and then inserted the token into the mouth of the Monster Beasts copper statue in front of the temple, bowed and said respectfully:","\"Servant has arrived to offer ’tribute’ to the Divine Lord.\"","The temple doors remained motionless.","Water Yama dared not make any moves.","Xie Liu also held his breath and focused.","Only Mo Hua looked at the temple doors with expectation.","After a while, as if Water Yama’s voice reached somewhere and received a response.","Outside the temple doors, the Fish Bone Token briefly flashed with a blood-red color.","The Water Demon’s bronze statue holding the fish bone trembled, its eyes emitting a spooky green light, and then, with a heavy \"boom,\" the ancient doors of the Dragon King Temple slowly opened.","Only then did Water Yama slowly straighten up, exchanged a glance with Xie Liu, and said to Mo Hua and the others:","\"Let’s go inside...\"","\"However, let me warn you,\" Water Yama’s gaze was unkind, especially when he looked at Mo Hua, \"don’t play any tricks, or I would rather not have that thing and kill you.\"","\"Mm-hmm.\" Mo Hua replied perfunctorily.","He didn’t believe for a moment that Water Yama wouldn’t want that box.","All of Water Yama’s abilities, especially the Transforming Evil spell and the Blood Prison Pupil Skill, rely on the Water Prison Forbidden Box for cultivation.","Without the Forbidden Box, he would have no way to further his techniques in this lifetime.","Moreover, this box is an item secretly passed down by the Sect Leader of the Water Prison Sect, which probably contains other valuable things, but it just can’t be opened for now.","It’s strange to think that Water Yama could part with it...","Mo Hua thought silently.","Then Water Yama led the way into the Dragon King Temple.","Mo Hua followed behind, but before stepping over the threshold, he hesitated for a moment.","He had a Heavenly secret Copper Coin clutched in his hand hidden in his sleeve.","Mo Hua wanted very much to calculate the fortune of this trip.","But he also had a premonition, absolutely not to do so; if he did, someone would sense it, and it would ruin everything.","Mo Hua rubbed the Copper Coin, restrained the urge to calculate, put the coin away again, slowly stepped forward, and crossed the threshold of the Dragon King Temple.","And so the group entered the depths of the Dragon King Temple.","Moments later, in the thick fog, blood-red appeared.","The large doors of the Dragon King Temple slowly closed, as if a giant monster had closed its bloody mouth...","...","On the Rouge Boat.","The battle was essentially settled.","The cultivators on the Rouge Boat, whether noble family’s sons or sect disciples, were suddenly startled by Mo Hua during a spring night revel, caught off guard.","Then, as the sea of fire spread and they fled hastily, they encountered the cultivators of the Taoist Court, leaving little room for resistance.","The Taoist Court captured those they needed to capture, showing no mercy to the obstinate.","Now it was mostly about cleanup.","But there was one exception, Ye Hong.","He was brought by Taoist Court people to Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official.","Ye Hong presented a letter, saying:","\"A young lord boarded my boat to come here, and before departing, he gave me this letter, saying that if I encountered an investigation by the Taoist Court, I should give this letter to a Canon with the surname Gu to clear up misunderstandings and avoid some trouble.\"","A Canon with the surname Gu...","Xia Canonical Official glanced at Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai maintained a calm expression, took the letter, glanced at it, and raised his eyebrows.","The letter was indeed written by Mo Hua, simply stating:","\"Uncle Gu, this person is named Ye Hong, father of Senior Sister Ye Jin, not a bad person.\"","Seeing Xia Canonical Official’s displeasure, Gu Changhuai showed her the letter, after reading it, she nodded, pondered for a moment, and said to Ye Hong:","\"I understand the situation. However... even though you don’t know the inner workings of the Rouge Boat and are not involved in its schemes, there is indeed a ship belonging to you among the Rouge Boats. You still must come with us to the Taoist Court to explain the background, provide a statement, and formalize the legal procedures.\"","Ye Hong breathed a sigh of relief, bowed, and said:","\"Of course.\"","\"Alright, you may leave now.\" Xia Canonical Official said.","\"Yes,\" Ye Hong bowed, but seemed hesitant and asked in a low voice, \"Where might that young lord be now...\"","The Rouge Boat explosion and the spreading fire had Ye Hong searching for a long time, still unable to find any sign of Mo Hua, causing him some worry.","He didn’t know the explosion was caused by Mo Hua, so he feared Mo Hua might have been caught in it.","Gu Changhuai said: \"You don’t have to worry; he should be fine.\"","With Mo Hua’s meticulousness, if his own Formation backfired on him, that would indeed be strange.","\"Yes.\" Ye Hong replied and bowed.","Being only at Foundation Establishment Peak, as a Third Grade family member, he naturally showed due respect towards Gu Changhuai, a Golden Core Realm Canon of the Taoist Court.","Ye Hong turned to leave, but when he reached the doorway, he encountered someone and was momentarily stunned.","\"Xiao Zhisi?\"","Xiao Tianquan, upon seeing Ye Hong, also had a flicker of strangeness in his eyes, but he quickly concealed it, nodding and greeting:","\"Elder Ye.\"","Seeing this, Gu Changhuai’s eyes narrowed slightly, \"You two know each other?\"","Ye Hong said: \"Our Ye family is a Third Grade family from Mistwater City. Xiao Zhisi once stayed in Mistwater City for official duties, and by chance, we crossed paths a few times and struck up some acquaintance.\"","Xiao Tianquan also bowed and said: \"Previously in the Ye family, thank you, Elder Ye, for your hospitality, it’s just that...\"","Xiao Tianquan’s eyes flashed as he asked, \"Elder Ye, why are you here?\""]},{"number":1616,"title":"Chapter 1616 - 845: Dragon King Temple (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"This... it’s hard to explain...\" Ye Hong sighed, realizing it wasn’t the time to talk, he said, \"Mr. Xiao has official duties, so I won’t disturb you too much. If there’s an opportunity in the future, I will fulfill my duty as a host and entertain Mr. Xiao properly.\"","Xiao Tianquan clasped his fists, \"Thank you, Elder Ye.\"","The relationship between the two seemed quite good.","Gu Changhuai saw this and didn’t mind.","The cultivators of the Taoist Court had their official duties, but privately, they couldn’t avoid having some personal connections.","After Ye Hong left, Xiao Tianquan reported:","\"The matters with the Xia Official and Supervisor Gu are all dealt with.\"","\"The fire was extinguished, the cultivators who fell into the water were rescued as much as possible, but those who couldn’t be saved, perished in the Water Demon’s mouth.\"","\"Those injured by the Formation explosion were treated with pills, and along with others, were bound by the Spirit-binding Lock, restrained on the Taoist Court’s ship to be identified before further action upon return.\"","\"Some key figures were also apprehended and documented.\"","\"However, Water Yama has disappeared...\"","Xiao Tianquan’s expression was somewhat solemn.","While speaking, another person appeared outside the door.","This person wore the Taoist Court Canon robe, his aura was deep, his steps steady, also a Golden Core Cultivator, but his eyes squinted slightly, with a smile on his face, though it felt a bit forced and incongruous.","This person was Master Xiao.","Mo Hua previously gave him a nickname, \"Smiling Tiger.\"","Master Xiao entered the room, exchanged simple greetings with Gu Changhuai and Xia Official, then said:","\"I’ve inquired and investigated a bit, there is a Golden Core on this ship.\"","\"This Golden Core Cultivator, surnamed Xie, first name Liu, was previously an Inner Gate Instructor of the Gui Water Sect, with considerable experience. With a few more years, he could have been promoted to ’Elder’.\"","\"But he was closely associated with the Sever Gold Sect and was previously involved in a case linked to the direct lineage of the Sever Gold Sect.\"","\"This case wasn’t too big nor too small, but it was still a wrongdoing, bringing shame to the Gui Water Sect. As a result, Xie Liu was expelled from the Sect.\"","\"Unexpectedly, even after being expelled, he secretly continued to do these dirty jobs.\"","\"Truly... an unfortunate Sect...\"","Master Xiao squinted his eyes and sighed.","Gu Changhuai’s expression was slightly odd.","He knew in his heart, Xie Liu might be doing dirty work, but this dirty work was originally the Gui Water Sect’s; frankly, the Gui Water Sect was indeed dirtier.","But since they were all Court Officials, some formal words of courtesy must be said.","\"This Xie Liu seems to have escaped...\"","Master Xiao continued, \"I used torture, interrogated a few people, and acquired some leads from their mouths.\"","\"According to them, Rouge Boat was secretly set up with a Formation by someone unknown, then suddenly exploded, the fire spreading rapidly. The Golden Core Xie Liu, along with the wanted ’Water Yama’, took three young cultivators towards the depths of the thick fog...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"Abducting...\"","He glanced at Xia Official, the two exchanged looks, both faces were slightly solemn.","\"Xie Liu must be brought to justice, and Water Yama cannot be allowed to escape again. How about this? I and Supervisor Gu will pursue them, while here at the Rouge Boat, I will trouble Master Xiao to help with the aftermath.\" Xia Official said.","\"This course of action is good, but,\" Master Xiao squinted, showing no emotion on his face, but his tone was slightly worried:","\"You two going alone might not be safe... Xie Liu is dishonest, and Water Yama is cunning, both are tough to deal with.\"","\"Moreover, they are headed towards the depths of the fog, indicating that there might be a sanctuary for heretical demon in the dense mist, possibly hiding other Golden Core Evil Cultivitors; it’s not impossible...\"","Master Xiao quickly added, \"Of course, Xia Official and Supervisor Gu have profound cultivation, intelligence and courage, and are outstanding talents in the Taoist Court, naturally fearless of these heretical demons.\"","\"But precisely because of this, if something goes wrong or there’s any mishap, it would be a significant loss for our Qianxue Court Tribunal. Please proceed cautiously and reconsider...\"","Master Xiao had spent many years in the Taoist Court, and his skills in speaking were evident.","Xia Official then said, \"In your view, Master Xiao, what should be done?\"","Master Xiao pondered, \"Since this is the case, why don’t... I go along with you two? Though fighting a rabbit might require full strength, with three Golden Cores joining forces, even if Xie Liu and Water Yama had three heads and six arms, they couldn’t create much havoc...\"","Xia Official had some concerns, \"But, what about the Rouge Boat...\"","Master Xiao replied, \"The matter of the Rouge Boat is already settled, the Taoist Court will send people to take over, the subsequent matters are trivial, no need for us to worry.\"","\"On the contrary, the situation with Xie Liu is urgent, if we don’t pursue soon, I’m afraid we’ll miss them.\"","Xia Official thought for a moment before slowly nodding.","Under such circumstances, indeed, it’s better if the three of them go.","Moreover, Xia Official knew, although Master Xiao was showing great respect, in terms of position, they were all Court Officials, and outwardly she led because of the face provided by the Xia family.","In reality, she didn’t have the authority to dictate to other Court Officials.","Master Xiao showed such humility, giving plenty of face, she couldn’t refuse easily.","\"Alright, let’s go together to apprehend Xie Liu and Water Yama together.\" Xia Official said.","And as soon as she spoke, Xiao Tianquan also clasped his hands saying:","\"Xia Official, I am incompetent but would like to go as well.\"","\"You?\" Xia Official was slightly stunned.","Xiao Tianquan stated righteously:","\"Water Yama is extremely wicked; everyone should eradicate him. Last time he got away, I couldn’t eat or sleep in peace. This time I will ensure he is brought to justice, please approve this, Official.\"","Xia Official looked at Xiao Tianquan, recalled her uncle’s instructions before coming, and nodded:","\"Alright, you may go.\"","\"Yes.\" Xiao Tianquan clasped his hands.","Gu Changhuai thought Xiao Tianquan was eager to earn merits and did not mind.","But Master Xiao, on the side, showed a hint of indifference and also some hostility when looking at Xiao Tianquan.","The Taoist Court then prepared the Spirit Boat.","Gu Changhuai, Xia Official, along with the Xiao family’s Master Xiao and Xiao Tianquan, together boarded the Spirit Boat headed toward the depths of the mist.","As they moved, Master Xiao, who always squinted and smiled forcibly, turned his head to glance at the wreckage, blood mixed with fire, the Rouge Boat still not burned out, his eyes slightly opened.","In his eyes lay a sea of blood.","Strands of Evil Qi flowed within.","...","Within the Dragon King Temple.","Mo Hua and his party continued to walk into the temple.","The temple was spacious, with high walls and flying eaves, quite imposing. However, along the way, it was empty and dead quiet, without any sound.","Water Yama and Xie Liu felt increasingly uneasy.","Even Mo Hua felt a twinge of unease in his heart.","They walked all the way to a large hall, Water Yama hesitated for a moment, stepped forward, knocked on the door, and said:","\"Mr. Witch, I brought ’offerings’.\"","There was no response from inside.","\"Mr. Witch?\"","Water Yama frowned.","\"Where is everyone in the temple? Where have they gone?\"","\"Mr. Witch, are you here?\"","\"Mr. Witch...\"","Water Yama’s voice grew lower, and his mood became more solemn.","At that moment, there was a sound of something dripping. Water Yama’s expression stiffened, quickly withdrew a few steps, moving away from his spot.","Simultaneously, something fell from the beam above, crashed to the ground.","Everyone looked intently.","It was a bloody corpse."]},{"number":1617,"title":"Chapter 1617 - 846: Monster","paragraphs":["Everyone present turned pale.","Whose corpse is this?","Water Yama identified the attire on the corpse and coldly said:","\"It’s the temple guardian’s, there are teeth marks on the body, severely mutilated, flesh mottled, as if... something gnawed on it...\"","Before his words finished, a sound came from the beams above.","\"There’s something up there!\"","Water Yama’s pupils shrank.","But before Water Yama could sense anything, Mo Hua had already pulled Ouyang Feng with one hand and Hua Qianqian with the other, retreating far to the side.","From the beam above, a murderous intent suddenly appeared.","A massive, deformed, bright red blood shadow descended with a speed almost indiscernible to the naked eye.","In an instant, a bloody wind assaulted their faces.","\"So fast!\"","Water Yama’s heart trembled, and he immediately drew his long whip to meet the blood shadow.","But after only one exchange, Water Yama was shaken back.","The blood-drenched figure landed on all fours, roared, and rushed at Water Yama.","But before it could reach Water Yama, a deep blue sword light struck its body.","It was Xie Liu’s Gui Water Sword Qi.","The sword qi obstructed the blood shadow for a moment, but only for a moment. It didn’t even leave a mark on the monster.","Xie Liu, in the Golden Core Realm, wore an extremely ugly expression.","The sudden change, and the blood shadow’s speed had put Water Yama at a disadvantage, but now with a moment’s respite, he regained his composure.","He executed the Water Shadow Step, turning into several ghostly figures to confuse the blood-colored monster.","At the same time, he hid in the water shadows and used the Water Punishment Whip to launch a stealth attack.","Xie Liu dared not hold back any longer and pushed the Gui Water Sword Technique to the fullest extent within the Foundation Establishment Realm.","Waves of Gui Water Sword Qi erupted, aimed at the grotesque and bloody monster.","Mo Hua, on the other hand, watched from the sidelines.","Seeing no movement from Mo Hua, Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian also remained vigilant without taking action.","The battle continued, with Mo Hua observing quietly.","The monster’s body was entwined with deep red blood qi, which enveloped its form, making it appear as a massive blood shadow with no discernible shape.","But with each attack, it seemed to consume the blood qi.","In front of the hall, after fighting Water Yama and Xie Liu for a while, the blood color on its body faded, and its form became vaguely visible.","Mo Hua scrutinized it for a moment, his pupils involuntarily quivering.","This was a... demon creature of unknown class.","Its body was as tall as two people, with thick but deformed limbs, crawling on all fours, twisted yet extremely agile.","Its face was ugly, mouth full of blood, seemingly still with human flesh on it.","Thick, seemingly blue-green scales covered its body.","The scales were extremely thick and hard.","Neither Water Yama’s Water Punishment Whip nor Xie Liu’s Gui Water Sword Qi could make the slightest cut.","Mo Hua was slightly shocked.","By the looks of its blood qi, this monster was only a Second Grade creature, but Water Yama at Foundation Establishment Peak, and Xie Liu in the Golden Core Realm—though limited to Foundation Establishment Peak strength—were certainly stronger than ordinary Foundation Establishment Peak.","Both attacking with full force, yet they couldn’t even scratch the monster’s scales...","\"What exactly... is this thing?\"","A serious expression spread across Mo Hua’s face.","He made a minor move, casting a couple of Fireball Techniques to test his strength.","But his mid-stage Foundation Establishment Fireball Technique, upon hitting the monster, vanished silently, not even causing a scratch, likely not even letting the beast feel a hint of warmth.","The monster didn’t even glance at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua roughly gauged his strength and reluctantly retracted his hand, then obediently watched from the sidelines.","The fierce battle in front of the hall continued.","Whip shadows, sword qi, and blood shadows intertwined.","According to Mo Hua’s calculations, Water Yama and Xie Liu were not opponents for the monster; in a direct confrontation, they couldn’t break its scales.","But should their claws touch them, blood marks would undoubtedly be left behind.","The blood marks exuded black air, clearly mixed with many sinister and filthy elements.","Fighting hard like this, Water Yama and Xie Liu would eventually die.","Mo Hua began considering an escape route.","But before he could figure something out, the monster suddenly roared, transforming into a gust of bloody wind, leaping onto a beam and disappearing into the shadows.","\"Ran away?\"","Mo Hua was taken aback.","Water Yama and Xie Liu bore numerous wounds, their expressions heavy. Seeing the monster suddenly flee, they both felt a sense of relief.","However, Mo Hua frowned.","He glanced at the visibly exhausted Water Yama and Xie Liu, somewhat puzzled.","If he were that monster, he would surely finish them off first; they had fought so far, and it suddenly fled?","Why?","Mo Hua recalled the many signs of the bloody monster and had a rough guess in his heart.","\"Is it because... of its blood qi?\"","This monster, perhaps, needed the blood qi swirling around its body to move.","With blood qi enveloping it, it could wander around, hunting cultivators.","Without blood qi, it had to retreat.","Was this blood qi used to power its powerful flesh?","Or perhaps, it hadn’t fully transformed yet and had to rely on blood qi to move outside?","Mo Hua silently pondered in his heart.","On the other side, Xie Liu and Water Yama had already taken out pills to begin healing.","The injuries on their bodies weren’t too severe, but the troublesome aspect was the blood qi within the monster’s claws.","They didn’t know the origin of this blood qi, but it was certainly tainted with human blood and other unknown foulness, now seeping into their wounds. If they didn’t remove the filth quickly, it would leave future troubles."]},{"number":1618,"title":"Chapter 1618 - 846: Monster (Part 2)","paragraphs":["The two of them sat in meditation to heal.","Mo Hua quietly began to gather a Fireball Technique at his fingertips.","But just as he made a move, Xie Liu suddenly opened his eyes and glared fiercely at Mo Hua: \"Kid, what are you doing?\"","Mo Hua extinguished the Fireball Technique, looking innocent, \"I wasn’t doing anything.\"","Xie Liu sneered, \"I’m warning you, don’t try any tricks.\"","\"Oh.\"","Mo Hua looked indifferent.","Xie Liu gritted his teeth in anger, but healing was urgent, and he couldn’t let this kid disturb his peace of mind.","Xie Liu suppressed his anger and continued to heal.","Mo Hua tested for a moment and realized that although Xie Liu and the others were healing, they were also watching him, hence he restrained himself a bit and indeed stopped making any more moves.","But after a while, Shui Yan suddenly spat out a mouthful of blood, and when he opened his eyes again, they were completely red.","His face was enveloped by deep Evil Qi, and a violent desire surged in his eyes, then he turned his head, staring intently at Hua Qianqian.","Desire burned within him, causing his entire body to tremble.","\"Not good!\"","Mo Hua’s expression changed, and he quickly pulled Hua Qianqian back a few steps.","The next moment, Shui Yan lunged forward.","Ouyang Feng swung his longsword horizontally, blocking for a moment, but failed to hold him back.","Mo Hua threw a few fireballs, momentarily hindering Shui Yan, but it had little effect. Shui Yan, like an Evil Ghost, ignored everything and continued lunging at Hua Qianqian.","Mo Hua said coldly, \"Wretch, don’t you want that box anymore?\"","Shui Yan’s eyes remained blood-red, ignoring his words.","Mo Hua’s heart sank, secretly thinking it wasn’t good.","The Water Prison Forbidden Box was important when Shui Yan was rational.","Now this Shui Yan, after many hard battles, had lost his Vital Energy and the bloody monster had soiled his Blood Qi, worsening his injuries, and the Evil Qi gradually got out of control.","Previously, he had inhaled so much dense fog that desire was deeply rooted. Now, it seemed his state of mind was unbalanced, entirely controlled by desire.","\"Forget it...\"","Seeing Shui Yan charging again, Mo Hua silently thought to himself.","This waste, seems to be useless...","Golden light flickered in his eyes as he began to mobilize his Divine Soul, trying to see if he could use the Soul-Shocking Sword to shatter Shui Yan’s Divine Soul directly.","Just then, a figure stood in front of him, blocking Shui Yan and his line of sight, hindering his Soul-Shocking Sword.","It was Xie Liu.","He protected Mo Hua, swung back with a sword, forcing Shui Yan to retreat, then struck again, slicing Shui Yan’s shoulder.","Shui Yan felt the pain, his Divine Sense clearing up a lot, and he snapped back to his senses, cursing:","\"Xie Liu, what the hell are you doing?\"","As a Golden Core, being cursed like this made Xie Liu’s face slightly angry, then he sneered, \"What are you doing?\"","Shui Yan bitterly said: \"I can’t hold back the fire, need to vent a bit.\"","Xie Liu retorted, \"No way!\"","Shui Yan was furious, speechless, and shouted angrily:","\"What’s wrong with you? They are not only unrelated to you, but also your enemies. Why stop me from venting my anger on them?\"","Xie Liu pointed his longsword at Shui Yan, sneering, \"I’ve been wanting to ask... that box the kid mentioned, what is it?\"","Shui Yan hesitated, and his confidence weakened a bit, only saying, \"It’s none of your concern.\"","Xie Liu chuckled disdainfully, \"You think I’m an idiot?\"","Shui Yan said, \"Even if I give that thing to you, you wouldn’t be able to use it.\"","Xie Liu said, \"You don’t give it to me, how do you know I can’t use it?\"","Shui Yan gritted his teeth and said helplessly, \"That thing is really not something you can learn.\"","Xie Liu’s face turned cold, \"You can learn it, and I can’t? Don’t forget, you’re just Foundation Establishment, and I’m a Golden Core. Tell me... what exactly is that box?\"","Shui Yan’s expression turned cold and he said nothing.","Seeing that Xie Liu couldn’t get an answer, Mo Hua \"kindheartedly\" told him: \"It’s the Water Prison Forbidden Box.\"","Xie Liu was taken aback, \"Water Prison Forbidden Box? What is that?\"","Mo Hua said: \"You know the Water Prison Sect, right...\"","When Shui Yan heard this, he immediately shouted angrily: \"Kid, shut up!\"","Xie Liu slashed a sword light toward Shui Yan, forcing him back a few steps, then sneered and turned to look at Mo Hua, \"Continue.\"","Mo Hua continued: \"The Water Prison Sect was the predecessor of the Gui Water Sect. The Water Prison Forbidden Box was the treasure of the top Twelve Streams Sect of its time, containing the Ultimate Technique that only the Water Prison Sect masters could cultivate!\"","Xie Liu’s eyes instantly turned red, his breathing grew heavy, his expression filled with disbelief.","Sect Protecting Treasure, Sect Leader’s Ultimate Technique!","He used to be a Sect Disciple, later an Inner Gate Instructor, a step away from becoming an Inner Sect Elder.","Thus, he clearly understood the difficulty of advancement within the Sect and the strict barriers to inheritance.","Sect Protecting Treasure, Sect Leader’s Ultimate Technique, even if he became an Elder, was something he could never touch in his lifetime.","He was not even worthy to catch a glimpse.","But now, such a thing was almost within reach!","Xie Liu trembled, \"Where is it?\"","Mo Hua glanced at Shui Yan, then at Xie Liu, pondered for a moment and sighed:","\"Originally, if Shui Yan hadn’t made a move, I would have given it to him afterward, but he broke his promise, leaving me with no choice. Here’s the deal, as long as you ensure the safety of me and my three senior brothers and sisters, once we leave the Dragon King Temple and reach the shore, I’ll tell you where the Forbidden Box is.\"","Xie Liu’s gaze was dark, as if lost in thought.","Mo Hua then said: \"No matter what ideas you have, they won’t work. If you kill me, I won’t tell, if you threaten me, I still won’t tell. This Forbidden Box is our only bargaining chip for survival; if we give it to you now, the three of us will surely die. So, until we escape safely, I cannot tell you where it is...\"","\"The safety of the three of us and the Water Prison Sect’s master treasure, you can only choose one.\""]},{"number":1619,"title":"Chapter 1619 - 846: Monster (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Xie Liu didn’t need to choose.","In Mo Hua’s eyes, the lives of the three of them were worth less than a single hair of this treasure.","This was the Sect Leader’s legacy for the sect’s protection!","But...","Xie Liu hesitated and said, \"How can I be sure that after you get out, you’ll give me this treasure?\"","Mo Hua looked indifferent, \"This forbidden box, I snatched it from the hands of Shui Yan. I can’t understand it myself, so keeping it is useless. Using it to exchange for my own life and that of my senior brother and sister is only natural, isn’t it?\"","\"If you’re worried, after we get out, you can take us to the Third-Grade State Boundary. By then, you’re a Golden Core, we’re just Foundation Establishment; naturally, we can’t resist and can only obediently tell you the whereabouts of the item.\"","Xie Liu frowned and pondered several times, feeling that what Mo Hua said seemed reasonable, and then nodded slightly.","On the side, Shui Yan said coldly:","\"This little brat is crafty and cunning, Xie Elders, don’t listen to his nonsense, or you’ll fall into his trap.\"","Xie Liu glanced back at Shui Yan, sneering, \"Aren’t you just the same? No matter how cunning he is, he’s just a kid of a mere twenty years of cultivation age. If we talk about being sinister, how could he compare to you?\"","Shui Yan hastily said, \"You have no idea about this brat’s background.\"","\"That’s right, I don’t know his background, but I know very well your cruelty, Shui Yan.\" Xie Liu laughed mockingly.","Seeing that Xie Liu didn’t understand, Shui Yan couldn’t help but curse, \"Fool!\"","A glint of killing intent flashed in Xie Liu’s eyes, \"I respect you because you’ve done a lot for the young master, and you have the potential to advance to Golden Core. But don’t forget, you’re not a Golden Core yet. If you’re disrespectful again, don’t blame me for being impolite.\"","Mo Hua nodded repeatedly on the side, \"Exactly, exactly. Shui Yan has been used to being arrogant in the Foundation Establishment Realm, thinking that once he forms a core, he will surely slaughter all directions, so he doesn’t even regard Elder Xie in his eyes.\"","\"On the surface, he might be respectful to you, but now that something has happened, he’s anxious and exposing his true nature, calling you a ’fool’. It’s truly too much...\"","Mo Hua, with eloquence, said all this in one breath.","Xie Liu looked ashamed and angry, staring sharply at Shui Yan.","Shui Yan cursed inwardly and quickly said, \"Elder Xie, don’t be swayed by this brat’s words.\"","Xie Liu sneered, \"Do I need your reminder?\"","\"Exactly, exactly,\" Mo Hua said, \"Elder Xie doesn’t need Shui Yan to speak out of turn. For him to say such things, he still looks down on you, thinking you’re a ’fool’.\"","Shui Yan, infuriated, said, \"Brat, aren’t you sowing discord?\"","Mo Hua replied confidently, \"How is it sowing discord? Am I not speaking the truth? You know very well what you’re thinking.\"","\"If you can’t say it, I will. Since what I say is the truth, it is ’telling it as it is’ rather than ’sowing discord’. \"","\"I’m just stating the facts. If you don’t let me speak, it shows you’re up to something, trying to deceive Elder Xie.\"","Unable to win an argument with Mo Hua, Shui Yan grew furious and shouted:","\"I’ll kill you!\"","Before he could act, Xie Liu immediately swung a sword, striking again, driving back Shui Yan’s whip.","Mo Hua stood behind Xie Liu and quickly said:","\"Elder Xie, Shui Yan wants to kill me. He can’t get the forbidden box, nor does he want you to have it. His intentions are truly despicable.\"","Shui Yan gritted his teeth.","Xie Liu looked at Shui Yan with increasing hostility.","Seeing no way out, Shui Yan sighed and said, \"Elder Xie, considering we’re from the same clan, we have some connection...\"","\"What does being from the same clan matter?\" Mo Hua interjected, \"Why didn’t you tell Elder Xie about the forbidden box? Such an important treasure, you want to hoard it alone? Clearly, you don’t place Elder Xie in your heart. Now, seeing things go south, you’re trying to rekindle old ties. Aren’t you ashamed?\"","Xie Liu’s gaze turned cold as he looked at Shui Yan.","How could he not know that Mo Hua was sowing discord?","But even though Mo Hua was sowing discord, what he said was indeed the truth.","This Shui Yan wanted to privately hoard the treasure, deserving death!","Moreover, previously, he didn’t mention the Water Prison Forbidden Box in front of him, showing he didn’t regard Xie Liu, a Golden Core, in his eyes.","If it weren’t for this little brat’s information, he would’ve missed out on such a great opportunity!","Xie Liu pointed his sword at Shui Yan, warning, \"From now on, stay away from these three brats.\"","At least until he obtained the Water Prison Forbidden Box, these three couldn’t come to any harm.","Shui Yan, full of remorse, pleaded, \"Elder Xie, if you believe this brat so easily, you’ll surely be poisoned by him!\"","Unheeding the honest advice, Xie Liu replied firmly:","\"Say no more, I’m aware. Do I need you to teach me how to act?\"","\"Exactly, exactly.\" Mo Hua nodded again.","Shui Yan was filled with hatred, but now Xie Liu needed to protect Mo Hua and the others for the forbidden box, leaving Shui Yan powerless and forced to temporarily stop.","Afterwards, they sat down for a while to heal their injuries.","This time, however, a rift formed between Xie Liu and Shui Yan, making them sit farther apart, cautiously guarding against each other.","Mo Hua instead moved closer to Xie Liu, looking with a smug expression at Shui Yan, infuriating Shui Yan to the core.","But he dared not act out.","On the surface, they barely maintained an uneasy peace.","After resting, Xie Liu looked at Shui Yan, his tone slightly softened, \"We’ll discuss the forbidden box later. Right now, the priority is to find out what happened in this temple and what that monster is...\"","Although he was a Golden Core and had once guarded the Rouge Boat scene, he rarely came to the Dragon King Temple.","Shui Yan, on the other hand, often brought the \"sacrifices\" to the temple.","So Shui Yan was much more familiar with this temple, making it necessary to rely on him to hide from the Taoist Court’s pursuit.","Knowing the importance of the situation, and considering his deep scheming, Shui Yan suppressed his previous grievances and nodded:","\"What Elder Xie says is true...\"","He glanced around, frowning, \"Something significant must have happened in this Dragon King Temple for it to become so strange. This is no ordinary place; without understanding it, danger looms large.\"","Xie Liu frowned, \"What about Mr. Witch, could it be that he too...\"","Shui Yan shook his head, \"Mr. Witch is favored by the Divine Lord, with profound divine skills; it shouldn’t be...\"","Xie Liu looked at the hall, \"This is Mr. Witch’s room?\"","Shui Yan nodded.","Xie Liu said, \"Shall we go in and take a look? We might find some clues.\"","Shui Yan hesitated, showing a bit of fear, \"Mr. Witch is of an odd temperament, mercurial, and generally doesn’t allow anyone into his room. If we enter rashly, it might incur his wrath later.\"","\"Given the special situation now, there’s no choice.\" Xie Liu said.","Shui Yan thought for a moment and nodded, \"Alright.\"","Distant aid can’t help the immediate.","Being scolded by Mr. Witch is still better than dying at the hands of an unknown monster.","Having battled that monster before, Xie Liu and the others knew how terrifying it was, with swirling blood aura, hard scales, and deformed limbs.","Not knowing the situation now, escaping was no option.","They stood in front of the hall’s door.","Shui Yan hesitated for a while, then reached out and slowly pushed open Mr. Witch’s door amid the dull creaking sound.","A strong scent of blood rushed out...","...","(ps. An extra Chapter today, more to come later~)"]},{"number":1620,"title":"Chapter 1620 - 847: Chaotic Situation","paragraphs":["The spacious room was soaked in blood, with dismembered body parts scattered about, as if some Demon Monster had been feasting inside.","Even Shui Yanluo, an Evil Cultivator who had killed countless, felt somewhat nauseated.","Though he killed, he did not eat people.","But the people in this room had clearly been \"gnawed and chewed\" by something.","\"Could it be that the people in the temple were all eaten by that monster?\"","\"Was Mr. Witch also eaten?\"","Xie Liu and Shui Yanluo’s hearts sank.","\"Look around and see if there are any clues,\" Xie Liu said.","Shui Yanluo nodded.","Then the two of them began searching the messy room full of severed limbs.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian turned pale instantly when they saw the blood-soaked flesh.","As Sect Disciples, they had never seen such a bloody and terrifying scene.","Hua Qianqian covered her mouth and nose with her hand and closed her eyes, not daring to look any further.","Mo Hua was relatively fine.","Although he felt some discomfort, his short, not even twenty-year-long Tao Cultivation career was already filled with extensive encounters with Heretical Demons.","He had seen similar scenes before.","And he was a Monster Hunter, having witnessed monsters devouring humans since childhood, so he quickly adapted.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then also began searching the room.","However, with the ground covered in flesh, it was a bit dirty, and he didn’t want to dirty his hands, so he took a stick out of his Storage Bag, poking here and prodding there, looking for clues.","After searching for a while, he indeed found something.","\"A large number of Formations were once drawn inside the room, and they were drawn with human blood; these are Evil Formations...\"","\"These Formations have all been activated.\"","\"After the Formation operated, something seemed to have happened, but to prevent others from knowing, even the Formation Patterns were erased...\"","\"This Formation... is somewhat complicated.\"","Mo Hua frowned; with his Formation foundation and experience with Evil Formations, he couldn’t see much more.","Of course, it could also be that the remaining Formation Patterns were already few and blurred by blood, so he couldn’t discern them.","Additionally, Mo Hua also found a small piece of scale within the flesh.","This scale was a blue-ink color, stained with blood, similar to the scales on that monster, but smaller and more crystalline.","The scale lacked the eerie Blood Qi but retained a trace of...","Mo Hua pondered for a moment; it was difficult to describe.","But by intuition, it was a scent he had never perceived from any beast, somewhat ancient, with a hint of sacredness.","Mo Hua sniffed around near the scale.","Besides the strong stench of blood, there was another fresh blood scent.","The strong blood smell was Human Blood.","What was the fresh blood scent...?","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","But this blood only left a scent, with no liquid, not even a trace, overwhelmed by the stench of Human Blood, making it even more difficult to detect.","Mo Hua shook his head, muttering to himself:","\"What on earth happened in this room? What Formation was set up, and what is the origin of this blood scent?\"","\"What was feeding here?\"","\"And Mr. Witch, could it be...?\"","Mo Hua’s gaze flickered with thought.","On the other side, Shui Yanluo and Xie Liu also finished searching, then gathered together and said:","\"These corpses are the temple guards’...\"","\"There’s no corpse of Mr. Witch.\"","\"He might still be alive.\"","\"Everything else has been destroyed, books, Jade Slips, Tokens, all ruined, seemingly done on purpose by someone...\"","The two frowned at this point.","Questions increased, yet what they knew remained very limited.","This Dragon King Temple, more secretive than the Rouge Boat, was shrouded in thick fog, making it difficult for ordinary cultivators to find.","This was a place for the Divine Lord’s banquet, under the protection of the Divine Lord.","Who could have such great power to create such bizarre disturbances, and for what purpose?","Shui Yanluo glanced at the scattered limbs and the sticky flesh underfoot, feeling a bit uneasy, said:","\"We shouldn’t stay here too long, let’s leave first.\"","Xie Liu also felt uneasy, being a Golden Core cultivator, he vaguely sensed some events were beyond his understanding.","The group left Mr. Witch’s main hall and stepped outside; the blood scent faded, but the oppressive feeling grew heavier.","It was as if something was watching them from the shadows.","Shui Yanluo’s eyes darted, and he immediately said: \"Let’s get out of this temple!\"","They came here to hide.","But now, it seems, hiding in this temple isn’t much safer than encountering the Court Official’s dogs, and the temple itself might be more dangerous.","Unknown dangers lingered.","If so, why stay here?","Xie Liu understood too, responding in a deep voice: \"Alright!\"","Mo Hua was a bit reluctant.","He had gone through a lot to get into this temple, and now he was about to leave empty-handed.","Mo Hua, with a shift in mind, thought of some little tricks to keep Xie Liu and Shui Yanluo here, but turning to see Ouyang Feng and the pale-faced Hua Qianqian, he softened his heart a bit.","\"I don’t mind, but it’s indeed dangerous for senior brother and sister to stay here; it’s better to go out first...\"","Shui Yanluo set out, heading towards the temple’s exit.","Mo Hua followed silently.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian closely followed Mo Hua, while Xie Liu stayed at the back, also closely watching Mo Hua.","The Sect Leader’s legacy was tied to Mo Hua.","He couldn’t let Mo Hua die, nor could he let Mo Hua escape.","Even if death were the only option, it would have to wait until he secured what he needed...","The group proceeded cautiously towards the temple’s exit."]},{"number":1621,"title":"Chapter 1621 - 847: Chaos (Extra - for Alliance Hierarch Boss Feng Wo Xin) (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Inside the temple, it remained deathly silent; the high walls of the grand hall, with their ancient carved beams, appeared overwhelmingly oppressive.","After walking for a short while, they arrived at the entrance of the temple.","Xie Liu glanced at Shui Yanluo, who said nothing but silently walked up to the doorway, retrieved the Fish Bone Token once more, and inserted it into the mouth of a nearby gatekeeping monster beast statue.","The token flashed, and the monster statue trembled.","Subsequently, it seemed as if a formation was activated, the thick iron chains on the door began to crank, drawing the heavy gate open slowly.","Seeing the door open, everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","The temple door opened wider and wider. Xie Liu led the way, heading outside, but as he reached the doorway, his expression suddenly changed dramatically.","Through the crack of the door, an icy blue sword light flashed by.","An icy sword qi shot straight at his face.","Xie Liu tried his best to turn his head, yet the sword qi still cut one of his ears. The fresh blood hadn’t yet had the chance to flow before it was frozen solid by the ice spiritual power.","Immediately after, a green Wind Blade slashed over.","This Wind Blade aimed directly for his heart meridian.","Xie Liu drew his longsword, placing it horizontally across his chest to block the Wind Blade, using its force to propel himself backward, retreating back into the temple.","As Xie Liu retreated, the people outside rushed in.","Leading was a cultivator holding a feather fan, tall and strikingly handsome.","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up.","\"Uncle Gu!\"","Gu Changhuai, hearing Mo Hua’s voice, silently breathed a sigh of relief.","Thankfully, still alive...","Despite knowing Mo Hua’s cunning, able to navigate between Xie Liu and Shui Yanluo without much trouble, Gu Changhuai was still somewhat worried before.","Now seeing Mo Hua unharmed and quite spirited, Gu Changhuai relaxed and then directed his spiritual power to attack Xie Liu.","Behind Gu Changhuai was Xia Canonical Official, wielding an ice-colored short sword.","Following them were two others, dressed in the official Taoist Robes of the Taoist Court, one a Supervisor, the other an Enforcement Leader.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but be taken aback at the sight.","\"It’s ’Howling Celestial Dog’... and ’Smiling Tiger’?\"","\"Why are they all here?\"","On the other side, Gu Changhuai quickly suppressed Xie Liu, especially with Xia Canonical Official assisting from the side, leaving Xie Liu at a disadvantage.","He didn’t possess the many bizarre skills of Shui Yanluo, so when facing head-on, his cultivation and Taoist Skills were clearly inferior.","Meanwhile, Xiao Tianquan found Shui Yanluo, and the two began to fight fiercely.","It seemed he indeed intended to deal with Shui Yanluo personally.","Shui Yanluo merely looked at him with a cold smile, saying nothing more.","Mo Hua stood aside, watching the spectacle unfold.","In this situation, it wasn’t his turn to act yet.","Similarly, ’Smiling Tiger’ Master Xiao also stood by without hastily making a move, but observed the situation quietly.","The situation gradually became clear.","After watching for a while, Master Xiao finally acted.","He took out a longsword; the sword was shrouded in deep blue water light as he started to conjure sword qi.","\"Deep blue water light...\"","Mo Hua caught a glimpse of this sword light and suddenly sensed something was wrong. As moments passed, the feeling grew stronger.","An indistinct but powerful hostility surrounded him, directed at him.","\"What’s happening?\"","Mo Hua was startled and, upon raising his eyes, realized at some point, ’Smiling Tiger’ Master Xiao was staring at him, with an icy gaze.","And the sword qi from his deep blue longsword was also aimed at him.","Mo Hua was suddenly shocked.","This Smiling Tiger, he wants to kill me?!","Has he lost his mind?!","Mo Hua hurriedly pushed his Water Passing Step to its extreme, his form flowing like water, retreating backward.","Master Xiao, having suddenly attacked, was somewhat surprised at Mo Hua’s quick response, but his gaze soon darkened, and with a flicker, he transformed into nearly ten water shadows, attacking Mo Hua at an even faster speed.","Water Shadow Step!","Moreover, it was an even more intricate Water Shadow Step than Shui Yanluo’s.","Mo Hua, feeling helpless, resorted to using the Concealment Technique.","However, Master Xiao was a Golden Core cultivator, experienced and with keen perception.","While Mo Hua was concealed, he hadn’t gone far, and his aura still lingered slightly; Master Xiao could vaguely sense Mo Hua’s position.","Estimating the location, he slashed at the concealed Mo Hua.","At this moment, Ouyang Feng unleashed the Taia Sword Technique, shielding Mo Hua from that strike.","Hua Qianqian, seeing that the Taoist Court Supervisor unexpectedly attacked Mo Hua, also wore a frosty expression and wielded the Hundred Flowers Spirit Needle towards Master Xiao.","Master Xiao swept his sword, knocking Ouyang Feng back, making him cough up a mouthful of blood, and with a backward flick, swept Hua Qianqian’s Spirit Needle aside.","Then expanding his Divine Sense, he found Mo Hua had vanished who-knows-where, making him look troubled as he muttered:","\"This little rascal, so slippery...\"","Having no choice, since he couldn’t capture Mo Hua, he could only target the other two.","Master Xiao’s sword light was swift, stabbing Ouyang Feng’s right arm, temporarily crippling his meridians, rendering him unable to use his sword.","With a backhanded throw, he launched a poisonous dart, hitting Hua Qianqian’s shoulder.","Hua Qianqian, poisoned, turned deathly pale, her lips slightly blue.","Now, both Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian were powerless to resist.","This sudden turn of events shocked not only Mo Hua but everyone present, leaving them unprepared.","However, all these changes occurred in just a few exchanges, swift as they were.","Once Master Xiao had Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian in his grasp, the scene fell silent instantly.","Gu Changhuai stopped his movements, wearing a stern expression, \"Master Xiao, what do you mean by this?\"","\"What do I mean?\" Master Xiao’s expression remained plastered with a smirk, but the smile on his face grew more indifferent, \"Supervisor Gu, don’t feign ignorance, you must have suspected me for some time.\""]},{"number":1622,"title":"Chapter 1622 - 847: Chaos (Extra - for Alliance Hierarch Boss Feng Wo Xin) (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai’s expression was indifferent, and he did not speak.","\"You suspect me, but you have no evidence, so on the surface, you can only deal with me perfunctorily. Some things, you know, how could I not know?\" Master Xiao said.","Gu Changhuai frowned.","He did indeed suspect Master Xiao.","At the same time, he really had no evidence.","Without evidence, everything is just empty talk. Trying to topple a Dao Court Canon with groundless crimes is utterly naive.","What’s more, this Canon is from the Xiao family.","But what he never expected was that this Master Xiao, having hidden for so long, would suddenly act at this critical moment.","In Gu Changhuai’s expectations, even if this Xiao intended to act, it would only happen when the Dao Court had concrete evidence, surrounded from all sides, leaving him no way out.","Not now, when there’s only suspicion without a shred of evidence, and he just suddenly jumps out to betray.","Master Xiao seemed to have guessed Gu Changhuai’s thoughts, and smiled lightly, \"Make preparations ahead of time; everything should be done early.\"","\"In this Qianxue State Boundary, the Golden Core cultivation level is neither too big nor too small.\"","\"If I really waited until you discovered the truth, with concrete evidence, and the Dao Court issued an arrest warrant, how would I escape then?\"","\"I am also a Canonical Official, very familiar with such matters.\"","\"If one is to make a move, naturally, one must choose the most appropriate and most unexpected time for you.\"","\"Otherwise, with any hesitation, one can only sit and wait for death...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"So, a few days ago, it was you who saved the Water Yama’s Golden Core?\"","\"You were also involved in the Rouge Boat affair.\"","\"The mole of the Gui Water Sect in the Dao Court was you, and you were the one who kept covering for the Rouge Boat internally?\"","Gu Changhuai’s words were sharp.","Master Xiao smiled without speaking.","Although he had turned against them, he wasn’t foolish enough to lay out in detail everything he had done.","Master Xia also looked coldly at Master Xiao, and asked, \"Is this your decision, or the decision of the Xiao family?\"","Master Xiao squinted and said, \"This summer Canonical Official, you should be clear about it in your heart. When a family gets big, there are all kinds of people, and the ones above can’t control them. My background is not bad, but not good, and without the protection of the Ancestor, if I don’t seek some ways and connections, there’s no way out for me in this life.\"","\"It’s just a pity that the Rouge Boat was destroyed, my affairs would be exposed sooner or later, so it would be better to make plans early and take preemptive action...\"","Master Xia asked, \"What do you want?\"","\"I don’t want much,\" Master Xiao smiled and said, \"After all, we’ve been colleagues, there’s some friendship, I don’t want to make things difficult for you.\"","\"As long as your Xia family gives me a Yundu Decree of the Nine State, and the Gu family gives me a Qianxue Command from the Qianxue State Boundary, with these two items, I can leave the Qianxue State Boundary and take the Cloud Ferry to leave Qian State, from then on, the mountains and rivers will be vast and we’ll never meet again.\"","\"I won’t be in your way, and you both won’t see me, Xiao, again in this lifetime, which will be good for both you and me.\"","\"I wonder what you two think?\"","Gu Changhuai and Master Xia exchanged glances without speaking.","\"Of course,\" Master Xiao said, \"I know you two won’t agree so easily...\"","He drew his longsword and held it against Ouyang Feng’s neck, \"These two, one is a disciple of the Tai’a Sect, the other of the Hundred Flowers Sect, both of unusual identity. If you don’t agree, I will have to reluctantly send them to their end.\"","\"At that time, it would be hard for you to give an account to the Tai’a Sect and the Hundred Flowers Sect...\"","At this point, Master Xiao regretted a little, \"Originally, I wanted to capture that little ghost. He’s from the Taixu Gate and not unrelated to the Gu family. Surprisingly, you have a deep friendship with the cold-faced Supervisor Gu. That indeed surprised me.\"","\"I wanted to capture him and use his life as leverage. I think Supervisor Gu wouldn’t back down easily. It’s just a pity, I didn’t expect this kid to be so slippery, not easy to catch at all...\"","Master Xiao was a bit regretful.","Master Xia’s expression was like a frost, and Gu Changhuai also looked displeased.","And Mo Hua, who had been in concealment, quietly revealed himself beside them.","Master Xiao looked deeply at Mo Hua and couldn’t help but raise an eyebrow, praised:","\"What a wonderful Concealment Technique, clearly only at the Foundation Establishment cultivation, but even an experienced Golden Core Steward like me almost couldn’t detect it. Indeed, to have a deep friendship with Supervisor Gu, even if it’s just a child, is no ordinary talent...\"","Mo Hua kept a cold face, not excited by the compliment from the smiling tiger.","After Master Xiao finished speaking, he looked at Gu Changhuai and Master Xia:","\"Have you two considered? Give me the Yundu Decree and Qianxue Command, or else I’ll kill these two heavenly pride disciples right now.\"","Master Xia frowned, glanced at Ouyang Feng, who was undaunted even with a longsword at his neck, and at Hua Qianqian, who despite being poisoned, pressed her lips and neither spoke nor begged for mercy, and sighed:","\"Release these two children and I’ll give you the Yundu Decree.\"","\"Master Xia is compassionate and generous,\" Master Xiao praised, then looked at Gu Changhuai.","Gu Changhuai also sighed: \"I will give you the command too.\"","Saving people is urgent, especially with Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian’s special identities.","If they escape, they can be recaptured.","But if they die, there’s no saving them.","\"But I don’t have it right now, I’ll have to order it to be handled after going out,\" Gu Changhuai said.","\"No matter,\" Master Xiao said, \"I can wait, but I advise you two not to have other intentions. You know, being a Supervisor myself, you can’t hide any tricks on the token from me.\""]},{"number":1623,"title":"Chapter 1623 - 847: Turmoil","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai frowned.","Just then, Mo Hua suddenly spoke crisply, \"Are you sure you can still get out?\"","Master Xiao was slightly stunned, \"What do you mean?\"","Mo Hua pointed towards the door, \"Look.\"","Master Xiao initially thought Mo Hua was trying to deceive him, so he naturally refused to turn around easily. But after a moment, seeing Mo Hua’s expression, he seemed earnest, and the place Mo Hua pointed did have a trace of unusual aura.","Master Xiao tightened his grip on his sword slightly and slowly turned sideways, using the corner of his eyes to look at the place Mo Hua pointed.","At that glance, his pupils contracted instantly.","The place Mo Hua pointed had a bronze statue of a monster beast guarding the door.","At this moment, standing on the bronze statue was a creature, its body wrapped in blood qi, entirely blood-stained, something unknown.","This creature looked scary, yet its aura seemed somewhat faint.","Just then, everyone was embroiled in a fight, unable to mind things around, completely unaware of when it appeared.","At this moment, the creature glanced at everyone and then bowed its head to bite, holding a fish bone token in its mouth and pulling it out.","As soon as the fish bone token was pulled, the heavy doors of the Dragon King Temple slowly closed.","Then the creature suddenly swallowed the token into its abdomen with lightning speed and swiftly turned into a flash of blood, leaping onto the beams on both sides.","Before everyone could react, it had disappeared.","Soon, the cultivators present realized what had happened, their hearts shuddering in alarm.","Master Xiao immediately looked at Water Yama, saying gravely, \"Is there another token?\"","Water Yama shook his head fearfully, \"There’s only one...\"","Master Xiao’s fake smile turned somewhat cold, and he swung a sword backward, sending a deep blue sword light striking the door.","Yet the doors of Dragon King Temple, made of some unknown material.","This Foundation Establishment Peak sword light hit it without causing a ripple.","It appears that without a fish bone token as a key, this door is fundamentally impenetrable by force.","Mo Hua sighed, \"I forgot to tell you, some strange things happened in this temple. Now the situation is not about whether the Taoist Court catches you, whether you have a mandate, or whether you can take the Cloud Ferry to fly away...\"","\"The real problem now is that we might not even be able to get out of the Dragon King Temple’s doors. If we don’t find a way to save ourselves, we’ll be trapped to death inside for a lifetime.\"","\"Oh, maybe not even a lifetime...\"","Mo Hua lamented again, \"Just now that creature is man-eating, perhaps soon we’ll end up in its stomach.\"","Master Xiao’s face turned grim, his fake smile almost unmaintainable.","He calculated everything, never anticipating that such bizarre changes would suddenly occur in this Dragon King Temple...","Otherwise, with a mandate in hand, leaving Qian State, he could reach new heights with different prospects.","The air in the room became heavy and silent.","Everyone fell into silent contemplation.","Mo Hua looked around, observing everyone for a while, then said:","\"So now everyone understands the situation, the urgent task is to catch that elusive creature to see if we can snatch the token back.\"","\"As for other grievances, they can only wait to be settled after we manage to get out.\"","\"Otherwise, everyone will only be left here in Dragon King Temple to die.\"","\"Don’t blame me for not warning you, that creature might not be the only one, and this Dragon King Temple might contain even more terrifying monsters.\"","\"If we don’t band together now, we’re all doomed.\"","Mo Hua said solemnly.","Master Xiao also looked around, his eyes narrowed, but the smile on his face had vanished. He nodded, saying:","\"Fine, I won’t make a move.\"","\"Anyway, my plan was just to seek a way to survive, to escape and not aim for a showdown to the death.\"","\"Now that there are threats everywhere in the temple, I can agree to a ceasefire.\"","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official exchanged a glance and nodded, \"Getting out is urgent; other matters can be set aside for now.\"","All three Golden Cores agreed, leaving the others no room to dissent.","They weren’t fools, able to discern priorities.","Any rancor, in the face of life and death, can be temporarily cast aside.","Thus, a strange \"team\" was temporarily formed.","Mo Hua was satisfied at heart, nodding and said:","\"Alright, let’s go find that creature now!\"","Thus, Mo Hua led at the front, with this ragtag team, diverse in composition, purpose, mindset, and even differing in allies, started hunting monsters in the eerie Dragon King Temple...","-----------------","ps. Thanks to Boss Feng Woxin for the Alliance Hierarch reward~","6k words for a big Chapter, seeking monthly tickets~","(๑•.•๑)"]},{"number":1624,"title":"Chapter 1624 - 848: Dragon Blood","paragraphs":["In the Dragon King Temple, Mo Hua led the way.","But the team’s atmosphere was somewhat strange.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official were on his left and right, guarding Mo Hua while also wary of Master Xiao.","Master Xiao still wore a fake smile, but now revealed his true colors, with only a superficial grin remaining.","Meanwhile, the others’ attitude towards Master Xiao was quite subtle.","Water Yama was clearly in cahoots with Master Xiao; the two had some interactions, whether openly or secretly.","Previously, when the water bandits were hunted on the island, Water Yama managed to escape from Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official’s hands because Master Xiao saved him.","Thus, Water Yama was obedient to Master Xiao’s orders.","Yet, at the same time, he seemed to fear Master Xiao, exhibiting an unexplainable dread.","This was very rare for the murderous Water Yama.","Xie Liu also vaguely knew Master Xiao’s identity.","Among the few Golden Core cultivators in the Dragon King Temple, he had the lowest status, the weakest strength, and the smallest voice, so he could only follow behind, barely considered part of Master Xiao’s \"alliance\".","The strangest was Xiao Tianquan.","Xiao Tianquan and Master Xiao were both cultivators from the Xiao family, supposedly part of the same alliance.","But after Master Xiao’s betrayal, Xiao Tianquan kept silent, even deliberately maintaining a distance from Master Xiao, aligning himself with Xia Canonical Official.","\"The Xiao family’s situation seems quite complex...\" Mo Hua thought silently to himself.","As for Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian, they were now considered \"held hostage\".","Although on the surface, Master Xiao no longer troubled them.","Mo Hua knew that should anything change, Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian would still be used as \"bargaining chips\".","He had no good solutions for now, only able to act according to the situation.","Mo Hua’s eyes flashed slightly.","Thus, the hunt continued, and the group walked cautiously within the Dragon King Temple.","Mo Hua led the way, tracing the bloodthirsty monster’s trail, occasionally consulting Water Yama about the temple’s layout to confirm the route.","Among this group, only Mo Hua was a Monster Hunter.","The Taoist Court official, although adept at chasing, pursued humans.","An outlaw cultivator like Water Yama, though familiar with pursuit, was generally the one being hunted.","Only Mo Hua truly hailed from the Monster Hunter lineage.","Therefore, regarding the habits, behavior, and subtle aura of monster beasts, no one present was more skilled than him.","Of course, this monster might not be a monster beast, but the principles remained the same.","Mo Hua then glanced upward to the beams, extending his divine sense to follow the monster’s traces through clues.","But the Dragon King Temple was vast, the halls towering, the rooms many, with the surroundings oppressive and filled with a bloody aura; as the pursuit went on, the monster’s trail vanished.","Mo Hua could only guess and calculate, finding his way bit by bit... when suddenly, he stopped, his expression subtly changing.","Everyone else stopped as well.","Gu Changhuai asked, \"What’s wrong?\"","Mo Hua replied, \"There’s something...\"","Then he thought for a moment, and with a light flip, he gracefully turned onto the beam.","The beams were made from giant logs, extremely wide, and near the wall was a mess, with a large hole dug by some unknown entity.","The hole was large, but its entrance was shallow, revealing its bottom at a glance.","It seemed something had once resided here.","Mo Hua guessed it was highly possible that the monster used this as a temporary lair.","He walked a few steps closer, suddenly noticing a hint of blood in the lair.","The blood was cyan, its scent very faint, lacking the foulness of human or monster blood, instead carrying a light fragrance.","Fragrance?","Mo Hua frowned.","As he observed, he suddenly could not resist dipping his finger in the blood and tasted it.","In that instant, dragon roars sounded in his ears.","Mo Hua’s pupils trembled.","\"Dragon...\"","Though he had never seen a True Dragon nor heard its voice, at this moment he felt certain that the sound stirred his spirit, a clear resonance echoing like a Goldstone, undeniably, the sound of a dragon’s roar.","Dragon blood?","Mo Hua’s expression showed shock, unable to prevent himself from smacking his lips.","Unfortunately, he couldn’t discern the taste.","The blood was extremely faint, the residue nearly dried up, just the slightest aura remained, which Mo Hua tasted lightly, without picking up on any flavor.","Mo Hua’s expression showed regret, but soon his heart skipped a beat.","\"The Dragon King Temple... could the monster be related to ’dragon’?\"","Its scales, could they be... Dragon Scales?","Because they were dragon scales, swords and spells couldn’t penetrate, more robust than any metal he’s seen.","And the blood coursing through it... Dragon Blood?","\"No, that’s not right...\"","Mo Hua shook his head again.","A dragon is a Divine Beast, and wouldn’t exhibit such bloodthirsty tendencies.","Moreover, though the monster was strong, it was clearly nowhere close to the \"dragon\" in legends.","It even consumed humans and drank human blood, surely its blood was polluted; thus, what flows in its veins couldn’t be dragon blood.","\"It’s likely dragon blood is just a trigger.\"","\"The monster consumed dragon blood, refining it within, thus growing such hardened ’dragon scales’, possessing such deep blood qi and a robust physique...\"","Mo Hua nodded slightly, finding this hypothesis fairly reasonable, while his eyes brightened.","Now it seemed the monster’s secrets were far more numerous than he imagined.","No matter what, the monster must be captured and carefully examined.","Of course, with his own capabilities, he surely couldn’t catch the monster."]},{"number":1625,"title":"Chapter 1625 - 848: Dragon Blood (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Fortunately, he has a bunch of \"henchmen\" now.","Mo Hua jumped down from the beam, and Master Xiao feigned a smile and said, \"What’s up there that has young master looking for so long?\"","Because he and Gu Changhuai were on guard against each other, he didn’t go up to check in person.","Mo Hua said, \"There’s a lair; a monster once resided here. It’s probably not far away, we can keep searching.\"","He kept the matter of the Dragon Blood secret.","Master Xiao couldn’t possibly know, and just nodded slightly, \"Alright.\"","Afterwards, Mo Hua continued to lead the way.","But after circling the area once, he found plenty of traces of the monster, yet still couldn’t see the monster’s figure at all.","Just as Mo Hua was frowning in thought, his heart suddenly throbbed, as if something was pulsating.","\"Dragon Blood...\"","The dragon blood he had licked earlier seemed to be taking effect now.","Mo Hua felt the blood flow within him accelerating.","The sound of dragon cries echoed in his ears, his heart beat faster, his meridians were swelling painfully, and his limbs were a bit paralyzed, as if the dragon blood was gradually waking within him, devouring his bloodline.","Even though it’s just a trace of dragon blood.","Moreover, it might not even be True Dragon Blood.","But with his frail physique, he couldn’t bear it at all.","Mo Hua’s physical body was too weak, and his bloodline too feeble, this trace of \"dragon\" power was far beyond what his body could handle.","\"I’m finished. If I’d known beforehand, I wouldn’t have eaten randomly...\"","Mo Hua regretted deeply in his heart.","Fortunately, Dragon Blood is not something he can eat at will.","Earlier he only licked a tiny bit, not even a blood star, so the chaos within his bloodline only lasted for a moment and then gradually calmed.","Cold sweat formed on Mo Hua’s forehead as he breathed a long sigh of relief.","Beside him, Xia Canonical Official saw this, and his expression changed slightly. He reached out with his pale hand to lightly wipe Mo Hua’s forehead, frowning:","\"Mo Hua? What’s wrong with you?\"","\"Nothing,\" Mo Hua sighed, \"I ate something bad.\"","Xia Canonical Official was a bit confused, not knowing what he was talking about.","How could one eat something bad all of a sudden?","\"Sister Xia, I’m fine now, let’s continue looking for that monster, the monster is urgent...\" Mo Hua quickly shifted the topic.","Seeing Mo Hua was alright, Xia Canonical Official didn’t dwell on it, but nodded and asked:","\"That monster seems to have disappeared; how do we find it now?\"","Mo Hua frowned again, he expanded his Divine Sense and perceived around, yet still found nothing.","The monster seemed to have vanished.","Suddenly, Mo Hua’s heart trembled again.","Mo Hua was startled.","Is it not over?","But when he carefully sensed, he found that it was not his own heart that was beating, but another heart...","The \"heart\" of that monster?","Mo Hua closed his eyes, held his breath and concentrated, after a moment, opened his eyes, his expression had a hint of realization.","It wasn’t the beating of a heart.","But... a kind of sensing between Divine Souls.","Mo Hua slightly furrowed his brow.","Earlier he had consumed a trace of Dragon Blood.","This trace of Dragon Blood seemed to contain the \"Divine Soul\" of an ancient divine beast.","And through this trace of \"Dragon Blood,\" Mo Hua seemed to have formed a subtle sense with the \"Divine Soul\" of this ancient divine beast.","He could sense the flow of other Dragon Blood within the Dragon King Temple.","In other words, he could sense... the location of that monster.","Mo Hua found it somewhat incredible.","Is there a \"Divine Soul\" contained within Dragon Blood?","Why?","The reason dragons are called divine beasts, could it be because their \"Divine Souls\" can merge with flesh?","Mo Hua was secretly shocked, but now wasn’t the time to think about those things, so he turned his head to the group and said:","\"I know where the monster is, follow me...\"","Then Mo Hua confidently proceeded down the corridor on his right.","The group behind him exchanged looks, unsure how Mo Hua knew.","However, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official always trusted Mo Hua, so hesitated little and followed him.","Water Yama knew Mo Hua was mysterious, his skills were strange, so he didn’t doubt it.","Xie Liu wanted to get the Water Prison Forbidden Box from Mo Hua, so he would follow at any cost.","Xiao Tianquan hesitated for a moment, then followed the crowd.","Only Master Xiao quietly watched Mo Hua’s back, his gaze growing more surprised, feeling this young master increasingly difficult to fathom.","He was silent for a moment, blood flashing in his eyes, then quietly followed Mo Hua.","The group followed Mo Hua all the way to a small square where they were met with scattered corpses.","On the ground paved with bluestone, blood splattered like ink, like wild cursive script, spilled on the ground.","The cultivators in the scene, whether Supervisor or Evil Cultivitors, were experienced, and immediately saw a massacre had occurred here.","Moreover, it was a \"massacre\" that caught them off guard.","It seemed that not long ago, these temple guards gathered here for unknown reasons, then suddenly fell victim, slaughtered en masse.","The killer didn’t use spells or spiritual artifacts, relying only on sheer physical strength.","Most likely, it was the monster.","Mo Hua surveyed the surroundings, using Divine Soul sensing, then pointed at a plaque in the distance.","\"Over there.\"","It was a plaque hanging high up in the hall, broad and thick, with a blue lacquer background, etched with ancient golden words. On the plaque were three large characters:","\"Yaksha Hall.\"","The group followed the direction Mo Hua pointed, and frowned.","Water Yama said, \"Is there a monster there?\"","\"Just based on feeling, it’s in that direction...\"","Mo Hua said it was \"based on feeling,\" but his tone was very certain, \"It should be behind the Yaksha Hall plaque, where it’s dug another hole for hiding.\""]},{"number":1626,"title":"Chapter 1626 - 848: Dragon Blood (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Master Xiao, upon hearing this, drew his longsword, intending to strike, but was stopped by Mo Hua.","\"You must not act rashly, lest you startle the snake by beating the grass.\"","Master Xiao glanced at Mo Hua, silently sheathed his sword, and said, \"Then according to Young Master’s words, what should be done?\"","Mo Hua appeared confident, \"Rest assured, leave it to me. To be honest, my ancestors were all Monster Hunters for generations. My monster hunting skills are all family heritage...\"","Master Xiao’s gaze was subtle.","This Young Master, it’s unknown what kind of inheritance he received since childhood, knows a myriad of things, odd and unexpected.","\"Very well, let’s follow the Young Master’s lead,\" Master Xiao said.","Mo Hua nodded and then said:","\"Know yourself and know your enemy, and you will not be imperiled in a hundred battles. Hunting monsters requires careful preparation before taking action.\"","\"Otherwise, even a slight negligence can lead to great losses.\"","\"Based on the current situation, this monster is enveloped in Blood Qi. Its dragon...fish scales are hard, its flesh incredibly strong, and the blood on its talons is both foul and highly toxic.\"","\"It appears to be Second Grade, but it’s definitely not something an ordinary Foundation Establishment Cultivator can handle.\"","\"Especially with its body covered in scale armor that is impenetrable to swords and spears and resistant to water and fire. Whether it’s Spiritual Artifacts, Strength, or Spells, none seem to be able to break it.\"","Master Xiao furrowed his brows, \"Not even a combined effort of Peak Foundation Establishment Cultivators can break it?\"","Mo Hua pointed at Xie Liu, \"You should ask him.\"","Xie Liu, unwilling to admit it, had to speak the truth, \"I used Gui Water Sword Qi and slashed dozens of times but didn’t harm the scales even slightly.\"","This statement revealed the truth to everyone present.","Xie Liu is a Golden Core Cultivator, who suppressed his cultivation to Peak Foundation Establishment and still couldn’t break the scale armor after dozens of slashes. Even other Golden Core Cultivators, no matter how strong, might not fare better.","\"Therefore,\" Mo Hua said, \"a frontal confrontation is unlikely to subdue this monster, let alone kill it.\"","\"But it seems to have a weakness...\"","\"A weakness?\" Xie Liu frowned.","He had fought the monster in dozens of rounds and never discovered that it had any weakness.","Mo Hua nodded and said, \"Its weakness is its surrounding Blood Qi.\"","\"All things in the world operate by certain laws.\"","\"Formations require a formation eye for energy, cultivators need a heart for blood supply and a Qi Sea for Spiritual Qi, and even Monster Beasts rely on a Demon Core for demonic power...\"","\"This monster is no different. It relies on that surrounding foul Blood Qi, of unknown origin, to move, to nourish, and to hunt.\"","\"Once the Blood Qi is exhausted, and it loses its energy source, it can only await its demise.\"","\"Therefore, the key to hunting this monster is, firstly, to trap, and secondly, to deplete its energy.\"","\"With so many Golden Core Cultivators present, depletion should not be an issue; the main problem is ’trapping’ it.\"","Mo Hua asked the crowd, \"Does anyone have any Spiritual Artifacts or Formations to trap this creature? If so, please set them up in advance.\"","The crowd hesitated a bit.","Water Yama frowned and said, \"Little ghost, aren’t you capable of setting up formations yourself?\"","Mo Hua sighed helplessly and said:","\"I’m only at Foundation Building Middle Stage, with limited Divine Sense. The formations I set up are of limited Grade, and cannot possibly restrain this Peak of Second Grade monster.\"","\"Moreover, I’ve almost used up all my formations along the way.\"","Gu Changhuai looked at Mo Hua with a peculiar expression but said nothing.","Although Xia Canonical Official knew that Mo Hua’s formation skills were not low, he didn’t know exactly how high, so he didn’t question it either.","The others found nothing wrong with these statements.","Mo Hua added, \"The situation is urgent. Everyone should work together. If you have methods, bring them out now; otherwise, being trapped in this Dragon King Temple, it will be too late to regret.\"","After a moment of reflection, Gu Changhuai was the first to take out a set of chains and two formations:","\"These chains are standard traps from the Taoist Court, used for setting ambushes in advance. The formation is from my Gu Family, which I usually carry on me, but rarely get the chance to use.\"","Then Xia Canonical Official also took out a net, \"This is the Xia family’s Earthen Net, Second Grade, can restrain an enemy temporarily.\"","\"Since formations are cumbersome to set up, I seldom carry them...\"","With Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official taking the lead, others also brought out a few items, more or less.","Including Master Xiao, Xie Liu, Water Yama, and Xiao Tianquan.","But Mo Hua felt it wasn’t enough, so he scrutinized everyone to see who was withholding, quietly observing any Spiritual Artifacts or formations for ’trapping’ the enemy not yet shared, looking intently with a determined look that he wouldn’t rest until everyone had contributed everything.","\"I’ve handed everything over to you...\"","\"Still not enough.\"","\"These many Spiritual Artifacts and formations should be sufficient.\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"That monster is cunning and swift; trapping it won’t be easy. Full preparation is necessary. Otherwise, if it gets away and hides deep within the Dragon King Temple, we may never capture it again.\"","\"Alright then...\"","So, Mo Hua went around gathering ’wool,’ almost ’collecting’ all the formations and Spiritual Artifacts used for trapping and binding from everyone.","With this, he was reassured.","Afterward, he observed the terrain and ’commanded’ everyone to set up the formations and occupy places with the Spiritual Artifacts for trapping, and the ’hunt’ began.","Master Xiao slashed with his sword, and a sword light struck the plaque of Yaksha Hall.","This plaque, of unknown construction, resembling solid metal, did not break but was dislodged by the impact of Sword Qi, revealing a dark, blood-stained hole behind it.","\"As expected...\"","Master Xiao’s pupils contracted slightly.","Then, from within the hole, came a sound and a monster emerged slowly, clutching a limb, devouring it with relish.","Seemingly angered by the sudden disruption of its meal, the monster was enraged, its eyes turning blood-red, and let out a piercing cry.","The sound was very peculiar, similar to a yaksha devouring in a river, or a type of powerful Exotic Beasts.","Mo Hua listened closely, discerning the sound.","The monster’s roar sounded somewhat like a... \"Dragon’s Roar.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes flickered slightly.","With the monster now present, the crowd hesitated no longer and commenced their action immediately.","A great battle was on the verge of breaking out.","Gu Changhuai unleashed his azure Wind Blade, and Xia Canonical Official condensed Ice Sword Qi.","The Smile-Face Tiger and Xie Liu both wielded the Gui Water Sword.","Water Yama used a Water Punishment Whip, while Xiao Tianquan used the Xiao family’s Swordsmanship.","Ouyang Feng was injured, and Hua Qianqian was poisoned, rendering them unable to fight.","Being the youngest of the lot and with the lowest cultivation, Mo Hua wisely refrained from joining the fray, choosing instead a clean step devoid of bloodstains to sit and watch the spectacle from the sidelines.","The cultivators present were far from inexperienced; they’d gathered ample battle and spellcasting experience.","Moreover, with four Golden Core cultivators joining forces, Mo Hua was not concerned at all.","Everything was proceeding according to his plan."]},{"number":1627,"title":"Chapter 1627 - 849: Mr. Witch","paragraphs":["In front of the Yaksha Hall, amidst a small square covered in bloodstains.","A hunt was underway.","Four Golden Cores, along with two Foundation Establishment Peaks, joined forces to hunt a monster wrapped entirely in Blood Qi, standing as tall as two people, with limbs on the ground, deformed yet powerful.","The strength of this monster was truly formidable, its form bizarre, due to twisted limbs, and its movements were often unexpected, turning into streaks of blood shadow, making it unpredictable.","Fortunately, there were enough cultivators besieging it, and everyone followed Mo Hua’s instructions, focusing on wearing it down, avoiding prolonged combat or seeking glory.","Defending primarily, attacking as support, with confinement as the main objective.","At first, Master Xiao didn’t pay much attention to this tactic.","He only thought about a swift battle, taking the chance to kill the monster and retrieve the Fish Bone Token from its belly.","But after engaging with the monster for several rounds, he gave up this idea.","Almost everything Mo Hua said was correct.","This monster indeed could only be exhausted, not killed.","Not even Xie Liu or his Gui Water Sword Qi could break that scale armor on the monster even slightly.","\"What on earth is this monster...?\"","Master Xiao’s pupils quivered slightly; then, he suppressed his astonishment and dutifully executed Mo Hua’s plan.","Not only Master Xiao, but also Gu Changhuai’s Wind Blade and Master Xiao’s Ice Sword couldn’t harm the monster.","However, they knew that Mo Hua always had precise plans, so they had a rough understanding in their hearts.","The group continued the siege for a while.","Amidst the battlefield, sword light and Sword Qi flashed and Wind Blade Spells danced, intertwining with the cultivators’ silhouettes and the monster’s blood shadows, creating an intense battle.","Mo Hua found it captivating and was deeply engrossed in watching.","After over a hundred rounds of such combat, the four Golden Cores still couldn’t break the monster’s scale armor.","But indeed, the Blood Qi on this monster was being rapidly consumed.","Soon, under the joint efforts of everyone, the Blood Qi on the monster became increasingly thin, and its movements gradually slowed down.","The monster immediately became aware of something.","In its eyes, there was a glint, seemingly containing some vicious yet panicked emotions.","Mo Hua was taken aback by this sight.","This monster... seems to have a trace of rationality remaining?","Is it not acting completely on instinct?","Mo Hua recalled earlier, when the monster took advantage of the chaos among the group to sneak to the temple gate, swallowed the Fish Bone Token from the gate-guarding demon statue, closed the main door, and then escaped...","\"There’s something wrong...\"","Mo Hua showed a thoughtful expression.","Meanwhile, on the field, with almost no Blood Qi left, the monster clearly realized the severity of the situation.","It suddenly roared, its body turned into barbed Dragon Scales, then transformed into a mass of blood shadow, charging towards Xiao Tianquan’s direction.","It wanted to find a way to escape.","Among the besieging party, Xiao Tianquan was the weakest.","The monster was well aware of this, hence it targeted the weakest Xiao Tianquan.","Xiao Tianquan indeed couldn’t stop the monster; with just one exchange, he was knocked back several meters, using his sword to support himself, and spat out a mouthful of blood.","A gap naturally appeared in the encirclement.","But Mo Hua had already made preparations, so there was no way they would let it escape.","The formation on the ground unfolded, and Gu Changhuai and others urged the Spirit-binding Locks in their hands to confine the enemy.","Chains wrapped around the monster’s body.","Gu Changhuai blocked its position, not allowing the monster to escape.","Others also acted in unison; the formation, spiritual artifacts, and cultivators worked together to create a large net, firmly trapping the monster in the middle of the square outside the Yaksha Hall.","The monster was infuriated, dashing left and right, yet it was utterly helpless.","Blood Qi was its lifeline and source of power.","With the Blood Qi damaged, it couldn’t hold on for much longer.","The group unleashed their sword and spell attacks, and within thirty minutes, the Blood Qi of the monster was completely exhausted.","Its movements grew slower and slower until it finally collapsed to the ground, losing all ability to act.","Even so, none of them dropped their guard.","This was something Mo Hua had repeatedly emphasized.","Even with the monster down, they had to remain cautious and guard against it playing dead.","Although the monster had exhausted its Blood Qi and might not be able to feign death, it’s a habit worth cultivating.","Xia Canonical Official maintained vigilance with a shortsword, while others surrounded the area.","Gu Changhuai stepped forward, using the Spirit-binding Lock from the Taoist Court to bind all four limbs of the monster, ensuring it couldn’t move.","Indeed, the monster showed no signs of movement, seemingly becoming a mere pile of flesh and bone puppet.","Only then did the group slightly relax.","\"What do we do now?\" Xie Liu asked.","Master Xiao said, \"Its body is covered with scales, impervious to swords; in that case, let’s pierce a longsword into its mouth, through the throat, into the abdomen, and shred its internal organs to make it truly dead. Then find a way to peel off its scales, cut open its belly, and retrieve that Fish Bone Token.\"","As a Dao Court Canon, he employed numerous tortures and had diverse methods of killing.","Although the group found it somewhat brutal, it seemed at this moment to be the only option.","Suddenly, Mo Hua said, \"Wait.\"","Master Xiao turned his head, somewhat bewildered, looking at Mo Hua, \"Young master, what is it?\"","Mo Hua stroked his chin, examining the monster’s face, and muttered softly:","\"Could this monster be... Mr. Witch?\"","\"Mr. Witch?\"","The crowd was taken aback, though some were puzzled, not knowing who Mr. Witch was.","Mo Hua pointed to Water Yama, saying, \"He knows.\"","Mr. Witch...","Water Yama’s expression was startled, momentarily finding it hard to believe. He stared at the monster for a few moments, the more he looked, the more shocked he became, and then said coldly:"]},{"number":1628,"title":"Chapter 1628 - 849: Mr. Witch (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"Mr. Witch... is the overseer of this Dragon King Temple, the shaman of the Divine Lord. Every time I bring offerings, dedicated to the Divine Lord, it’s Mr. Witch who presides over the ceremonies.\"","Divine Lord?","Gu Changhuai frowned.","Master Xia also looked a bit puzzled.","It was basically the first time they heard this term.","The henchmen of the Evil God might be listed by the Taoist Court.","But the hidden, unseen, unheard, unknown, and indescribable Evil God wasn’t part of their Tao cultivation knowledge.","Even Shui Yama himself knew \"Divine Lord,\" but not necessarily what the Divine Lord truly signified.","Those who don’t practice the Divine Way are all ordinary mortals, unable to see the true form of the deity.","\"What is the Divine Lord?\" Gu Changhuai asked.","Shui Yama’s face turned solemn, and he replied coldly: \"You mortals, how could you comprehend the majesty of my Divine Lord, or be worthy of invoking my Divine Lord’s name?\"","\"Enough,\" Master Xia frowned, \"so full of yourself...\"","In her eyes, Shui Yama was not only a damn Sin Cultivator but also a god-worshipping lunatic.","People like this often have erratic temperaments, which explains why he committed so many killings.","As for the so-called \"Divine Lord\" he believed in, who knows what kind of rogue deity or evil object it could be.","It’s hard to say if it even exists.","More pressing concerns await us now.","Master Xia turned to look at the monster lying motionless on the ground, chained, pondered for a moment, and said:","\"If he truly is that Mr. Witch, he must know some of the inside information. If we shred his organs, cut open his stomach, and take out the Fish Bone Token, then he will surely be dead...\"","\"This temple is a bit eerie, so it’s better to spare his life for now and get the answers we need.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Indeed...\"","This Mr. Witch might still be of use.","If he died, where would one find an altar?","Master Xiao looked worried: \"Even if this monster is really Mr. Witch, in his current state, neither human nor ghost, lacking consciousness, how can we interrogate him?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, his eyes lighting up, \"Let’s bleed him.\"","\"Bleed him?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"He must have turned into such a state due to the blood inside him...\"","Furthermore, this blood is likely Dragon Blood...","\"If that’s the case, draining the blood might remove the external evil from his Divine Soul, perhaps restoring some of his sanity...\"","\"What if bleeding him kills him?\" Master Xiao asked.","Mo Hua regretfully said, \"Then he would be unfortunate; we’ve given it our best, and if we can’t save him, it’s just his bad luck, not our fault.\"","\"If bleeding kills him, we can simply cut open his belly and retrieve the Fish Bone Token without delay.\"","Master Xiao pondered and nodded: \"Alright.\"","But this monster’s body is covered in scale armor, making it not easy to bleed.","Master Xiao searched for a long time before finding a weak spot in the scale armor under the monster’s armpit. With some effort, he used a longsword to pierce its armpit.","Blood at the wound site was thick, but it didn’t flow out.","Master Xiao said gravely: \"It has consumed too much human flesh; the blood is too filthy and thick, almost merged with the flesh. Even after breaking the scale armor, the blood won’t flow out.\"","\"A bit troublesome...\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brow, pondered for a while, then suddenly recalled he had an old \"ultimate technique\" that he hadn’t used in ages.","Blood Drawing Art.","It was a gift from his senior sister in Tongxian City many years ago.","His ability to hunt monster beasts and extract monster blood to blend Spiritual Ink for self-sufficiency was due to this \"Blood Drawing Art.\"","Mo Hua rolled up his sleeves, \"Let me do it!\"","Then, under the strange gaze of the others, he placed his palm against the monster’s armpit and used his Divine Thought to draw the blood out.","The monster’s blood was very thick and much denser than ordinary monster blood.","But Mo Hua’s Divine Thought had significantly advanced, both in quality and quantity, compared to before.","Therefore, using a small Blood Drawing Art was quite easy.","The dark, thick blood on the monster’s body slowly flowed out under Mo Hua’s Divine Thought.","Everyone was somewhat surprised by the scene.","Master Xia couldn’t help but say: \"Mo Hua, you seem to know everything?\"","\"Yes, yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"I’m from a Loose Cultivator background; children from poor families have to learn a bit of everything to make a living in the future.\"","Master Xia: \"...\"","You’re a Taixu Sect Disciple, a formation genius, an honored guest of the Gu Family, needing to learn such things to \"make a living\"?","Master Xia didn’t believe a word.","Mo Hua chatted idly while focusing on bleeding the monster.","In just a moment, the monster’s form slowly \"slimmed down.\"","The scales on its body began to shrink, shed, gradually fade, and finally merge into the skin.","As time went by, and more blood was drawn, the monster grew thinner, and its deformed body slowly began to assume a \"human form.\"","Everyone was startled by this.","This bloody monster was indeed a person...","After about thirty minutes, the blood was almost drained.","And the monster regained its original appearance.","It was a short, slender, pale old man with some residual monster scales on his hands and feet.","Shui Yama observed his face and sighed: \"It really is ’Mr. Witch’...\"","Mo Hua glanced at the thick, filthy qi-tinged blood drawn from his body, feeling somewhat disappointed.","\"There wasn’t any Dragon Blood...\"","This \"Mr. Witch\" was covered in Dragon Scales and must have consumed Dragon Blood.","Mo Hua thought he might be able to draw out some Dragon Blood with his Blood Drawing Art, then secretly keep it for research."]},{"number":1629,"title":"Chapter 1629 - 849: Mr. Witch (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Unfortunately, hope fell through.","And at this moment, Mr. Witch was still unconscious.","\"We need to wake him up...\" said Mo Hua.","This Mr. Witch, who was stationed at the Dragon King Temple and presided over the rituals, was certainly not a good person.","Everyone was in a hurry to find a way out and had no time to just wait idly for him to wake up naturally.","Waking someone up in this place with so many Supervisors around was not something Mo Hua needed to handle.","Xia Canonical Official took out a few Pills and fed them into Mr. Witch’s mouth.","Mo Hua didn’t know if they were for replenishing blood or for poisoning him to death.","A moment later, Mr. Witch did look a little better, but he still did not wake up.","Xia Canonical Official wanted to give him a few more, but Gu Changhuai was already impatient.","He grabbed Mr. Witch by the neck and lifted him up, slamming him on the ground a few times.","Mo Hua’s eyelid twitched; he could vaguely hear the sound of bones breaking.","But one had to admit that this method of \"waking\" was indeed very effective.","A moment later, an elderly, murmuring voice sounded.","\"Stop... cough, stop...\"","Gu Changhuai stopped and dropped Mr. Witch to the ground.","Mr. Witch slowly got up, feeling dizzy and in pain all over, severely losing blood, and his Vital Energy greatly damaged, as if he was plunged into Hell, taking a long time to come to his senses.","He looked at everyone with a pained expression and frowned as he spoke:","\"Who... who are you? Why have you come to my Dragon King Temple and dared to disturb the Divine Lord’s peace? Aren’t you afraid...\"","\"Cut the crap,\" Gu Changhuai said impatiently, \"We’re asking you questions, so answer truthfully. Otherwise, we’ll kill you now.\"","Mr. Witch sneered, \"Ignorant fools, how dare you...\"","Gu Changhuai again grabbed him by the neck, lifted him, and slammed him on the ground a few more times.","This time, Mr. Witch became compliant.","The pain made him realize his predicament.","\"Sir, ask away. I will speak without reservation,\" Mr. Witch said sincerely, rubbing his broken ribs with clasped hands.","Gu Changhuai said, \"Let me ask you, why did you steal our Token and not let us leave?\"","\"Steal the Token?\" Mr. Witch was taken aback.","Gu Changhuai’s gaze was icy, \"You don’t know?\"","Mr. Witch frowned and thought for a moment, perplexedly saying:","\"Why would I steal your Token? What Token? Besides, I don’t even know you. Why would I steal your Token?\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, and the others exchanged looks; Mo Hua also found it strange.","This Mr. Witch, does he remember nothing?","Mo Hua said, \"Then what do you know?\"","\"Know... what?\" Mr. Witch still didn’t quite understand.","\"I mean,\" Mo Hua thought for a moment and said, \"What were you doing in your last memory before this?\"","Mr. Witch clasped his hands, sincerely saying, \"I was sitting in front of this square’s main hall, routinely lecturing, extolling the Divine Lord’s might and virtue to the temple guards who were Believers.\"","\"And then...\"","Mr. Witch tried hard to recall, and suddenly his expression changed, his eyes somewhat manic:","\"I seemed to have heard the Divine Lord’s prophecy. He said there would be a great crisis in this temple, a strong enemy was approaching, intending to kill the Divine Lord’s Believers, seize the Divine Lord’s Taoist Field, desecrate the Divine Lord’s altar, and encroach upon the Divine Lord’s authority...\"","\"And then, and then, I...\"","Mr. Witch’s brow furrowed tightly, his expression painful, as if he couldn’t remember anything.","Then he suddenly looked around and saw the horribly dead temple guards, dismembered limbs everywhere, and blood splattered, a gruesome scene, which made him a bit nauseous, his expression shocked and then suddenly clear.","He wore an angry face, pointed at everyone, and said tremblingly: \"You... it was you...\"","\"You are the enemies of the Divine Lord!\"","\"You killed the Believers in my temple! With such vicious means and a wicked heart, you...\"","Mr. Witch’s burning anger rendered him speechless.","Mo Hua shook his head, \"These people weren’t killed by us.\"","Mr. Witch retorted angrily, \"Impossible!\"","\"You... you killed them,\" Mo Hua said, looking at Mr. Witch with clarity and certainty in his eyes.","Mr. Witch’s expression froze suddenly on his face, then he shook his head repeatedly, muttering: \"Impossible, how could I have killed them, I...\"","\"Not only did you kill them,\" Mo Hua continued, \"you also ’ate’ them...\"","Mr. Witch’s face instantly turned deathly pale, a mix of urgency and anger in his eyes as he pointed at Mo Hua and said:","\"You little wretch, you’re slandering me! How... how could I possibly eat people? I... I...\"","\"Look at the corner of your mouth, what is that?\"","Mo Hua’s voice was calm, but to Mr. Witch’s ears, it sounded as chilling as a ghost from Hell.","Mr. Witch smacked his lips and only then did he taste the blood in his mouth.","There were even strands of meat stuck between his teeth.","This blood was human blood, and these strands of meat...","Mr. Witch’s eyes rolled back as he suddenly vomited frantically on the ground, as if trying to expel his liver and gallbladder.","Looking at Mr. Witch, Mo Hua murmured in slight surprise, \"He truly didn’t know...\"","Everyone watched Mr. Witch, on the verge of vomiting his guts out after just a few words from Mo Hua, then turned to look at Mo Hua silently, unable to speak...","Mr. Witch vomited for a long time, almost to the point of really expelling his insides, before he managed to regain himself a little.","Yet, in his heart, he still couldn’t accept the fact that he had killed a Believer of the Divine Lord and devoured their flesh.","\"It must be you, it was you! It was you who killed, it has nothing to do with me...\"","Mr. Witch cried hysterically.","Water Yama, not wanting to bear this \"guilt,\" said sincerely, \"Mr. Witch, you should recognize me, I am also a Believer of the Divine Lord, I...\"","\"Shut up!\" Mr. Witch shouted angrily, \"I understand now, it must be you, you brought these villains here, you betrayed the Divine Lord, you are also the sinner of the Divine Lord!\"","Water Yama’s face turned unsightly.","Master Xiao’s eyes flickered slightly, then he said, \"Mr. Witch seems to know nothing, so there’s no use keeping him. In that case, let’s cut open his stomach and retrieve that Token, so we can leave.\"","Mr. Witch was shocked, \"What do you mean cut open my stomach?\"","Master Xiao looked at him and said slowly, \"You transformed into a monster, stole our Token, and swallowed it.\"","Mr. Witch said, \"Impossible!\"","Master Xiao disregarded him, \"I’ll cut open your stomach, take out the Token and show you, then you’ll know.\"","Mr. Witch, in terror, said, \"How could that be done? I’m gravely injured, once my stomach is cut open, how could I survive? Even if I don’t die, I’ll be left with half a life.\"","Master Xiao said coldly, \"Whether you live or die, what does it matter to me? I only want the Token.\"","\"But there’s truly no token in my belly.\"","\"How do you know there’s none?\"","\"I would know if there was anything foreign in my stomach.\"","\"I don’t believe you.\"","\"You...\"","Master Xiao drew his sword, ready to cut open Mr. Witch’s stomach.","Mr. Witch was pale with fear, powerless to resist, \"There truly isn’t, there isn’t the slightest feeling of a foreign object in my abdomen...\"","But Master Xiao wasn’t listening; he believed only what he could see.","Just then, Mo Hua suddenly said, \"Master Xiao, perhaps Mr. Witch truly has no token in his stomach.\"","Master Xiao paused, frowning, \"Why?\"","Mo Hua said, \"He transformed into a monster, his flesh is too filthy, and can corrode external objects. That Fish Bone Token, it doesn’t look sturdy enough, after being swallowed for so long, it probably has been corroded by Blood Qi...\"","\"Yes, yes,\" Mr. Witch grasped at the straw he clung to, nodding vigorously, \"This little... Little Daoist speaks the truth!\"","Master Xiao’s expression was stern and silent, caught up in thought.","Mo Hua, seeing the opportunity, said to Mr. Witch, \"Now that the Dragon King Temple’s doors are sealed, do you know any other way to leave the Dragon King Temple?\"","Mr. Witch’s expression was hesitating.","Mo Hua’s tone grew colder, \"Don’t blame me for not warning you, Master Xiao is not someone to be trifled with. If you’re of no use, even if there’s truly no token in your stomach, he will dissect you regardless...\"","Mr. Witch’s face turned as white as paper. After pondering for a moment, he said through gritted teeth, \"There is a way out...\"","\"What way?\"","\"I have another Token hidden...\"","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow, \"Where is it hidden?\"","Mr. Witch looked frightened, hesitated for a long time, and finally spoke slowly, \"I hid it... inside the altar...\"","Mo Hua paused, then a slight smile curved his lips.","-----------------","ps.","The new month has begun, please give me some monthly votes.","Having no monthly votes is terrible (crying)~","Also, there will be an extra Chapter today, aside from the normal update, another Chapter should be ready~ (๑•.•๑)"]},{"number":1630,"title":"Chapter 1630 - 850: Stolen Voices (Extra - for Boss Catnip of the Night)","paragraphs":["Finally!","Caught a weakness at last...","Mo Hua was elated inside, but on the surface, he remained composed, merely maintaining a stern face as he asked, \"What altar?\"","\"The altar where offerings are presented to the Divine Lord...\"","\"Where is it?\"","\"In...\" Mr. Witch hesitated.","Mo Hua kindly reminded, \"Master Xiao is not a patient man. If you don’t speak, he may well cut you open.\"","Mr. Witch panicked and hurriedly said, \"It’s in the inner hall of the Dragon King Temple!\"","Mo Hua’s eyes flickered slightly, then he shook his head and said,","\"Something’s not right. You didn’t ask for anything in return, not a single condition, just revealed the altar’s location so easily? There’s definitely something off...\"","Mr. Witch smiled wryly, \"The blade is in your hands; I am just fish on the chopping block, how dare I make any demands. It’s enough if you spare my life. If I die, I can’t serve the Divine Lord with loyalty and devotion.\"","This Mr. Witch, even in the face of death, still thought about his \"Divine Lord.\"","Who knows how his brain has been washed.","Mo Hua shook his head.","Nearby, Master Xiao pondered for a moment; unwilling to delay further, he pointed his longsword at Mr. Witch’s throat. Between his narrowed eyes, there was a gleam, and he said coldly,","\"You lead the way to the altar and fetch the Fish Bone Token you have hidden, and I won’t kill you.\"","Mr. Witch, trembling with the sword pointed at him, said, \"Alright, I’ll take you there...\"","The long-desired altar, Mo Hua was eager to go there too.","But with so many watching, he had to pretend and said with a worried look,","\"I fear it might be a trap...\"","Master Xiao shook his head, \"It doesn’t matter.\"","Mo Hua added, \"This Mr. Witch may not have good intentions, and that altar might not be a good place either...\"","Master Xiao said, \"With so many of us, and four Golden Cores, in this Dragon King Temple, there’s nothing to fear. As for Mr. Witch...\"","\"On this journey, at the slightest stir, I’ll have Mr. Witch meet his end first.\"","Mr. Witch’s face twitched, but he dared not say anything.","He only had Foundation Building Cultivation; unless he turned into the invulnerable Dragon Scale monster, he was not a match for Master Xiao.","Mo Hua then sighed and said, with some reluctance,","\"If that’s the case, let’s follow Master Xiao’s advice and go take a look at the altar.\"","Master Xiao nodded and, with his sword, gestured to Mr. Witch, \"Please lead the way, sir.\"","Mr. Witch’s face turned sullen, but under the circumstances, he had no choice but to agree.","\"Everyone, follow me...\"","Mr. Witch glanced around, paying his respects guiltily to the corpses of the temple guards on the ground, and then turned to proceed toward the Yaksha Hall.","Entering the Yaksha Hall, they saw statues standing on both sides of the path, with limbs, covered in scales, bearing grotesque blue faces and fangs—these were yakshas.","Seeing this, Mo Hua mumbled to himself.","The appearance of these yakshas somewhat resembled the monster that Mr. Witch transformed into.","Mr. Witch did not glance at these statues and continued deeper inside.","Passing through the Yaksha Hall and several other halls, they arrived at the central hall of the Dragon King Temple.","The moment they reached the central hall, blood was everywhere, and everyone’s expressions subtly changed.","As far as the eye could see, the entire central hall, with countless pavilions and halls, had mostly been dismantled. Beams had collapsed, leaving behind ruined walls. It appeared desolate and barren.","And the ground all around was soaked with filthy blood.","The blood was dark, fetid, and seemed to conceal abundant evil power.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, pulling out an iron rod. After soaking it in the water for a while and retrieving it, the rod had been corroded by evil qi, its iron loosened—and inside was black and red.","Mo Hua turned his head to Mr. Witch and asked,","\"Is this bloodwater used to draw an Evil Formation?\"","Mr. Witch’s heart pounded, but on the surface, he appeared confused and flustered, saying, \"Young master, what Evil Formation, I don’t know...\"","\"Aren’t you a Formation Master?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"I am indeed a Formation Master, but I truly know nothing about this bloodwater.\"","\"Then what happened here in the main hall? Why is it all collapsed?\"","\"This...\" Mr. Witch hesitated.","Mo Hua’s voice turned slightly cold, \"Those people outside, whom you killed and consumed, you can claim ignorance. But this destruction of the temple is evidently not an overnight affair, and as the person in charge at the Dragon King Temple, don’t tell me you don’t know even this?\"","Mr. Witch’s face twitched lightly and he said, \"By the order of the Divine Lord, this Dragon King Temple was to be renovated and rebuilt. Therefore, the halls were dismantled for reconstruction, but...\"","Mr. Witch said helplessly, \"...we hadn’t started before this happened. All the temple guards died, and I don’t know how I ended up like this, or where all this bloodwater came from...\"","Mo Hua frowned and remained silent.","Master Xiao, scanning around with indifferent eyes, spoke,","\"Enough, discussing this is futile, let him quickly lead the way. Finding the altar, getting the Fish Bone Token, and leaving this wretched temple is what’s important.\"","Mo Hua nodded and said nothing more.","Mr. Witch dutifully led the way.","The bloodwater on the ground was both filthy and bloody, unsafe for cultivators to touch, so they had to find another path through the ruins, taking more time.","After a bumpy journey, they made their way through the ruined central hall, across the sprawling pool of crimson blood.","And beyond the central hall, there stood a massive gate before them.","The gate was five or six people tall, topped with temple eaves, wide and heavy, adorned with murals. Between the two closed doors lay a grotesque ram’s head stone lock."]},{"number":1631,"title":"Chapter 1631 - 850: Stolen Voices (Extra - for Boss Catnip of the Night)","paragraphs":["The sheep’s head opened its mouth, majestic and terrifying, tightly sealing the two doors.","This was the gate separating the central hall from the inner hall.","It was also a gate that isolated the altar.","Mo Hua looked at the grim and horrifying, yet familiar and amiable sheep’s head, faintly sensing the tempting and drooling aura behind it, his heart pounding.","He didn’t pretend anymore and directly asked Mr. Witch:","\"How do we open the door?\"","Mr. Witch replied, \"This door, it’s not easy to open...\"","\"Stop talking nonsense.\" Mo Hua’s face was stern.","\"Okay, okay...\"","Mr. Witch repeatedly said, muttering inwardly: This little devil, why was he so cautious just now, but now he seems a bit impatient?","Throughout this journey, this little devil was just too shrewd.","He could pick faults in the smallest matters.","Those eyes were clear as water, sometimes deep as an abyss, making one feel uneasy being watched.","Mr. Witch didn’t dare lie and thus explained:","\"Opening this door takes time... Originally, it had to be prepared a day in advance before the sacrifice, first by placing offerings, burning incense to inform the Divine Lord, praying for His command, and only with His approval could the door be opened...\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"Explain it more clearly.\"","\"Yes, yes,\" Mr. Witch said, \"In simple terms, it means placing offerings, sacrificing a person, and after a day, if the Divine Lord approves, this door will naturally open.\"","\"Why does it take a whole day?\" Mo Hua asked.","Mr. Witch smiled bitterly, \"This... this is the Divine Lord’s rule, it takes a day to open this door, as for why... I am just the Divine Lord’s servant, how could I know...\"","Mo Hua’s brow slightly furrowed, but he said nothing, instead saying:","\"Then open the door now.\"","Mr. Witch hesitated, \"Opening this door requires a person as a sacrifice...\"","\"What kind of sacrifice?\"","\"It means a live person, as a ’victim’, only then can the door be opened...\"","Mo Hua’s expression was cold, \"Stop telling me these irrelevant things, I just want the door opened, you figure out the rest yourself.\"","\"Whatever sacrifice, dog sacrifice, get it yourself. Can’t manage, slaughter yourself and offer yourself as the ’human sacrifice’.\"","Mr. Witch had a bitter smile on his face but was seething with anger inside.","This little devil, truly detestable!","Someday he will be punished by the Divine Lord, dying without a burial place!","Mo Hua didn’t spare this Mr. Witch either.","He’s dealt with such scheming, human-like, ghost-like \"religious con men\" a lot, understanding their true nature.","If you don’t pressure them a bit, you have no idea what tricks they have up their sleeves.","\"Quickly open the door, don’t play tricks, or else I’ll gut you!\" Mo Hua threatened.","Master Xiao on the other side was also holding onto his longsword, watching intently.","Mr. Witch sighed, not daring to delay any further deliberately, and walked to one side of the large door to a statue, turning a mechanism, extracting three boxes from the statue’s abdomen.","Patterns carved on the boxes, Mo Hua instantly noticed, were ice-type formations, likely used for preservation.","Mr. Witch opened the boxes, each containing a pulsating heart.","These three hearts, whether human or monster, uncertain how long they had been kept, yet still fresh in color, slightly quivering upon taking them out.","Mr. Witch placed these three hearts in the mouth of the sheep horn relief.","In a flash, the sheep’s mouth sprouted several fangs, biting into the three hearts.","Blood seeped out, along the fangs, absorbed into the mouth of the sheep horn relief, then permeating the surroundings, following the blood grooves above, activating the strange patterns one by one.","However, this process was very slow.","\"Once the blood grooves are filled, the door will open,\" Mr. Witch said.","Mo Hua saw that the door was indeed slowly opening and he nodded, no longer making things difficult for Mr. Witch.","Since the door’s opening takes a day.","Before that, everyone could only wait silently, some still injured, needing a place to meditate and rest.","But the problem is, Mo Hua and his group were not really companions, on the surface in harmony, but there still remained distrust and suspicion among them.","So, during the rest period, everyone tactfully separated, each finding a place near the ruins in front of the sheep horn door to meditate and rest, while staying vigilant and guarding against each other.","Mr. Witch was alone.","Xie Liu, Water Yama, and Master Xiao were together.","Xiao Tianquan pondered for a moment, unsure of what he was thinking, but temporarily stayed with Master Xiao.","Mo Hua naturally stayed with Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official.","As for Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian, he had them stay nearby Xia Canonical Official to meditate and heal.","Master Xiao noticed but did not interfere, only glancing at Mo Hua, reminding:","\"The Tai’a Sect boy suffers from my Water Prison force, the girl from Hundred Flower Valley is poisoned by Gui Water Poison, in this Dragon King Temple, only I can neutralize that Water Prison force and only I can cure the Gui Water Poison...\"","Implying for Mo Hua not to entertain other thoughts.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian were still his hostages.","Mo Hua found it tricky in his heart but nonchalantly waved his hand, \"Understood, understood, Master Xiao rest assured, I won’t run off with them.\"","Master Xiao’s expression remained indifferent without visible joy or anger, then turned and left.","Afterwards, Mo Hua found a clean place for everyone to rest.","Surrounding them were ruins, somewhat safe, also able to see the sheep horn door not far away, monitoring the blood groove’s progress, anticipating the door’s opening time.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official sat cross-legged, guarding against Master Xiao and the others."]},{"number":1632,"title":"Chapter 1632 - 850: Stolen Voices (Extra - for Boss Catnip of the Night)","paragraphs":["Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian sat in meditation under the protection of two people, one healing and the other suppressing the poison.","Mo Hua also sat for a while and felt that the ground was a bit cold.","This Dragon King Temple is in the middle of the Mistwater River, soaked in water qi, and chillingly cold.","Earlier during the fight and traveling it was fine, but now that everything had quieted down, sitting on the ground, he felt a bit cold.","Mo Hua took out a warm blanket and wrapped himself up, turned to look at Gu Changhuai and the others, thought for a moment, and then took out a few blankets, giving one to each person.","He often went out and camped frequently, so furry blankets were a must-have in his Storage Bag.","This habit developed back when he traveled with his master, junior brother, and junior sister.","Everyone was a bit surprised, but they didn’t refuse, thanking Mo Hua as they received the blankets. After draping them over themselves, they indeed felt warm and couldn’t help but appreciate Mo Hua’s thoughtfulness and care.","Afterward, everyone went silent and meditated to rest.","The surroundings became tranquil.","Mo Hua, wrapped in his blanket, took the opportunity to quietly ponder the matters of the Dragon King Temple.","Some things others might not care about, but he couldn’t let them go unnoticed.","After all, the great dangers within the Dao of Divine Thought, the great crises amongst the Evil Gods and Demon Monsters, none had been witnessed or personally experienced by others, so naturally, they wouldn’t understand.","As for the matters within the Dragon King Temple, at first glance, there might not be much, but upon deeper reflection, there were too many incongruities...","\"Is the altar really behind this big door?\"","\"Could there be other dangers inside?\"","\"What exactly happened to Mr. Witch, is he hiding other malicious plans?\"","\"Where is the Dragon Blood?\"","\"And moreover, what is the reason for all these ruinous remnants... what was being rebuilt? What are they rebuilding?\"","\"...\"","Mo Hua recalled every bit along the way, pondering the answers in his mind and then verifying back and forth.","Lost in thought, Mo Hua suddenly froze, sensing a trace of anomaly.","This... the aura of a Formation?","Someone was secretly setting up a Formation?","Who could it be?","Daring to set up a Formation right under his nose?","Mo Hua quietly turned his head, using the dim light within the Dragon King Temple, quietly looked over, and then discovered that the one setting up the Formation...","was actually Master Xiao!","Mo Hua felt a slight shock in his heart, made a slight calculation, and then gently exhaled.","\"It’s a Sound Isolation Formation, not any dangerous Killing Formation, Trapping Formation, or Evil Formation...\"","Probably wanting to have a secret conversation, fearing others might eavesdrop.","Mo Hua felt at ease.","He resumed his previous train of thought, continuing to ponder, yet as he thought, Mo Hua paused again.","\"A secret conversation?\"","Mo Hua suddenly became very curious, his eyes slightly brightening.","Someone set up a Sound Isolation Formation right in front of him, to have an unspeakable secret conversation, how could he resist...","Mo Hua pondered a bit, then secretly took out two blankets, wrapping his head as well, pretending to rest, while quietly slipping out from the blankets, then used the Concealment Technique to sneak away.","Cannonical Official Xia, watching Mo Hua sneak away so openly, couldn’t help but open his mouth.","Gu Changhuai, however, was not surprised, even helping to tuck Mo Hua’s blanket tighter, making Mo Hua look more like a \"blanket person.\"","Mo Hua, hidden, quietly approached Master Xiao, stopping a few feet away.","After all, Master Xiao was a Golden Core, so he dared not get too close.","Mo Hua looked around, found a corner, squatted down, raised his head, and peered stealthily, discovering that Master Xiao was within the range of the Sound Isolation Formation, talking to Water Yama about something.","Their expressions were grave, voices low, clearly discussing something confidential.","\"Confidential matter...\"","Mo Hua felt an itch in his heart, thought for a moment, and released his Divine Thought very \"gently,\" perceiving the Sound Isolation Formation on the ground.","This Sound Isolation Formation was of the Second Grade.","In the Second Grade Territory, only Second Grade Formations could be used.","Since it was a Second Grade Formation, that made it simple.","Mo Hua performed a slight inference in his mind, calculating the intervals of Spiritual Power flow within the Sound Isolation Formation, which was the internal \"flaw\" of the Formation.","Then he took out a silver needle inscribed with the \"Stealing Sound Array\" using fine engraving techniques, flicked it lightly with a finger, and sent the silver needle into the flaw of the Sound Isolation Formation.","The silver needle was very light, and its sound was extremely faint.","And the Sound Isolation Formation insulated sound both inside and out, so Master Xiao remained unaware.","Of course, mainly because he didn’t think anyone could use such a method to eavesdrop on his conversation.","With the silver needle breaking into the Formation, Mo Hua took out the corresponding thread, wrapped it around his ear, and within moments, he could indeed hear sound.","Initially, the sound was somewhat intermittent, then gradually became clear:","\"Inadequate, more of a hindrance...\"","\"...I had already saved you once before, didn’t expect you to still be so incompetent...\"","\"...if it weren’t for needing to open that thing, I wouldn’t care about your life or death.\"","Mo Hua was somewhat bewildered upon hearing this.","Open... that thing?","What thing?","Mo Hua thought carefully for a moment, shocked in his heart, \"Could it be... to open the Water Prison Forbidden Box?!\"","This smiling tiger intends to use Water Yama to open the Water Prison Forbidden Box?","Mo Hua’s heart was heavy for a moment, but after a while, he calmed himself and continued eavesdropping.","\"Big Brother, it’s not that I’m incompetent, it’s just that the unexpected changes are too surprising, as if every move has been calculated by someone...\"","Water Yama said in a low voice.","Master Xiao’s expression was indifferent, \"I won’t listen to excuses.\"","Water Yama reluctantly closed his mouth, not daring to say more.","Master Xiao turned his head, glanced at Water Yama, \"Where is that thing?\"","Water Yama’s face instantly turned ashen.","Seeing Water Yama’s expression, Master Xiao slightly frowned, contemplated for a moment, his pupils contracted, eyes widening suddenly, and he said with a sinister tone:","\"Don’t you tell me... you lost it...\"","\"Not lost,\" Water Yama said tremblingly, \"just... it’s not with me right now.\"","Master Xiao’s eyes flashed with killing intent, anger turning to laughter:","\"Well, well, your abilities are indeed great, losing even that thing. Didn’t I warn you, your life can be lost, but that box must not suffer the slightest mishap?\"","Water Yama gritted his teeth, \"Forgive me, Big Brother, it was my negligence, I fell for a villain’s plot, and the box was snatched away.\"","\"I am doing my utmost to retrieve that box again and will not let Big Brother be disappointed.\"","Master Xiao frowned, \"Who has the box now?\"","Water Yama said, \"In... in the hands of that brat named Mo Hua.\"","Mo Hua, listening in stealthily, couldn’t help but shrink back his head.","Master Xiao, instead, looked dumbfounded as if he hadn’t heard clearly, \"Who?\"","\"Mo Hua...\" Water Yama said softly.","\"Which Mo Hua?\"","\"The one... who just talked with you, Big Brother... that Mo Hua.\"","Master Xiao opened his mouth, for a moment, his expression was quite wonderful.","The person who robbed the Water Prison Forbidden Box was just the kid he initially wanted to capture as a hostage but failed, then traveled together for a while, even planning with him how to capture Mr. Witch...","This kid robbed his treasure and then still casually wandered around in front of him for a large half of the day.","And he knew nothing!","At this moment, Master Xiao truly had the urge to kill Water Yama."]},{"number":1633,"title":"Chapter 1633 - 851: Big Scandal","paragraphs":["This is such an important matter, and this waste only speaks of it now. If it weren’t for this, I would have used all means to capture that little ghost back then!","Master Xiao looked at Shui Yan with murderous intent, then turned his head, eyes slightly open, with a sinister gaze, looking toward the distant \"Mo Hua\".","In his eyes, blood-colored Evil Qi surged, a terrifying aura.","But the distant \"Mo Hua\", being just a \"blanket person\", didn’t feel afraid, so there was no reaction at all, resting calmly by the broken wall.","Instead, Gu Changhuai, nearby, sensed something unusual and looked over coldly.","Both of them locked eyes, atmosphere tense, but neither spoke a word, and after a moment, they each withdrew their gaze.","Master Xiao coldly harrumphed in his heart.","\"This Gu Changhuai, still as alert as ever...\"","\"As for that little ghost...heartwide indeed, sleeping soundly...\"","He collected his emotions, his eyes squinted again, hiding everything within his heart’s city fortress, and calmly said:","\"I understand, the matter of the Water Prison Forbidden Box, do not mention it to anyone...\"","\"Yes.\"","\"How is your cultivation technique progressing?\" Master Xiao asked Shui Yan.","\"Not to let Big Brother down, I’ve already reached the fourth layer.\" Shui Yan replied.","Master Xiao’s expression slightly eased, nodding: \"That’s about right...\"","Upon hearing Master Xiao’s words, Shui Yan also seemed relieved, cupping his hands:","\"The spell point of the Water Prison Sect is indeed exquisite, all thanks to Big Brother’s full teaching that I could have such abilities at my disposal.\"","Full teaching?","Mo Hua was taken aback upon hearing this.","So all of Shui Yan’s abilities were taught by the smiling tiger?!","Master Xiao \"hmm\"ed in acknowledgement, saying no more, instead waving his hand to let Shui Yan leave.","Shui Yan saluted and then left.","There was only Master Xiao left in the field.","Mo Hua frowned and was about to leave, when suddenly a divine thought moved, discovering another silhouette.","\"Someone else is coming?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then continued to stay at the corner of the wall, pricking up his ears to listen.","After a while, a figure stepped out from the shadows, walked up to Master Xiao, and cupped his hands: \"Uncle.\"","The visitor was exceptionally talented, precisely Xiao Tianquan.","Master Xiao glanced at Xiao Tianquan, with an extremely complex expression, then after a moment, coldly laughed, \"No need to call me uncle.\"","Xiao Tianquan said, \"The bloodline is unbroken, with this bond of cause and effect, you will always be my uncle.\"","\"Bloodline...\"","Master Xiao’s expression was indifferent, with a touch of ridicule, \"Everyone knows, in the eyes of the wealthy, money is nothing; in the eyes of the nobles, power is nothing; and in the eyes of the family, blood ties are nothing.\"","Master Xiao looked at Xiao Tianquan, his expression growing colder, his gaze more indifferent, even carrying a trace of long-suppressed anger and unwillingness:","\"I have worked hard, scheming for so many years, did so much dirty work, paid countless efforts for the Xiao family, all I sought was the position of Court Leader.\"","\"Some matters, even, in order not to implicate the family, all the dirty water I bore alone.\"","\"You, at a young age, entered the Taoist Court, it was also me who supported you step by step.\"","\"You wanted achievements, fine! I found people to work for you; you were bored, I went to Rouge Boat to find women for you; you wanted prospects and network, I introduced you to the Young Masters’ Pavilion...\"","\"I even planned it, as long as I became Court Leader, managed relationships, paved the way, the next Court Leader of the Fifth Grade Qianxue Dao Tribunal, would definitely be yours!\"","\"But I never expected...\"","Master Xiao’s eyes were filled with anger, \"Those old undead in the clan are so eager to even bypass me and directly elevate you to compete for the Court Leader position!\"","Master Xiao laughed in extreme anger, \"What a great plan! I worked tirelessly all my life, laid down the path with great difficulty, not even having stepped on it yet, only to find myself as nothing but a stepping stone.\"","\"This is the family! When it comes to connections, it’s all kinship; when it comes to interests, it’s all indifferent beasts!\"","Xiao Tianquan’s face turned slightly pale, expression somewhat ashamed, \"Uncle, this is the Ancestor’s arrangement, I am also helpless...\"","\"Of course you are helpless, the benefits all fall onto you, what more do you want?\" Master Xiao coldly laughed.","Xiao Tianquan lowered his head and bowed to Master Xiao.","Master Xiao stared at Xiao Tianquan for a moment, knowing that in this matter, his nephew indeed had no say in it, feeling understanding, but simultaneously could not help but feel envy in his heart.","Blame only the fact that among this generation of disciples of the Xiao family, Xiao Tianquan was truly too outstanding.","Bloodline, spiritual root, talent, perception, appearance—everything was excellent.","If I were the Ancestor, I would surely also favor this direct-line grandson, thinking of ways to pave the way for him.","Compared to this energetic Heaven’s Chosen Son, an aging, petty middle-aged Supervisor like me, if discarded, no one would care, nor would anyone spare a glance.","As long as one is young, talented, and attractive, the future interests for the Xiao family are limitless.","Especially... arranged marriage.","Master Xiao said indifferently: \"I heard that the Ancestor and the others are discussing your engagement with Xia Canonical Official...\"","This sudden statement was like a bolt from the blue, stunning the eavesdropping Mo Hua.","The Howling Celestial Dog... and Xia Canonical Official’s engagement?!","What??","Mo Hua’s mouth was agape like a duck egg.","What in the world?","After the shock, Mo Hua immediately realized something, collected his emotions, focused intently, and continued listening.","In another place, within the sound isolation formation.","Xiao Tianquan cupped his hands, silent, clearly acknowledging it.","Master Xiao’s face carried a hint of mockery, and a hint of admiration, nodding: \"Truly worthy of the Ancestor, doing what others don’t dare to think...\""]},{"number":1634,"title":"Chapter 1634 - 851: The Big Scoop (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"According to common sense, given the Xiao family’s rank and status, we are certainly unworthy of forming an alliance through marriage with the Xia family. However, your situation with Master Xia is quite special...\"","\"You have good Spiritual Roots, excellent talent, and unlimited prospects. Most importantly, you are very young.\"","\"Master Xia is also not bad, in appearance and Spiritual Roots, all top-notch, with nothing to criticize. But, he’s only old, and has served in the Taoist Court for many years, cold and distant, with a bad temper.\"","\"With Master Xia’s qualities, seeking an alliance from above, or even marriage, is somewhat difficult. But you are still young, and with your promising future, you make up for the shortcomings of family background.\"","\"In this way, you two actually become well-matched.\"","Master Xiao’s gaze darkened slightly, glancing at Xiao Tianquan, \"I heard... that the Xia family’s Master Xia has already personally met with you and is quite satisfied with you?\"","Xiao Tianquan respectfully said, \"All thanks to Master Xia’s favor.\"","Master Xiao sneered, sighed, and said coldly:","\"Everyone’s playing a good game... You two marrying, the Xia family gets a rope to tie the Xiao family, and the Xiao family gets a ladder to climb up. Good, good...\"","But he, this old dog selling his life, was sold out.","If he doesn’t bark, he might still breathe a few times. If he barks, there wouldn’t even be bones left.","Xiao Tianquan also sighed a little, expressing sincerely:","\"Uncle, your kindness is something I will never forget. These schemes are made by the Ancestors. I really have no right to interfere... But Uncle, rest assured, when I become the Court Leader someday, I will surely appoint you to an important position. In the future, even if you don’t become the Court Leader, at least the position of Deputy Court Leader will be yours without a doubt.\"","Master Xiao nodded, \"Not bad, at least in drawing circles for others to sell their lives, your way with words isn’t bad. With this skill, taking on the Court Leader position shouldn’t be a problem...\"","Xiao Tianquan said, \"Uncle...\"","Master Xiao raised an eyebrow, \"I’ve treated you well, don’t take me for a fool.\"","Xiao Tianquan fell silent.","Master Xiao gave Xiao Tianquan one last deep look, \"Considering that I bear the surname Xiao, and that you are the Heaven’s Chosen Son in whom the Xiao family has high hopes, the backbone of the Xiao family’s future... For this sentiment, I will ensure you leave this Dragon King Temple safely.\"","\"But once you leave, this identity of a Supervisor, I don’t want it anymore. The name ’Xiao,’ I’ll also give up. You and I will no longer have any ties. Live or die, it’s none of my concern...\"","With these words, Master Xiao left indifferently, sweeping his sleeves as he went.","Xiao Tianquan showed a hint of loss in his expression, seemingly still grateful for Master Xiao’s care over these days, but it quickly faded.","He is the Heaven’s Chosen Son, different from Master Xiao. Parting ways now is ultimately a good thing.","Xiao Tianquan offered a distant salute to Master Xiao’s retreating figure, then turned and left as well.","After they left, Mo Hua let out a slight sigh of relief, retrieved his silver needles, tucked away the wire, concealed himself, and quietly returned to the resting place, slipping back under his blanket.","The \"blanket person\" turned back into Mo Hua.","Gu Changhuai, sensing the commotion, looked around and asked in a low voice, \"What did you hear?\"","Master Xia also looked over curiously.","Mo Hua recalled the conversation just now, shocked.","He heard something incredible!","Got a shocking piece of gossip!","This gossip is too big, he can’t swallow it all in one bite.","The Xiao and Xia families are planning to pair the Howling Celestial Dog with Master Xia!","Mo Hua opened his mouth to speak but stopped, glancing at Master Xia.","Does Sister Xia even know about this?","If she doesn’t know, even if I tell her, it seems... it’s of no use?","You can’t twist an arm into a thigh, Sister Xia may be a Golden Core, but the Xia family is in the Central Dao Court, a great family in the Taoist State at the heart of the Nine State.","Even if she disagrees, what can she do?","And if she already knows, wouldn’t I be, in effect, gossiping in front of the involved party?","After all, this kind of private marriage talk isn’t great to say out loud.","Sister Xia likely doesn’t want others to know, nor would she like it being discussed.","As for Uncle Gu.","This idiot, he may not even get it. With his current relationship with Sister Xia, even if you tell him, he may not be aware of anything.","Mo Hua silently swallowed this big gossip.","Having gossip and not being able to share it is very uncomfortable.","Gu Changhuai saw Mo Hua hesitating and said puzzled, \"Speak up, what’s there to hesitate about.\"","Mo Hua looked at Gu Changhuai, then at Master Xia, sighed internally, and picked another matter to speak of:","\"I just heard a big secret... that Water Yama’s skills were taught by the Grinning Tiger!\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression was shocked.","Master Xia was somewhat taken aback, \"Grinning Tiger?\"","Gu Changhuai explained helplessly, \"Master Xiao... it’s a nickname Mo Hua gave him, calling him the Grinning Tiger.\"","\"I see...\"","Master Xia nodded, recalling Master Xiao’s fake smiling but not smiling face, had to admit, the child Mo Hua’s nickname was indeed quite apt.","Seeing this, Mo Hua followed up, \"I gave Xiao Tianquan a nickname too, calling him ’Howling Celestial Dog’.\"","\"Howling Celestial Dog?\"","Master Xia was taken aback, then his expression remained usual but his lips slightly pursed, evidently amused but trying hard to hold it in.","Gu Changhuai sighed, \"Speak of the important matters.\"","Mo Hua responded with an \"oh,\" pondered briefly, then summarized the Grinning Tiger and Water Yama’s conversation just now.","Of course, he left out the part about the Water Prison Forbidden Box in his possession.","He also mentioned Xiao Tianquan’s matters.","\"That Grinning Tiger took the ’Howling Celestial Dog’ to the Rouge Boat, said to find women for his pleasure, and also said to introduce the ’Howling Celestial Dog’ to the ’Young Masters’ Pavilion,’ for the sake of expanding his network...\""]},{"number":1635,"title":"Chapter 1635 - 851: The Big Scoop (Part 3)","paragraphs":["As Mo Hua spoke these words, he sneaked a glance at Xia Canonical Official, noticing her slightly furrowed brows and a hint of disdain in her expression, she nodded slightly.","Even though Mo Hua didn’t reveal the biggest secret, the secret he did share was enough to surprise both Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official.","They hadn’t expected that Master Xiao was so deeply involved.","As for Xiao Tianquan’s affairs, they were unexpected, yet not entirely surprising.","In private, the Rouge Boat was Soul Extinguishing Town, the Young Masters’ Pavilion was a place for nobles. Such an \"olive branch\" would be nearly impossible for a common noble family’s son to refuse, unless they were truly resolute and righteous cultivators.","As long as it wasn’t laid out openly, it might even be regarded as a \"fortunate\" event that many would seek after.","It wasn’t too surprising that Xiao Tianquan had visited the Rouge Boat.","Mo Hua speculated, \"It seems now, this smiling tiger actually learned the superior inheritance of the Water Prison Sect.\"","\"The heritage of the Water Prison Sect is hierarchical, where the higher ranks suppress the lower, allowing no defiance.\"","\"The inheritance of the smiling tiger clearly surpasses that of the Water Yama, which is why the sinister Water Yama acts so obediently in front of him...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"If that’s the case, catching Master Xiao might not be that easy...\"","Mo Hua also nodded, \"If we suppose that all of Water Yama’s skills come from the smiling tiger, then it is possible that the smiling tiger knows everything Water Yama does, and maybe even better.\"","\"That is to say, not only does he know the Gui Water Sword, but also the Water Shadow Step, Water Torture Whip, and even... that eerie Blood Pupil Skill...\"","Both Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official looked grave.","This means that this Master Xiao is essentially a Golden Core version of the \"Water Yama,\" and reinforced Taoist skills version at that.","Or in other words, what seems like a troublesome Water Yama is actually just a \"substandard\" version of Master Xiao.","\"This Xiao Zhenhai is hiding so deeply...\" Gu Changhuai sighed.","Xiao Zhenhai is the real name of Master Xiao.","For so many years, he has been maneuvering within the Taoist Court, and although he restrained himself in confrontations, appearing to possess middle-of-the-road cultivation prowess, it was unexpected that he hid so many immeasurable methods behind the scenes.","Xia Canonical Official said seriously, \"If that’s the case, it might be unwise to act against Master Xiao lightly. It’s best to maintain peace and leave the Dragon King Temple first...\"","Mo Hua nodded.","But he knew in his heart, things might not be that simple.","Before, the smiling tiger might have thought of coexisting peacefully and fleeing far away, for he didn’t want to truly offend the Xia family and the Gu family to death.","But now, knowing that the Water Prison Forbidden Box is in his hands, the situation is different.","Gu Changhuai also said, \"Xiao Zhenhai seems friendly but is wicked at heart and deep-minded; it’s necessary to guard against him...\"","\"Everything else is fine, except for that pupil skill. If he has cultivated it, he’s likely much stronger than Water Yama. If caught by his pupil skill in this peril-laden Dragon King Temple, it could be dire...\"","Xia Canonical Official pondered for a moment, took out a jade pendant, and said:","\"This is the calming jade of my Xia family, a secretly crafted spiritual artifact not shared with outsiders, which can calm the mind and ward off evil. Wearing it on the chest, if affected by the pupil skill, it can protect the heart meridian and suppress evil qi, not completely block it, but much better than none.\"","She originally intended to use it against Water Yama.","Gu Changhuai, being ill-tempered and unpleasant in speech, was not her initial choice to give it to, but the situation is unique now, and among the few Golden Core people in this Dragon King Temple, only Gu Changhuai is worthy of her trust.","Gu Changhuai hesitated for a moment, then silently accepted the jade pendant, considered for a moment, and then casually handed it to Mo Hua, saying:","\"You take it.\"","He was worried that Mo Hua might become a victim of Master Xiao’s hand. After all, originally, Master Xiao wanted to capture Mo Hua as a hostage.","Mo Hua, however, wished he could hit Gu Changhuai’s head with a stick.","With such low emotional intelligence, no wonder he’s single all his life.","Mo Hua naturally wouldn’t accept it and frantically signaled to Gu Changhuai with his eyes.","\"Uncle Gu, this jade pendant is so valuable, please keep it well.\"","Gu Changhuai said, \"You...\"","Mo Hua said, \"I’m fine, the smiling tiger will only target you and Sister Xia with his pupil skill. You and Sister Xia are Golden Cores, your safety ensures mine. If either of you falls prey to the smiling tiger’s trickery, only then will I be in danger...\"","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment, nodded, and finally put the jade pendant away carefully with a \"fine.\"","Xia Canonical Official said nothing, silently watching Gu Changhuai, her expression somewhat strange, perhaps angry.","Mo Hua sighed, feeling a bit weary.","He suddenly understood Elder Gu Hong’s hardships as a matchmaker...","After that, everyone quieted down.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian were still healing.","Over with Master Xiao and Water Yama, things were temporarily peaceful.","Mr. Witch, at some unknown time, had knelt before the ram’s horn gate, murmuring his devotion to the Master of the Great Wilderness.","Time passed bit by bit.","The blood grooves around the ram’s horn relief were slowly filled with the blood from the three hearts used as \"human offerings.\"","Finally, after a full day, the blood from the hearts was completely drained, leaving them shrunken and empty.","The blood grooves of the ram’s horn relief were thoroughly filled, displaying strange and obscure blood-colored patterns around them.","A majestic and terrifying aura emanated from the ram’s head relief.","Mo Hua’s pupils shrank slightly.","Everyone else sensed this strange aura too, feeling a bit uneasy in their confusion.","Mr. Witch immediately prostrated on the ground, bowing six times, sincerely and fearfully saying:","\"Divine Lord, I have brought the sacrificial offerings, I beg the Divine Lord to open the door of the live sacrifice!\"","After saying this, Mr. Witch prostrated on the ground, kowtowing devoutly.","After a while, a dull sound emerged, seemingly a response from some existent presence, to Mr. Witch’s plea.","On the door, the eyes of the ram’s horn relief momentarily flashed with an ancient golden light.","Then, the relief opened its mouth, releasing the grip on the two doors.","The door slowly opened.","Revealing a vast endless blood-sea, denser and richer than the residual blood outside, stretching as far as the eye could see, boundless.","This was a giant, boundless blood pool.","And in the center of the blood pool, stood several demon monster statues, surrounding an altar. On this altar, stood a fierce ram horn.","Before the ram horn were blood and flesh offerings, surrounded by white skeletal remains.","This is the place for sacrificing to the Evil God within the Dragon King Temple beside Mistwater River, precisely what Mo Hua has sought day and night...","The altar of the Master of the Great Wilderness!","Mo Hua even lightened his breathing for fear that breathing too hard would make the altar vanish..."]},{"number":1636,"title":"Chapter 1636 - 852: Fish Bone Order","paragraphs":["In Mo Hua’s eyes, there was only the altar for a moment.","A moment later, he came to his senses, looking at the boundless blood sea, without a raft or a path, unable to see the edge of the gigantic blood pool, he furrowed his brows.","\"How do we get across?\"","Mo Hua asked Mr. Witch.","Mr. Witch said, \"There is the White Bone Boat, which can carry you across the blood sea to the other shore.\"","\"White Bone Boat?\"","\"Everyone, follow me,\" Mr. Witch nodded and said.","Ever since entering the inner hall, getting closer to the blood pool, and nearer to the altar, it seemed also closer to the \"Divine Lord\". Mr. Witch’s face showed less fear and instead carried a hint more of steadiness and piety.","He led the way at the front, guiding everyone to the edge of the blood pool, stopping at the statue of a giant fish-bodied demon monster. No one knew what hand gestures he formed, but suddenly there was a rumbling sound as the statue’s head and body separated.","The fish demon statue, made of white bone, slid into the blood sea, exactly in the shape of a \"White Bone Boat\".","Mr. Witch said, \"Please.\"","The group hesitated for a moment, just about to take action, when Mo Hua suddenly said, \"Wait.\"","Mr. Witch turned back, looking at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua said, \"Let me ask you, when was this blood pool built?\"","Mr. Witch clasped his hands and said, \"When the Dragon King Temple was first built, there was this blood pool.\"","\"For what purpose?\"","\"This... naturally to offer tribute to the Divine Lord...\"","Mo Hua sneered, \"You’re lying. Although my cultivation is not high and my Formation skills are not good, I am after all from a Great Sect, so I know a little about Formations...\"","As Mo Hua mentioned that his \"Formation skills are not good\", Gu Changhuai couldn’t help but twitch his eyelids.","Thinking to himself, this kid is starting to give people a hard time again.","\"Don’t think I don’t know. This blood pool, full of Evil Power, and located at the center of this Dragon King Temple, must be the formation eye of some kind of Formation. Charged with evil blood, this Formation must be an Evil Formation.\"","\"You so easily agreed to use this White Bone Boat to take us across the blood pool, you must have malicious intentions, perhaps thinking of capsizing halfway to throw us into the blood pool.\"","\"Or maybe you intend to use an Evil Formation against us...\"","Evil Formation...","As Mo Hua spoke these words, everyone felt a chill in their hearts.","Even in Master Xiao’s expression, there was increased vigilance.","Mr. Witch’s face slightly changed, he laughed awkwardly:","\"Young master is joking. Since you have learned about Formations, you should know that all Formations in this world require Formation media; without media, there can be no Formation.\"","\"This blood pool is vast and boundless, with nothing to rely on, so we cannot create Formation media, therefore no way to draw Formation Patterns, much less set up the Formation Pivot or construct the formation eye.\"","\"Moreover, with the blood water in this pool, accumulated over the years, the Evil Power is so strong that flesh touching it will perish, and metals will corrode. Even if Formation media had been set up, it would have eroded long ago. Even if a Formation had been drawn, it wouldn’t be able to be activated...\"","After speaking, Mr. Witch suppressed his unease and looked at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua furrowed his brows, appearing very puzzled, but then nodded, muttering, \"It seems correct, there’s no Formation Patterns around here either...\"","Mr. Witch maintained a calm expression, silently letting out a sigh of relief in his heart.","He thought that he had really been found out by this little imp...","Fortunately, it was just a false alarm.","Luckily, this little imp was only half-baked, seeming to have learned a bit from his elders and eager to show off.","Though his vigilance was indeed high, and his intuition very sharp, but after all, his knowledge was lacking due to his age. Otherwise, things would have turned bad.","Mr. Witch said frankly, \"The Fish Bone Token is placed on the altar, if you trust me, follow me to retrieve it. If you don’t trust me, there really is nothing I can do, do as you wish.\"","Master Xiao stared at Mr. Witch for a moment, pondering, then spoke, \"Let’s board the boat.\"","At this point, even if Mr. Witch truly harbors other intentions, they can only proceed.","Because there’s no way back.","But being reminded by Mo Hua, Master Xiao still retained a bit of suspicion and instructed Xie Liu, \"Keep an eye on him, don’t let him make any move.\"","Xie Liu disliked being ordered around, but in front of Master Xiao, he could only suppress his temper, drew his longsword, and placed it against Mr. Witch’s neck, coldly saying:","\"Mr. Witch, my apologies.\"","Mr. Witch looked at him coldly, quietly making a mark in his heart against him.","He considered himself a servant of the Divine Lord.","These people weren’t even worthy to serve as servants, yet dared to threaten him.","Mr. Witch was escorted by Xie Liu onto the White Bone Boat.","The rest of the group also boarded the boat afterward.","Then the White Bone Boat set sail, with Mr. Witch ferrying, taking the group across the boundless blood sea, cutting through waves towards the altar in the center of the blood pool.","The blood pool reeked with a nauseating odor, with Evil Power surging.","Sitting on the White Bone Boat, looking around, all they could see was the vast blood water, leaving everyone feeling somewhat apprehensive.","Yet, fortunately, the journey was smooth.","Whether it was that Mr. Witch truly had no other intentions, or because he was being held by Xie Liu and had no chance to make any move, the blood sea roared, looking dangerous, but the passage had been unusually smooth.","In about an hour, the group reached the shore.","The shore had white bones, with stairs made of white bone, casting demon statues alongside the steps, several hideous demon statues guarding the altar.","Mo Hua stared at the altar, almost unable to move.","If it weren’t for all these people around, with the timing not being right, he would have already rushed over, stepped on the demon statues, kicked away the ram-horned skull, and sat grandly on this altar, enjoying a \"feast\" of demon monsters for himself.","In this way, his Nineteen Patterns Divine Sense could advance further.","Advancing Nineteen Patterns further, for all Formations below the Golden Core, except for Second Grade Ultimate Formation, he would learn them with almost no threshold.","Mo Hua was craving badly.","\"What a pity...\"","The pity was that the timing was not right, there were too many bad people, and he had to be patient to \"clear the field\" one by one."]},{"number":1637,"title":"Chapter 1637 - 852: Bone Order (2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua’s eyes narrowed slightly, feigning that nothing had happened, silently blending into the crowd.","The group arrived in front of the altar, looking at the ram’s skull, and everyone halted.","For some reason, the altar was shrouded in a chilling aura, as if a terrifying will had descended here, making hearts uneasy, not daring to step forward.","Even the Xia Canonical Official, who did not believe in the \"Divine Lord\" and thought that the cultivators in the Dragon King Temple were merely using the name of \"god\" to unleash killing intent and were mad in spirit, felt a trace of unease, sensing something was amiss.","Master Xiao asked Mr. Witch, \"Where is the Fish Bone Token?\"","Mr. Witch pointed to the offering table and said, \"Below that offering table, at the very center of the cushion, there’s a secret compartment when you lift it.\"","Master Xiao glanced at the altar, particularly at the offering table with the ferocious ram’s skull displayed, feeling apprehensive, not daring to go over himself, he said to Mr. Witch:","\"Go honestly to fetch the token without making any rash moves. My sword Qi is locked onto your heart, a slight disturbance and I’ll take your life.\"","Mr. Witch complied, saying, \"Yes.\"","He proceeded forward but before reaching the altar, he started bowing, muttering prayers and apologies like \"forgive the disrespect, Divine Lord,\" seemingly afraid of provoking the wrath of the Evil God.","He bowed every three steps and kowtowed every nine steps until he reached the offering table at the altar, where he knocked his head eight or nine times like pounding garlic.","Only then did Mr. Witch lift the cushion and retrieve a wooden box from the secret compartment inside.","He held the wooden box, bowed his head, and retreated respectfully, roughly thirty steps back, before turning around and walking straight to the group.","\"I have fetched the token.\"","Mr. Witch said, and then he opened the wooden box before the crowd.","Inside the box indeed lied a token made of fish bone, bizarre in appearance, similar to what the Water Yama had used previously.","Master Xiao turned back to glance at the Water Yama.","The Water Yama examined the Fish Bone Token for a moment and nodded, \"It’s indeed the key token, there’s no mistake.\"","Only then did Master Xiao relax.","Mr. Witch placed the wooden box with the Fish Bone Token on the ground, then slowly retreated, calmly observing the crowd.","Yet none among them made a move.","The atmosphere was momentarily tense.","Earlier, perhaps there was a fleeting moment of \"unity\" among them, but that was earlier.","Now that the token lay before them, the temporarily formed \"team\" unraveled on its own.","\"This token...\" Master Xiao looked at Xia Canonical Official and Gu Changhuai, said in a serious tone, \"Who will take it?\"","Gu Changhuai’s gaze fixed, \"It’s certainly not going to be you.\"","Master Xiao sighed, \"After working together for so many years, Supervisor Gu, you still don’t trust me.\"","Gu Changhuai sneered, \"Precisely because we’ve worked together for so many years, I do not trust you.\"","Master Xiao’s gaze darkened a bit, speaking earnestly:","\"To be frank with you both, the Dragon King Temple is full of weirdness, fighting internally here is unwise. Why not we hold off temporarily and settle any grievances after leaving the temple...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned slightly, asking, \"What do you propose?\"","Master Xiao pointed to the Fish Bone Token on the ground, \"To show sincerity, I can hand over the token to you two for safekeeping.\"","\"As long as you guarantee the temple door can be opened, allowing me to leave the Dragon King Temple safely.\"","\"As for what comes next, we can talk about it once we leave this damn temple...\"","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official exchanged glances, both slightly astonished.","But since Master Xiao had spoken to this extent, neither of them had reason to refuse.","Xia Canonical Official nodded, \"Alright.\"","She then slowly walked to the box, leaning down to fetch the Fish Bone Token.","Gu Changhuai held the Green Bird Feather Fan, lightly activating his spiritual power, focusing intently on Master Xiao while subtly shielding Xia Canonical Official behind him.","Just as Xia Canonical Official reached out her hand, touching the Fish Bone Token...","Master Xiao’s gaze darkened, his form vanished, transforming into multiple water shadows, overlapping with sinister Yin Qi.","\"Watch out!\" Gu Changhuai whispered urgently.","Xia Canonical Official grasped the Fish Bone Token, unable to evade in an instant.","Seeing this, Gu Changhuai immediately launched several Wind Blades, sweeping toward the surrounding water shadows.","The Wind Blades shredded the water shadows.","But within those shattered water shadows, Master Xiao’s form was absent.","Gu Changhuai paused, then startled, shouting:","\"Mo Hua!\"","He looked around and suddenly found Mo Hua’s figure had already disappeared.","When Xia Canonical Official reached for the Fish Bone Token, Mo Hua sensed something amiss and had already gone invisible, fleeing far away.","He knew that Master Xiao, the old schemer, would certainly target him.","On this journey, he could occasionally perceive within his divine soul, Master Xiao’s implicit, unrevealed killing intent toward him.","This smiling tiger squinted, feigning amiability, thinking he was well concealed, but didn’t realize Mo Hua’s skill in the path of divine sense far surpassed ordinary cultivators.","Invisible, Mo Hua retreated ten zhang away, only then did he let out a sigh of relief.","But before he could fully exhale, a fierce killing intent suddenly descended.","Mo Hua’s pupils shrank, immediately using Water Passing Step to dodge, catching a glimpse at the corner of his eye, he saw a deep blue spiritual power cage had formed where he was just standing.","\"Water Prison Technique!\"","The spell he often used to trap others was now finally being used against him.","Moreover, eight chains had formed jointly on this water prison."]},{"number":1638,"title":"Chapter 1638 - 852: Bone Order Fish_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua could only condense six paths.","This Water Prison Technique is stronger than his own!","Mo Hua’s expression turned grim.","He was all too clear about the effects of the Water Prison Technique.","Once trapped, he’d inevitably become like a turtle in a jar, unable to escape.","A moment later, a cold and somewhat cruel Divine Sense locked onto him again.","Mo Hua’s expression turned serious, and he once again used the Water Passing Step, narrowly escaping.","At the same time, in the distance, a figure appeared in a water shadow. It was Master Xiao, holding a mirror, looking at Mo Hua with great surprise, and couldn’t help but exclaim:","\"In terms of quick wit and agile movement, young master, you are in the top three among cultivators I’ve seen in my life.\"","\"If considering cultivation as well, you are undoubtedly the first.\"","\"To capture you, I’ve specially prepared a Peeping Mirror to break your concealment; also gave the Fish Bone Token to Mr. Gu and others, causing them to be careless; meanwhile, using Water Shadow Step to cover, and suddenly striking, yet unexpectedly, you still managed to dodge... \"","\"Caught off guard, even with two Water Prison Techniques, I couldn’t capture you... \"","Master Xiao thought about it more and more, finding it unbelievable.","Not to mention a mere Foundation Building Cultivator, even an Initial Golden Core Cultivator would be trapped with such meticulous planning and means.","This little rascal is indeed strange...","Mo Hua was somewhat upset and said, \"Master Xiao, you and I have no past grievances or recent conflicts, why target a little cultivator like me?\"","Master Xiao remained silent, \"Do you really not know?\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Master Xiao coldly smiled, \"Is that thing in your hands?\"","Mo Hua looked bewildered, \"What thing?\"","\"That...\" Master Xiao’s gaze sharpened but he didn’t say it out loud, instead saying, \"The thing you snatched from Water Yama...\"","As soon as he said this, everyone present was stunned.","Even Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official were somewhat surprised, not expecting this.","When did this kid Mo Hua snatch something from Water Yama?","But Mo Hua directly shook his head, \"I don’t even know what you’re talking about?\"","Master Xiao’s forehead twitched.","\"How do you know I took something from Water Yama?\" Mo Hua asked confidently.","Master Xiao glanced back at Water Yama.","Mo Hua understood, then somewhat angrily said, \"This Water Yama is cunning, nothing from his mouth can be trusted!\"","\"That item, maybe he hid it himself. He’s blaming it on me, trying to use someone else to kill me, using you, Master Xiao, to kill me.\"","\"I’m so weak, I would die at your hands with a single strike. By then, dead with no evidence, Water Yama could conveniently swallow the item whole.\"","\"Truly malicious intentions...\"","Mo Hua spoke righteously.","Master Xiao listened and suddenly felt that Mo Hua was making sense too.","That thing being in Mo Hua’s hands was indeed only Water Yama’s one-sided words, and besides that, there was no way to prove the true whereabouts of the Water Prison Forbidden Box.","Master Xiao glanced at Water Yama again.","Water Yama, already furious to the point of almost bursting, hurriedly said:","\"Big brother, do not believe this little rascal’s nonsense, this little rascal is cunning and shameless, not a word from his mouth is to be trusted!\"","Master Xiao coldly looked at him, unsettling Water Yama, before turning his head and saying:","\"Little brother, honest folks don’t talk nonsense; if Water Yama didn’t say anything, that item is in your hands.\"","Mo Hua still refused to admit, \"What item?\"","Master Xiao was slightly angry, coldly laughed, \"Fine, still playing dumb with me.\"","He immediately used the Water Shadow Step again, intending to use it to get close to Mo Hua, so he could leverage cultivation suppression to restrict Mo Hua’s movements and take the opportunity to use the Water Prison Technique, even one Water Prison Technique trapping Mo Hua for just a breath would make him \"a thing in the bag.\"","But just as Master Xiao made his move, two figures suddenly blocked in front of him.","It was Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official.","Gu Changhuai held a feather fan, surrounded by swirling Wind Blades, Xia Canonical Official holding a short sword, its blade gleaming coldly.","Both protected Mo Hua in front, looking at Master Xiao with unfriendly eyes.","Master Xiao’s face twitched, he sighed slightly, \"I didn’t intend to become enemies with you two, but I didn’t expect you to press so closely, repeatedly hindering my plans, so you can’t blame me for not considering our shared past.\"","Gu Changhuai wore a cold smile but soon sensed something was wrong.","Around Master Xiao, an intense Evil Qi entwined.","At the same time, an extremely vast and cold Spiritual Power flowed through his meridians.","\"This is...\" Gu Changhuai’s expression changed, and suddenly he realized, \"a... Superior Spell?!\"","He immediately activated all the Wind Blades, turning into a gust of blue wind, attacking Master Xiao.","Simultaneously, Xia Canonical Official, like a flash of cold light, appeared in front of Master Xiao, short sword raised high, radiating icy aura.","The power of a Superior Spell is great, but comparatively, the time for casting and adjusting is also long.","Against ordinary cultivators it’s fine, as they can still prepare a big move, determining victory with one strike.","But Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, experienced in magic battles, naturally wouldn’t fall for it.","They knew to attack with all their might before the Superior Daoist Magic took shape, even if unable to break the spell, they could seriously injure Master Xiao.","However, their prediction was slightly off.","The time Master Xiao took to form the Superior Daoist Magic was much shorter than they anticipated.","Almost as soon as their Wind Blades and Sword Qi reached Master Xiao, his Spiritual Power surged, and deep blue water energy transformed into countless chains, layering and wrapping around him.","Then in just an instant, the Spiritual Lock exploded, spreading like countless threads.","On the ground, one prison after another rose.","And these countless chains, along with layers of prisons, entwined and wrapped together, forming a majestic and terrifying...","Stagnant Water Taoist Prison!","This Taoist Prison seemed capable of binding and suppressing all cultivators within its spell range.","Gu Changhuai was bound tightly by dense chains, unable to move.","And Xia Canonical Official, being close to Master Xiao, was even more heavily suppressed by several prisons.","Within the Taoist Prison, stagnant water spread, making it almost hard to breathe.","When Master Xiao was gathering power, he sensed something wrong, and Mo Hua, already having run far away, couldn’t help but gasp at the sight.","This Daoist Magic, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official might not know its origin, but Mo Hua understood it clearer than anyone.","The sect-protecting ultimate skill of Water Prison Sect, rare in the Cultivation World, a nearly unique superior control class Daoist Magic—","Water Prison Skill!","Mo Hua once remembered, Elder Yu Canghai of Water Prison Sect had said:","This Water Prison Skill is the highest ’control spell’ in the Water Prison Sect’s inheritance system, able to restrain all cultivators who practice Water Prison Sect’s techniques, and movement technique.","At the same time, the Water Prison Skill is a true \"strong control\" spell, ignoring immunity effects from Gold Body Techniques or Golden Body Talismans, forcibly restraining all cultivators...","The ultimate skill of Water Prison Sect, a sect-protecting inheritance.","Superior Daoist Magic, strong control spell, ignoring Gold Body.","Mo Hua’s heart grew increasingly shocked.","He never expected, this Water Prison Skill would fall into Master Xiao’s hands?!"]},{"number":1639,"title":"Chapter 1639 - 853: Bloody Battle","paragraphs":["This smiling tiger, he’s hidden too deep!","Yu Canghai, the last surviving elder of the Water Prison Sect, didn’t even know the whereabouts of the sect’s protecting Taoist Skill, yet this smiling tiger not only got hold of it but secretly mastered it long ago.","Who could have thought...","As Mo Hua marveled, a sense of danger arose, prompting him to instinctively use the Water Passing Step and Concealment Technique to escape.","A streak of Gui Water Sword Qi struck where he originally stood, missing its mark.","Then, another Water Prison Technique descended, missing again.","Originally using a superior control technique and the Water Prison Skill to subdue Gu Changhuai and Canonical Official Xia, Supervisor Xiao, feeling proud, watched Mo Hua and suddenly grew inexplicably furious.","He could capture even a Golden Core, yet this little Foundation Establishment brat was slippery like a mudfish, evading even his fingertips.","Supervisor Xiao clicked his tongue.","\"Never mind...\"","He turned his hand over, flashed, and appeared in front of Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian looked mildly angry, just about to act when Supervisor Xiao pointed a finger at each of them, inflicting Water Prison Strength on their shoulders, worsening their injuries instantly, leaving them unable to move.","Supervisor Xiao held the longsword horizontally before them, looking indifferently at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua felt helpless.","Uncle Gu and Canonical Official Xia were tricked by this smiling tiger, struck by the Water Prison Technique, temporarily subdued.","Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian were being used as threats by this smiling tiger.","Water Yama and Xie Liu were on the same side as the smiling tiger.","Xiao Tianquan stood by, watching with folded arms, unable to intervene anyway.","Counting it all, only Mo Hua was left on the scene.","Sensing the situation was unfavorable, Mo Hua sighed and immediately chose to surrender, saying to Supervisor Xiao:","\"I admit defeat, just stop chasing me.\"","Supervisor Xiao paused, then his gaze darkened, \"Young Master, you do know how to adapt to the situation.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Those who adapt to the times are wise, and indeed, I am wise.\"","Supervisor Xiao couldn’t help but laugh, shaking his head: \"What a pity, if it were not for differing paths and stands, I would genuinely like to be your Taoist Friend.\"","Mo Hua waved his hand, \"We’ll see...\"","He’s got plenty of friends, doesn’t lack this two-faced smiling tiger.","Supervisor Xiao was unconcerned, speaking directly: \"Young Master is a sensible person, so I won’t beat around the bush...\"","A glint of sharp light flashed in his eyes, \"That box... where is it?\"","At this point, Mo Hua no longer concealed anything and said:","\"I’ve kept it in a secret place, I’ll tell you once we’re out of the Dragon King Temple.\"","Mo Hua looked placid.","But Supervisor Xiao shook his head, \"Young Master, don’t take others for fools.\"","Mo Hua looked puzzled, \"Who did I take for a fool?\"","Supervisor Xiao’s face twitched slightly, he placed the longsword on Ouyang Feng’s shoulder, then glanced at Hua Qianqian, pondered a bit, and smiled:","\"What a lovely girl, it would be a pity if she met a tragic end.\"","Mo Hua understood Supervisor Xiao’s meaning, sighed, and said helplessly, \"Alright.\"","Ouyang Feng, with blood in his mouth, smiled bitterly and said: \"Junior Brother Mo, don’t worry about me, I lack the skill, whether it’s life or death, I can’t blame anyone else...\"","Hua Qianqian glanced at Mo Hua, her pale face resolute, and said:","\"Junior Brother, you should run quickly...\"","In her hand, she held a silver needle, intending to pierce her own heart if things became impossible.","Better to die and have it all over with than to suffer humiliation at the hands of these villains.","And she could not let them threaten Junior Brother Mo any longer.","Mo Hua couldn’t possibly ignore them.","If it were someone else, he might leave just like that.","But Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian were close friends, always looking out for him.","Returning a favor received, one must pay back in full.","That’s what his mother taught him from childhood.","Mo Hua nodded: \"The sect’s protecting treasure, the Water Prison Forbidden Box, indeed is with me!\"","At these words, those who knew about it, and those who didn’t, were all shocked.","Supervisor Xiao had suspected it was with Mo Hua.","But even so, hearing Mo Hua admit it stirred his heart.","Water Yama and Xie Liu showed greed on their faces.","Even Xiao Tianquan’s eyes flashed with sharp light.","Gu Changhuai and Canonical Official Xia deeply understood what \"sect protecting treasure\" and \"sect leader’s legacy\" truly meant, and even under the control of the Water Prison Technique, their expressions were still of shock.","\"I can give you the box...\" Mo Hua said, \"but I have conditions.\"","Suppressing his excitement, Supervisor Xiao nodded: \"Speak.\"","\"Release Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian, remove the Water Prison Strength from them, and cure the Gui Water Poison.\" Mo Hua said.","Supervisor Xiao nodded, \"Alright.\"","\"And inside the Dragon King Temple, do not attack us anymore.\" Mo Hua continued.","Supervisor Xiao nodded, \"Agreed.\"","\"You first do it, release my senior brother and sister, remove the strength, and cure the Gui Water Poison.\" Mo Hua insisted, showing he wouldn’t act prematurely.","Supervisor Xiao frowned, \"You give me the box first...\"","Mo Hua shook his head and confidently said: \"You’re a Golden Core, I’m just Foundation Establishment, I can’t defeat you, so you must first meet the conditions and do it before I give you the box.\"","Supervisor Xiao pondered for a moment, finding the logic sound.","This kid, although clever and cunning, had all his skills focused on escape, his combat methods were negligible.","Even if he stood still for him to attack, he might not even harm him.","Given this, it would be best to give him some breathing room, not press too hard.","Besides, nothing mattered more than the Water Prison Forbidden Box.","As long as he got the Water Prison Forbidden Box, everything else was irrelevant.","Supervisor Xiao nodded, \"Alright.\""]},{"number":1640,"title":"Chapter 1640 - 853: Bloody Battle (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Afterwards, he kept his promise and pointed a finger on the shoulders of Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian, removing the Water Prison strength from their bodies, then took out a bottle of pills and tossed it to Hua Qianqian.","\"Detoxification Pill from Gui Water Sect, it can detoxify.\"","Hua Qianqian hesitated for a moment, then took out a pill and swallowed it. After a while, she felt the remaining toxins dissipate and let out a slight sigh of relief, nodding to Mo Hua.","Master Xiao looked at Mo Hua seriously and said, \"I have done as you said, young brother, do not let me down.\"","Mo Hua nodded and resolutely said, \"Alright, I’ll give you the box!\"","Mo Hua reached into the storage bag, then took out the Water Prison Forbidden Box from the Storage Ring, put it into the storage bag, and then \"pretended\" to take it out from the storage bag, neatly tossing it to Master Xiao.","His actions were so decisive, so crisp and unhesitant.","As if he was tossing not the Sect Protecting Treasure of the Water Prison Sect, but just an ordinary, valueless box.","Master Xiao feared Mo Hua might trick him, so he hesitated for a moment.","But just in that moment of hesitation, a figure suddenly flew forward, wanting to grab the forbidden box right in front of Master Xiao.","It was Xie Liu!","Master Xiao was enraged, \"Audacious!\"","He immediately thrust his sword with all his strength.","Xie Liu didn’t dodge or evade, allowing Master Xiao’s sword to pierce through his shoulder, but still pressed forward without hesitation to snatch the box.","After grabbing the forbidden box, Xie Liu disregarded his injury, broke free from Master Xiao’s longsword, took a few leaps, and retreated several meters away. Despite the blood flowing from his shoulder, his heart was filled with wild joy:","\"The Water Prison Forbidden Box! It’s mine now!\"","He laughed madly a few times, then with a face full of grievances, he said angrily:","\"With this legacy, I, Xie Liu, will no longer be a nameless nobody! I will never bow to others again, never be bossed around again!\"","Seeing his treasure clutched in someone else’s hands, Master Xiao was furious beyond measure, \"Seeking death!\"","He swung his sword again.","Xie Liu chuckled coldly, leapt away, dodging Master Xiao’s swing.","Seeing his strike miss, Master Xiao’s face fell immediately. He pointed his fingers, and a Water Prison Technique formed out of thin air, enveloping Xie Liu.","Initially, Xie Liu didn’t pay much attention.","Earlier, he had seen Master Xiao using the Water Prison Technique to control that brat without hitting once, so he thought it was a useless spell.","But he didn’t know that he wasn’t Mo Hua. He didn’t have such keen perception of killing intent, nor such profound mastery of the Dao of the Divine, nor the same proficiency with the Water Prison Technique.","Seeing Mo Hua evade so easily, he became a bit careless, but when he truly faced it, in an instant, he was tightly bound by the Water Prison Technique.","Xie Liu’s expression changed dramatically.","Just as Master Xiao’s Sword Qi was about to arrive, Xie Liu’s expression turned frantic, then he gritted his teeth and exerted all his spiritual power, narrowly escaping from the Water Prison Technique.","But his back was still struck by Master Xiao’s sword.","Enduring the severe pain, Xie Liu countered with a backward sword strike, then leapt away, escaping to the distance.","But Master Xiao was somewhat powerless.","No matter how strong he was, he was still only at the Initial Golden Core stage. Frequently using Sword Qi and spells, and even depleting a large amount of spiritual power to perform superior Water Prison Control, his spiritual power was running low, making it very difficult to pursue Xie Liu.","Master Xiao was both shocked and furious.","He never expected that after battling wits with Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, and the trickery from Mo Hua, all efforts were in vain, letting Xie Liu, a seemingly insignificant pawn, slip through the cracks, pick up the cheap, and snatch the treasure of the Water Prison!","Master Xiao roared, \"Xie Liu, return the forbidden box to me, or I will tear you to pieces!\"","Upon hearing this, Xie Liu sneered inwardly.","Returning a treasure that’s already in my hands? Does Xiao Zhenhai take me for a fool?","\"The box is sealed with secret techniques. Without knowing how to ’unlock’ it, it’s useless to keep.\" Master Xiao said.","Xie Liu ignored him and just ran forward blindly.","Whether he could open it or not, he decided to hold it firmly in his own hands first.","Seeing the White Bone Boat just ahead, Xie Liu sped up his movement technique, eager to board the boat and flee this place early.","Seeing this, Master Xiao’s expression became extremely terrifying.","His forehead bulged with veins, his face turned livid, his originally squinted eyes suddenly widened, filled with blood threads, and an uncontrollable evil Qi surged around him.","\"Xie Liu, die...\"","Xie Liu was fleeing well when suddenly he sensed an astonishing killing intent behind him, mixed with frightening evil Qi that sent chills down his spine.","\"What’s going on?\"","Xie Liu was utterly shocked.","This Xiao Zhenhai... what means does he intend to use to kill me?","The White Bone Boat was just ahead, and once onboard, he could temporarily shake off Xiao Zhenhai. Afterward, he could find an opportunity to leave the Dragon King Temple and devour the Water Prison treasure alone.","But deep down, Xie Liu still felt a bit uneasy.","As a Canonical Official of the Taoist Court, Xiao Zhenhai was deeply scheming, skilled at enduring, with his Taoist skills being fiercely unpredictable.","Xie Liu had no idea what methods Xiao Zhenhai had in his hands, fearing he might be killed in one blow, so he turned his head to take a look.","But just that one glance, changed the game of life and death.","He saw Master Xiao’s eyes.","Those were a pair of blood-red eyes, seemingly containing a Taoist Prison, imprisoning sinners within, who were enduring bloody torture, constantly suffering and screaming.","Blood flowed from the sinners, gradually filling the entire Taoist Prison.","The sinners’ faces were blurred, still struggling, full of despair.","In the next moment, the face of the sinner gradually became clear, suddenly transforming into Xie Liu’s own face.","Xie Liu’s face turned pale, and he was lost in panic.","The torture that the sinner was enduring seemed to \"transfer\" and inflict pain upon him."]},{"number":1641,"title":"Chapter 1641 - 853: Bloody Battle (Part 3)","paragraphs":["He was a sinner, a prisoner, condemned to plunge into purgatory, subjected to endless torture, never to be reborn for all eternity.","His Divine Soul was contaminated by Evil Qi, violently trembling.","Pain voraciously devoured his mind.","His spirit, too, tormented and struggling, threatened to leave his body.","Spirit Blood Prison Pupil!","And this was an even more profound, powerful Blood Prison Pupil Skill than Water Yama, with Evil Qi even more intense!","Xie Liu, caught by this pupil skill, in an instant, suffered tremendous damage to his Divine Soul, standing as if soulless, a look of pain and despair on his face, like a puppet of agony.","\"Still thinking of running?\"","Master Xiao sneered, wielding a sword light through the air, severing Xie Liu’s arm, defenseless and entrapped by the Blood Pupil Skill.","Xie Liu’s arm was severed; blood splattered, and the severed limb fell to the ground, still clutching the Water Prison Forbidden Box.","But this intense pain brought Xie Liu back to his senses.","Despite his Divine Soul’s violent trembling, a splitting headache, Evil Qi seeping into his Sea of Consciousness, everything before him cloaked in blood-red, unable to see, Xie Liu still struggled towards his severed arm.","Moving toward the box within the severed hand, which sealed the highest inheritance of the Water Prison Sect.","\"I, my...\"","But it was already too late.","Master Xiao had already stepped before him, first to seize the Water Prison Forbidden Box from the severed arm.","Watching Xie Liu frantically approach, Master Xiao’s expression turned disdainful, the corner of his mouth curling into a sneer.","But halfway through his laughter, it abruptly caught in his throat.","Behind Xie Liu, stood another person.","Unknown when Mr. Witch, who used to appear somewhat timid, now with a grim face, suddenly loomed behind Xie Liu.","Seizing the moment Xie Liu’s severed arm was gravely wounded, combined with the breakdown from the Pupil Skill, Mr. Witch, with a darkened expression, suddenly lunged at Xie Liu, biting into his neck, frenziedly draining his blood, even... his flesh.","Everyone’s expressions changed dramatically, and Mo Hua also sensed something amiss, hurriedly shouting:","\"Stop him!\"","Master Xiao hesitated no more, swinging another sword, but it was already too late.","Mr. Witch, having fed on Xie Liu’s flesh, his limbs began to twist, his skin suddenly sprouting scales.","Master Xiao’s sword struck the scales, not causing even a fraction of damage, instead provoking \"Mr. Witch’s\" fury.","Covered in Scale Armor, in a half-human, half-demon state, Mr. Witch shrieked:","\"A bunch of beasts! A bunch of swine! Desecrating the Divine Lord, all must die!\"","Then his figure flickered, dragging Xie Liu, leaping together into the Blood Pool.","In an instant, the filthy, foul Blood Pool corroded, thoroughly engulfing them both.","The sudden change was too drastic, catching everyone off guard.","\"Is this Mr. Witch seeking his own death?\"","Master Xiao’s face turned grim.","Mo Hua glanced at the Blood Pool, recalling the scales on Mr. Witch’s body, eyes narrowing.","He knew in his heart, it might not be so simple...","Everyone present seemed to realize something likely was about to happen.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, at this moment, finally broke free from the Water Prison Skill’s control, arriving in front of Mo Hua.","Though the two appeared somewhat battered, their hearts bore a deep fear.","Mo Hua also sighed internally.","The control of this Water Prison Skill was much stronger than he had anticipated.","Compared to the Water Prison Technique, it was entirely on a different level.","No wonder the Water Prison Sect revered it as their Sect Protecting Faction’s Ultimate Technique, not passed down except to the Sect Leader.","If given the chance, Mo Hua truly wanted to learn it himself, but alas, his Spiritual Power was too weak. Even if he learned it, he might not be able to use it effectively.","However, now was clearly not the time to ponder these matters.","Mo Hua released his Divine Sense, perceiving the surrounding Blood Pool, then solemnly declared, \"The Formation is activated...\"","No sooner had the words left his lips, when suddenly a \"rumbling\" sound arose, and the ground trembled.","The altar in the center began to rotate, sinking down.","The surrounding Blood Pools abruptly surged, blood waters howling and rushing, destination unknown.","Columns of White Bone shot up from the Blood Pool, spiraling upward, converging.","In the unseen, lines of Formation Patterns lit up.","The Blood Pool’s whereabouts unknown, the ground kept twisting and changing, more bone columns emerging from the pools...","Everyone could only do their best to protect themselves, adapting to the shifting terrain, avoiding the peculiar bone spikes shooting up from everywhere, while steering clear of the filthy blood waters...","Fortunately, this seemed to be merely the \"activation\" phase of the Formation, and this Formation did not primarily aim at slaughter.","After a while, the Formation settled, and the surroundings stabilized.","Standing firm, when they looked around, they saw the once vast sea of blood transformed into a pale, bone-white forest.","Dense clusters of White Bone, like masonry, constructing towering, bone-spurred walls and halls.","These walls and halls, winding and turning, stretched without end, resembling an entire \"White Bone Maze.\"","Mo Hua was shocked but unsurprised.","Upon seeing the blood sea, he had vaguely sensed that buried within it lay a Mystery Formation and a corresponding \"Maze.\"","Just like before, in the Bronze Maze within Bi Mountain Demon Cavern.","In this Dragon King Temple, there stood an entire \"White Bone Maze.\"","However, for it to be so grand in scale, so bizarre in transformation, to create a maze of bone was beyond Mo Hua’s expectations.","This appeared to be a structural form of the Evil God Altar.","Building a maze outside the altar, using the maze to shield and surround the altar.","Only now, they were trapped in the maze, yet the \"altar\" was nowhere to be seen.","Mo Hua sighed.","He knew well enough, this altar would not be so easily seized by him.","Mo Hua looked around, finding everyone there, and although they encountered some disturbance when the Formation activated, they were unharmed, silently releasing a breath of relief."]},{"number":1642,"title":"Chapter 1642 - 853: Bloody Battle (Part 4)","paragraphs":["Of course, Mo Hua and the others were fine, as were Master Xiao and his group.","However, Xie Liu was already gone.","With cold eyes, Xia Canonical Official looked at Master Xiao, thinking about the bizarre Water Prison Skill from earlier, his expression heavy and his tone indifferent:","\"I did not know that Master Xiao was hiding such powerful Taoist Skill.\"","Master Xiao also smiled, \"It’s just a small trick, my apologies for displaying it.\"","Gu Changhuai sneered, \"Where exactly did you acquire this Taoist Skill? Neither the Water Prison Sect nor the Gui Water Sect would possibly have taught you such a skill, right?\"","Master Xiao replied, \"The inheritance of Taoist Skills is a secret, so it’s not convenient to disclose it to Supervisor Gu. Perhaps we should consider what to do next?\"","Gu Changhuai said coldly, \"What do you intend?\"","Master Xiao said, \"Now, the Fish Bone Token is in your hands, and the Water Prison Forbidden Box is in mine. We’ve both achieved our goals, so we can naturally call a temporary truce. The only problem is this White Bone Hall in front of us...\"","\"That Mr. Witch acts strangely, and who knows how much danger is hidden in this White Bone Hall. Fighting among ourselves at this time would be unwise, and it might lead to mutual destruction, giving others an opportunity to take advantage...\"","Gu Changhuai raised an eyebrow, \"Do you want to form an alliance?\"","Master Xiao shamelessly said, \"Exactly.\"","\"There is no other way,\" Master Xiao continued.","Gu Changhuai glanced at Xia Canonical Official, who frowned and then nodded, \"Agreed.\"","She did not trust Master Xiao.","But given the current situation, she had no choice but to temporarily agree to team up with Master Xiao.","Master Xiao was slightly pleased and cupped his hands, \"Xia Canonical Official truly understands the greater good.\"","\"Let’s go, time is tight, we should first see if there’s a chance to get out...\" Xia Canonical Official said.","\"Alright.\" Master Xiao nodded.","Then everyone gathered together again and continued to search for an escape route.","But there was some distance between both sides, as they were wary of each other.","After walking a while, everything seemed fine.","Mo Hua also relaxed a little, following behind Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, observing the surrounding bone pillars, inferring the formation traces, and was somewhat distracted.","A moment later, as Mo Hua was pondering the formation, he suddenly sensed a familiar killing intent coming towards him.","He found it hard to believe for a moment.","Again?","This scoundrel, intends to make a move on him again?!","This is truly shameless...","Mo Hua was speechless for a moment, turned his head slightly, and indeed saw that Master Xiao had found an opportunity, executed Water Shadow Step, and was already within three yards of him.","Mo Hua sighed and could only continue to dodge.","And at the moment Master Xiao made his move, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official also noticed, their expressions turning cold as they protected Mo Hua, and jointly attacked Master Xiao.","But almost at the same time, the Water Yama standing by the side, with eyes turning red, emitted evil qi and quietly executed the Blood Pupil Skill.","No good!","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, being battle-hardened, instinctively reacted to this Pupil Skill.","They quickly turned their eyes aside, narrowly avoiding Water Yama’s Pupil Skill.","But when they turned their eyes back, they still saw a pair of bloody eyes.","It was Master Xiao!","Master Xiao’s eyes were blood-red, with blood seas churning and evil qi surging between his eyes, and wraiths howling.","Water Yama was an illusion, Master Xiao was real.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official dodged one danger but not another, and ultimately fell into the trap.","And with the cooperation of Water Yama, Master Xiao aimed for a quick victory, using all his power to execute the Blood Pupil Skill almost without hesitation.","His Blood Pupil Skill far surpassed Water Yama’s.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official only felt the evil qi invade their minds, causing excruciating pain in their Sea of Consciousness, their faces turning pale, and their expressions filled with pain, standing in a daze.","\"Uncle Gu!\"","Mo Hua was startled, just about to run away, but as he looked up he saw Master Xiao’s bloody eyes.","Mo Hua was dumbstruck for a moment, but his gaze remained clear.","Seeing Mo Hua’s reaction, Master Xiao also hesitated momentarily.","Then in a flash, Mo Hua immediately reacted, letting out a miserable scream, and fell to the ground, clutching his eyes, \"in pain\" and rolling around.","\"Ah, my eyes...\"","Mo Hua secretly rubbed his eyes to make them red."]},{"number":1643,"title":"Chapter 1643 - 854: Blood Zombie","paragraphs":["Mo Hua pretended to be controlled by the Pupil Skill, rolled a few times on the ground, rubbed his eyes until they were red, then struggled a bit, tilted his head, and \"fainted\" straight away.","The \"acting\" was a little exaggerated.","Master Xiao had some doubts.","The reaction of Mo Hua to the Pupil Skill was a bit strange, it seemed somewhat delayed...","But he did not doubt for long.","Because so far, no one could withstand his Blood Prison Pupil Skill.","Gu Changhuai from the Gu Family, and Xia Canonical Official from the Xia family, both Golden Core cultivators, were no match, let alone a mere Foundation Establishment.","Maybe because this kid had exceptional talent, his Divine Sense was a bit special, so his appearance under the Pupil Skill was different from others.","He was an odd little rascal to begin with.","After being hit by the Pupil Skill, some strange reactions seemed quite normal as well.","Because he was always odd, Master Xiao, on the contrary, found it unsurprising.","He walked over, checked Mo Hua’s breathing, found that he was still alive, but his Divine Sense had withdrawn deeply, almost imperceptible, clearly showing that his Sea of Consciousness had suffered considerable damage.","Only then did Master Xiao nod, took out the Taoist Court’s Spirit-binding Lock, bound Mo Hua, and tossed him to Water Yama.","\"Watch him well.\"","Water Yama’s face turned grim: \"Not going to kill him?\"","Master Xiao sneered, \"Kill him for what? Use your mind a bit, keeping this brat around has great use for me.\"","Water Yama dared not defy, nodded and said: \"Yes.\"","At this moment, the Jade Pendants on the chests of Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official lit up, emitting a lustrous glow, dispelling the Evil Qi.","The two also barely recovered from the intimidation of the Blood Prison Pupil Skill.","Master Xiao was a bit surprised, but thinking that both were from prominent families, accompanied by some Spiritual Artifacts or Treasures for protection, it made sense.","\"Mo Hua!\"","Xia Canonical Official saw Mo Hua, bound by the Spirit-binding Lock, unclear of mind, unconscious in Master Xiao’s hands, and his expression grew somber.","Gu Changhuai also gazed sternly at Master Xiao, his eyes carrying killing intent.","\"Xiao Zhenhai, let Mo Hua go,\" Gu Changhuai said coldly.","Master Xiao chuckled lightly: \"It took a great deal of effort to catch this young lad. How could I let him go easily?\"","Xia Canonical Official also spoke coldly: \"Master Xiao, didn’t you say we should join forces? Is this your way of ’joining forces’?\"","Master Xiao shook his head and said: \"Teaming up with you two is indeed true. It’s just that I am always cautious, and without some leverage, I’m uneasy working with others. Moreover, this rascal is quite mysterious, making it baffling. Letting him wander freely makes me anxious. Now it’s better...\"","Master Xiao gripped Mo Hua’s collar and lifted him slightly, \"With this brat in my hand, tied up, as leverage, I’m relieved...\"","Xia Canonical Official frowned, \"What do you intend to do?\"","\"Give me the Fish Bone Token,\" Master Xiao said.","Xia Canonical Official’s eyelid twitched slightly, \"If I give it to you, will you let Mo Hua go?\"","Master Xiao laughed, \"How is that possible? I already said, getting hold of this kid was hard-won, I can only promise that if you give me the token, I won’t make things difficult for him, otherwise...\"","Master Xiao’s pale, cold hand gripped Mo Hua’s neck, with a cold smile on his face.","Xia Canonical Official hesitated for a long time, ultimately worried about Mo Hua’s safety, sighed and said: \"Fine, I’ll give you the token.\"","Master Xiao’s expression lit up with joy and promised: \"Rest assured, Xia Canonical Official, I also quite like this little brother, as long as you give me the token, I won’t do anything to him.\"","He then smiled slightly and said: \"Originally, with the token in your hand or in mine, it’s all the same. Only, I’m no longer the Supervisor as I was before, being a wanted criminal by the Taoist Court after leaving the Dragon King Temple, I inevitably need to be more cautious and vigilant...\"","Xia Canonical Official’s gaze sank as he took out the Fish Bone Token and tossed it to Master Xiao.","Master Xiao nodded, \"That’s much better; minor misunderstandings, please don’t let them dwell in your hearts. The sooner we leave this eerie White Bone Path, the better.\"","He did not truly wish to sever ties, just wanted a means to restrain Gu Changhuai and the others.","This White Bone Path is mysterious, it’s unknown what dangers we might encounter, having one more person means one more support.","But now his identity is exposed, not having some leverage to threaten Gu Changhuai and the others would certainly result in backlash.","Xia Canonical Official was hard to predict, but that Gu Changhuai had a ferocious nature and once given the chance, he would undoubtedly find every way possible to take his life.","Master Xiao and Gu Changhuai worked together for many years, understanding Gu Changhuai’s disposition and means, so even if Master Xiao has been suppressing Gu Changhuai all along, he didn’t dare truly underestimate him.","\"Let’s go,\" Master Xiao said.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official could only nod.","Beside them, Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian wanted to save Mo Hua, but were powerless; they could only sigh helplessly at this moment.","After saying so, Master Xiao turned around, glanced at the unconscious Mo Hua, and instructed Water Yama:","\"You carry him.\"","Water Yama’s face looked as if he had swallowed a fly.","But ultimately, he obediently carried Mo Hua on his shoulder, though his actions were not gentle.","Master Xiao frowned, \"Be careful, if you hurt this young lad, I’ll hold you accountable.\"","Water Yama’s face hesitated, nodded and said: \"Yes...\"","In this way, the group temporarily called a truce and set off again.","But this time, the initiative rested entirely with Master Xiao.","Master Xiao took the lead, Water Yama following behind with Mo Hua on his back.","And with Mo Hua as \"leverage,\" Gu Changhuai and the others followed behind, not daring to act rashly.","Xiao Tianquan kept a distance from Master Xiao, walking together with Xia Canonical Official.","The group then proceeded along the White Bone Path."]},{"number":1644,"title":"Chapter 1644 - 854: Blood Zombie (Part 2)","paragraphs":["The passage was filled with white bones, vast and boundless, leading in all directions like a maze, making it impossible to discern the way.","Without anyone to guide them, the group could only rely on luck, moving forward without a clear destination.","The further they went, the deeper they found themselves trapped in the intricate paths of the maze instead of finding their way out.","All around, the white bones grew thicker, more grotesque, and the atmosphere grew increasingly oppressive.","Bloodstains, not yet dried, began to appear between the bones.","Master Xiao stopped in his tracks, frowning.","It was then that he realized he had underestimated this maze.","The scope of this maze was larger than he expected, and its terrain was far more complex than he had imagined.","And these walls of bone...","Master Xiao drew his sword and slashed at one of the bone walls.","The Sword Qi struck the bone wall, causing it to crack with a fine sword mark appearing on its surface.","However, Master Xiao’s frown deepened.","The bone wall, although it could be broken, required an extraordinary effort to do so.","Moreover, the maze was full of bone walls, standing in rows upon rows, countless in number. To force a way through with martial strength, they might die from exhaustion before ever making it out.","And wandering aimlessly like a headless chicken was not a solution either.","Master Xiao was not a foolishly stubborn person; seeing that it was infeasible, he turned his head and asked Gu Changhuai and the others:","\"Do either of you have a means to guide us?\"","Gu Changhuai hesitated for a moment, said nothing, and took out a Si Nan, while Xia Canonical Official took out a suspended magnetic silver needle.","Both were Spiritual Artifacts for navigation.","Yet upon activation, the Si Nan went erratic, the magnetic needle wavered unsteadily, indicating that in the maze, all navigation artifacts were ineffective.","Gu Changhuai frowned and said, \"With the guiding artifacts useless, we’ll have to rely on our memory and take it step by step.\"","Master Xiao said no more.","Afterwards, the group continued forward.","But the further they pressed on, the stronger the scent of blood became, the thicker the blood stench, and waves of Evil Qi permeated the maze.","Everyone wore a cold, stern expression.","Just then, Master Xiao stopped once more, his entire body brimming with an evil aura as though drawn by something, and solemnly said:","\"Everyone, be careful.\"","No sooner had he finished speaking, when the white bones around them began to tremble.","From nowhere, \"blood zombies,\" their bodies blood-red, flesh rotting away, faces completely unrecognizable, crawled out.","\"What... are these?\"","Everyone’s expressions changed.","Master Xiao frowned, drew his longsword, readying his Sword Qi.","Gu Changhuai also took out his feather fan, while Xia Canonical Official wielded her Ice Sword, and the others drew their Spiritual Artifacts as well.","Then the blood zombies howled, blood Qi pervaded, and a fierce battle was imminent.","The blood zombies, moving like the Walking Dead, twisted their limbs, rushing through the forest of bones to attack the group.","Sword Qi interwove, Wind Blades swept, Spirit Needles and Spiritual Artifacts flew through the air.","Before the blood zombies could even get close, their arms and legs were severed, causing them to fall to the ground, but before long, they would adhere together through the eerie blood on the ground and continue their attack.","And the blood on their bodies, reeking and foul, could corrode Blood Qi.","The group could only battle as they retreated.","Some of the blood zombies still wore remnants of monk’s robes.","The sight chilled the Water Yama, who said, \"They are temple guards...\"","All the temple guards, except those killed at Yaksha Hall or consumed by \"Mr. Witch,\" were discarded beneath the blood pool, in this White Bone Maze, and turned into these monstrous \"blood zombies.\"","As more blood zombies appeared, their combat strength was unreliable; a single sword could sever arms and heads, but they were not killed, and they bore tainted blood.","This would not end well...","Master Xiao said gravely, \"Let’s retreat.\"","Given the situation, no one hesitated any longer; while wielding their Spiritual Artifacts and casting spells to fend off the attacking blood zombies, they all began to withdraw.","And it seemed that the blood zombies had a limited range in their pursuit.","Once they had retreated far enough, most of the zombies ceased their chase, except for a few scattered ones whose blood Qi fury could not be quelled, continuing to pursue the group.","The group fought as they retreated until they reached a secluded spot, where no blood zombies followed them any longer, feeling slightly relieved, but inevitably worn out from the prolonged battle.","Along the way, hunting the monster turned Mr. Witch, followed by repeated internal conflicts without time to rest, and then encountering these blood zombies like a tidal wave.","Even with the foundation of a Golden Core, they couldn’t withstand such exhaustion.","Especially Xia Canonical Official.","She practiced the Ice System cultivation technique and Taoist skill, focusing on swift kill techniques with her movement technique, meaning prolonged battles in direct confrontation were disadvantageous.","Additionally, having suffered under Master Xiao’s Blood Prison Pupil Skill, the evil aura had entered her mind, her Divine Soul was disturbed, and after this arduous fight, her face turned pale, her breath unstable.","Xiao Tianquan, always by her side, saw this and asked:","\"Xia Canonical Official, are you alright?\"","Xia Canonical Official was just about to reply when suddenly her Sea of Consciousness throbbed with a stabbing pain, as if grieving souls wailed and a Fierce Ghost was claiming her life.","Up until now she had gritted her teeth and endured, but now she could no longer hold on; pale-faced, swaying on her feet, she could not stand firm.","Xiao Tianquan reached out intending to support her.","Yet, halfway there, a figure flashed before him, and Gu Changhuai, quicker than he, had already supported Xia Canonical Official’s arm.","Xiao Tianquan paused.","Gu Changhuai too wore a momentary bewilderment on his face.","He had supported Xia Canonical Official almost instinctively, even he himself didn’t quite understand why he did it.","Perhaps it was out of camaraderie as fellow Supervisors.","Or maybe it was seeing Xiao Tianquan approaching Xia Canonical Official, and some inexplicable pang of jealousy surged in his heart.","But since he had already supported her, he didn’t let go.","Xia Canonical Official’s Sea of Consciousness stung, making her unstable on her feet, then she felt a man suddenly supporting her, instinctively pushing away a few times.","Yet this aura felt strangely familiar."]},{"number":1645,"title":"Chapter 1645 - 854: Blood Zombie (Part 3)","paragraphs":["It’s not that annoying...","Xia Canonical Official came to her senses, slightly opened her eyes, and found the person standing beside her was Gu Changhuai. She was stunned and forgot to refuse.","Gu Changhuai saw her looking exhausted, turned his head, and said to Master Xiao: \"Find a place to rest for a while.\"","Master Xiao was also running low on Spiritual Power at this time and nodded: \"Alright.\"","So, they chose a relatively safe and defensible alleyway in the maze, the White Bone Alley, to rest temporarily.","Gu Changhuai helped Xia Canonical Official as they walked into the alley.","Xiao Tianquan passed them calmly, but when he looked at the backs of Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, a hint of jealousy flashed in his sullen eyes.","It was as if something that belonged to him had been touched by someone else...","All this was observed by Master Xiao, who only smiled coldly without saying anything.","The White Bone Alley was in the shape of an \"I\", with two dead ends.","Master Xiao and Gu Changhuai’s groups occupied each end, wary of each other.","But there were exceptions.","Xiao Tianquan, who belonged to the same clan as Master Xiao, was now staying with Gu Changhuai.","Originally supposed to be with Gu Changhuai, Mo Hua was now \"held hostage\", staying with Master Xiao and Water Yama.","Mo Hua was still \"unconscious\".","Even when everyone was fighting the blood zombies, continuously battling, he did not wake up.","This only emphasized the prowess of Master Xiao’s Pupil Skill.","And also highlighted his own serious injuries.","Master Xiao was a Golden Core Cultivator, while he was just a minor Foundation Establishment. It stood to reason that being affected and unconscious for so long by a Golden Core Realm’s skill was reasonable.","Therefore, while everyone was busy fighting the blood zombies, Mo Hua felt justified in slacking off.","In reality, Mo Hua wasn’t really injured.","But he had to admit in his heart, this blood prison pupil skill from the smiling tiger was indeed impressive.","Even made him feel a strong sense of oppression.","But the oppression wasn’t strong enough.","It even felt to Mo Hua less intimidating than the big white dog that watched over the Sect Leader at Taixu Gate.","Mo Hua was a bit suspicious.","He just realized that he might have overestimated Master Xiao’s skill and underestimated Taixu Gate’s big dog.","That big dog might really not be an ordinary big dog.","Master Xiao was not as good as a dog.","And having defeated that big dog himself, it suggested... his pupil skill should not be inferior to Master Xiao’s.","Mo Hua felt reassured and was more confident about what lay ahead.","However, these were only his assumptions; the actual outcome of a real confrontation still needed someone to test...","Mo Hua, eyes closed, was calculating in his mind.","Water Yama kept staring at Mo Hua’s handsome face, growing angrier the more he looked, and said to Master Xiao in irritation: \"Big Brother, this brat must be faking unconsciousness.\"","Master Xiao completely ignored him.","Water Yama’s chilly hand reached out to pinch Mo Hua’s neck, trying to wake him and humiliate him, to vent his anger.","He had suffered losses at Mo Hua’s hands repeatedly, and hated him to the point of madness.","But before he could act, Master Xiao’s cold gaze locked onto him: \"Don’t touch him!\"","Water Yama was confused: \"Big Brother...\"","\"I said, this kid is still useful; before leaving the Dragon King Temple, don’t touch him, don’t make me say it twice.\" Master Xiao said coldly.","Water Yama could only reply resentfully: \"Yes...\"","Master Xiao paused silently, then suddenly took out the Water Prison Forbidden Box from the Storage Bag and tossed it to Water Yama.","Water Yama was momentarily stunned, then overjoyed.","Master Xiao said: \"You’ve already cultivated that technique to the fourth layer, it’s about time. For the next two days, don’t do anything; use your blood essence to nurture that box, find a way to open it...\"","Open the box?!","The \"unconscious\" Mo Hua’s heart couldn’t help but skip a beat.","This Master Xiao actually knew the method to open the Water Prison Forbidden Box?","Even Elder Yu from the Water Prison Sect didn’t know...","Mo Hua felt annoyed internally.","This Master Xiao, capable of Water Shadow Step, Water Prison Skill, Blood Prison Pupil Skill, even knew the way to open the Water Prison Forbidden Box.","Was more like the last successor of the Water Prison Sect than Yu Canghai, the Water Prison Sect Elder...","And opening the Water Prison Forbidden Box...","Mo Hua was initially unsettled by Master Xiao’s sudden words, then quickly calmed himself and continued to feign unconsciousness.","But it was already too late; this emotional fluctuation had been noticed by Master Xiao.","Master Xiao suddenly turned his head, eyes narrowing, silently staring at Mo Hua’s face.","Mo Hua felt somewhat awkward under his gaze, thinking they were all smart people, further pretending would be impolite, so he murmured, opened his eyes in a weary manner, seemingly just awakened.","Master Xiao’s eyelid twitched, saying indifferently: \"Little brother, you’ve awakened?\"","Mo Hua frowned, pretending to be confused and in pain, \"Master Xiao... Where is this place...\"","Master Xiao asked expressionlessly, \"When did you wake up?\"","Seeing him ask that, Mo Hua decided to stop pretending, saving his acting skills for better use.","Acting was indeed tiring.","Mo Hua replied: \"Just woke up recently...\"","\"So,\" Master Xiao’s face darkened, \"you heard everything I said earlier?\"","\"Heard what?\" Mo Hua feigned confusion.","Immediately, Water Yama wanted to pinch Mo Hua’s neck again, hatingly saying:","\"Big Brother, this brat is exceedingly cunning; keeping him is really a disaster, better to kill him now!\"","Master Xiao said coldly, \"I told you, don’t touch him!\"","Mo Hua nodded repeatedly in agreement:","\"Yes, yes, my physical body is very weak, you use even a little force, perhaps I’ll lose my life, won’t be able to be a hostage.\"","Water Yama gritted his teeth in anger.","With deep eyes, Master Xiao gazed at Mo Hua, his mind restless.","He really couldn’t kill Mo Hua now.","This White Bone Maze was fraught with dangers, relying on his own Golden Core cultivation might not be sufficient to escape; he needed to borrow Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official’s strength.","And killing Mo Hua would be completely tearing apart their relationship.","Both sides would fight to the death, ultimately perishing in this White Bone Land.","This brat clearly understood the stakes, which was why he was so composed.","However...","Master Xiao’s gaze sharpened, \"My pupil skill seems to have no effect on you, young sir?\"","\"How could it have no effect?\" Mo Hua clearly disagreed, \"Master Xiao’s pupil skill is incredibly powerful, far superior to Water Yama. I merely glanced at it and was unconscious for most of the day...\"","\"Then why now are you completely fine?\" Master Xiao frowned and asked.","Reasonably speaking, even if truly unconscious for most of the day, the Divine Soul being damaged should have significant aftereffects.","Mo Hua’s thoughts turned, and he replied: \"A teacher in my sect taught me the Meditation Technique, which can clear distractions, calm the mind.\"","Unexpectedly, upon hearing this, Master Xiao’s pupils trembled.","\"Meditation Technique?!\""]},{"number":1646,"title":"Chapter 1646 - 855: Roll Call","paragraphs":["\"You actually know the Meditation Method?\"","Master Xiao was momentarily incredulous.","Mo Hua was somewhat surprised; he mentioned it casually, not expecting the usually insincere Master Xiao to react so strongly, even somewhat losing composure.","He recalled the mysterious aspects of the Meditation Technique his master had told him about, slightly understanding more.","The Meditation Technique is an extremely obscure spell point.","Few learn it, fewer use it, and even fewer manage to master it to a significant degree.","Throughout a long tao cultivation journey, amidst the mundane world, the entanglement of grudges and desires, very few cultivators can maintain a tranquil heart and persist in practicing the Meditation Technique.","Even his master admitted that as he grew older and gained more experience, his mindset had become tainted, and his meditation level had deteriorated significantly.","Therefore, the inheritance of this Meditation Technique must also be scarce.","Ordinary cultivators cultivate the body but not the heart, cultivate spiritual power but not the Taoist Heart, naturally they wouldn’t bother learning any Meditation Technique.","But cultivators like Water Yama and Master Xiao are different.","They cultivated Evil Qi, and it was through the methods of the Evil Path that they did so.","Thus, if the mind is disturbed, it’s easy to suffer a backlash from the Evil Qi.","The Fire Buddha is likely the same.","He is clearly a mass murderer, yet pretentiously cultivates the Buddhist Law to nurture his heart and suppress the Evil Qi.","Thus, the \"Meditation\" spell point is crucial for them.","Of course, Mo Hua thought, with their evil demon mindset of nurturing evilness through killing, even if he told them how to use the Meditation Technique, they might not be able to learn it.","The Buddhist Law can still deceive one’s conscience with \"put down the butcher’s knife, become a Buddha on the spot,\" allowing those with blood on their hands, laden with wrongdoings, to seek peace of mind.","The Meditation Technique does not.","Facing one’s heart directly, what it should be, it is.","They likely cannot bear their own sins.","But Master Xiao didn’t know all this, and appeared eager, breathing somewhat heavily, trembling as he said:","\"You... young master, you... tell me the Meditation Technique...\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","He’s not foolish.","Master Xiao’s expression was hesitant, even somewhat twisted.","He wanted to threaten Mo Hua, but after thinking it over, felt it inappropriate; such a spell point must be willingly offered for it to be beneficial.","The Meditation Technique for cultivating the heart emphasizes subtlety and significance.","Every word holds particular use.","If discontent arises, a few more or fewer words during instruction could lead to significant error.","Temptation is better than coercion.","Master Xiao’s eyes turned dark, \"Young master, tell me what you want? Cultivation Technique, Taoist Skill, woman? I can get them for you.\"","\"That girl from the Hundred Flower Valley, do you like her? If you do, I’ll find a way to fulfill your desires in this White Bone Maze.\"","He assumed Mo Hua, while having a clear Taoist Heart, was still young and ignorant, with youthful vigor, likely hazy on matters of love but with lingering thoughts.","Especially since before coming to the Dragon King Temple, Mo Hua had visited Rouge Boat, shrouded in mist, and desires would inevitably float to the surface somewhat.","Some desires are surely hidden in the heart, just not spoken...","Mo Hua wouldn’t fall for his trick.","Nor would he harm Senior Sister Qianqian.","He pondered for a moment, eyes brightening, \"I can give you the Meditation Technique, but you must show me what’s inside the Water Prison Forbidden Box.\"","Master Xiao was stunned, expression somewhat cold.","Mo Hua said, \"Just let me take a look. I’m just curious what’s hidden inside.\"","Master Xiao’s eyes narrowed slightly, considering for a moment, then suddenly squinted and said:","\"How about just a glance? Young master, if you tell me the Meditation Technique, once the Water Prison Forbidden Box is opened, I can let you learn the spell inside... but only up to the second level, to Foundation Establishment...\"","Mo Hua’s expression lit up, \"Really?\"","Master Xiao nodded, \"I wouldn’t deceive the young master.\"","I trust you as far as I can throw you.","Mo Hua thought silently.","He hesitated, slowly nodding, \"That works too, but... it must happen after leaving the Dragon King Temple, otherwise I’m not reassured.\"","Mo Hua nodded determinedly, \"After leaving the Dragon King Temple, we’ll make a deal, you show me the Water Prison Forbidden Box, I’ll tell you the Meditation Method.\"","Master Xiao silently observed Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s gaze was clear, meeting Master Xiao’s.","His eyes, as clear as water, seemed pure enough to reflect Master Xiao’s figure.","Master Xiao’s gaze deepened, \"Good, it’s a deal.\"","The two had tentatively reached a bargain.","Afterward, Master Xiao no longer avoided Mo Hua and said to Water Yama:","\"Integrate the spiritual power of the Water Prison Skill with blood essence, as I instructed, irrigate the forbidden box...\"","Water Yama hesitated, \"My cultivation technique may not have enough control...\"","\"It’s enough.\" Master Xiao said firmly, \"We don’t have much time, we must open the box before leaving the Dragon King Temple, or changes may arise.\"","Seeing Water Yama still hesitating, Master Xiao added, \"Rest assured, for working for me, I won’t treat you unfairly; the inheritance inside includes a share for you.\"","Water Yama’s heart warmed, and he finally gritted his teeth, \"Yes.\"","Then Water Yama began to sit in meditation, circulating the spiritual power throughout his body, gathering it at his heart, waiting for the spiritual power to merge with a drop of heart blood. He then exerted his skills to force this drop of essence blood to his arm, took out a dagger, sliced open his arm, and let the fresh blood irrigate the Water Prison Forbidden Box.","The Water Prison Forbidden Box seemed to come alive, beginning to absorb the blood.","The Daoist Prison Map on it, which practiced the Blood Prison Pupil, also became increasingly crimson.","Mo Hua watched in secret surprise.","So that’s how the box is opened...","This Water Prison Sect’s inheritance truly has a touch of the uncanny."]},{"number":1647,"title":"Chapter 1647 - 855: Roll Call_2","paragraphs":["No wonder the Taoist Court wiped them out...","It’s just that he didn’t really understand the intricacies inside, he could only watch the spectacle, and after a while, he felt bored.","Mo Hua yawned, his eyelids drooped, and he pretended to fall asleep.","Master Xiao glanced at him and did not ask, but concentrated, staring intently at the Water Yama.","Mo Hua was actually not asleep.","Thanks to the mystical Taoist Stele, he generally doesn’t need to sleep.","He was just resting with his eyes closed, contemplating some things.","The altar is hidden deep within the Dragon King Temple.","But this altar is different from the one in Bi Mountain Demon Cavern and even the small fishing boat’s altar; it may have existed for a long time.","With the desire between men and women on the Rouge Boat as bait, and such a vast Dragon King Temple as protection,","This must be a very crucial altar.","With his ability alone, attempting to sneak into the Dragon King Temple is quite difficult, and approaching the altar is almost impossible.","The Dragon King Temple is too large, the halls interconnecting.","The temple guards are all dead, Mr. Witch is a monster.","The main door is locked by Mr. Witch, the inner hall is a sea of blood, and beneath the blood sea lies a maze.","Within the maze, there are countless blood zombies.","This layer upon layer of obstacles and dangers make it impossible for him to enter alone.","Therefore, he can only find people to work and take risks for him.","Such a thing is very dangerous.","Senior Brother Feng and Sister Qianqian are not suitable, their cultivation is not enough.","Uncle Gu and Xia Canonical Official do have enough cultivation, but they count as \"one of us.\"","As everyone knows, exploring secret realms generally costs \"teammates.\"","Mo Hua is somewhat unwilling to let Uncle Gu and the others take risks for him.","Therefore, Master Xiao and several others are the best candidates.","And on this journey, without Xie Liu paving the way, Shui Yan opening the door, and Master Xiao dealing with Mr. Witch turned monster, he really might not have made it into this inner hall.","However, although the situation is generally developing according to his calculations, there are still some surprises.","The biggest surprise was Master Xiao.","Mo Hua truly didn’t expect that Master Xiao would be this strong.","He possesses the orthodox core direct lineage inheritance of the Water Prison Sect, not to mention cultivation technique and movement technique, and with the Water Prison Skill and Blood Pupil Skill, it’s even more terrifying.","Such skills, strictly speaking, are only eligible for the sect leader of Water Prison Sect to learn.","To have learned these skills, previously, Master Xiao was almost supposed to be the designated sect leader of the Twelve Streams Water Prison Sect.","Looking across the entire Qian Learning State Boundary, there are not many Golden Cores with such treatment.","Saying this, it’s no wonder Uncle Gu and Xia Canonical Official couldn’t beat Master Xiao.","Uncle Gu is of the direct lineage of the Gu Family, but is not favored, though he learned the core spell points of the Gu Family, it’s definitely inferior compared to the true sect leader’s inheritance.","Xia Canonical Official is the same.","She is from the direct lineage, but there are quite a few in the Xia family’s direct lineage, and her inheritance is definitely not the most core.","No matter how deep the Xia family’s wealth, the inheritance of a direct lineage disciple cannot be more powerful than the sect leader inheritance of the Twelve Sects.","What’s more, the smiling tiger is an old hidden rogue.","He had always remained unremarkable, all his skills were suddenly displayed at critical moments, catching Uncle Gu and Sister Xia off guard, falling into his trap is not surprising.","Really can’t blame Uncle Gu and Sister Xia...","However, Master Xiao’s actions have reminded Mo Hua.","Killer moves and trump cards should be kept as tight as possible and not used until the last moment; then they are deadly.","Indeed, there is definitely someone to learn from.","There are many things on Master Xiao worth learning for himself.","Thinking of this, although Mo Hua kept his eyes closed pretending to sleep, he couldn’t help but nod.","Beside him, Master Xiao was puzzled.","Seeing Mo Hua nodding even while asleep, he was a bit uneasy.","That kid...what did he suddenly realize again?","Surely he has a keen mind; just wonder where this little devil learned his sly and cunning techniques...","...","This place is not suitable for a long stay, after the group rested for a while, recovering from any injuries, they set off again.","Mo Hua had \"woken up,\" so he didn’t need Shui Yan to carry him anymore; instead, he wore the Spirit-binding Lock, following behind Master Xiao.","Xia Canonical Official, Gu Changhuai, and Ouyang Feng, and Hua Qianqian all sighed in relief upon seeing Mo Hua.","Hua Qianqian asked: \"Junior Brother Mo, are you alright?\"","\"Mm-hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Don’t worry, Sister, I’m alright.\"","Hua Qianqian finally put her mind at ease.","\"Alright, no more reminiscing, better think of a way to leave early.\" Master Xiao said.","Everyone understood and didn’t say much, instead continuing to wander in the maze, trying to avoid the endless blood zombies and find the way out.","Arriving at an intersection, Master Xiao looked around, frowned, thought for a moment, and prepared to go right.","Mo Hua suddenly said: \"Go left.\"","Master Xiao was slightly stunned, his gaze deepened, looking at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua said candidly: \"The exit is on the left.\"","Master Xiao’s expression tightened, he asked in a deep voice: \"How do you know?\"","Mo Hua decided not to hide his skills.","The time is almost ripe, having seen the altar and entered the maze, the gatekeeper \"Mr. Witch’s\" various means have mostly been forced out, there’s no need to delay anymore.","It’s time to close the net.","Mo Hua said: \"Ancestor taught me a Formation, related to Mystery Formation, containing mystery formation layout, directional path, formation changes, and so on...\"","\"This White Bone Maze secretly aligns with the Mystery Formation, embedded with some blood sacrifice corpse raising formations. As long as you follow the Formation’s direction, you can determine the maze’s location and safely leave here...\""]},{"number":1648,"title":"Chapter 1648 - 855: Roll Call_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua spoke half-truths, sounding convincing.","Master Xiao didn’t know the details, but he was still taken aback.","Especially by the words \"Ancestor\".","The sect’s ancestor, they are not ordinary figures.","Master Xiao’s expression was solemn, \"The sect’s ancestor taught you the Formation? What exactly is your identity?\"","Mo Hua casually replied, \"Our sect’s ancestor is different. He enjoys personally teaching the disciples the Formation. All the disciples in the sect have been taught by the ancestor...\"","Master Xiao was half-skeptical.","Mo Hua said no more, and instead waved his hand, saying, \"Follow me.\"","After speaking, he naturally stepped past Master Xiao, leading the group.","Master Xiao silently watched Mo Hua’s back without saying anything.","Gu Changhuai and the others were even less inclined to speak.","They were familiar with Mo Hua and knew he was always skilled at finding paths. Although he sometimes seemed mysterious, they didn’t know how he identified routes and directions. But generally, following him was not mistaken.","The group then followed Mo Hua, walking through the White Bone Path of the maze.","With Mo Hua leading, the originally intricate maze path suddenly became clear.","Which paths were passable, which were not.","Where to turn, where to turn back.","Mo Hua was thoroughly knowledgeable.","It seemed like he personally supervised the construction of this White Bone Maze.","Master Xiao found it somewhat unbelievable, even suspecting Mo Hua was actually colluding with that \"Mr. Witch\", leading them towards a dead end.","Fortunately, the journey was smooth thereafter.","When encountering Blood zombies, Mo Hua seemed to possess foreknowledge, able to evade in advance.","Occasionally, there were a few unavoidable ones, which were not opponents for Master Xiao.","Thus, they proceeded, kill and move, occasionally stopping to rest.","Without knowing how long had passed, they walked until they reached the edge of the maze.","Mo Hua was somewhat hesitant.","He still hadn’t found the altar.","Moreover, he had a feeling that the position of the altar had changed, very likely hidden by that \"Mr. Witch\".","Recalling earlier, the scene of the blood sea pouring back.","The altar very likely was the \"spring eye\" of the Blood Pool.","\"This is troublesome...\"","Mo Hua frowned.","If he took everyone out like this, it would be almost impossible for him alone to explore into the depths of the maze.","Even if possible, it would be fraught with danger.","Besides, he still didn’t know where the altar was.","Even if he knew where the altar was, if the place where the blood water was pouring back was where the altar was, he couldn’t enter...","Mo Hua pondered deeply, no good solution, only deliberately took a few wrong paths, starting to delay some time.","But continuing to delay like this wasn’t a solution either.","Mo Hua glanced at Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian, sighed slightly.","Enough, better send the people out first, to avoid neglecting one thing over another...","Mo Hua then led everyone towards the maze’s exit.","After about 30 minutes of walking, the maze’s exit was before their eyes.","This was a grand door, and it looked very familiar, ram’s horn relief, wide and thick, just like the door when entering the inner hall.","Blood Pool transformed into the White Bone Maze.","Thus the maze’s exit was naturally the entrance before entering the Blood Pool.","Everyone’s expressions were filled with joy.","Even Master Xiao breathed a sigh of relief, he looked at Water Yama, asked in a low voice, \"How much longer?\"","Others might not know what he was asking, but Mo Hua was clear.","Master Xiao was asking, how much longer until the Water Prison Forbidden Box could be opened.","Water Yama’s gaze deepened, said, \"About six hours.\"","Master Xiao frowned.","This time was a bit long...","Mainly because Mo Hua led them too quickly, otherwise they couldn’t have exited the maze so fast.","Now with six hours remaining, it slightly deviated from his plan.","But now leaving was the priority.","Master Xiao thought about it and walked towards the door, but before he could reach it, his expression changed and he slowly retreated.","An eerie laughter suddenly rang out:","\"It’s amazing you found your way here...\"","At the same time, in front of the door, a dense swarm of Blood zombies crawled up from all directions, tightly blocking the door.","The number was several times more than those encountered in the maze before.","Blood Qi flooded the surroundings.","A figure gradually materialized in the center of the Blood zombie.","Its limbs twisted, surrounded by Blood Qi, covered in scales, ugly and ferocious, resembling a yaksha.","It was Mr. Witch.","Behind it followed a special Blood zombie.","This Blood zombie had only one arm, but Evil Qi was intense, its neck had a row of blood holes, covered in blood, evidently it had been refined not long ago.","It was none other than Xie Liu, who shortly before had had an arm cut off by Master Xiao and was bitten by Mr. Witch, fallen into the Blood Pool.","Transformed into a monster, Mr. Witch’s gaze at this moment was frenzied, speaking human words:","\"This Dragon King Temple is a dead land.\"","\"On Divine Lord’s command, all cultivators who enter this temple must die.\"","\"All believers guarding the temple are dead, I killed them.\"","\"Their lives were offered to the Divine Lord, their flesh nourished the embryo, their Divine Souls shall return to the Great Wilderness.\"","\"Death was their honor, also my supreme offering to the Divine Lord!\"","The inhuman Mr. Witch finished grippingly, his scarlet gaze turned towards the group, then continued with a cold laugh:","\"According to Divine Lord’s prophecy, a great adversary desecrating the Divine Lord will arrive soon.\"","\"And you all are the best living sacrifices.\"","\"You are the grand gift I present to the Divine Lord!\"","\"When the Divine Lord awakens, tastes your Divine Souls, uses your flesh as puppets to eradicate the adversary, naturally will bestow upon me supreme blessings.\"","\"I give you a chance, surrender now...\""]},{"number":1649,"title":"Chapter 1649 - 855: Name Called Out_4","paragraphs":["Before Mr. Witch could finish speaking, a beam of ice-blue sword light slashed across his face.","It was Canonical Official Xia’s sword.","Mr. Witch, interrupted, looked even more furious, his gaze even colder:","\"Those who stubbornly refuse to change are unworthy of being a believer of the Divine Lord...\"","Mr. Witch growled.","This was the battle signal.","Behind him, Xie Liu, already turned into a \"blood zombie,\" suddenly shrieked and lunged toward everyone.","Gu Changhuai swung his feather fan, surrounded by several wind blades, countering the killing move from the \"blood zombie\" Xie Liu.","The dragon-scaled monster that Mr. Witch transformed into also lunged forward.","Master Xiao and Canonical Official Xia raised their sword lights and confronted Mr. Witch, engaging in battle.","The remaining blood zombies surged forward like a tide.","Some surrounded the three Golden Core cultivators of Master Xiao, while others rushed directly at the Foundation Establishment cultivators including Mo Hua.","There were too many blood zombies, it was impossible to fight them all.","Mo Hua frowned and quickly said, \"Retreat quickly!\"","Shui Yan and his group weren’t fools either; realizing things were not in their favor, they immediately retreated into the depths of the White Bone Maze.","With the narrow maze as a barrier, they could barely manage against these blood zombies.","But there were too many blood zombies, and as they retreated, their formation became a bit disordered.","Shui Yan took the opportunity to pull Mo Hua further into the maze’s depths.","Mo Hua was still bound by the Spirit-binding Lock. Seeing so many blood zombies rushing over, he said to Shui Yan, \"Release me.\"","But Shui Yan sneered and continued retreating.","Mo Hua frowned, feeling something was odd about Shui Yan’s demeanor.","Sure enough, as they retreated deeper into the maze, Shui Yan found a secluded corner, took out a copper furnace, and lit a piece of red incense, letting the fragrance disperse to form a thin layer of mist.","This incense was unknown, but the smoke seemed to intimidate the blood zombies.","Those blood zombies did not dare cross the smoke, lingering outside the mist for a moment, then hissing a few times before leaving.","With this respite, Shui Yan took out the Water Prison Forbidden Box, placed it on the ground, then took out a dagger and stabbed his own arm fiercely.","A large amount of essence blood burst out, all merging into the Forbidden Box.","Then, a blood color gradually spread across the Forbidden Box, quickly filling the seven Taoist Prisons.","Mo Hua’s heart was shocked.","Shui Yan was accelerating the opening of the Water Prison Forbidden Box...","The seven Taoist Prisons were filled with blood.","Then, with a heavy look of evil intent, Shui Yan activated his Pupil Skill, gazing at the center of the Qi Essence Taoist Prison, the Life Soul Prison.","A look of pain appeared on Shui Yan’s face.","He seemed to be enduring immense pain and trials.","Mo Hua also held his breath, remaining silent.","After an unknown amount of time passed, a faint, obscure light flashed across the Forbidden Box, an ancient meaning emanating from it, and a crack appeared on the originally seamless sides of the Forbidden Box.","The Water Prison Forbidden Box was opened...","Shui Yan looked wildly joyful, then cursed:","\"Damn Xiao Zhenhai, does he really take me for a fool? Wants me to open the box and then kill me? Pipe dream, dream on anyone pregnant with that idea!\"","\"This box belongs to me, no one can take it away!\"","Shui Yan grasped the Water Prison Forbidden Box tightly, then lashed out a whip, wrapping it around Mo Hua’s neck.","A blood mark appeared on Mo Hua’s neck from the strangulation.","Shui Yan threatened, \"Kid, tell me the Meditation Technique, and I’ll spare your life!\"","With the evil spell point of the Water Prison Sect and the Meditation Technique to steady his mind, given time, he could form a Golden Core, his future would be limitless!","Shui Yan’s heart was ablaze with excitement.","Before Mo Hua could speak, several Spirit Needles suddenly flew in, aiming directly at Shui Yan’s face.","Shui Yan hurriedly blocked them with his hand; though he fended them off, his palm was pierced by the Spirit Needles, causing bloody wounds and severe pain.","\"Let go of Junior Brother Mo!\"","A voice, gentle yet filled with anger, echoed.","Shui Yan turned his head in anger and saw the graceful silhouette of Hua Qianqian.","Beside Hua Qianqian stood Ouyang Feng, with a solemn expression.","The two had been separated by the blood zombies, but seeing Shui Yan holding Mo Hua hostage, worried for Mo Hua’s safety, they hurried over.","Shui Yan laughed instead of being angry, \"Good, good, two fledglings coming to seek death on their own.\"","His gaze lingered over Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian, particularly resting on Hua Qianqian for a while, his eyes growing increasingly red.","\"Such top-grade quality, I will definitely enjoy it thoroughly, make you wish you were dead.\"","Hua Qianqian’s face turned pale with fear. But when she looked at Mo Hua, trapped by the Spirit-binding Lock, she gritted her teeth and, with a firm voice, said:","\"It’s you who deserves death!\"","Ouyang Feng’s gaze deepened as he drew his sword, charging at Shui Yan.","Hua Qianqian continued to unleash Spirit Needles.","Shui Yan coldly laughed, throwing Mo Hua aside, pulling out his Water Torture Whip, and channeling his Spiritual Power to engage with Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian.","This time, he would not let these two go again!","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian, battling with Shui Yan, found it extremely difficult.","After dozens of rounds, Shui Yan found an opportunity; blood shadows flickered in his eyes as he intended to exploit their flaw to control Hua Qianqian and Ouyang Feng to seal the battle in his favor.","But before he could use his Pupil Skill, he heard a voice calling out:","\"Shui Yan.\"","This voice, crisp and pleasant, yet extremely cold, as if the true Yama was calling his name.","Shui Yan instinctively turned his head and saw a pair of golden eyes."]},{"number":1650,"title":"Chapter 1650 - 856: Worse Than a Dog","paragraphs":["\"You are no longer of use.\"","In those eyes, there was a hint of indifferent majesty, a golden, awe-inspiring sword light contained within.","Then a flash of golden light.","Water Yama’s expression turned dazed, as if trapped in a cage woven of sword light, a thousand strands of golden sword light slicing through his divine soul.","\"Pupil Skill?!\"","At the critical moment, Water Yama mustered all his strength, channeling evil qi into his eyes, trying to resist the golden pupil skill with the Transforming Evil Blood Pupil Skill.","A sea of blood emerged, wrathful spirits snarling.","But the golden light swept through, and in an instant, the entire sea of blood was annihilated.","Water Yama’s divine soul seemed to have been slashed by a sword, intimidated by the sword intent, and immense fear arose within his heart.","He still wanted to struggle, but he discovered that the evil qi he had suppressed for so long was on the verge of losing control, gradually eroding his sea of consciousness.","The pupil skill duel failed, and there was a backlash of evil qi.","Once the sea of consciousness was flooded by evil qi, he would surely die!","Water Yama’s expression twisted, using the last bit of his rationality to desperately suppress the evil qi.","But his eye sockets were still gradually filling with blood, and at the same time, he saw Mo Hua.","At some unknown time, the spirit-binding lock on Mo Hua’s body had already been unlocked.","He approached Water Yama, taking advantage of his divine sense being out of control, and right before Water Yama’s eyes, took his Water Prison Forbidden Box.","The one he had spent so much effort, cultivated spiritual power, sacrificed half of his blood essence, and had just \"opened the box\" not long ago...","The Water Prison Forbidden Box!","Water Yama felt a surge of fury attack his heart, the evil qi in his sea of consciousness about to break through his restraint.","At this moment, he heard Mo Hua murmur softly:","\"Sigh, I really overestimated you. You’re far worse compared to that dog in my Taixu Gate...\"","Hearing this, Water Yama’s anger surged, spitting blood, unable to suppress the evil qi within him any longer.","His sea of consciousness suffered a backlash from the evil qi, and his divine soul began to fracture.","And his eyes, from deep red, slowly turned to black-gray, leaving only some instinctive parts, furiously biting around.","Mo Hua saw this and quickly retreated.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian saw Water Yama, for some reason, suddenly lose his mind, spiritual power in chaos, aura gray and defeated, quickly taking the opportunity to attack.","Ouyang Feng stabbed directly at Water Yama’s heart vein with a longsword.","Hua Qianqian used the Hundred Flowers Spirit Needle to pierce into Water Yama’s forehead.","Both of these were lethal wounds.","Water Yama, severely injured, had his evil qi gradually retreating, experiencing a slight revival before his death, seemingly about to say something.","At this moment, another shadow turned around from the corner of the wall.","This person, wearing a Taoist Court robe, with handsome features and fair skin, was Xiao Tianquan.","Xiao Tianquan, quick-eyed and agile, immediately flashed over and pierced Water Yama’s throat with a sword.","Water Yama’s pupils shrank, dazedly looking at Xiao Tianquan, and then his gaze gradually dissipated, losing his breath altogether.","This Water Yama, who had committed countless atrocities on the Mistwater River, was thoroughly dead.","Mo Hua glanced at Xiao Tianquan, then patted his chest and let out a long breath, saying with lingering fear:","\"Brother Xiao, it’s lucky you arrived in time, or else I would’ve fallen victim to that Water Yama.\"","Xiao Tianquan nodded, \"This person committed countless sins, deserved to die.\"","But...","Xiao Tianquan looked at the black-gray dead eyes of Water Yama, frowned, and said:","\"How did he suddenly lose his senses?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"I don’t know... Probably did too many bad things and got punished by the heavens, faced his retribution.\"","He executed his pupil skill discreetly earlier, so no one present saw the golden sword intent in his eyes.","Xiao Tianquan furrowed his brows tightly, stared at Water Yama for a while, then relaxed slightly, and said in a low voice:","\"Probably couldn’t suppress the evil qi and got a backlash...\"","Mo Hua raised an eyebrow.","This Howling Celestial Dog knows quite a lot.","With Water Yama dead, the matter was settled here, Ouyang Feng pondered for a moment, then asked:","\"Supervisor Gu and Xia Canonical Official are entangled with that Mr. Witch. Should we go see if we can help?\"","At this moment, even if they wanted to escape, they couldn’t.","And in this White Bone Maze, with dangers lurking at every turn, there were the scaled monsters \"Mr. Witch\", countless blood zombies, and the treacherous Master Xiao.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official in the Golden Core Realm were their reliance.","If Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official remained safe, there might be a chance.","Once they met with misfortune, then the few of them, including Mo Hua, might be in desperate straits.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then nodded.","\"Let’s go, let’s check it out.\"","He held the incense burner left by Water Yama, and that segment of red incense to drive away the blood zombies, and then stepped towards the big door.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian followed behind Mo Hua.","Xiao Tianquan was at the back, but he deliberately hesitated for a moment, looked down at Water Yama, and pulled out the sword stuck in Water Yama’s throat, still not at ease, he reversed grip on the sword and stabbed a few more times at Water Yama’s heart vein after already dead, then stealthily searched Water Yama’s body and his waist storage bag, but found nothing.","\"Nothing?\"","Xiao Tianquan’s expression was slightly tense as he looked up at Mo Hua, his gaze obscure, and after pondering for a moment, he silently followed them.","Mo Hua led the group, driving the blood zombies away, retracing their steps, arriving once more in front of the White Bone Gate.","Before the gate, several Golden Cores were still fighting to the death.","Blood zombies were everywhere, blood nearly soaking every inch of the ground red.","Gu Changhuai, alone, held off Xie Liu turned into a blood zombie, while Xia Canonical Official and Master Xiao teamed up against Mr. Witch, clad in dragon scale armor.","Everyone bore more or less injuries, their auras significantly weakened.","Even that monster Mr. Witch, his blood qi had nearly been consumed half."]},{"number":1651,"title":"Chapter 1651 - 856: Worse Than a Dog (Part 2)","paragraphs":["But Mr. Witch clearly held the upper hand, especially with the assistance of numerous blood zombies, allowing him to attack and defend with ease.","If this continued, the defeat of Gu Changhuai and the other two was just a matter of time.","Mo Hua observed the situation and made a decision in his heart, then handed the incense burner to Ouyang Feng, \"Senior Brother Feng, you all stay back, I’ll be right back.\"","Ouyang Feng didn’t know what Mo Hua was planning to do, so he could only caution: \"Junior Brother Mo, be careful.\"","\"Mm, rest assured, Senior Brother Feng.\"","After saying this, Mo Hua silently employed the Minor Five Elements Stealth Skill. His figure dimmed and vanished once more.","While invisible, Mo Hua took advantage of the frenzy of the battle when no one was paying attention to quietly circle around Mr. Witch and his group, avoiding the blood zombies as he made his way to the main gate.","He remembered clearly that the blood zombies had crawled out from near the main gate.","Mo Hua searched for a moment at the main gate and indeed found the blood-red Evil Formation carved under the white bone stone seat.","These Evil Formations were used in the Blood Sacrifice method to refine the blood zombies.","Mo Hua could not fully understand them, but breaking them was not difficult.","Around the Evil Formation, he painted some Gold and Fire Formations, using gold to repel evil, fire to burn evil, and formation to break formation.","In fact, the best repelling evil formation is the Thunder Formation.","But the Thunder Formation inheritance in the Cultivation World was extremely rare, not even possessed by the Taixu Gate, and Mo Hua simply did not know it.","However, these Blood Sacrifice Formations were not high-level, and just destroying them violently didn’t require such profound complexity.","Mo Hua glanced up, seeing the ongoing intense battle with no one paying attention to him, then used Divine Sense Control Ink, his fingers sketching and guiding the Spiritual Ink to form a formation.","Soon, the formation materialized.","Without hesitation, Mo Hua immediately detonated the formation.","In an instant, flames burst forth, thunderous sounds erupted, and the white bones on the ground were blasted apart, destroying the blood formation at the same time.","The moment the blood formation was destroyed, the surrounding blood zombies were instantly out of control, twitched a few times, then fell to the ground, motionless.","Even Xie Liu no longer had the strength to resist, collapsing with a thud, offering his neck to be slaughtered.","Gu Changhuai gathered spiritual power and condensed it into an extremely powerful Wind Blade, severing Xie Liu’s head, then turned around to join Master Xia and Master Xiao in surrounding Mr. Witch.","The blood zombies lay prostrate, and Xie Liu was dead.","In the blink of an eye, Mr. Witch, who had been so imposing surrounded by a tide of blood zombies, was now standing alone.","Mr. Witch was greatly shocked, then said furiously: \"What scoundrel broke my formation?!\"","Mo Hua naturally did not make a sound.","At such a time, he had no need to step out and attract Mr. Witch’s hatred.","Master Xiao and the other two knew well that this was a rare opportunity, so they all made their moves, Wind and Sword Qi bursting forth, beginning to surround and kill Mr. Witch.","Mo Hua watched in hiding for a while, thought for a moment, and began secretly setting up formations, preparing for the next phase of the plan.","Mr. Witch transformed into a yaksha-like monster, covered in dragon scales, impervious to blades and spears, unaffected by spells, and very powerful.","But he was facing three Golden Cores.","Moreover, regarding how to tackle Mr. Witch, Mo Hua had previously devised a plan, and Gu Changhuai and the others were already experienced.","At this point, it was simply repeating old tactics, implementing Mo Hua’s plan again.","Indeed, Mr. Witch could not withstand the wear and tear.","In less than an hour, the Blood Qi around him nearly thinned out, and the scales on his body became clearly visible.","Without the swirling Blood Qi and the energy supply of blood, Mr. Witch finally panicked.","He didn’t want to repeat past mistakes, so he charged left and right, trying to find an opening to escape, hoping to absorb more Blood Qi and make a comeback.","But the three Golden Cores present were not easy to deal with.","Mr. Witch had no chance at all.","It took just a short while for him to be captured.","Master Xiao originally intended to kill Mr. Witch, but found that Mr. Witch, upon transforming into a yaksha monster, had undergone some unknown change. He had not only retained his intelligence but his scale armor had become even harder than before.","His jaws were tightly clenched, and blades couldn’t penetrate, unable to shred his internal organs and take his life.","\"Keep him trapped, we’ll figure a way out first.\"","Mo Hua now revealed himself, and then personally secured Mr. Witch with chains and trapping formations, one after another, binding him tightly.","Master Xiao gave Mo Hua a deep look and said coldly: \"The young master’s formation skills are indeed extraordinary.\"","Mo Hua waved his hand modestly, \"Just so-so, enough to make a living.\"","Master Xiao’s gaze darkened slightly, his expression inadvertently becoming more serious.","With Mr. Witch and the blood zombies resolved, Ouyang Feng, Hua Qianqian, and Xiao Tianquan from afar also gathered.","As everyone gathered, Master Xiao suddenly paused, frowned, and asked:","\"Where is Water Yama?\"","Everyone looked at each other in confusion.","Mo Hua said: \"Dead...\"","\"Dead?!\" Master Xiao’s pupils constricted.","Mo Hua sighed: \"For some unknown reason, he suddenly lost his sanity, his eyes turned red, and he went mad trying to kill me. I, along with Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian, were not his match. Luckily, Brother Xiao arrived in time and killed Water Yama...\"","Master Xiao’s sharp gaze suddenly turned to Xiao Tianquan.","Xiao Tianquan only felt his scalp tingle, but he had no choice but to brace himself and say, \"Yes... I killed him...\"","Master Xiao’s gaze grew dark as he glanced at Xiao Tianquan, remaining silent, then turned around and said: \"Let’s figure out how to get out first.\"","Everyone had their thoughts, but said nothing.","Reaching the main gate, they found the doors tightly closed, the ram’s bones grim, with not a crack in sight, nor any formation to open the gate.","But fortunately, everyone discovered a demon copper statue.","This copper statue was identical to the one at the Dragon King Temple gate, used to insert the Fish Bone Token to open the temple door."]},{"number":1652,"title":"Chapter 1652 - 856: Worse Than a Dog (Part 3)","paragraphs":["And now, the Fish Bone Token is in Master Xiao’s hand.","Gu Changhuai glanced at Master Xiao.","Master Xiao was silent for a moment, then slowly stepped forward, took out the Fish Bone Token from his storage bag, and inserted it into the demon copper statue.","In just a moment, the gate trembled and slowly began to open with a dull sound.","But for some reason, maybe something had gone wrong with the Blood Pool, or some formation had broken, the door only opened a crack before stopping again.","Everyone breathed a soft sigh of relief at the sight.","Although the door was huge, even a crack was enough for people to pass.","Everyone started to step forward, intending to head outside, but just then, another change occurred.","A cyan wind blade suddenly shot towards Master Xiao.","The person who acted was Gu Changhuai.","He wanted to kill Master Xiao.","A flash of icy blue came from the side, as Xia Canonical Official also used an ice-type sword light, aiming for Master Xiao’s throat.","Master Xiao was not surprised.","But, instead of engaging with Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, he first used the Water Shadow Step to dodge, then his figure flashed, closing in on Xiao Tianquan, reaching out a large hand to grab him.","Xiao Tianquan seemed to have anticipated this.","He guessed that Master Xiao wanted to grab him, so at the moment when everyone acted, he had already withdrawn, narrowly avoiding Master Xiao’s grasp.","Seeing his miss, Master Xiao wanted to strike again, but Xiao Tianquan quickly shouted:","\"Uncle, I don’t have it in my hands.\"","Master Xiao was half convinced, and then suddenly thought of something, turning his gaze towards Mo Hua.","Mo Hua appeared innocent.","Master Xiao became even less certain.","Mo Hua, this little ghost, might be acting.","And Xiao Tianquan, his nephew, whom he watched grow up, was also quite shrewd, and likely to deceive him.","Although Xiao Tianquan killed Shui Yan Luo, the Water Prison Forbidden Box might not truly be in his hands.","While Master Xiao was hesitating, he suddenly found that Mo Hua was gone.","He scanned with his Divine Sense and suddenly noticed a faint figure near the demon copper statue.","\"This little brat, he wants to snatch the token!\"","Master Xiao acted suddenly, slashing at Mo Hua, then his figure flashed, abandoning Xiao Tianquan to attack Mo Hua.","The Fish Bone Token was within reach, but with Master Xiao already attacking, Mo Hua had no choice but to abandon the token and use Water Passing Step to evade.","Meanwhile, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official came over to support Mo Hua.","They blocked Master Xiao’s attack, then also tried to seize the Fish Bone Token, but Master Xiao would not let them succeed.","The three of them fought fiercely over the token, with sword edges crossing, but for a moment, no one could gain the upper hand.","At this moment, everyone was well aware.","The maze had been solved, Mr. Witch had been subdued, and if Xiao Zhenhai got hold of the Fish Bone Token again, everyone would be at his mercy.","Xiao Zhenhai was a man with a poisonous heart and deep scheming; they must not leave their fate in his hands.","Xiao Zhenhai understood as well, if Gu Changhuai obtained the Fish Bone Token, with his nature of hating evil as enemy, he would undoubtedly go to great lengths to kill him.","Furthermore, he absolutely had to get the Water Prison Forbidden Box.","This box was related to his entire Taoist skill and cultivation; no matter who had it, he had to take it back.","Even if it meant killing everyone present and searching their bodies, it was imperative!","With this thought, both sides went all out.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official faced Xiao Zhenhai head-on.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian provided support from the side, even Xiao Tianquan started joining everyone to besiege the uncle who had always treated him well.","Xiao Tianquan knew well.","If Gu Changhuai won, he likely wouldn’t kill him.","But if his uncle, no, now Xiao Zhenhai... if he won, given his suspicious nature, he definitely wouldn’t spare him.","Therefore, in the matter of killing Xiao Zhenhai, this nephew nearly gave his all.","Xiao Zhenhai, enraged to the point of laughter.","Gu Changhuai coldly said, \"Xiao Zhenhai, you are full of sins, your death is deserved. Surrender early, perhaps we can spare your life; otherwise, this White Bone Maze will be your burial ground today!\"","Xiao Zhenhai sneered, \"Supervisor Gu, you and I are both supervisors, such words to deceive others might work, using them to deceive me, isn’t it laughable?\"","\"As we are both supervisors, that’s why I offer you this way out.\"","Though Gu Changhuai spoke kindly, his spells never stopped, and each strike was more vicious than the last.","The others showed no mercy, either.","Even though Xiao Zhenhai carried the entire set of ultimate techniques of the Water Prison Sect as its Sect Leader, he now felt tremendous pressure.","If it were the Third-Grade State Boundary, it would have been better; he could use the power of the Golden Core to exert his full legacy.","But here, in the Second Grade State Boundary, he was constrained and fought very uncomfortably.","Xiao Zhenhai, overwhelmed with anger, sneered viciously, \"Fine, fine, you all want to kill me, then don’t blame me for being ruthless...\"","His eyes reddened slightly, and Evil Qi surged.","Gu Changhuai, with experience, immediately avoided Xiao Zhenhai’s gaze.","But in doing so, although he avoided the Pupil Skill, he also revealed a flaw, which Xiao Zhenhai seized, using the Water Shadow Step to close in and land a sword strike.","Xiao Zhenhai wanted to press the advantage, but fortunately, Xia Canonical Official assisted from the side, temporarily forcing Xiao Zhenhai to retreat.","Subsequently, Xiao Zhenhai repeatedly used the Blood Pupil Skill for intimidation, finding flaws, and took the opportunity to strike, coupled with his top-tier cultivation technique and movement technique, making Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official struggle tremendously.","The situation gradually worsened.","Just then, Xia Canonical Official, exhausted from the prolonged battle and slightly disoriented by the Evil Qi, moved a bit sluggishly.","Xiao Zhenhai seized the opportunity, thrusting a sword towards Xia Canonical Official’s neck.","Gu Changhuai’s expression turned unpleasant, uttering a \"tsk,\" he pulled Xia Canonical Official aside, blocking the sword with a feathered fan.","But his cultivation was ultimately slightly inferior to Master Xiao’s; although he blocked the sword, he was still caught off guard by Xiao Zhenhai’s move and got stabbed in the shoulder.","Gu Changhuai’s face paled, and he spat out a mouthful of fresh blood.","Xiao Zhenhai’s eyes gleamed with excitement, just about to step forward and thrust another sword, only to find himself momentarily immobilized.","He looked down and saw the ground’s formation patterns flickering.","Strands of azure Spiritual Power wrapped around his body like vines, holding him tightly.","\"Formation?\"","Xiao Zhenhai’s pupils contracted.","When Xia Canonical Official regained herself, seeing Gu Changhuai take a sword for her, with his shoulder pierced, she immediately showed anger on her delicate face; her short sword, veiled with a layer of ice crystals, rapidly slashed towards Xiao Zhenhai’s throat.","Xiao Zhenhai barely evaded, but still got a gash that leaked a blood thread.","The ice crystals followed the blood thread, sealing his throat.","Xiao Zhenhai’s expression was extremely grim; he swung a sword to repel Xia Canonical Official, and he too retreated a few steps to temporarily create distance.","After standing firm, just as Xiao Zhenhai hadn’t fully recovered his senses, a flash of fire erupted on the ground, signaling another formation had been triggered.","Earth Fire Formation.","Followed by the Di Sha Formation.","Interspersed with some trapping formations like quicksand, golden locks, and wooden prisons.","Fire Qi and Earth Qi intertwined, explosions erupting one after another.","Only then did Xiao Zhenhai notice that at an unknown time, he had fallen into a surrounding of formations, enduring their repeated assaults.","Moreover, these formations were all without exception of the Nineteen Patterns or even Eighteen Patterns, high-level Second Grade formations.","They were the finest array among Second Grade!"]},{"number":1653,"title":"Chapter 1653 - 857: Pupil Skill Slaughter","paragraphs":["Such a multitude of Second Grade High-Level Formations, hidden in the dark, linked together, exploding layer by layer, even Supervisor Xiao of the Golden Core Realm found it somewhat unbearable for a moment.","When the smoke cleared, Xiao Zhenhai, full of injuries and in a sorry state, appeared, clearly not lightly wounded.","He was a Golden Core; even if he suppressed his cultivation, his foundation remained.","If not for this, so many Second Grade High-Level Formations would have been enough to kill him several times over.","Xiao Zhenhai spat out a mouthful of blood, his face trembling.","\"I fell into a trap...\"","Someone had ambushed him with formations, calculating against him.","This greatly exceeded his expectations.","The study of formations is extremely difficult.","Even some Formation Masters with exceptional talent usually find their formation level lagging behind their cultivation realm.","Formations with eighteen or nineteen patterns, other than those truly brilliant in formations, generally require at least someone at the level of Golden Core, or an old array master at the peak of Foundation Establishment, with over a hundred years of immersion.","Moreover, these formations were not there prior; they were clearly just laid out.","In this Dragon King Temple, who had the ability to lay down so many Second Grade High-Level Formations in such a short time, right under everyone’s nose, without leaving a trace?","His mind raced, considering everyone, but he couldn’t guess who the hidden hand was.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official had sufficient cultivation, but they didn’t have the time.","Xiao Tianquan, his dear nephew indeed had Foundation Establishment Peak cultivation, but he was far from having this level of formation skill.","The remaining few, not worth mentioning.","\"Something’s wrong!\"","Xiao Zhenhai suddenly remembered there was one person who had always remained invisible.","If anyone was scheming behind the scenes, it could only be...","\"Mo Hua?!\"","Xiao Zhenhai’s pupils contracted in disbelief.","That kid, with just Foundation Building Middle Stage cultivation and only twenty years of cultivation age, how could he lay down a Second Grade Nineteen-Pattern Formation approaching Foundation Establishment Peak?!","Never mind the Twelve Streams and Eight Great Gates; even within the Four Great Sects, it’s afraid there hasn’t been such an extraordinary Array Demon for nearly a thousand years.","Yet, when all impossibilities are ruled out, the only remaining possibility must be the truth.","The image of Mo Hua once again surfaced in Xiao Zhenhai’s mind.","The casual yet adept manner when Mo Hua waved his hand and said, \"Just getting by...\" now sent chills down Xiao Zhenhai’s spine.","\"Such an insidious kid, concealing his means so deeply...\"","Xiao Zhenhai gritted his teeth.","Just at this moment, Gu Changhuai’s azure Wind Blade, and Xia Canonical Official’s icy blue sword light, interlaced and came to kill.","To strike while he’s weak and take his life.","Xiao Zhenhai, now wounded by the explosion of formations and lacking Qi Power, was at the perfect juncture for taking his life.","Gu Changhuai certainly wouldn’t miss this opportunity.","Xiao Zhenhai’s face darkened, cursing lowly, dodged one Wind Blade, raised his sword, and unleashed Gui Water Sword Qi, engaging Xia Canonical Official once again.","However, bearing injuries, whereas previously he could hold the upper hand in hard combat, now engaging in this clash, he only felt a burning pain in his viscera, with signs of his Spiritual Power waning.","The icy Spiritual Power of Xia Canonical Official was also corroding his meridians.","In just an instant, Xiao Zhenhai realized the precariousness of his situation.","If this continued, doom was certain!","\"I cannot hold back, swift battle decisive!\"","Xiao Zhenhai’s gaze became sinister.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official seemed to also know Xiao Zhenhai was going to make a desperate struggle, making their assaults increasingly fierce, offering no respite for Xiao Zhenhai.","But Xiao Zhenhai still had the advantage in inheritance; after exchanging blows for a dozen rounds, he seized an opportunity to perform Water Shadow Step, confusing Gu Changhuai and the others.","By the time Gu Changhuai discerned the truth and falsehood of the Water Shadow, Xiao Zhenhai had already withdrawn several zhang away.","Retreating several zhang, Xiao Zhenhai first crushed a talisman, enveloped himself in a mass of golden light, then his entire body surged with Gui Water Spiritual Power, making for an imposing presence, as strings of water-colored Spiritual Locks condensed around him.","Using Gold Body for protection, with Water Prison to subdue the enemy.","Xiao Zhenhai crushed a Golden Body Talisman, intending to rely on its protection to forcibly cast the superior control spell, Water Prison Skill.","When first using Water Prison Skill, element of surprise was crucial, hence he refrained from using the Golden Body Talisman then, lest Gu Changhuai become aware.","But having already employed Water Prison Skill once, Gu Changhuai, having been hit once, would surely be wary.","Hence, wanting to use it again required the most comprehensive preparation; taking chances was not an option, the Golden Body was essential.","With Gold Body’s protection, he only needed to withstand the Sword Energy Skill from Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official to manifest Water Prison Skill and determine victory in one strike.","Golden light enveloped, spiritual power flowed, and Water Prison Skill was forming.","Xiao Zhenhai’s body teemed with spiritual power, the deep blue water force transforming into endless chains, layer upon layer, hovering around him...","Yet Gu Changhuai seemed to have anticipated this.","He did not retreat, instead using his Spiritual Power to unleash more fine Wind Blades, attacking Xiao Zhenhai with full force.","The Wind Blades slowly eroded Xiao Zhenhai’s Golden Body.","Xiao Zhenhai’s expression was indifferent.","Before Gu Changhuai could penetrate the Golden Body, he would have time to solidify the Water Prison Skill.","But just at this moment, Xia Canonical Official also produced a Jade Talisman, which she crushed with her delicate hands, and with a flick of her fingers, a blinding red light shot straight at Xiao Zhenhai.","This red light made Xiao Zhenhai’s expression greatly change.","\"A Gold-breaking Talisman of this grade?!\"","Before the words were finished, the red light had arrived, and the Golden Body, consumed by Gu Changhuai’s Wind Blades, shattered instantly.","With the Golden Body Talisman broken, Gu Changhuai’s eyes flashed with a sharp light, immediately transforming into several more ferocious Wind Blades, directing them at Xiao Zhenhai.","With Xiao Zhenhai’s Gold Body Technique broken and the Water Prison Skill only half formed, there was no time to dodge, leaving him to watch as Gu Changhuai’s ferocious Wind Blades tore through the air, directly striking his shoulder."]},{"number":1654,"title":"Chapter 1654 - 857: Pupil Skill Slaughter_2","paragraphs":["The Wind Blade sliced through the flesh, leaving a great scar, blood and flesh flowing.","Xiao Zhenhai hurriedly retreated, took out a Pill and swallowed it, suppressing the injury within his body, his expression extremely grim.","His once smiling face, now bore a heavy layer of anger.","For nearly a century, he had hidden in the shadows, never finding himself in such peril.","Ever since he learned this top-notch inheritance, he could kill whoever he desired, never suffering such a great loss.","But unexpectedly today, he fell into a trap and stumbled hard.","A killing intent rose in Xiao Zhenhai’s heart.","\"Fine, you all are courting death!\"","His eyes opened completely, a blood-red hue within, no longer restraining the killing intent, releasing all the Evil Qi cultivated so far, pushing the Blood Prison Pupil Skill to its peak.","Xiao Zhenhai’s eyes transformed into abysses of sin.","Countless Cultivators he had slaughtered struggled and pleaded within them.","\"This is bad!\"","Gu Changhuai’s face darkened, hurriedly averting his gaze.","But this time the Blood Prison Pupil Skill, differed from before, its power stronger by more than a notch.","The killing intent was fully unleashed.","The blood-red Evil Qi seemed to come alive, snaking like venomous serpents, spreading everywhere, infiltrating endlessly.","Even though Gu Changhuai had averted his gaze, the Evil Qi still seeped into his Sea of Consciousness through his Eye Acupoint, causing his Divine Soul to suffer, rendering him immobile for a moment.","Xiao Zhenhai seized the opportunity, his figure flickering as he approached Gu Changhuai, raising his longsword high.","\"Gu Changhuai!\"","Xia Canonical Official’s face turned ashen, immediately condensing Sword Qi, intent on stopping Xiao Zhenhai.","Xiao Zhenhai suddenly turned his head, his gaze blood-red.","Xia Canonical Official, overwhelmed by concern, failed to guard against it, falling right into Xiao Zhenhai’s Pupil Skill.","She felt her Sea of Consciousness freezing cold, like being cut by a knife, blood trickled from the corner of her mouth, her pupils losing focus.","Xiao Zhenhai sneered, \"Don’t rush, I’ll kill you one by one...\"","After speaking, he lifted his sword, Gui Water Sword Qi burst forth, aiming to cut Gu Changhuai’s neck first.","Just at this moment, he heard a crisp voice.","Someone was calling his name:","\"Xiao Zhenhai!\"","Xiao Zhenhai initially didn’t want to pay attention, wanting to kill the killable first, to ensure safety.","But this voice was special.","It was that sneaky little devil, who never revealed themselves.","Also the one who, though unassuming, had an extraordinary mastery of formations, the Junior Formation Master.","And moreover...","\"Daring to call my name directly...\"","Xiao Zhenhai let out a cold laugh, his eyes turning red as he looked at Mo Hua.","Thereafter, he discovered Mo Hua was staring coldly at him.","Xiao Zhenhai was momentarily stunned, then laughed, but the smile on his face had a hint of derision.","\"A reckless little devil, daring to meet my gaze...\"","But gradually, the smile on Xiao Zhenhai’s face froze.","He noticed a glimmer of Golden Light in Mo Hua’s eyes, spreading and becoming more dazzling.","\"This is... a Pupil Skill?!\"","Xiao Zhenhai understood instantly.","The Water Prison Forbidden Box was in Mo Hua’s possession!","And before this, Mo Hua had already unlocked the mysteries within that box.","He learned the Pupil Skill inscribed on the box!","\"And moreover, his pupil skill... is golden?!\"","Golden Pupil Skill!","In that instant, Xiao Zhenhai felt unprecedented pressure.","He couldn’t comprehend it, but didn’t dare hesitate or take it lightly, meditating on his \"Blood-colored Daoist Prison Map\" nurtured by evilness, pouring all the Evil Qi cultivated in his life into his eyes, transforming it into a sea of blood and purgatory, to contend with Mo Hua’s golden pupil skill.","The clash of Pupil Skills was extremely perilous.","One Thought born, one Thought perished.","Xiao Zhenhai exerted all his effort to lock eyes with Mo Hua.","In the void, the blood-red pupil skill, and the golden pupil skill collided, Evil Qi and Golden Light entwined, tearing each other apart.","But in a split second, the Divine Sword emerged, Golden Light swept forth.","Blood Qi collapsed, crumbling inch by inch.","Only then did Supervisor Xiao become terrified.","Sword Intent?","This isn’t a Pupil Skill! This is... a Sword technique?","A Sword of Divine Thought executed through Pupil Skill?","Am I wielding eyes against someone’s Sword Qi?","Xiao Zhenhai felt a chill in his heart, and upon realization, discovered the golden Sword Intent had already penetrated his eyes, seeping into his Divine Soul.","A golden prison, purely composed of sword light, suppressed him within.","The sword light was dazzling and sharp, inflicting dismemberment on his Divine Soul bit by bit.","He was like a sinner of heinous crimes, undergoing the judgment of sword punishment.","The agony of his Divine Soul being cut and flayed spread slowly, and amid the pain, Xiao Zhenhai found clarity in his heart.","So this is what torture feels like...","He wanted to resist, but couldn’t.","Wanted to struggle, but lacked the strength.","Under the oppressive, overwhelming Sword Intent, Xiao Zhenhai’s Divine Soul trembled, utterly unsure how to counteract.","He could only let his Seven Souls, his Life Soul, be sliced apart by the sword light...","Mo Hua’s eyes were locked onto Xiao Zhenhai.","His gaze was filled with Golden Light and authority.","But blood flowed from the corners of his eyes.","Even though his Divine Soul was strong, and his Divine Sense profound, this body was merely at Foundation Establishment, and facing a Golden Core, the burden on his eyes was too heavy.","Just at this moment, Gu Changhuai regained a bit of consciousness.","He saw Mo Hua with blood at the corners of his eyes, as well as the devastated, painful Xiao Zhenhai, who seemed to be under torture, nearing \"loss of control,\" and his heart shook.","Gu Changhuai endured the aftereffects of the Blood Pupil Skill, and with great willpower, overcame the dizziness and pain, forcing himself to wake up.","Once his Divine Sense recovered, Gu Changhuai immediately gritted his teeth, and exerted all his might, starting to condense a Spell."]},{"number":1655,"title":"Chapter 1655 - 857: Pupil Skill Slaughter_3","paragraphs":["Spiritual power surged around him, stirring up a turbulent wind filled with countless blades, dense as feathers, shining brightly yet containing killing intent.","Wind-Riding Feather Transformation Art!","Gu Family’s superior Taoist skill.","This wind-based spell is incredibly powerful but requires operating the spell formula to accumulate massive spiritual power.","Until now, Gu Changhuai had not had the opportunity to use it in battle.","But now, Xiao Zhenhai failed in his combat with Mo Hua’s pupil technique, his Divine Sense damaged, Evil Qi rebounding, tipping on the edge of losing control, providing Gu Changhuai the only chance to use this Taoist skill.","Majestic wind-system spiritual power converged.","After a few breaths, Gu Family’s superior Taoist skill Wind-Riding Feather Transformation Art was realized.","Gu Changhuai’s gaze was indifferent as he pointed forward, and the wind blades around him, like the wings of a green luan, suddenly fluttered, turning into a raging gale rushing towards Xiao Zhenhai.","Xiao Zhenhai’s Divine Soul suffered sword punishment, on the brink of collapse, but could vaguely sense mortal danger, instinctively dodging aside, trying to escape this lethal move.","At this moment, Xia Canonical Official awoke too, seeing Xiao Zhenhai attempting to dodge, she endured the severe pain in her Divine Sense, infused spiritual power into her short sword, using Sword Controlling Method to condense icy sword light and attacked Xiao Zhenhai.","Her swordsmanship was known for its perilous speed and efficiency.","Now she struck swiftly, directly piercing Xiao Zhenhai’s chest, ice-system spiritual power spread, instantly freezing Xiao Zhenhai’s heart arteries.","Xiao Zhenhai’s movements were frozen.","Almost simultaneously, the strong wind blade formed by the Wind-Riding Feather Transformation Art, like a green luan flapping its wings, whistled towards him.","Countless tiny wind blades directly engulfed Xiao Zhenhai, slicing his flesh bit by bit.","The intense spiritual power fluctuation forced Mo Hua and others to retreat quickly.","As the dust settled.","Xiao Zhenhai, akin to being flayed, was bloodied all over, his meridians severed.","Near death, dispirited and muddle-headed, Xiao Zhenhai took a last look at Mo Hua, wanting to speak but unable to articulate.","His eyes were filled with anger and reluctance.","All his life, he hid in the shadows, preparing for any eventuality.","But by misstepping once, overlooking once, he doomed his life...","Xiao Zhenhai’s heart burned with anger, spat blood, and then died.","This time, he was truly dead.","Almost exhausted to their last drop, everyone breathed a sigh of relief.","Gu Changhuai’s spiritual power was nearly depleted, and Xia Canonical Official wasn’t any better off.","Yet they looked towards Mo Hua first, concerned.","Gu Changhuai said: \"Are you okay?\"","Mo Hua wiped the bloodstains from the corner of his eyes, shook his head, and said: \"I’m fine.\"","However, when saying this, Mo Hua’s complexion was somewhat pale.","He had clashed fiercely with Xiao Zhenhai using the pupil technique, though he won, he suffered some backlash.","The methods of the Divine Soul always hurt a thousand enemies but lose eight hundred of oneself.","Mo Hua’s Divine Soul was strong, but his flesh was weak.","Using pupil technique through the eye acupoint, performing Soul-Shocking Sword Skill, usually it was alright, but once engaged in battle with a formidable enemy, the burden on both eyes was greater than Mo Hua had anticipated.","Moreover, Mo Hua felt his Divine Soul had also sustained some damage.","This injury wasn’t solely due to the kill-strike with Xiao Zhenhai using pupil technique.","It was connected to fighting the Big White, lacking enough rest, and then using the Soul-Shocking Sword twice consecutively in Dragon King Temple, which accumulated the damage to his Divine Soul, aggravating the injury, bursting forth during the fierce battle with Golden Core Realm Xiao Zhenhai...","Beside him, Xia Canonical Official caught a breath and thought deeply, becoming increasingly puzzled.","How was Xiao Zhenhai’s pupil technique broken?","Why did his consciousness abruptly verge on collapse, providing an opportunity for herself and others?","Why did Mo Hua’s eyes bleed?","What exactly did he do...","Xia Canonical Official looked quietly at Mo Hua, wanting to ask more, \"Mo Hua...\"","Gu Changhuai interrupted: \"This place isn’t safe for long. Let’s get out first.\"","Xia Canonical Official paused and nodded.","The situation was indeed special, not the right time for conversation.","She had no choice but to keep her doubts at heart and stop pressing for now.","After rounds of fierce battles, not only Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, but also Ouyang Feng, Hua Qianqian, and Xiao Tianquan, were almost drained of their spiritual power.","Before the gate, wreckage was scattered everywhere.","Xiao Zhenhai was dead, blood zombies were everywhere, white bone maze exuded eerie aura, and the blood red surroundings grew increasingly intense for unknown reasons.","It felt like something \"was\" gradually waking...","Gu Changhuai’s eyelids suddenly twitched, sensing something might happen, and hurriedly said: \"Quick, let’s move.\"","Everyone’s hearts tightened, collecting Xiao Zhenhai’s storage bag, checking their belongings to ensure nothing was missed, seizing the chance to leave one by one through the gap of the opened ram’s horn gate from the white bone maze.","Just as they exited the gate, before they could relax, they noticed something amiss.","The White Bone Token was still inside.","This token must be carried out as it would be needed when leaving Dragon King Temple.","Yet once the token is pulled out, the maze’s gate will close.","Thus, the one retrieving the token must have excellent movement technique.","Once the Fish Bone Token is pulled, while the gate is closing, they must quickly slip out through the crack.","Before Gu Changhuai could say anything, Mo Hua said:","\"I’ll go!\"","His movement technique is good, and his stature is slim, best suited for this task.","Just as Gu Changhuai was about to refuse, Mo Hua had already slipped back into the white bone maze through the gap, it was too late to stop him.","\"Be careful!\" Gu Changhuai could only furrow his brow and advise.","\"Okay.\" Mo Hua replied.","Once inside the white bone maze, Mo Hua didn’t dawdle, directly reaching the demon copper statue and after a moment of inspection, pulled out the Fish Bone Token embedded within it.","The maze’s gate closed slowly.","Mo Hua also prepared to leave.","But at that moment, a hair-raising chomping sound emerged.","Everyone turned pale, following the sound only to see Mr. Witch, transformed into a monster, crouching over Xiao Zhenhai’s corpse, gnawing on the flesh.","With the nourishment of Golden Core flesh, Mr. Witch’s aura climbed steadily.","Dense blood qi coiled around its body, its scales grew increasingly black and resilient, its form swelled with astonishing power.","Gu Changhuai was shocked, voice trembling:","\"Mo Hua, run fast!\"","Mo Hua seemed startled too, hastily activating his movement technique, preparing to escape through the door.","But in the next instant, a dreadful blood shadow appeared behind him, casting a shadow that completely enveloped him.","Too fast!","After devouring Xiao Zhenhai and transforming into a yaksha, Mr. Witch had grown immeasurably stronger.","In a mere moment, it appeared behind Mo Hua.","Mo Hua’s face gradually paled, he seemed to realize he \"couldn’t\" escape.","In the very last moment, with all his strength, he threw the Fish Bone Token through the gradually closing gate’s crack.","His lips moved, seemingly softly saying to everyone:","Run...","Gu Changhuai and others were heartbroken, wanting desperately to rush in and save Mo Hua, but it was too late.","The slowly shutting gate blocked them.","They could only watch helplessly as Mr. Witch’s gruesome claws reached for Mo Hua.","Endless blood red engulfed Mo Hua’s slim form entirely..."]},{"number":1656,"title":"Chapter 1656 - 858: Formidable Foe","paragraphs":["The door was completely shut.","Gu Changhuai and Supervisor Xia were heartbroken, Hua Qianqian shed tears, Ouyang Feng’s face was pale, while Xiao Tianquan frowned slightly.","Gu Changhuai’s mind raced and he quickly said, \"Hurry, figure out a way to open the door!\"","But after circling the door a few times, they couldn’t find a way to open it at all.","This was the gate to the inner hall, used for sacrifice, with a special way to open it. Following the previous methods of Mr. Witch, it required sacrifices and some bizarre rituals.","They had no idea how to open it.","Moreover, even if they managed to open the door, after such a delay, Mo Hua might have already...","Fear gripped Gu Changhuai’s heart, along with deep regret and guilt.","If he had known, he would never have let Mo Hua go in alone. At the very least, he should have followed.","But everything happened so fast earlier, after a hard-fought battle, he was so exhausted that he hadn’t even had time to think, leading to negligence.","And it was this bit of negligence that led to a big mistake.","By now, it’s too late to regret...","Gu Changhuai said solemnly, \"First use the Fish Bone Token to get out, gather everyone nearby, break through this door at any cost, and rescue Mo Hua...\"","Supervisor Xia also nodded solemnly, then frowned and asked, \"Should we inform the Taixu Gate?\"","Gu Changhuai nodded but then his expression turned stern, shaking his head he said, \"We can’t tell Taixu Gate yet...\"","Supervisor Xia was puzzled.","Gu Changhuai said solemnly, \"This is the Second Grade State Border, far water can’t quench near fire. If we can rescue Mo Hua, we are enough; if we can’t, by the time Taixu Gate’s people arrive, Mo Hua will already be...\"","The White Bone Maze, boundless blood, the monstrous Mr. Witch, countless blood zombies, and deep within the altar, that unknown and dreadful aura...","By the time the people from Taixu Gate come, Mo Hua will surely be in grave danger.","Everyone understood this, and their hearts ached once more.","Gu Changhuai sighed and said, \"First think of a way to save him. If we can rescue him, everything will be fine; otherwise, we can only go to Taixu Gate ourselves, carrying thorns to ask for forgiveness...\"","Supervisor Xia nodded, feeling even more regretful in his heart.","Thinking of how Mo Hua took the risk for everyone, and even in the last moment, knowing it was impossible, threw out the token to let them escape safely, while he himself...","Supervisor Xia’s heart was pricked with pain like needles.","At last, she looked at the door and sighed deeply:","\"I hope this child Mo Hua has great blessings and can turn danger into safety...\"","But the White Bone Maze was extremely dangerous, and how to turn danger into safety, she couldn’t even imagine...","...","White Bone Maze.","In a white, eerie corridor.","With a large physique, dragon scales all over, and resembling a \"yaksha,\" Mr. Witch clutched Mo Hua with a bloody hand, walking step by step towards the depths of the maze.","The surrounding blood color grew more intense.","An increasingly strong scent, which clearly shouldn’t exist, slowly spread.","Mo Hua was held by Mr. Witch, looking left and right, sniffing with his nose, and then raised his head to ask:","\"What’s happening here? The smell isn’t right?\"","Mr. Witch’s eyelids twitched.","Does this kid understand his current situation?","He ignored Mo Hua.","Mo Hua asked again, \"Are you going to use me as a ’sacrifice’?\"","Mr. Witch sneered, \"What do you think?\"","Mo Hua just nodded silently.","It seemed to be the case, just as he guessed.","He remembered that Mr. Witch had mentioned before that the \"great enemy\" of the Divine Lord would soon arrive, and they were the best \"living sacrifices,\" a grand gift for the Divine Lord.","\"Living sacrifices\" must mean living offerings.","Before the sacrifice, this Mr. Witch shouldn’t kill him.","Moreover, he had set up so many formations earlier, effectively showing Mr. Witch his extraordinary talent in formations.","Strong formation talent meant strong Divine Sense.","With such abundant Divine Sense, if he were a henchman of the Great Wilderness Evil God, he would want to capture himself as a sacrifice to the Evil God.","How could Mr. Witch resist?","And this altar...","Judging from the current situation, with the backflow of blood and the White Bone Maze surrounding it, the \"altar\" of the Evil God seemed to be hidden somewhere by this Mr. Witch.","He couldn’t find it for now.","Even if he did, the surroundings of the altar would probably be enveloped in blood filled with Evil Qi, and there might be other dangers and obstacles he can’t overcome.","For things he couldn’t do, he had to find someone to help.","Mr. Witch was just right.","Not only could he guide the way, but he could also be like a \"mule,\" personally taking him there without him having to walk.","This Mr. Witch was still quite useful...","Mo Hua secretly glanced at Mr. Witch and curiously asked, \"How did you turn from a person into a monster?\"","Mr. Witch frowned, \"Not a monster.\"","\"Then a yaksha?\"","Mr. Witch was a bit surprised, \"How do you know?\"","Mo Hua said, \"I saw you make a nest in the Yaksha Hall, and your appearance somewhat resembles the yaksha in the hall.\"","Mr. Witch snorted coldly, \"You do have some wit.\"","Mo Hua asked again, \"Then what about those scales on you? Where did they come from? Are they dragon scales? Why dragon scales? Do dragons really exist in this world? How do you have the dragon...\"","Mr. Witch was really annoyed and yelled:","\"Shut up!\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua responded indifferently.","After walking for a while in silence, Mo Hua felt it was too quiet and muttered a bit discontentedly:","\"Quite a temper, but earlier when captured, was all polite and begging for mercy all the time...\"","Mr. Witch’s forehead twitched in anger, \"That was temporary endurance, just to catch you ignorant fools who dare to desecrate the Divine Lord, using your blood to sacrifice to the Divine Lord.\""]},{"number":1657,"title":"Chapter 1657 - 858: Formidable Foe (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"So you’re saying,\" Mo Hua said, \"that you deliberately killed all the temple guards, and then turned into a monster... yaksha, and ate them all?\"","Mr. Witch sneered coldly, \"Indeed.\"","Mo Hua recalled earlier when Mr. Witch learned that he had \"eaten\" his companions, and his face turned pale as if he was about to vomit his guts out, and secretly mocked him in his heart.","This Mr. Witch is quite the \"drama king,\" putting on such a convincing act...","Then Mo Hua reflected for a moment and had to admit that Mr. Witch performed better than himself.","The expression of learning a cruel truth, seemingly about to vomit one’s vital organs, was something he couldn’t replicate.","It seemed his own \"acting skills\" needed more practice.","Mo Hua nodded and then asked, \"Speaking of which, these temple guards were your companions, right? After killing and eating them, doesn’t your conscience hurt?\"","\"What do you know?\" Mr. Witch mocked, \"To dedicate their loyalty, flesh, and even life to the Divine Lord is their highest honor.\"","\"To die for the Divine Lord is the best fate for them.\"","Mo Hua shook his head silently in his heart.","It’s over; the brain has been completely brainwashed.","\"Right,\" Mo Hua tried probing again, \"you keep saying ’Divine Lord, Divine Lord,’ what exactly is this Divine Lord you’re talking about?\"","\"How dare you!\" Mr. Witch roared with anger, \"The revered title of the Divine Lord isn’t something you can casually mention!\"","\"If not, what should I call it?\" Mo Hua asked sincerely.","Mr. Witch was about to say something but suddenly stopped.","He glanced around, looking at the white bone pillars, the blood-red mist, and the oppressive, chilling aura in the depths, finally frowning.","This little ghost... there’s something off.","Mr. Witch’s gaze focused, and he slowly said:","\"Do you know where this place is? Where I am taking you? Aren’t you... even a little scared?\"","Mo Hua quickly suppressed his inner excitement and said with a serious face:","\"I’m scared out of my wits, so much so that I’m talking to you to ease my fear.\"","Mr. Witch: \"...\"","This little ghost, is he missing a few brain cells?","Doesn’t he have any awareness at all?","Could it be that his Innate soul lacks something, affecting his emotions, so he doesn’t know what fear is?","Mr. Witch’s frown deepened.","Then he suddenly gave a sinister smile.","Ignorance is fearless; the more ignorant a person is, the more foolish courage they have. There are great terrors in this world; even if he doesn’t know now, he will experience it soon enough...","Mr. Witch said no more, grabbed Mo Hua, quickened his pace, and continued heading into the depths of the maze.","After that, whatever Mo Hua asked him, he remained silent.","Unable to get any information, Mo Hua had no choice but to look around, but the more he looked, the more confused he became.","The blood color in the depths of the White Bone Maze had become much richer than before.","And it continued to thicken, bit by bit.","It seemed to be \"hatching\" something, but Mo Hua didn’t sense anything strange around...","Walking like this, Mr. Witch finally brought Mo Hua to a Blood Pool.","The blood in the Blood Pool was extraordinarily thick.","With just one glance, Mo Hua roughly deduced that the previous expanse of blood sea, mixed with Evil Power, had all been gathered and concentrated into this Blood Pool.","Mr. Witch grabbed Mo Hua, about to jump into the Blood Pool, when Mo Hua quickly said:","\"Wait!\"","Mr. Witch paused, frowned, and said, \"What is it?\"","Mo Hua said, \"This blood is dirty and can corrode flesh; if you jump in with me, I might not make it to be sacrificed to the Divine Lord.\"","Mr. Witch sneered, \"Don’t worry, this offering is different; if it’s not fresh, the Divine Lord will blame me.\"","With that, he grabbed Mo Hua and leaped in.","With a \"splash,\" the blood scattered.","But because the blood was too thick, it stuck together, not much splashed out.","As they plunged into the Blood Pool, Mo Hua shut his eyes, and when he reopened them, all around was a deep red, filled with thick blood slurry.","And it seemed he was wrapped in Dragon Scale, so the blood couldn’t touch him.","Mr. Witch’s entire body transformed into a true blood-sea \"yaksha,\" covered in scales, carrying Mo Hua as they swam towards the depths of the Blood Pool.","All the way to the bottom of the Blood Pool.","Mo Hua looked up and finally saw the altar he had been longing for.","The altar was now quietly submerged in the center of the Blood Pool.","The surrounding blood water compressed, refining into dozens of blood streams, like blood vessels, flowing into the solemn Sheep Bone Statue on the altar, providing its Evil Power.","The outer blood was thick as paste, while around the altar, it became an area of vacuum.","Mr. Witch brought Mo Hua to the altar, retrieved a bone chain from somewhere, tied Mo Hua securely, and temporarily tossed him aside.","He then began respectfully placing some unknown flesh offerings on the altar, muttering something under his breath.","Mo Hua, tossed aside, looked at the peculiar blood streams, the eerie altar, the bloody offerings, and seemed to finally \"understand\" what fear was.","\"You’re not... really going to use me as a sacrifice, are you?\"","Mr. Witch sneered, cursing Mo Hua as a fool in his heart, only realizing such an obvious thing now?","But he was preparing the ritual.","In front of the Divine Lord, one couldn’t speak loudly, to avoid disrespect and incurring the Divine Lord’s wrath.","He placed the assisting ritual candles, incense, and flesh one by one onto the altar, then turned to look at the \"main course\" of this sacrifice—Mo Hua.","\"Originally, I meant to capture all of you and offer you all to the Divine Lord, but I didn’t expect you to be so troublesome.\""]},{"number":1658,"title":"Chapter 1658 - 858: The Great Foe (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"Except for that greedy fool who, out of greed, got his neck bitten off by me and turned into a blood zombie, the other Golden Cores are not easy to deal with.\"","\"You, kid, are as sly as a ghost.\"","\"Originally, my yaksha incarnation, which was impervious to sword and spear and immune to fire and water, was enough to wreak havoc everywhere, yet somehow you all found my weak point and wore me out...\"","Mr. Witch became increasingly agitated as he spoke, finally sighing:","\"There is nothing I can do, but fortunately, the heavens reward those who persevere, and the Divine Lord has blessed me by letting me capture you, kid...\"","Mr. Witch looked at Mo Hua with delight, growing happier the more he looked, nodding as he said:","\"Indeed, a perfect specimen for a live sacrifice, fresh and tender. The key is your divine sense, which must be immensely profound.\"","\"It was you who broke my Blood Formation. When you set up the Array Formation to trap that Supervisor named Xiao, I saw it too.\"","\"Your formation skills are truly exceptional, and your divine sense is absolutely extraordinary and incredibly flavorful.\"","\"Even though you alone might be a bit scant, I trust the Divine Lord will not hold it against me.\"","Mo Hua seemed a bit \"nervous\", keeping a stern face while saying to Mr. Witch:","\"I advise you not to sacrifice me, or you’ll regret it.\"","Mr. Witch laughed: \"Since I devoted myself to the Divine Lord, sacrificing my life for Him, I have yet to know how to spell the words ’regret’. \"","\"Enough,\" Mr. Witch lost patience, \"I have prepared everything, it’s time for you to go. I want to present you as my ’proof of loyalty’ to the Divine Lord.\"","Without waiting for Mo Hua to say anything, Mr. Witch hoisted him up onto the altar.","Then he lit candles, burned incense, and prayed on his knees:","\"O Master of the Great Wilderness, Three Thousand Dominions...\"","\"With awe-inspiring power, divine might prevails.\"","\"Bearing the blood of the Great Wilderness, honoring your sacred name, your believer shall today offer up an Innate Divine Item, a sacrifice rich in Divine Soul, to You...\"","\"May the Divine Lord endure eternally, may You soon grace the earth, bringing glory to the world...\"","Mr. Witch’s recitation was profoundly devout.","At the same time, an ancient and imposing presence indeed drifted above the altar.","It seemed something was awakening, preparing to savor this \"feast.\"","Mo Hua restrained himself, sitting properly without interrupting Mr. Witch’s prayer.","He feared that if he spoke, he might cause a distraction, making Mr. Witch misspeak and nullify the prayer, wasting all of his efforts.","Mr. Witch finished the prayer smoothly, glanced up at Mo Hua, and said indifferently:","\"You’re quite well-behaved.\"","Mo Hua nodded, then remembered something and asked, \"Mr. Witch, earlier you mentioned that the Divine Lord’s ’great adversary’ is about to arrive. How do you know?\"","Mr. Witch sneered, full of reverence, \"Naturally, through the Divine Lord’s revelation.\"","\"How was it revealed?\" Mo Hua inquired further.","Mr. Witch was about to answer but suddenly frowned, \"Why do you ask?\"","\"Oh,\" Mo Hua replied honestly, \"I forgot to mention... it seems your Divine Lord’s great adversary is me.\"","Mr. Witch was startled, and after a moment, he slowly burst into laughter, then laughed out loud, looking at the weak, bone-chained, lamb-to-the-slaughter Mo Hua, coldly saying:","\"Little brother, I didn’t know you had such a sense of humor...\"","How could someone so weak be considered the \"great adversary\" by a noble and mighty Divine Lord?","Mr. Witch continued to sneer.","But as he laughed, he suddenly couldn’t laugh anymore; he finally sensed something was amiss.","All along, he felt as if he was being \"orchestrated\" by someone.","Why?","And before reaching the maze, why was it that this little brat closed the door after entering?","Why, even though his movement technique was good, did he not dodge or evade?","Why, though he was smart, did he appear scared stiff, unmoving?","Why...","The atmosphere around the altar thickened, and the surrounding blood mist slowly rose, with the ancient resistance gradually resounding, as if ready to drag every divine soul into an unknown realm.","And this sense of discord, at the last moment, finally turned into a terrifying omen.","As the ritual reached its completion, Mr. Witch immediately reached out, intending to pull Mo Hua off the altar.","But he grabbed at nothing.","Though Mo Hua was clearly bound by bone chains and unable to escape along the way, he now effortlessly evaded the grasp and sat calmly on the altar, refusing to leave.","Mr. Witch’s face was pale.","In the next instant, whispers arose.","The blood mist surged completely, enveloping the entire altar.","It devoured and pulled all the divine souls around the altar, drawing them into another space of divine thought.","When the two opened their eyes again, it was still the Blood Pool, still the altar, but everything around had changed.","In the Blood Pool, countless vengeful souls’ ghostly faces roared hideously.","On the altar stood a massive horned statue, awe-inspiring and majestic, as if it were a deity, seemingly wielding immense power.","Now, Mo Hua sat on the altar.","Mr. Witch stood below the altar.","Originally, upon reaching this realm of the Divine Lord, Mr. Witch should have immediately bowed down, slaughtered the divine soul intended as a sacrificial offering, torn it apart, and presented it to the Divine Lord.","But at this moment, his heart and spirit quivered completely.","In front of him, sitting upright on the altar, was a strange little kid.","The appearance indeed had some resemblance to Mo Hua, but the age and physique were smaller, the aura was very obscure, and nothing abnormal could be detected.","But he was a Shaman, believing in deities for years, able to sense that the seemingly young Mo Hua exuded a trace of an aura that made him feel terrified.","This was an aura almost... divine!","Mr. Witch’s heart trembled, almost unable to stand, gritting his teeth, pointing at Mo Hua, \"Who exactly are you?\"","\"No...\" He shook his head, pupils contracting, \"What exactly are you?\"","Mo Hua slightly smiled at him, her voice crisp, saying:","\"The path you carried out was well done, next time there’s no need to lead it again.\"","Mr. Witch’s expression changed wildly.","He finally understood.","Indeed, everything was calculated perfectly!","This little imp hidden among the crowd, leaving no trace, was the real mastermind; from the very beginning, everything he did was to enter the altar.","His target... was the Divine Lord!","He didn’t lie to himself; this little imp was the great adversary of the Divine Lord!","\"The great adversary of the Divine Lord...\"","After the terror, Mr. Witch slowly stood upright again, his gaze resolute, and his heart surged with endless courage, which was boundless loyalty and fervent belief in the Divine Lord.","\"Being the great adversary of the Divine Lord, I shall sever your head, cut off your limbs, gouge out your eyes, extract your heart... and completely dismember you, to offer you to the Divine Lord, proving my loyalty!\"","Mr. Witch’s body gradually expanded.","The Evil God of the Great Wilderness endowed him with courage and also with \"swelling\" divine thought.","He transformed into a yaksha, with an even more robust physique, more indestructible Dragon Scales, sharper claws and teeth, his entire body’s Blood Qi thick as rivers.","Then, without waiting for Mo Hua to react, Mr. Witch’s figure flashed, his massive fist pounded towards Mo Hua.","This punch was imposing, incomparably swift.","But Mo Hua’s small hand merely stretched out, and all the momentum came to an abrupt halt.","This punch could advance no more.","Mr. Witch’s pupils gradually enlarged.","Then, Mo Hua also punched, carrying Golden Light. It seemed extremely slow but was exceedingly fast, giving Mr. Witch no time to react as it hit his chest.","The indestructible Dragon Scales shattered piece by piece.","The cracks gradually expanded, spreading from the chest to the limbs.","And Mr. Witch’s chest was already blasted with a black hole.","With just one punch, vitality extinguished...","Mr. Witch understood, his face turned pale, slowly kneeling on the ground, his voice filled with immense terror and endless regret:","\"With the Divine Lord above, I... am guilty...\"","\"I am gravely guilty!\"","\"I have caused a catastrophic disaster against the heavens. I have brought about... a terrifying great adversary...\"","In the next instant, Mo Hua directly twisted off his neck.","Henceforth, Mr. Witch’s divine soul was entirely annihilated."]},{"number":1659,"title":"Chapter 1659 - 859: Evil Embryo","paragraphs":["The Divine Soul has perished, and the remnants of Mr. Witch’s Divine Thought, tinged with a blood-red hue, dissipated around.","This could be \"consumed,\" but even though Mr. Witch transformed into a yaksha, he was still originally human, and he also consumed people. Mo Hua felt a bit disgusted and had no appetite, so he condensed a fireball and burned the remaining Divine Thought altogether.","This kind of corrupt appetizer is inconsequential.","Next, something better awaits him.","He wants to save his appetite for a \"feast\"!","Now, Xie Liu, Water Yama, Xiao Zhenhai, and Mr. Witch are all dead, meaning nearly all the enemies in the Dragon King Temple have been cleared out.","And under the guidance of the Divine Lord’s \"loyal\" believers, Mo Hua, who served as a \"sacrifice,\" finally descended upon the altar of the Great Wilderness God Master.","The Divine Marrow within Mo Hua began to circulate, his entire body emanating a faint golden light, his eyes turning dark gold, exuding an aura of majesty, unfathomable depth.","He looked akin to a \"deity.\"","Subsequently, Mo Hua sat upon the altar.","The altar welcomed the false \"Divine Lord.\"","Yet this \"false god\" had an aura very similar to that of the Master of the Great Wilderness.","He had even once truly stolen a portion of the Great Wilderness Master’s sovereignty, wielding power on behalf of the Divine Lord. Now, as he presided over the altar, everything felt familiar, as if he had returned to his own \"home.\"","The altar, adhering to its own \"loyalty,\" bestowed sovereignty upon this false god.","In that instant, endless Dao Laws, intricate like rain, passed by like shooting stars.","Rays of light converged, transforming unceasingly, interweaving with each other, merging into an inexhaustible, vast stream of light.","The flow of light ascended like a towering tree, branches extending and leaves spreading, covering the entire sky and earth.","The Divine Authority Tree!","Mo Hua remained at the altar, his clear eyes once again witnessing the extreme beauty yet terrifying spectacle of the law’s flowing light, intertwining and merging, reaching from earth to sky.","This scene was not new to him, yet it still left his mind and emotions shaken, longing for it.","\"Deities are born via the Dao, the Dao they uphold and the divine power granted by heaven is but a branch on this towering Divine Tree.\"","\"If one day, I could comprehend the entire Divine Authority Tree, master the myriad laws of heaven and earth, and unify all Dao in my heart, does it mean...I can become Immortal?\"","Mo Hua thought in his heart with some \"wishful thinking.\"","Of course, he also understood that this path was still very long.","His comprehension of the laws of heaven and earth was merely scratching the surface.","The branch of Divine Authority belonging to the Great Wilderness Evil God already felt vast and incomprehensible to him, impossible to fully master, let alone the origin tree of Divine Authority like the legendary \"Jianmu\" that spanned heaven and earth.","The path to immortality is long and arduous.","Mo Hua gathered his thoughts.","\"Eat to your fill first...\"","With his Divine Sense, he communicated with the altar, locating within the \"Divine Authority Origin Tree\" woven by the laws of heaven and earth...no, the Divine Authority Tree belonging to the Master of the Great Wilderness.","Mo Hua stole the Divine Authority and mastered the \"Divine Authority Tree\" of the Great Wilderness Master.","In an instant, the Divine Authority linked with his consciousness.","The tree of the Great Wilderness Divine Authority expanded, with nodes lighting up one by one, where countless Demon Monsters and Evil Spirits nurtured by the Evil God in nightmares were entirely under his control.","Of course, the top of the Divine Authority Tree was still shrouded in mist.","This was because Mo Hua, at most just a juvenile \"deity,\" didn’t possess enough \"Divine Power\" to dispel the mist and touch the pinnacle of the Great Wilderness Master’s Divine Authority.","Nevertheless, this was sufficient.","Just ordering a dish, what need is there for such a vast power?","Upon perceiving the demon nodes, Mo Hua began searching for \"Yu Er.\"","Yu Er was easy to find.","Within the Great Wilderness Master’s Divine Authority system, Yu Er’s status was quite special, and the nightmare node where she resided was brighter.","Compared to other nodes, the aura was purer, lacking the taint of evil and blood, instead possessing a pure child’s aura.","Mo Hua spotted Yu Er almost immediately.","But upon examining Yu Er’s node, he suddenly furrowed his brow.","\"It seems...dimmer than before, the pure aura has weakened, while the eerie aura has intensified...\"","Why?","Clearly, Yu Er accompanies him, happy every day, flitting about like a little bird. Why then has her aura diminished?","Is it an illusion?","Or...in these recent days, having slain fewer Demon Monsters, has Yu Er’s nightmare been suppressed again?","Mo Hua sighed, \"No choice, for Yu Er’s sake, this time I’ll reluctantly ’consume’ more...\"","Then he roused his spirits and officially began ordering.","This time he had experience.","Which Demon Monsters were strong, which were weak;","Which were \"fat,\" which were \"thin\";","Which Demon Monsters seemed strong but were helpless, being easily slain with a punch;","Which appeared weak but moved mysteriously, making them difficult to kill...","And some Demon Monsters, heavily tainted with Evil Qi, seeming very fat, but once slain and refined of Evil Thoughts, left little pure Telekinesis.","While others appeared thin, with Demon Nature concentrated only in their head; if you decapitate them and slightly refine the remaining Evil Thoughts, an unexpectedly considerable amount of Telekinesis remains...","These were all experiences he had accumulated from \"hunting,\" \"refining,\" and \"sampling\" Demon Monster Divine Thoughts over a long time.","It was a pity that in \"Demon Monster Appreciation,\" he had no \"Taoist Friend\" with shared interests to share these insights with, which was indeed a bit of a regret.","Mo Hua shook his head and continued ordering for himself."]},{"number":1660,"title":"Chapter 1660 - 859: Evil Embryo (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Compared to before, his appetite has grown much larger this time.","The divine sense with nineteen patterns is already close to Foundation Establishment Peak. For most second-grade Demon Monsters, even without considering the qualitative change of Divine Sense Sublimation, purely from the quantity of divine sense, it already shows a tendency of \"crushing\".","This means that most second-grade Demon Monsters can no longer satisfy his \"appetite\".","Going further up from nineteen patterns requires a vast amount of divine sense. Calculating it this way, to \"eat\" enough divine sense to reach twenty patterns, it’s unknown how many demon monsters are needed to be devoured.","Therefore, it’s important to cherish every opportunity to \"order dishes\".","\"Ox and Horse Demon Monsters, start with a thousand...\"","\"Wolf-Head Demon Monsters, start with five hundred.\"","\"Pig Head Demon, start with a hundred... Not enough? Then fifty to make do.\"","\"Sheep-Horned Enforcer, a bit few, order seven of them...\"","\"This node looks good, let’s have one of everything...\"","...","On the altar, Mo Hua was like a mouse that had fallen into a granary, happily ordering dishes.","But as he continued ordering, he suddenly froze, sensing something was wrong, as if someone was secretly watching him from behind.","Mo Hua slowly turned his head, his pupils involuntarily contracting.","Sure enough, behind him, there was a \"thing\".","This was an infant, covered in black blood, as if it had just been hatched from an embryo, blood mixed with amniotic fluid, dirty and bloody.","Its pupils were pitch black, with two sheep horns on its head, exuding a subtle, ancient, powerful aura.","Now, it was staring at Mo Hua with empty and indifferent eyes.","Their four eyes met.","A golden deity infant was looking at a newly hatched black-blooded infant.","The surroundings fell into dead silence.","Mo Hua felt a growing sense of unease.","\"Damn, it seems... I’ve encountered a big one...\"","In the next instant, the entity covered in black blood, akin to an \"Evil Baby\", spoke with a voice like a baby’s babble, carrying hints of confusion yet filled with cruel emotions.","Mo Hua frowned slightly, unable to understand what it was saying.","The black sheep horned Evil Baby silently watched Mo Hua, its pupils indifferent and slightly perplexed.","It seemed to have been born not long ago, trying hard to recall something. After a moment, a flash of understanding appeared in its empty eyes, and it looked at Mo Hua, speaking in half-fluent words:","\"You are... left for me... to ’eat’...\"","Mo Hua’s expression changed, sensing danger, and immediately flashed away.","In the instant he moved away, a pitch-black demonic claw suddenly fell, grasping at the original spot, then demonic qi raged as if vengeful souls were biting.","Once caught by this demonic claw, the divine soul would inevitably suffer damage.","Mo Hua’s expression also turned cold, and with a reverse flick of his finger, a fireball roared forth, directly aimed at the Sheep-Horned Evil Baby.","The Evil Baby just lightly raised its hand to block the fireball.","On its young but deformed face, anger appeared.","\"Eat...\"","In the next moment, it slowly stood up, its body surging with evil thoughts, turning into a black mist, rushing straight at Mo Hua.","\"Born not long ago yet already want to eat me?\"","Mo Hua’s face turned grim, and without hesitation, golden light surged all over him, clashing with the dark evil qi.","Instantly, around the altar, the clash of two strong divine thoughts sent tremors outward, turning over tables, smashing offerings, and even cracking the statues used for worship.","At the center of the tremor, Mo Hua, covered in golden light, and the black-blooded Evil Baby, were locked in battle.","Fist against fist, foot against foot.","This was the most unadorned and essential clash of divine thoughts.","With every exchange of blows, tremors would ripple through the area around the altar.","The Evil Baby fought more fiercely as it went on, and Mo Hua’s attacks grew more swift.","Fist and foot interlocked, golden light and black light intertwined, yet at the moment, the two divine thought incarnations were evenly matched, neither able to best the other.","The Evil Baby’s expression grew increasingly severe.","Mo Hua became more and more alarmed.","Unexpectedly unable to win...","Ever since he took the path of Divine Sense Proving the Dao, devouring divine marrow, achieving a small success in Dao Hua, he had always been invincible in clashes of divine thought, easily dispatching these evil demons and demon wraiths, one punch per demon.","There wasn’t a demon he couldn’t defeat with a punch.","If there was, then it would take two punches.","Yet, in this short time, he had exchanged nearly a hundred punches with this little black sheep cub and still hadn’t managed to take it down.","Not only that, Mo Hua didn’t even feel he had the upper hand.","What was more terrifying was that, in comparison, Mo Hua vaguely felt that this Sheep-Horned \"Evil Baby\" might be even stronger than him on the level of the divine soul.","Its weakness lay in the techniques of divine thought.","It seemed to have hatched not long ago, its \"memory\" not yet revived, thus retaining only the instincts of combat, but its killing techniques were very unfamiliar, and it had no real divine skills.","Meanwhile, during the battle with Mo Hua, it was gradually learning, gradually adapting, gradually mastering, gradually awakening.","Its gaze became a bit more cunning.","Its combat techniques flowed more smoothly.","The \"memory\" etched in its divine soul was gradually awakening.","Furthermore, taking advantage of the exchange of blows, amid mutual slaughter, it began to find time to employ other techniques, exhaling clouds and evil mist, conjuring blood hands from thin air, Vengeful Soul Chains, Soul-shocking Stab, Sheep Bone Long Spear, summoning Demonic Armies...","These techniques were diverse, brimming with evil, and insidiously vicious.","Mo Hua suddenly felt immense pressure, but could only counter each move, employing Divine Thought Power to manifest fireballs, water blades, quicksand, wooden prison, earth burial, and various Five Elements and Eight Trigrams spells.","On the altar of divine thought, black clouds immediately covered the skies, evil mists churned, multicolored spells interwove, and formation patterns bombarded all around.","This was truly a battle of deities."]},{"number":1661,"title":"Chapter 1661 - 859: Evil Embryo (Part 3)","paragraphs":["With the strength of Mr. Witch, even if he hadn’t died before, at this moment, even just by being affected by the aftershocks, he would have likely died dozens to hundreds of times.","After battling for hundreds of rounds, the Ram Horn Evil Baby unexpectedly realized something and summoned a giant statue of a Ram Horn Evil Demon behind it, slamming a massive palm towards Mo Hua.","Mo Hua never anticipated that the Evil Baby could pull such a move, and caught off guard, could only set up the Iron Wall Formation to protect himself, then mobilize Golden Light to cover his body to endure the attack from the Demon Statue.","The giant palm descended, covering the sky and blocking the sun.","Then a booming sound echoed.","The light of the Iron Wall Formation flowed, held on for a while, then shattered, the giant palm thunderously crashing onto Mo Hua.","For a moment, evil mist surged like a tide, the Golden Light shattered.","In the collision, the divine thought spilled like waves of a river.","As everything dissipated, Mo Hua still stood in the field, his divine thought unwavering, only his face slightly pale.","The Evil Baby did not attack again.","After the battle with Mo Hua, its instincts were provoked, and much of its innate memory seemed to be restored, its eyes more agile.","At this moment, looking at Mo Hua, the originally empty eyes showed a few degrees of contemplation and confusion:","\"Your strength is very strong... like a deity, but you are not yet.\"","\"You have humanity, but you are not completely human.\"","\"You have no divine skills, but you use formations...\"","\"Strange... there seems to be no such peculiar existence as you in my memory inheritance...\"","Its voice was intermittently childlike, but very gloomy, tinged with a tearing tone.","Finally, it looked at Mo Hua solemnly and said:","\"Submit to me, and I can pardon your blasphemous sins.\"","\"Submit to me, and toil for me ceaselessly.\"","\"When I am fully awakened, I can grant you supreme divine power, honor you with a respected position, and bestow upon you incomparable authority...\"","Mo Hua’s eyelids twitched.","Fully awakened...","Is this Evil Baby a \"main body\" of the Great Wilderness Evil God?","Or perhaps, it is truly a \"Divine Fetus\" of the Master of the Great Wilderness?!","\"This is not good...\"","Mo Hua’s divine soul faintly ached.","His earlier \"Soul-Shocking Sword\" had been used too many times—first to kill the Water Yama, then to intimidate Xiao Zhenhai—the accumulated injuries erupted.","Now having faced this near \"Divine Fetus\" little black ram cub head-on in so many bouts, and in haste, even took the giant slap from the Ram Horn Demon Statue directly, no matter how strong his divine thought was, he was starting to struggle to hold on.","The even more dangerous issue is, if this little black ram cub is truly the \"Divine Fetus\"...","Then that means it inherently inherits the gifted memory of the Great Wilderness Evil God.","He’s only lived twenty years, whereas the Great Wilderness Evil God has lived for countless thousands of years—the knowledge, power, tricks, means, divine skills, etc., on its divine way are simply beyond his comparison.","And Mo Hua just realized.","This little black ram cub, during the battle with him, as its gifted memory awakened, was gradually learning its inherent \"heritage,\" not only was its divine thought becoming stronger bit by bit, but its methods were also increasing little by little.","It would even occasionally instinctively use divine means that it didn’t know where came from.","And he had become the \"whetstone\" for the step-by-step growth of the Ram Horn Evil Baby, this \"Divine Fetus\" of the Evil God.","Mo Hua’s face looked somewhat unsightly.","He was always the one sharpening others.","Unexpectedly, now someone came to sharpen him.","Taking him as a \"whetstone\"—aren’t they afraid the blade would break?","Mo Hua coldly snorted in his heart.","But he also knew that he needed to find a way to quickly resolve this and eliminate this divine fetus ram cub.","Otherwise, once it fully awakens and gains control of its heritage, with his current strength, he would surely not be its match.","Mo Hua looked at the Ram Horn Evil Baby in front of him and asked:","\"Are you a ’Divine Fetus’?\"","The Ram Horn Evil Baby solemnly said: \"You should address me as ’Master’, submit to me, you can share longevity with the heavens and earth, endure thousands of tribulations without decay...\"","Mo Hua scoffed inwardly.","He’s gone mad if he trusts the lofty promises drawn by an Evil God.","\"I can submit to you, but you have to agree to one condition of mine.\" Mo Hua said.","The Evil Baby’s expression was displeased.","Clearly, it did not like to bargain.","For so many years, almost no one dared to bargain with this Evil God.","Power, fame, disaster, misfortune—all such things, but if granted, are all graces of the deity, and mortals have no right to refuse.","But the person in front of him was not an ordinary mortal.","And his current divine body had yet to awaken, his grand plan unfinished.","This young but strong demigod body, once it submits, will be his sharpest divine sword.","\"What condition?\" the Evil Baby asked in a dark tone.","Mo Hua said: \"I have a big appetite and eat a lot.\"","The Evil Baby recalled for a moment, and then said indifferently, \"No matter, under my command are countless demon monsters, you may devour them as you please.\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"My appetite has grown now, they no longer interest me. If you want me to submit to you, you must slice off some divine marrow every day, so I can eat my fill.\"","Upon hearing this, the Evil Baby grew enraged, and the surrounding atmosphere instantly became extremely oppressive.","Cut off the divine marrow?","What audacity!","This person is audaciously wicked and utterly unworthy of \"being subdued.\"","The Evil Baby’s hideous hand stretched, intending to summon the Evil God Demon Statue again to suppress Mo Hua, and then refine him to death bit by bit.","But unknowingly, Mo Hua had already raised his hand, saying quietly:","\"Kill!\"","Before the words faded, the killing formation surged.","Taking advantage of the conversation, Mo Hua had long since gathered his divine thought, prepared, and as the Evil Baby was filled with rage and heedlessness, suddenly attacked, manifesting the Li Mountain Fire Cremation Compound Formation that integrated trap and kill.","Mountains and stones rose, transforming into a cage.","Li Fire burned the mountain, flames as vast as the sea.","The Evil Baby was strong and could not be battled for long. To kill the enemy in one blow, Mo Hua held nothing back.","The compound formation, born of his immense divine thought, incinerated the entire altar realm, the flames vast and mighty, annihilating everything.","And as the flames stopped, the figure of the Evil Baby slowly emerged.","Its body was covered in charred spots, black blood mingling with black ash, wounds everywhere.","Its body, charred by the formidable power of the formation, became extremely hideous, and its gaze was filled with extreme anger.","This was a great disrespect, a great humiliation!","His divine soul must be cast into the three thousand great hells, tormented by karmic fire, devoured by demon monsters, to taste endless pain for all eternity!","\"Your formation is indeed not weak, but do you think this is enough to kill me?\"","The Evil Baby’s voice, due to anger, became fierce and cruel.","\"Of course not...\"","Mo Hua’s crisp voice rang out.","The Evil Baby was stunned, quickly turning its head, only to see Mo Hua had somehow appeared behind it, his eyes shining with brilliant golden light.","\"This is...\"","Chill spread in the Evil Baby’s heart.","\"Soul-Shocking Sword!\"","Mo Hua said softly.","Then the intense golden sword qi surged around him, weaving into a massive Sword Prison behind him.","The Sword Prison was stern and the sword qi sharp.","In an instant of the Evil Baby’s daze, it found itself trapped within the Sword Prison, hundreds and thousands of majestic sword lights slicing its divine body inch by inch.","Fear infiltrated its heart.","It wanted to struggle but couldn’t muster the courage to resist, as if its sins were so great that it should willingly offer its neck to the sword.","Taking advantage of the momentary chaos in the Evil Baby’s divine soul, Mo Hua condensed his right hand, forming a golden ancient short sword with \"Transforming Sword Skill.\"","With the short sword in hand, he approached the Evil Baby, gripping the neck of this just-hatched \"Divine Fetus\" of the Master of the Great Wilderness, and with a flash of golden light, pierced its skull with one sword strike."]},{"number":1662,"title":"Chapter 1662 - 860: Fetal Fusion","paragraphs":["The sword blade pierced through the skull, golden light gradually dispersed, slicing open the dark, filthy Evil Baby tainted with evil qi, black blood, and amniotic fluid-like impurity, bit by bit.","It was shocked, angry, terrified, but helpless.","The intimidation of the Soul-Shocking Sword still lingered, it couldn’t break free from Mo Hua’s hands that were strangling its throat. The astonishing Sword Intent condensed from Transforming Sword Skill pierced deeply into its skull, the Sword Qi was grinding it to death.","\"You... damn you...\"","The voice of the Evil Baby was filled with shrill screams.","Mo Hua remained indifferent, instead, he mobilized all his Divine Thoughts to gather stronger Sword Intent, infusing it entirely into the Sword of Divine Thought.","The embryo of the Evil God held innate memories, it must not be allowed to grow.","Therefore, he had to seize the opportunity, unleash his killing move, and with thunderous methods, utterly slay it.","The sword qi and black qi were intertwined.","It was unknown how long they remained locked in a stalemate, but finally, the Evil Baby lost its consciousness, a blank look, its pupils demising, no longer struggling, the black blood on its body gradually dried up, and the evil qi was annihilated bit by bit by the sword light.","Ultimately, it completely dissipated.","Mo Hua frowned, releasing his divine sense to perceive the surroundings, finding no eerie presence, only then did he feel slightly relieved.","Yet simultaneously, he had some doubts in his mind.","\"Is it dead already?\"","\"Body and soul both extinguished, even no ashes left?\"","Mo Hua shook his head:","\"The evil qi was eerie, even growing ram horns, I thought it was some formidable foe, turned out just this sort, an inexperienced little lamb... \"","Mo Hua snorted coldly, with some disdain.","Yet it was merely idle talk, deep down he knew clearly, this Evil Baby was the strongest Evil Mind Body he had encountered thus far.","The Divine Soul was bizarre and powerful, possessing innate heritage.","If it were truly allowed to grow for a while longer, mature, and complete its transformation, victory or defeat would be hard to say.","And even now, Mo Hua had already strangled this \"Evil Baby\" in the cradle, but he paid quite a price.","The injury to his Divine Soul worsened.","His divine sense was nearly exhausted.","If not for the Compound Formation of Divine Thoughts and the Soul-Shocking Sword and Transforming Sword Skill in Sword Transformation being held as his trump cards, utilized at critical moments to reverse the situation.","He might have fought until his strength was drained, yet might not have been able to slay this ram-horn Evil Baby.","And after the bitter battle, his Divine Soul started to ache faintly, and his Divine Thought was somewhat unsupported.","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","\"Better rest for a while...\"","Mo Hua muttered, then directly severed the connection with the Divine Authority Tree, his Divine Thought left the altar, returning to his own Sea of Consciousness.","In his Sea of Consciousness, with no evil demons disturbing, Mo Hua breathed a sigh of relief, then calmly began to meditate in sitting silence.","In the Sea of Consciousness, Mo Hua held his breath, calmed his mind, and sat quietly.","As he focused entirely, with closed eyes, peacefully meditating, his unsettled Divine Soul gradually calmed, and the over-consumed Divine Thought also began to recover bit by bit.","Yet in unnoticed corners.","Thin strands of black qi were gradually emerging.","This strand of black qi was extremely obscure, but also filled with intense evil thoughts, born from the void, gradually reviving, growing stronger, finally coalescing together, transforming into a pitch-black ram-horn monstrous snake, from behind Mo Hua, opened its mouth dripping black blood, suddenly biting down.","But before it could bite down, a delicate hand already grasped its neck.","Mo Hua, unknown when, had already opened his eyes, observing it curiously.","The ram-horned black snake struggled on its own.","Yet Mo Hua’s hand was like a vise, completely motionless.","Ultimately, the black qi directly dissipated, escaping from Mo Hua’s hand, regathered in the distance, again transformed into the entirely black, ram-horned, ugly and monstrous Evil Baby.","It looked at Mo Hua with venomous eyes, its voice gloomy:","\"You know I am attached to you?\"","Mo Hua remained silent.","He indeed knew, the Evil Baby was attached to him.","Just now in his perception, this Evil Baby was indeed killed by him, the Divine Soul extinguished, and not a trace of presence remained.","But Mo Hua knew, things were far from simple.","Having confronted the Evil God many times, some manifestations of Divine Remains were already quite troublesome, let alone this \"Divine Fetus\" with a more intense original aura.","It couldn’t be killed by just him alone.","Yet Mo Hua was somewhat puzzled.","This Evil Baby had attached to him... but where exactly?","Earlier, he repeatedly perceived many times, never detecting even the slightest breath of the Evil God.","If this were so, then the concealment and stealth ability of the Evil God were truly terrifying...","It’s likely there aren’t many cultivators in the same realm who can endure the Evil God’s \"infiltration\"...","Mo Hua’s expression turned a bit stern.","The Evil Baby saw Mo Hua in deep thought, ignoring it, somewhat angry, but after a while, it instead sneered coldly:","\"Out of nowhere to create a formation, Divine Thought into sword technique... In the inherited memories, you are indeed the most powerful among all low-level Divine Way entities.\"","\"Even some Second Grade Gods born with the Dao of the Earth are far inferior to you.\"","\"I am the Evil God, polluting degraded some gods not adept at killing, without even a hint of difficulty, but you, I have to admit, with my current yet-to-awaken abilities, I truly cannot kill you.\"","\"This is my acknowledgment of you, and you are worthy of pride.\"","Mo Hua pursed his lips, utterly unimpressed.","The Evil Baby’s forehead twitched, tolerating Mo Hua’s impoliteness.","The rudeness of the weak would be considered an offense.","The rudeness of the strong would always earn more tolerance.","After both fought till now, as the Divine Fetus of the Great Wilderness Evil God, the Evil Baby held more tolerance towards Mo Hua."]},{"number":1663,"title":"Chapter 1663 - 860: Fetal Fusion (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"I admit I can’t kill you, but you should also know, you can’t kill me either.\"","\"My Divine Soul originates from the Master of the Great Wilderness;\"","\"My existence spans tens of thousands of years;\"","\"My will, exists eternally within the Divine Way.\"","\"Once the Divine Fetus is formed, it is a seed of an Evil Path deity, just like the Evil God, undying and immortal...\"","\"This is my last time advising you, and it’s also the last chance I bestow upon you...\"","The Evil Baby’s face showed an irresistible majesty:","\"Surrender to me, and you will receive the gift of immortality; otherwise, you will surely fall into three thousand purgatories, your Divine Soul utterly destroyed!\"","Mo Hua casually said, \"I’ve already told you, I can submit to you, but you must give me some Divine Marrow to ’eat’ every day. You can’t bear to give up your Divine Marrow, and yet you want me to serve you for nothing, how could there be such a good thing?\"","The Evil Baby’s face was filled with killing intent. \"Too greedy, stubborn and wrongheaded.\"","It lost its patience, let out a chilling wail, and transformed into a semi-mature horned demon general, carrying a sinister wind, lunging at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua gripped with his right hand, congealing a Golden Sword, and charged up as well.","One person, one demon.","A demigod, and an Evil God, thus engaged in a fierce battle again within Mo Hua’s Sea of Consciousness.","For a time, demonic qi ran rampant, and Sword Qi danced wildly.","However, Mo Hua’s Divine Soul was injured, and his Divine Thought was insufficient.","The Evil Baby was not in good condition either, first being blasted by Mo Hua’s Li Mountain Fire Cremation Compound Formation, then intimidated by the Soul-shocking Sword, and finally pierced through the head by the Transforming Sword Skill, its injuries wouldn’t be lighter than Mo Hua’s.","Both sides were wounded, thus the scale of the fight was much smaller than before, but the peril was greater.","Finally, it is unknown how many rounds of fierce battle ensued.","Mo Hua, proficient in Divine Thought Skill, Formation, and Divine Thought into Sword, was indeed superior to the nascent Divine Fetus.","He exhausted the Divine Thought of the Divine Fetus, bound it with the Water Prison Technique, restrained it with the Golden Lock Formation, and then dealt with it little by little.","First with the Water and Fire Five Elements Skill.","Then the Five Elements Eight Trigrams Formation.","After that, the Divine Thought into sword True Jue.","Mo Hua used all sorts of means, one by one, on the Evil Baby.","When his Divine Thought was exhausted, Mo Hua would sit in meditation, recover a bit, then continue employing spells, formations, and sword techniques together, to ’torment’ the horned Evil Embryo.","He wanted to experiment to see if, without relying on external objects, he could purely rely on his own Divine Thought Power to inflict ’destructive’ harm on the ’Divine Fetus’ that was close to the Evil God’s origin.","But, as expected, he failed.","With the Divine Thought Techniques he currently mastered, even using all his means, he could at most eliminate the Evil God Power at the ’Divine Thought’ level.","The true Divine Soul, close to the Evil God’s origin, he simply couldn’t erase.","Mo Hua sighed.","\"Is it impossible...\"","The Evil Baby, suffering Mo Hua’s repeated ’humiliation’, was already furious beyond measure.","For countless years, no True God, Heavenly Demon, ghost, Evil Soul, or even Divine Practitioner had been able to subject it to such ’utter humiliation’!","This shame, it would forever remember within its Divine Soul.","The day its true body awakens, it is sure to command its multitude of believers, thousands of Demon Monsters, to spare no effort in capturing this little ghost, dissecting its soul, cutting its spirit, resurrecting it in endless suffering, to repay for the sins it committed!","Inwardly furious, it said with a sinister smile, \"There’s no need to waste your efforts, I told you, you can’t kill me.\"","Mo Hua nodded and sighed, \"Indeed, I can’t kill you...\"","Having said this, Mo Hua pinched the Evil Baby by the neck, lifting it, walked towards the center of his Sea of Consciousness.","The Evil Baby’s expression changed slightly, a sense of unease rising in its heart.","\"What are you going to do?\"","\"You’ll know in a moment,\" Mo Hua said indifferently.","He restrained the Evil Baby, brought it to the center of the Sea of Consciousness, then moved his Divine Thought slightly, communicating with that ancient existence.","Moments later, the voice of the Great Dao, resonant like a great bell, resounded.","In the center of the Sea of Consciousness, amidst the void, the ancient and incomplete Taoist Stele gradually appeared.","A vast and majestic Daoist aura rippled outward.","The Evil Baby’s expression changed dramatically, its voice trembling:","\"Dao...\"","The ancient memory within its talent made it feel that in front of this stone tablet, it was incredibly familiar, terrifyingly familiar, fearfully familiar...","But no matter how hard it tried to think, it couldn’t remember what this stone tablet was...","As if within it, existed a kind of taboo.","A terrifying taboo that even it, as an Evil God who lived for tens of thousands of years, dared not touch, dared not overstep, dared not interfere with.","Seeing the Evil Baby like this, Mo Hua was somewhat surprised. Then he deliberately paused, wanting to see if this Evil Baby might know something about the Taoist Stele’s origins.","But apparently, it didn’t know much either.","Mo Hua felt a bit disappointed, but after thinking it over, he let it go.","He didn’t want to prolong things any longer. They were deep within the Dragon King Temple, at the bottom of the White Bone Maze, and he had already spent too long with this Evil Baby. Prolonging would risk complications.","A quick resolution was needed.","Mo Hua planned to do another ’goat head barbecue’, using the Taoist Stele to suppress the Evil God, using Robbery Thunder to obliterate the Divine Soul, refine away the Evil Qi, and refine pure Divine Marrow.","It had been so long, he ought to enjoy something good.","However, the Evil Baby suddenly spoke:","\"I see... I understand now why my flesh, my bones, indeed containing my will, were utterly annihilated.\"","\"So it turns out, you possess such an ancient innate Treasure...\"","\"But if you think this can deal with me, you are still too young...\"","\"Always remember, in this world, not everything will go as you wish.\""]},{"number":1664,"title":"Chapter 1664 - 860: Fetal Fusion (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The Evil Baby chuckled sinisterly.","Its laughter was somewhat frightening.","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart, sensing something amiss. Without hesitation, he attempted to use the Robbery Thunder to completely wipe out the Evil Baby, but when he raised his hand, he found it empty.","\"Gone?\"","Mo Hua was shocked, immediately focusing inward. After some time, he discovered the Evil Baby had transformed into strands of black energy, infiltrating into his Divine Thought incarnation like blood.","And it wasn’t just that.","It was also penetrating into his Divine Soul, gradually merging with it!","By the time Mo Hua realized it, it was already too late. He found that the Fushi Soul among his Seven Souls had completely turned into a filthy black.","This was the color of the Evil God, a symptom of pollution.","Mo Hua’s expression changed, and he immediately activated the Soul-Shocking Sword to cleanse his Seven Souls with Sword Qi.","The other six souls could still be stimulated to cleanse the soul, but only the Fushi Soul remained unmoved, as if it no longer belonged to him and therefore did not obey his command.","At that moment, Mo Hua found himself speaking.","But these words were not his own; they were the Evil Baby, residing in his Seven Souls, using his voice.","Even his face involuntarily formed a venomous smile, akin to that of the Evil Baby.","His voice became sharp and piercing:","\"This Evil Soul Fusion Skill, merging the embryo into the soul, one Divine Fetus can only be used once. I didn’t intend to use it lightly...\"","\"But I never expected that such a great secret was hidden within you. Without using this origin Divine Skill, I’m afraid this Divine Fetus would meet the fate of soul death and Dao disappearance.\"","\"To have forced me to this point, you should be proud.\"","\"However, this is the end. My Divine Fetus has already merged into your Seven Souls and will gradually spread, ultimately integrating entirely with your Divine Soul, transforming you.\"","\"Then, you will be me, and I will be you.\"","\"You will become the embryo through which I descend into the world, becoming my ’woman’, becoming one of the true forms of the Master of the Great Wilderness...\"","Under the influence of the Evil Baby, Mo Hua couldn’t suppress himself and let out an owl-like laugh.","The next instant, Mo Hua quickly covered his mouth, rubbed his face to ensure his expression returned to normal, and then said with a cold smile:","\"Little lamb, you wish!\"","He activated the Seven Souls Shocking God Sword again, but still could not cleanse the polluted Evil Spirit.","He calmed himself through meditation.","But the Evil God’s embryo was hidden too deeply, nearly fused with his Divine Soul.","In the absence of using evil thoughts or deliberately affecting Mo Hua’s Taoist Heart, Mo Hua could barely notice it.","Kill it?","Mo Hua frowned.","The spell and formation power were insufficient; using Divine Thought into sword... to cut his own soul?","But the Evil Embryo had already become one with him. Even if he could cut, it might not be eliminated.","Besides, if he accidentally cut away one of his own souls, it would be a huge mishap.","Even if he survived, he might become a fool.","Use the Taoist Stele or Robbery Thunder?","Mo Hua considered it but found it was the same problem.","The Evil Embryo was fused into his Fushi Soul.","If it surfaced and he caught it, the Taoist Stele could suppress it, and the Robbery Thunder could destroy it.","But now it lay dormant, fused with his soul through this \"Evil Soul Fusion Skill,\" essentially becoming a part of him.","The Taoist Stele couldn’t suppress it.","Nor could he use the Robbery Thunder to destroy it.","Because destroying the Evil Embryo would mean destroying himself.","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart.","\"It seems really troublesome now...\"","Mo Hua frowned deeply, pondering and recalling all his Divine Dao Knowledge and Divine Dao techniques he had mastered, but he was still at a loss, without the slightest clue, and couldn’t help but gasp.","He really played himself this time...","Got himself entangled.","Mo Hua felt a headache.","Mainly, he hadn’t expected to be schemed against after so much meticulous planning, only to suddenly run into the Divine Fetus of an Evil God.","\"It can’t be such a coincidence; I must have been plotted against...\"","\"Who would plot against me? That Mr. Tu?\"","Mo Hua frowned, thought for a moment, nodded slightly, and found it quite possible.","He silently noted it down in his heart.","He could settle the score later, but the question was, what to do now?","Mo Hua pondered again with a frown, still with no solution, and could only sigh and temporarily compromise in the end.","\"Forget it, let’s get out first.\"","\"I’ll find a way outside, maybe inquire with Lord Yellow Mountain, or... come clean with Elder Master Xun? Tell them I’ve been possessed by an Evil God, and it’s not just any Evil God’s Remains, but a true Evil God’s Embryo?\"","\"I wonder if Elder Master Xun would slap me to death...\"","Mo Hua muttered to himself.","But in this situation, he had no other choice. After getting out, if all else failed, he could only seek out Elder Master Xun.","Just as Mo Hua was about to leave his Sea of Consciousness, he suddenly paused, feeling uneasy.","After a moment’s thought, he laid down a Divine Tao Array around his Divine Soul, sealing it to prevent the Evil Baby from suddenly causing trouble.","But with the Divine Soul sealed, the Soul-Shocking Sword couldn’t be used either.","Of course, the Soul-Shocking Sword required the use of the Seven Souls.","Now that one of his souls was polluted by the Evil Embryo, it was not advisable to use this Sword technique anymore.","Once the Soul-Shocking Sword was used, and the Seven Souls emerged from the body, the Evil Embryo lurking in the Fushi Soul would surely find an opportunity to deepen its infiltration and pollution of his Life Soul...","Mo Hua sighed again.","After sealing his Divine Soul and confirming there was no abnormality with the Evil Embryo, Mo Hua’s Divine Thought left the Sea of Consciousness and returned to reality.","Upon opening his eyes, he was still at the altar from before.","The altar in the nightmare had become a complete mess due to the struggle between Mo Hua and the Evil Baby.","The altar in reality, however, remained intact.","On the altar of white bone, eerie candles burned, with bloodstained offerings laid out.","Mr. Witch was also kneeling there.","Except, his Divine Soul had already been crushed by Mo Hua in the nightmare of the altar, leaving only a corpse.","Afraid that Uncle Gu would worry, Mo Hua initially wanted to leave quickly, but the more he thought about it, the angrier he became.","He had been ambushed.","Not only that, but his painstakingly cultivated Soul-Shocking Sword had been \"sealed\" just like that.","The more Mo Hua thought, the angrier he got, and the more he felt shortchanged.","He simply jumped back onto the altar, immersed his Divine Sense into the nightmare of the altar, and amidst the radiance of Dao Laws, he communicated with the Divine Authority Tree, taking control of the authority, and began \"vengefully\" targeting and consuming the countless Demon Monsters at the nodes of the Divine Authority Tree of the Great Wilderness’s master.","\"Dare to scheme against me... I’ll devour them all!\"","Previously, he had done it stealthily, afraid of being discovered.","Now, after the fight and taking the loss, having confronted the little fellow of the Master of the Great Wilderness and being schemed against, he was no longer behaving cautiously.","Fueled by anger, Mo Hua was unrestrained.","He intended to feast on a \"free meal\" greedily!","As he greedily devoured node after node, he suddenly paused.","He felt as though... he discovered a big one.","A familiar feeling came over him from one of the slightly familiar nodes, exuding a terrifying aura.","This seemed to be a pitch-black, unknown chaotic creation, a mixture of a Demigod, Evil God, and Demon Monster, emanating an eerie and chaos-filled aura."]},{"number":1665,"title":"Chapter 1665 - 861: Master","paragraphs":["\"What is... this thing?\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brows in thought for a moment, suddenly recalling that he had seen this thing before.","The first time he ’ordered a dish’ on the altar of the Blood-colored Fishing Village, he had perceived this peculiar and malformed yet very powerful node.","At that time, it was his first attempt at ordering, he was uncertain and wary of the strong evil Qi of this node, so he didn’t dare to choose it.","He never thought he would encounter it again now.","\"What exactly hides in the nightmare of this node... should I order it to take a look?\"","Mo Hua rested his chin in his hand, pondering for a moment, somewhat indecisive.","He sensed the node once again.","Previously, his perception was not deep, but now having achieved a small success in the Divine Way, and having the Evil Embryo ’possess’ him, he was considered a rare expert of the Divine Way in the Second Grade Realm.","Although this expert of the Divine Way had a very complex nature, half-human, half-god, and now a small part was an Evil God.","But it was precisely because of this that his perception of the ’Demon’ within this chaotic anomaly was clearer.","The Demon in this node had an evil and intricate aura, seemingly a mix of various types of flesh, diverse creatures, different demon monsters, all amalgamated with some embryo as the core.","It carried the aura of the Evil God, an aura so intense, it was, in some respects, not weaker than the Evil Embryo.","Yet simultaneously, it was filled with all sorts of filthy flesh, malformed evil thoughts, remnants of demon monsters, and even a wisp of... karmic mutation aura.","Mo Hua furrowed his brows again.","Before, he only thought of it as a ’big guy’.","But unexpectedly, this ’big guy’ might be much stronger than he had anticipated.","It seems he was right to be cautious before.","If back at the small fishing village altar, before his Divine Way was accomplished, without mastering Divine Thought into sword and the Divine Tao Array, rashly provoking this ’big guy’ would surely have spelled disaster...","Mo Hua sighed.","As expected, the Divine Way hides countless dangers, even with powers comparable to deities, he must still be cautious in the future.","Especially with this little lamb that caused him a big loss, he must learn from this for sure.","As for this ’big guy’, he’ll leave it be for now and deal with it when he becomes more powerful in the future...","Mo Hua silently told himself.","What’s more, when ordering dishes, he used Yu Er as ’bait’.","If the Demon is too strong, Yu Er’s danger increases accordingly.","It’s best to be more prudent.","With this thought, Mo Hua suddenly felt a bit of regret.","\"Acting on impulse, I ordered too much...\"","This time he fell into a scheme, got possessed by the Evil Embryo, acted out of anger, and ordered too many demon monsters.","These demon monsters would invade Yu Er’s nightmare, putting pressure on Yu Er.","Mo Hua felt a bit of heartache, \"Should I cancel some?\"","He sat on the altar again, communicating with the Divine Authority Tree, only to find that placing an order was easy, but cancellation was difficult, and altering the established nightmare path, reversing cause and effect, involved certain heavenly secret ways, even consuming a great deal of Divine Thought.","Mo Hua felt a bit dumbfounded.","But then he thought again and figured it should be alright.","Although his Divine Soul was polluted, and his Soul-Shocking Sword was ’sealed’, unable to exert its original power for the time being.","But the ones invading Yu Er’s nightmare were just ordinary demon monsters.","With the Dao Hua power of his Nineteen Patterns Divine Sense, even without relying on the complex Divine Thought into sword, and without utilizing the power of Divine Soul, he could easily crush these evil spirits.","Ordinary demon monsters didn’t deserve for him to use the Soul-Shocking Sword.","At that time, fighting and eating simultaneously, nurturing battle with battle, could also solve the consumption problem.","He just needed to think of ways to ensure Yu Er’s safety, it should not be a big issue.","Mo Hua nodded, preparing to leave the altar.","But just as he was about to leave, he suddenly noticed something peculiar about the altar.","Previously busy fighting with the Evil Embryo and ordering dishes, he had been focused and preoccupied.","Now that everything calmed down and the orders were finished, Mo Hua suddenly realized that there was something inherently odd about this altar.","When sitting on the altar, it seemed as if streams of evil desires were nourishing him.","But these desires weren’t strong.","Having practiced meditation techniques often, cleansing himself of evil thoughts, his Taoist Heart was clear, so upon encountering clinging desires, his instinct was to discard them.","But savoring them now in detail, these desires felt peculiar.","Lush and luxurious, greedy and murderous, angry and confused, unlike the evil thoughts of evil spirits, resembling more the manifestation of various inner desires of humans.","These desires, through certain cause and effect, flowed into the altar, nourishing Mo Hua.","No, it would be accurate to say they nourished the Evil Embryo, that had already merged into his Divine Soul.","Mo Hua pondered briefly before realizing.","He understood the causal logic behind how the Dragon King Temple’s altar operated.","The Evil Embryo was the owner of the Dragon King Temple.","Everything in this temple was meant to nurture this Evil Embryo, to transform and allow it to hatch into deity.","The Blood Pool was this Evil Embryo’s ’amniotic fluid’.","The temple guards and Mr. Witch were this Evil Embryo’s servants.","The Rouge Boat was this Evil Embryo’s ’rice bowl’.","And on the Rouge Boat, the various desires, greed, lust, delusion, karma, love, and hatred of the cultivators... all were ’bait’ for the Evil Embryo.","Now that the Evil Embryo had merged into his Divine Soul, these ’baits’ refined from human desires were now nourishing him.","Not only that...","Mo Hua tasted carefully, discovering that what nourished him wasn’t just desire, but also some distinctly more bloody, more brutal, more cold, laden with sins and cause-effect.","It was as if someone, acting upon his ’command’, committed various killings."]},{"number":1666,"title":"Chapter 1666 - 861: Master_2","paragraphs":["The killings also condense into a \"Cause and Effect\" containing Sin, nourishing and incubating itself, which is the incubation of the \"Evil Embryo\".","He didn’t understand the crux of the matter before, but now that he has transformed into the \"Evil Embryo\", experiencing it personally, everything has become much clearer.","\"Desires turn into flesh, Cause and Effect into bones.\"","\"This is... the Dao Hua method for cultivating the Evil Embryo and transforming it into an Evil God.\"","\"The ’desires’ come from the Rouge Boat, but where do the Causes and Effect of these ’sins’ come from?\"","Mo Hua frowned, then his thoughts shifted slightly, and his Divine Thought withdrew from the nightmare. He searched around the altar in reality several times and finally found an odd object on the offering table in front of the altar.","It was a wordless Blood Tablet.","The tablet was soaked in fresh blood but had no writing.","It seemed as if someone had dipped in fresh blood and written something on it.","But the writing on this tablet wasn’t meant for \"people\" to see. Thus, after it was written, it merged with the blood into the tablet.","This was more like a \"Divine Soul\" contract.","Others couldn’t see it, but Mo Hua could.","Though very faint, he could vaguely see the writing on the seemingly wordless Blood Tablet.","The writing was a series of names.","Mo Hua looked at it and suddenly felt a sinking feeling in his heart, quickly taking out a Jade Slip from the Storage Bag.","This Jade Slip was precisely Boss Jiang’s list.","It was also the blood alliance list of those Sin Cultivators, led by the Fire Buddha and Water Yama.","The names on the two lists were almost identical.","\"So this is the root...\"","Mo Hua finally figured out what this list was used for.","This was a \"soul contract\".","Sin Cultivators made a blood alliance and left their names on the list, equivalent to selling their Divine Soul and offering it to the Evil God.","In this way, all their crimes, all the killings, would be transmitted to the altar through a certain type of Cause and Effect, offered to the Evil God, gradually nourishing the Evil Embryo, making the Evil God stronger.","But this secret, these Sin Cultivators themselves might not know.","Moreover, there’s one more thing...","On the surface, this was just a \"list\".","It was a Sin Cultivators’ \"alliance\" list, a list of upper-level \"protection\", a list showing loyalty to the Master of the Great Wilderness.","But they surely didn’t know that this was actually a \"death\" list.","Because Mo Hua could sense a breath of Divine Soul from the names on the wordless Blood Tablet.","When signing this list, these Sin Cultivators actually severed a part of their Life Soul and offered it to the Master of the Great Wilderness.","The Master of the Great Wilderness grasps their Life Soul, in other words, controls their life and death.","Once a Sin Cultivator betrays, through this \"soul contract\" list, the Master of the Great Wilderness can let them die with a single thought.","\"Indeed, those who consort with the Evil God are surely doomed to a bad end...\"","\"Their lives pinched in someone else’s hands, they probably don’t even know...\"","Mo Hua shook his head and sighed.","He wanted to study a bit further but suddenly heard a \"boom\", the ground shook, as if something was banging against the inner hall’s door.","Mo Hua’s heart leapt.","\"Someone broke in?\"","\"No...\" Mo Hua suddenly remembered, \"Is it Uncle Gu and the others trying to rescue me?\"","He was shocked to realize that after a fierce battle and a hearty meal and studying the altar for a long time, he didn’t know how much time had passed.","Uncle Gu and the others must be anxious by now.","\"Better get out first...\"","But when he looked up, he found himself at the bottom of the Blood Pool. The blood in the Blood Pool had been drained, now a deep pit, pitch-black on all sides, with no way out.","\"How to get out?\"","Mo Hua frowned.","And at the moment he had this thought, the altar lit up, as if a Formation within was activated in the dark. Mechanisms turned, bones and stones interlocked, a dull sound echoed.","The massive altar, supporting Mo Hua, slowly rose, like bearing its master.","Mo Hua took a slight breath of cool air.","\"Is this altar... listening to me?\"","\"No, it’s not just this altar, but... the entire Dragon King Temple?\"","Mo Hua frowned, pondering.","The Evil Embryo is the owner of the Dragon King Temple.","And now, the Evil Embryo has integrated into his Divine Soul.","The Evil Embryo is me.","I am the Evil Embryo.","In other words, now I am... the master of the Dragon King Temple?","Mo Hua’s jaw dropped, his heart filled with shock.","...","Outside the White Bone Maze.","Many Cultivators gathered together, including Enforcement Leaders wearing Taoist Court Robes, as well as Cultivators from outside the Taoist Court, from the Gu family and the Xia family.","They formed teams of ten, creating formations, with Runes, Spiritual Artifacts, and Spells being used, taking turns to bombard the arched door of the inner core.","Rumbling sounds, one after another, dust rose everywhere, the ground trembled, and stones crumbled.","But no matter what methods they tried, they could never breach the door.","Gu Changhuai was anxious, and Xia Canonical Official was also worried.","Time ticked away, the ancient arched door, after dozens of attacks, remained unmoved, not even a gap in the door was opened.","The hearts of the people grew cold bit by bit.","Gu Changhuai finally sighed deeply, remorsefully saying: \"Inform the Taixu Gate, Mo Hua, he might...\"","Gu Changhuai couldn’t finish.","He, who was always cold to others, now looked exceptionally desolate.","Xia Canonical Official beside him also showed sadness in his eyes.","The others received the order and began to pack up, preparing to retreat.","But just then, a dull \"boom\" sounded, accompanied by the sound of bone and stone grinding...","Everyone’s expression changed slightly.","They quickly turned their heads and saw the door, which hadn’t been blasted open by any methods, formations, Runes, Spells, or Spiritual Artifacts, now slowly opened on its own..."]},{"number":1667,"title":"Chapter 1667 - 861: Master_3","paragraphs":["A bizarre, tense atmosphere spread out.","It seemed as if something was about to emerge...","This door wouldn’t open easily, unless...","Everyone felt a shiver in their hearts, as if facing a formidable enemy.","Yet the imagined, powerful and bloodthirsty enemy residing deep within the hall did not appear.","From the crack in the door, a head poked out.","It was Mo Hua.","He looked left and right, only to find a large crowd densely packed outside.","At this moment, all eyes simultaneously turned to Mo Hua.","Feeling a bit embarrassed under so many gazes, Mo Hua scratched his head awkwardly and said shyly, \"Why is it so lively...\"","Everyone was in a daze, their thoughts momentarily scattered.","...","In a side hall of the Dragon King Temple.","With no one else around, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official checked Mo Hua from head to toe, finding no injuries or mental instability on him, and only then did they truly breathe a sigh of relief.","Of course, Mo Hua was indeed quite different now, but they couldn’t see it.","Xia Canonical Official gave Mo Hua a deep look, suddenly pulling him into her arms and patting his back, her voice trembling a bit:","\"It’s good you’re okay...\"","It was unclear whether she was comforting Mo Hua or herself.","She was a Supervisor, with a strong sense of responsibility.","On the surface, Mo Hua was trapped in the inner hall to save them, and if anything truly unfortunate had happened, she would feel guilty for life.","Mo Hua was somewhat surprised, yet also touched.","Though Xia Canonical Official appeared cold, she actually had a soft heart.","Gu Changhuai was also relieved.","If anything had happened to Mo Hua, it would have been hard to explain to the Taixu Gate, Cousin Wan’er, Aunt Gu Hong, and himself.","\"It’s good you’re okay...\"","Gu Changhuai also murmured.","After calming down and seeing that Mo Hua was safe, with no one else around, Gu Changhuai then asked curiously:","\"Where is Mr. Witch? Did he do anything to you? What happened inside?\"","Mo Hua was prepared, so he said partly truthfully:","\"Mr. Witch seemed to want to offer me to something, but maybe I got lucky, as Mr. Witch suddenly died during the ritual, and I managed to escape...\"","Gu Changhuai: \"...\"","After a moment of silence, Gu Changhuai said somewhat helplessly, \"That’s it?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"That’s it.\"","\"Suddenly died?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua said, \"very suddenly, it was just in the blink of an eye.\"","He was killed by me...","Gu Changhuai looked at Mo Hua and sighed, \"Alright.\"","Xia Canonical Official’s expression was also somewhat subtle.","She certainly hoped Mo Hua had great fortune and emerged unscathed from peril, but didn’t expect this kind of \"emerge unscathed.\"","This luck is simply defying heaven...","Or maybe Mo Hua wasn’t telling the truth?","However, at this point, neither of them had the heart to pursue the matter. In any case, coming back safe and sound was what mattered.","Mo Hua glanced around and asked, \"Where are Senior Brother Feng and Senior Sister Qianqian?\"","Gu Changhuai said, \"I initially wanted to send them back to the Sect, but with your life uncertain, they refused to leave.\"","\"I didn’t dare to keep them in the inner hall, as it’s perilous and unpredictable, and if anything happened to them, a Taixu Gate, a Tai’a Sect, a Hundred Flower Valley—if the three were added together, it would be even harder to explain.\"","Just thinking about it gave Gu Changhuai a headache.","\"So I had them wait at the entrance; they should be coming over now.\"","After a while, Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian indeed came over.","Upon seeing Mo Hua, both of their faces lit up with joy.","Even the usually composed Ouyang Feng couldn’t resist giving Mo Hua a hug and patting his shoulder.","\"Junior Brother Mo...\"","Ouyang Feng was emotionally stirred, his body trembling slightly, with countless words but unable to speak. After calming down for a moment, he released Mo Hua, clasped his hands in respect, and solemnly said:","\"Junior Brother Mo, words cannot express my gratitude!\"","\"Senior Brother Feng, you’re too kind...\"","Before Mo Hua could finish, he was enveloped in a fragrant scent and embraced by Hua Qianqian.","When Mo Hua’s fate was unknown, Hua Qianqian had put on a brave face, but now seeing him safe, she couldn’t help but tear up.","\"Junior Brother Mo, it’s so good you’re alright...\"","She even wiped her tears and snot on Mo Hua.","Mo Hua could only comfort her back, \"I’m fine, don’t worry, Senior Sister...\"","In any case, this trip to the Dragon King Temple was a close call with no mishaps.","Everyone was safe and sound.","The three caught up for a while, then Mo Hua asked Gu Changhuai to send Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian back to the Sect.","As the three parted, Mo Hua secretly reminded them:","\"Senior Brother Feng, Senior Sister Qianqian, remember, do not mention anything about the Rouge Boat and the Dragon King Temple to anyone...\"","\"I’ve already informed the Taoist Court, and Uncle Gu and Xia Canonical Official will also keep it secret and won’t speak of this incident.\"","\"As for the Dragon King Temple, it’s easier to explain. If someone insists on asking, say you happened to pass by and came to the rescue with the Taoist Court.\"","\"But as for the Rouge Boat, you’ve never been there, and never mention it again...\"","Otherwise, even if you jump into the Yellow River, you won’t be able to wash it clean...","Mo Hua’s gaze was solemn.","Ouyang Feng and Hua Qianqian stiffened a bit and looked at Mo Hua gratefully, both nodding.","After that, Mo Hua watched the two depart on the Gu family’s small boat, leaving the Dragon King Temple.","Mo Hua then turned back to find Gu Changhuai again.","Seeing Mo Hua, Gu Changhuai was a bit surprised, \"You’re not leaving?\"","Mo Hua said, \"I want to search the Dragon King Temple once more.\"","\"Search the temple?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","With everyone present, and the Taoist Court’s manpower abundant, he wanted to search the Dragon King Temple thoroughly from start to finish.","He felt that, given its name \"Dragon King Temple,\" the temple should have something to do with \"dragons.\"","Moreover, he had now integrated the Evil Embryo.","In a sense, this ancient Dragon King Temple was already his.","As the owner, he needed to \"inventory\" his temple."]},{"number":1668,"title":"Chapter 1668 - 862: Dragon Bone","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai thought for a moment and then nodded in agreement.","Mo Hua always had his considerations when doing things.","Although Gu Changhuai couldn’t figure out Mo Hua’s exact intentions, based on his past experiences, listening to Mo Hua generally wouldn’t lead to anything bad.","Furthermore, the Dragon King Temple indeed needed to be investigated.","The sooner the better; if actions were delayed, and others intervened, who knows what this Dragon King Temple would become.","\"Are we still doing it like before, digging three feet deep, not missing a single brick or tile?\"","Gu Changhuai asked, knowing Mo Hua’s way of doing things.","\"Yes.\"","Mo Hua nodded, but halfway through, he repeatedly shook his head, \"No, that’s not right... we need to be gentler this time.\"","\"Gentler?\" Gu Changhuai was stunned, \"Why?\"","Because now this Dragon King Temple belongs to me!","Mo Hua silently thought to himself.","But he couldn’t say this out loud. With a twinkle in his eye, he said, \"I suspect there are some ’filthy things’ hidden here.\"","\"Filthy things?\"","\"Things on the level of Divine Thought, like ghosts or evil spirits... Isn’t that Mr. Witch always talking about the Divine Lord? Even if that Divine Lord isn’t an Evil God, it’s still a big evil spirit. So we should be cautious to avoid disturbing any unknowns and causing disaster...\"","Mo Hua said with a solemn expression.","Gu Changhuai didn’t quite believe in things like the Evil God before.","But spending time with Mo Hua, who was full of mysterious talk, he had somewhat changed his perception.","He was in a state of \"half-believing, half-doubting\" and \"possibly believable, possibly not.\"","Because some bizarre things were indeed gradually surpassing his understanding...","\"Alright.\" Gu Changhuai nodded.","Thus, under Mo Hua’s guidance, a group of cultivators from the Taoist Court, including those from the Gu Family and the Xia family, began the \"cleansing\" of the Dragon King Temple.","\"This is an ancient temple, we need to be gentle, be careful, do not damage any bricks or tiles...\"","\"Those filthy flesh must be cleaned away...\"","\"The filthy Evil Formation must be dismantled, to be used as evidence...\"","\"What can’t be dismantled should not be forcefully removed, leave it for now.\"","...","Mo Hua \"issued commands\" through Gu Changhuai.","These things, he couldn’t do alone; once he left the Dragon King Temple, he wouldn’t find so many people to help with his chores.","So he had no choice but to use the Taoist Court’s hand to tidy up the temple.","Inside the Dragon King Temple, the flesh was cleared, the Evil Formation was cleaned, and the ruins were gradually being cleared.","After about half a day, the entire Dragon King Temple was \"renewed\".","Although not immaculate or solemn, compared to its previous bloody and ominous aura, it was much improved.","Mo Hua also took the opportunity to thoroughly inspect the Dragon King Temple.","From some traces, it seemed indeed to be an ancient temple that had been around for many years.","It might have existed even before the Great Wilderness Evil God erected the altar.","And the Dragon King Temple itself was not built to worship the \"Evil Embryo\" but truly to honor the \"River Dragon King\".","The Great Wilderness Evil God merely \"usurped the nest\", occupying this Dragon King Temple on the Mistwater River to nourish the Divine Fetus.","However, the present-day Dragon King Temple was already quite dilapidated.","Before he arrived, many of the temple buildings had been destroyed.","Connecting it to what Mr. Witch mentioned earlier, Mo Hua speculated that it seemed to be because the mastermind predicted the Divine Lord’s great enemy—him—would come.","So, the one behind it all simply \"Fortified and Cleared the Field\", ordered everything to be dismantled, and people were killed to be refined into Blood Zombies. Mr. Witch voluntarily martyred himself, transforming into a \"yaksha\".","Although ultimately unable to stop him, as a result, the things remaining in the Dragon King Temple were quite limited.","Mo Hua also examined the White Bone Maze.","This maze was similarly constructed following a special mystery formation.","Similar to the Bronze Maze in the Bi Mountain Demon Cavern, its formation patterns, formation pivot, and overall formation structure have quite an ingenious similarity.","Mo Hua even suspected that these mystery formations were actually two derivative formations of a complete formation.","Similar mystery formations and the mazes built upon them should exist in various places around the Qian Learning State Boundary.","But this mystery formation was something he couldn’t decipher for now.","With limited time, he couldn’t stay here indefinitely studying the mystery formation.","He had a more important matter to investigate.","And that was the \"Dragon\".","Ever since he fused with the Evil Embryo, temporarily becoming the owner of the Dragon King Temple, he could perceive a strong aura of \"dragon\" cause and effect deep within the temple.","Following this aura, Mo Hua left the maze, bypassed the inner hall, and discovered a side door, hidden among ruins, on the other side of the inner hall.","This side door was blocked by a giant stone.","Mo Hua then asked the cultivators from the Gu Family to clear away the giant stone.","After clearing the stone, as expected, they found a large White Bone Gate, heavily obstructed by formations and mechanisms.","The formations were complex, the mechanisms perilous, the gate was sturdy, and there was no key.","If it were someone else, they would find it nearly impossible to open.","But Mo Hua wasn’t an outsider; he was now the \"owner\".","With a gentle push, accompanied by the rustling fall of gray stone, the heavy White Bone Gate slowly opened to welcome its master.","Behind the White Bone Gate was a vast grand hall.","This grand hall was taller than any temple Mo Hua had seen before.","However, the interior of the hall was empty, with nothing inside.","As if fearing something might be noticed, the murals had been erased, the statues dismantled, the floor re-laid, and the carved beams and painted rafters had been covered by gray stone."]},{"number":1669,"title":"Chapter 1669 - 862: Dragon Bone","paragraphs":["Mo Hua pondered for a moment, with a faint guess in his heart.","This hall should be the true... Dragon King Hall.","Because it enshrines the \"Dragon King,\" it needs to be built tall, wide, majestic, and solemn.","\"But what about the things inside? Have they all been destroyed?\"","Mo Hua frowned.","This Evil God truly is squandering treasures, a perfectly good Dragon King Hall, ruined beyond recognition.","More importantly, nothing was left for himself...","Unwilling, Mo Hua walked around the hall, still finding nothing, and just as he was about to leave, he suddenly sensed a trace of a divine soul wave, ancient and with a faint \"sacred\" meaning.","He was startled in his heart and quickly turned his head to look.","The source of the divine soul wave was an inconspicuous little corner of the hall, empty, seemingly with nothing there.","Mo Hua’s brows furrowed even tighter.","He walked slowly towards that corner.","But as soon as he approached the corner, Mo Hua suddenly froze, scratching his head with some confusion, looking at a loss.","\"What... am I doing here?\"","Mo Hua was puzzled, shook his head, turned to leave, and after taking just two steps, he suddenly awoke, immediately turned his head, and stared at that corner, shocked in his heart:","Something’s wrong!","This place is hiding a big secret!","It could even deceive himself, to a certain extent, twisting his perception as half-human, half-demigod, even \"half-Evil God.\"","Unconvinced, he walked towards the corner again.","But as soon as he got close, his expression again became dazed, as if he forgot his purpose and started to turn away again.","After some time walking, he suddenly awoke again, still not convinced, headed towards the corner.","Not far away, a few cultivators from the Gu Family, following Gu Changhuai’s command to protect Mo Hua, saw him moving back and forth in that corner like hitting a ghost wall, exchanging glances with confusion.","But they dared not speak to disturb him.","After all, Young Master Mo’s actions have always been a bit peculiar.","After several rounds of this, Mo Hua knew this wouldn’t do, so he began implanting \"suggestions\" in his Taoist Heart, planting a thought:","\"Go to the corner, go to the corner...\"","\"Don’t look back, don’t look back...\"","Mo Hua recited this several times in his heart, then continued forward.","And this \"Planting Devil in Taoist Heart\" indeed proved useful.","Whenever he stopped, dazed and without a goal, a thought would surface in his mind: \"Go to the corner.\"","This way, he had a direction.","And whenever he tried to turn back, he would remember \"don’t look back,\" thus stepping forward with determination.","Mo Hua made himself into his \"puppet,\" executing his will with firm purpose.","Just like this, stopping and starting, intending to turn back but halting, stumbling along, Mo Hua finally reached the corner.","The moment he stepped into the corner, all obstacles and confusion in his Divine Sense vanished.","Mo Hua’s eyes cleared, and with a steady gaze, found that an unnoticed small sculpture was lying in this inconspicuous little corner.","The statue was made of white bone.","Mo Hua looked closer and was suddenly startled, realizing something was off.","This bone, snow-white and crystalline, curled delicately with fine cloud patterns, appeared incredibly hard, an ancient and sacred aura wafting around it.","This was not a human bone, but...","Dragon Bone!","Dragon Bone Sculpture!","Mo Hua was deeply shocked.","To cast a sculpture with Dragon Bone...","His thoughts surged unpredictably, and after a long time, he retrieved a term from memory:","Lifebound Divine Statue!","This was a deity’s Lifebound Divine Statue!","And most likely the Lifebound Divine Statue of the Dragon God enshrined in this ancient Dragon King Temple!","Mo Hua took a deep breath.","This thing is truly terrifying...","He immediately wanted to store this Lifebound Dragon Bone Divine Statue in his storage ring but tried several times and found it impossible.","A Lifebound Divine Statue is a deity’s origin.","Such a thing carries great cause and effect, with overwhelming interference, inherently repelling the Void Law, so it can’t be stored in a storage space.","\"What to do then? Just carry it like this?\"","Unable to find another way, Mo Hua reached out to touch it.","The divine statue trembled, an ancient aura surged forth, but dissolved automatically upon encountering Mo Hua, seemingly not rejecting him.","Mo Hua sighed in relief, cradling the Dragon Bone Divine Statue in his arms as he walked out of the hall.","The Gu Family cultivators were confused, \"Young Master Mo, why are you walking like that?\"","\"Like what?\"","\"As if you’re carrying something...\"","As if...","Mo Hua was startled, \"You can’t see it?\"","\"See what?\"","Mo Hua lowered his head, looking at the Dragon Bone Sculpture in his arms, then at the bewildered expressions around, shaking his head:","\"Nothing.\"","He adjusted his posture, holding the Dragon Bone Sculpture properly, so it didn’t appear he was carrying anything.","Luckily, the divine statue wasn’t large nor heavy, making it easy for him to carry.","\"Young Master Mo, do you still need to inspect this hall?\"","\"No need to inspect anymore, no need...\"","Mo Hua waved his hand.","All the good stuff was clutched in his arms, what else is there to check.","\"This place has been emptied, there’s nothing at all, let’s leave.\" Mo Hua feigned regret.","The others didn’t suspect anything and left the Dragon King Hall with Mo Hua.","After leaving the hall, Mo Hua had a sudden thought and went over to sway in front of Gu Changhuai.","Upon seeing this, Gu Changhuai asked, \"Are you completely done searching?\"","\"Just a little more to go.\" Mo Hua replied.","Gu Changhuai nodded, saying no more.","Mo Hua looked at Gu Changhuai, now certain in his heart:"]},{"number":1670,"title":"Chapter 1670 - 862: Dragon Bone","paragraphs":["\"Uncle Gu can’t see it either...\"","In this entire Dragon King Temple, it seems I’m the only one who can see this Lifebound Dragon Bone Divine Statue.","Should I tell Uncle Gu about the statue?","After all, we’re all on the same side. During the journey to the Dragon King Temple, Uncle Gu and Xia Canonical Official provided quite a bit of help.","However, Mo Hua pondered for a moment and decided against it.","Since they can’t see it, telling them would be pointless.","Moreover, I’m now the master of the Dragon King Temple, and logically, everything here should belong to me.","Mo Hua collected the Lifebound Dragon Bone Divine Statue with a clear conscience.","He found a package and wrapped the statue in it, carrying it openly on his shoulder, yet even so, no one found it unusual.","It seemed that everyone subconsciously ignored the statue, along with its package.","This was a kind of \"invisibility\" akin to a Heavenly Mechanism Technique.","Not seeing what was in plain sight, not hearing what was said aloud.","Mo Hua became increasingly convinced of his suspicion.","This statue definitely had a significant origin.","Afterward, Mo Hua wandered around the vicinity for a while, but there were no other discoveries, so he prepared to head back home.","Before leaving, he manipulated the White Bone Maze to hide the altar.","This altar still had its uses for him and couldn’t be destroyed just yet.","Likewise, considering this altar had already been exposed, the Master of the Great Wilderness was unlikely to use it again, likely severing the connection to prevent me from stealing its authority.","With the White Bone Maze as an obstacle, even if the Taoist Court came to investigate, they might not be able to reach the altar deep within.","Gu Changhuai also heeded Mo Hua’s \"suggestion\" and resealed the inner hall’s doors to prevent anyone from accidentally stumbling into the White Bone Maze, becoming food for the blood zombies, or sacrifices for the Evil Demons.","For now, matters here came to a temporary halt, and Mo Hua prepared to leave afterward.","He had stayed in the Dragon King Temple for far too long.","Now that everything was ready, he could return to the Sect to prepare for a grand feast.","Gu Changhuai felt somewhat uneasy about Mo Hua, fearing he might cause some trouble at the last minute, so he planned to personally escort Mo Hua back to Taixu Gate to prevent any accidents on the road.","Accompanying them was Xia Canonical Official.","He also needed to return to the Taoist Court to handle the aftermath of the Rouge Boat incident, including matters regarding the Dragon King Temple and Xiao Zhenhai.","Xiao Tianquan was also on the same boat.","And so, the group boarded a small boat, leaving the Dragon King Temple, sailing into the misty waters of the Mistwater River.","...","Meanwhile, in a sect akin to a palace of jade and jadeite.","Disguised as \"Elder Shen,\" and usually refined and gentle, Mr. Tu, was in his Elder’s Residence, fiddling with a Sheep Bone Compass, his face gloomy as he muttered to himself.","\"I exhausted all my efforts to set up this grand scheme, yet still... it didn’t go as planned.\"","\"Sealing off the Dragon King Temple, isolating outsiders, massacring the temple guards, refining them into blood zombies, turning Mr. Witch into a yaksha, even having the Divine Lord’s Fetus descend didn’t stop it, couldn’t capture this Fierce God, truly incomprehensible...\"","\"This Fierce God, how terrifying it is...\"","Mr. Tu’s eyes were cold as he sighed slightly.","\"However... it’s okay, even though the situation isn’t looking too optimistic, it was within my expectations.\"","\"The Evil God’s Embryo is nearly immortal.\"","\"As long as one is parasitized by the Divine Fetus, the Divine Soul will gradually become polluted, transformed, and eventually completely assimilated, becoming an embryo hatched by the Divine Lord.\"","\"No one, no god, is exempt.\"","Mr. Tu grinned fiercely, showing his bloodless teeth.","He still remembered the initial fear when a wisp of his soul was chased by this faceless Fierce God wielding a Golden Sword in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons.","But now, the tables have turned.","The Fierce God also finally fell into his trap once.","Even just this one time, it caused serious harm, deeply affecting its soul, likely being beyond redemption.","Even if this Fierce God could resist the \"pollution\" and \"corruption\" of the Divine Master, and didn’t fall into an Evil Embryo, it would be years, decades, or even centuries before it could wield the power of the Divine Soul again.","Unable to wander outside.","It could only hide in the Taixu Gate like a mouse, or in some temple, licking its wounds on its Divine Soul, living in constant fear, no longer able to obstruct the Divine Master’s grand plan.","When he awakens, the entire Qianxue State Boundary will have become a bloody purgatory.","And this \"false god\" will be forever suppressed by the awakened Divine Master!","Mr. Tu let out a laughter as cold as a night owl’s.","But as he laughed, he felt his heart was bleeding.","Especially when he looked at the Sheep Bone Compass, at the myriad of demons under the dominion of the false god’s authority, bound to perish, Mr. Tu felt intense pain.","Nurturing Demon Monsters was no easy feat.","These Demon Monsters were the result of years of his labor.","It seemed that when the Fierce God realized it had been plotted against, its fury was truly terrifying.","However, everything was worth it.","Mr. Tu took a deep breath, a glint of sharpness flashing in his eyes.","\"Having dealt with this Fierce God, we can continue to push forward with the subsequent plans...\"","\"Giving up the Dragon King Temple, since it has been searched through a hundred times over the centuries, there’s nothing worthwhile left inside.\"","\"The connection to the altar has also been severed to prevent any more leakage of the Divine Master’s authority.\"","\"It’s a pity about the Rouge Boat, but once discovered, there’s no helping it. Paper cannot wrap fire forever.\"","\"Since the Xia family arrived, you must let them have a share, give them some merit, otherwise, you cannot appease this passing fierce tiger.\"","\"The real show is only just beginning...\"","Mr. Tu’s mouth curled into a knowing smile.","...","On the Mistwater River.","Mo Hua was on the small boat, looking at the reflection of the moon in the water, still contemplating about the Rouge Boat and the Dragon King Temple.","Especially the Dragon Bone Divine Statue he had just obtained.","Everyone on the boat was lost in their thoughts, not making a sound.","The small boat sailed silently.","Uncertain how much time had passed, Mo Hua’s Divine Thought stirred, suddenly raising his head to look into the deep night in the distance, his expression wary.","\"A ship?\"","Or a large ship?","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official noticed it too and slowly stood, gripping their swords.","A moment later, a luxurious Spirit Boat emerged, breaking through the waves from the distant darkness, adorned with understated lights.","High above the Spirit Boat flew a flag, embroidered with the dignified and noble character \"Xia,\" exuding an air of authority in the night.","Xia Canonical Official breathed a sigh of relief, \"It’s Uncle’s boat.\"","\"Uncle?\" Mo Hua was startled.","Gu Changhuai’s expression was somewhat solemn, \"It’s Master Xia... an Inspector from the Central Dao Court, Feather Transformation Realm.\""]},{"number":1671,"title":"Chapter 1671 - 863: True and False","paragraphs":["Since it was Master Xia’s ship, both emotionally and logically, we should go and greet him, ask how he is, and report on the affairs of the Taoist Court.","Xia Canonical Official called out a few times, then someone on the ship deactivated the Formation and opened the deck, allowing everyone to board.","Once on the ship, Mo Hua looked around and felt indeed, this was worthy of being the Spirit Boat of Master Xia from the Xia family—majestic and luxurious, yet understated and reserved.","Before long, a man clad in a white Taoist Robe embroidered with gold and jade Patterns, accompanied by several cultivators of the Xia family, emerged.","This man was tall and erect, his gaze cold and stern, exuding a heavy air of authority, and his aura was vast like an abyss or a towering mountain.","\"Feather Transformation...\"","Mo Hua secretly felt a chill in his heart.","This man was the Inspector of the Xia family, leading this endeavor, giving orders from behind the scenes, and managing the situation.","Everyone stepped forward to pay their respects, Master Xia nodded slightly, then looked towards everyone with an indifferent expression.","Especially when he saw Gu Changhuai, his attitude appeared particularly cold.","He was still fairly amicable towards Xia Canonical Official, but unexpectedly nodded towards Xiao Tianquan.","As for Mo Hua, he only glanced at him lightly, not taking him seriously at all.","Mo Hua, however, was relieved, touched the Dragon Bone Sculpture he carried and thought to himself that this Master Xia too was ’blind with open eyes,’ unable to recognize good things.","Master Xia glanced at everyone again and indifferently said, \"Regarding the Rouge Boat affair, thank you for your efforts. I happen to be returning to the mansion and can give you all a ride.\"","After saying this, Master Xia then spoke to Xia Canonical Official: \"Ronger, come with me for a moment.\"","Xia Canonical Official cupped his hand in respect: \"Yes, uncle.\"","Afterwards, Xia Canonical Official followed Master Xia and headed towards the cabin.","Mo Hua secretly asked Gu Changhuai, \"Uncle Gu, is Xia Canonical Official’s name ’Ronger’?\"","Gu Changhuai frowned and ignored Mo Hua.","It was Xiao Tianquan, on the other hand, who stared at the back of Xia Canonical Official thoughtfully, lost in a trance.","...","In the elegant cabin.","Master Xia was seated at the table drinking tea, while Xia Canonical Official stood respectfully across.","\"Xiao Zhenhai is dead?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"What about the body?\"","\"It’s already in a wretched state, with flesh blurred; it was collected by the Taoist Court and should be shipped back tomorrow...\"","Master Xia replied with a mild \"Hmm,\" then after some time added:","\"Since he’s dead, all matters of the Xiao family should be attributed to Xiao Zhenhai. All responsibility should be borne by him alone.\"","Xia Canonical Official furrowed his brow, \"Uncle...\"","Master Xia gave him a glance.","Xia Canonical Official hesitated to speak.","Master Xia gently sipped his tea, \"Speak if you have something to say.\"","Only then did Xia Canonical Official ask: \"Are you planning to favor the Xiao Family?\"","Master Xia nodded, not concealing it at all, \"The Xiao family is quite perceptive, having operated in the Qian Learning State Boundary for many years, with decent influence, network, and foundations. Since they are willing to pledge allegiance to my Xia family, I can give them an opportunity.\"","\"But to serve my Xia family, they must be clean, so the Rouge Boat affair can only be entirely blamed on the greedy and rebellious Xiao Zhenhai.\"","\"But...\" Xia Canonical Official hesitated.","Master Xia understood his intention and slowly said:","\"Too clear of water has no fish, too much scrutiny finds no followers. A family so large, it’s impossible for everyone to be absolutely clean; the Xiao family is the same. Sometimes, one must be generous and tolerant.\"","Although saying that, Xia Canonical Official still frowned, \"Does it have to be the Xiao family?\"","Master Xia put down his teacup and asked indifferently, \"What do you mean?\"","Xia Canonical Official said: \"Out of so many families within the Qian Learning State Boundary, must we choose the Xiao family?\"","\"Who do you want to choose?\" Master Xia’s gaze was prudent.","\"Perhaps...\" Xia Canonical Official whispered, \"The Gu family.\"","Master Xia firmly stated: \"The Gu family is not suitable.\"","Xia Canonical Official’s face changed slightly: \"Why?\"","Master Xia silently stared at him.","Realizing his impropriety, Xia Canonical Official softly explained:","\"Uncle... The Gu family is upright, acting righteously and properly. Generations of cultivators from the Gu family have served the Taoist Court for many years, always enforcing the law fairly. Rarely do matters of corruption arise. Though often stubborn, they are upright in character and capable, isn’t this...\"","Master Xia shook his head, \"Precisely because the Gu family is upright, they are not suitable.\"","Xia Canonical Official was stunned, somewhat puzzled.","Master Xia gazed at Xia Canonical Official and sighed lightly:","\"The Gu family’s integrity means they cannot be utilized by my Xia family. They don’t engage in corruption or deceit, and act openly; I don’t hold any leverage over them, how can I trust them?\"","\"The Xiao family is different; their actions have often not been clean. If I wanted to investigate, I could find plenty of leverage over them, which makes it easier for my Xia family to control them.\"","\"And with their weaknesses in my Xia family’s hands, naturally they can only serve us loyally.\"","Xia Canonical Official pressed his lips tightly and said nothing.","Master Xia pondered briefly and then asked: \"What do you think of that noble son of the Xiao family?\"","Xia Canonical Official replied: \"Which noble son is uncle referring to?\"","\"Who else could it be?\"","Xia Canonical Official lowered his head and indeed was reluctant to speak.","Master Xia gave him a faint glance, \"I haven’t mentioned this matter to you, but given your careful nature, you must have guessed a bit by now.\"","Xia Canonical Official remained silent.","\"You ought to think about your significant life events...\"","After Master Xia spoke, he sighed, stood slowly, turned to the night’s scenery outside the window, and said solemnly:","\"For the noble family’s sons and daughters, marriage alliances are inevitable.\"","\"Though you are of Direct Lineage, your parents are ineffectual, hold no sway within the clan. Your marriage was never arranged by them early on. Now considering it is actually somewhat late.\"","\"Within prestigious families, genuinely good alliances are usually identified and settled early.\""]},{"number":1672,"title":"Chapter 1672 - 863: True and False (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"Your appearance, spiritual root, and family background are all outstanding, but you’ve been delayed for too long, are a bit older, and have been working too aggressively at the Taoist Court, so your temper isn’t great either. Now finding a husband who matches the Xia family’s status and has extraordinary talent is basically impossible.\"","\"But as for Xiao Tianquan...\"","Master Xia paused and continued, \"He is the core of the Xiao family’s direct lineage, young, with a good spiritual root, very ambitious, and with a promising future. He doesn’t shame you. Coincidentally, he’s somewhat beneath you in every aspect, just enough for you to control.\"","\"Of course, I won’t wrong you; a Golden Core from the Xia family marrying down to a Foundation Establishment of the Xiao family—what would that look like if word got out?\"","\"I’ll tell him, give him twenty years. If he can form a core within those twenty years, the marriage will be set. By then, the two of you will be joined, I will help him rise to great heights, and the position of the Xiao family head will be his.\"","\"A family head of a fifth-grade family as your husband; that is more than worthy of you.\"","Master Xia turned his head, looking quietly at Canonical Official Xia, his gaze softening, \"I am your uncle. This marriage is not just for now, but for the future. I can only manage this far for you.\"","Canonical Official Xia felt grateful in her heart, but thinking of Xiao Tianquan’s character, it felt like a thorn in her heart.","Her emotions were written on her face, and Master Xia, having seen countless people, knew it well.","\"Is there someone in your heart?\"","Canonical Official Xia’s face turned slightly pale, shaking her head, \"No...\"","Master Xia sighed deeply, and earnestly said:","\"Matters between men and women seek a long-term connection, not just a moment of confused emotions. The entanglement of love obscures your view; you can’t see clearly what’s good or bad...\"","\"Uncle, I know...\" Canonical Official Xia mumbled.","Seeing her like this, Master Xia slightly shook his head, his expression turning colder:","\"I am your uncle, I won’t force you, but there are things I must make clear to you.\"","\"A marriage alliance seeks both your happiness and the family’s interest. If you accept, the family will benefit, naturally raising you, giving you opportunities to climb step by step. If you refuse, you disregard the clan’s interest, and you’ll become marginalized, excluded from the family’s core.\"","\"These matters, you should understand. Think it over yourself...\"","After saying that, Master Xia closed his eyes to rest.","Canonical Official Xia made a bow and respectfully retreated, yet there was still some sorrow between her brows.","Back on the deck, Mo Hua noticed that Canonical Official Xia seemed absent-minded and asked, \"Sister Xia, is something troubling you?\"","Canonical Official Xia was startled, lifted her head, about to say something when she saw Gu Changhuai.","The two exchanged glances, Canonical Official Xia looked deeply at Gu Changhuai, then for some reason, her gaze became resolute, and then cold.","Gu Changhuai, on the other hand, kept his face cold.","Their relationship thus turned awkward.","Mo Hua silently sighed.","Fate is indeed unpredictable.","Fortunately, Canonical Official Xia soon turned her gaze away and said to Mo Hua, \"It’s too late, let’s return on Uncle’s ship. The matter at the Dragon King Temple has troubled you. I’ll take you to your room so you can rest.\"","\"Okay,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"Thank you, Sister Xia.\"","Canonical Official Xia smiled slightly, but it was clear the smile was somewhat absent-minded.","Afterwards, Canonical Official Xia led the way for Mo Hua and the others.","Xiao Tianquan did not follow; he went to find Master Xia, whether to flatter him or to discuss real matters was unknown.","The others couldn’t be bothered with him.","Canonical Official Xia led Mo Hua and Gu Changhuai into the cabin, finding two vacant guest rooms:","\"You both rest here for the night, around dawn the spirit boat will dock, and we’ll return to Qian Learning State Boundary.\"","\"If you need anything, just ask the Xia family disciples in the cabin.\"","\"Alright.\" Mo Hua said.","Canonical Official Xia, having given a few more instructions, prepared to leave.","This spirit boat belongs to the Xia family; she has her own room and does not need to stay in the guest room.","Mo Hua hurriedly said, \"Sister Xia, let me see you off.\"","Seeing Gu Changhuai unresponsive, Mo Hua quickly tugged at him.","Gu Changhuai was somewhat reluctant but stood up to escort Canonical Official Xia along with Mo Hua.","The three reached the corridor, and as they turned, they ran into someone.","Upon meeting, their expressions changed instantly.","Mo Hua was shocked.","This person was a woman, her breath weak, obviously seriously injured, wearing a conical hat to cover her face, which also bore burn marks hidden under thick makeup.","Hua Ruyu!","Mo Hua was somewhat incredulous.","Hua Ruyu was equally shocked to see everyone.","Moments later, she collected her surprise and her eyes roamed over Gu Changhuai and Canonical Official Xia, then mocked:","\"Men in this world are indeed unfaithful. Not long ago, Supervisor Gu was discussing marriage with me, but with a heartless scheme, he harmed me terribly. Now, in no time, he’s forgotten the old and hooked up with another...\"","Canonical Official Xia frowned.","Gu Changhuai’s face also turned ugly, \"Aren’t you supposed to be in the Taoist Prison? Why are you here?\"","\"What Taoist Prison?\" Hua Ruyu sneered.","Gu Changhuai’s gaze turned cold, \"You committed a grave crime; don’t pretend you know nothing about the Rouge Boat affair...\"","Hua Ruyu said, \"What does the Rouge Boat affair have to do with me?\"","Gu Changhuai was about to take action to seize her.","Hua Ruyu sneered, \"Don’t blame me for not warning you; I’m a guest of Master Xia on this ship. If anything happens to me, you think carefully about how to explain it to him.\""]},{"number":1673,"title":"Chapter 1673 - 863: True and False (Part 3)","paragraphs":["With these words, Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official both had a change in expression.","Even Mo Hua furrowed his brow.","Hua Ruyu glanced at Gu Changhuai’s stiff expression and couldn’t help but laugh flamboyantly, speaking in a sarcastic tone:","\"You wouldn’t think that I’m just a simple Sect Instructor, would you?\"","\"For so many years, I’ve trained so many top-grade girls and served numerous high-ranking sons. Though some are heartless and indifferent, ultimately, there are a few who remember the past and are reluctant to see me die...\"","\"They cherish and adore, unwilling to see me suffer at the Taoist Court, revealing secrets that shouldn’t be spoken.\"","\"Master Xia is also a person who does great deeds, broad-minded and able to act decisively, not bothered with a little woman like me.\"","After finishing, Hua Ruyu glanced at Gu Changhuai with quite a bit of satisfaction.","\"Unexpected, isn’t it? A place like the Taoist Prison simply can’t hold me. You’ve struggled to investigate for so long, yet you can’t do anything to me. Some things are beyond what you mere errand boys can decide...\"","Gu Changhuai’s face was full of killing intent.","Xia Canonical Official also had anger in his eyes.","Mo Hua couldn’t stand her arrogant demeanor and spoke out with concern:","\"Sister Hua, what happened to your face? Why has it become so ugly, are you disfigured?\"","Upon hearing this, Hua Ruyu immediately reacted like a furious fox, her expression extremely fierce, and rushed viciously towards Mo Hua.","\"You little brat, I’ll kill you...\"","Before she could get close to Mo Hua, Gu Changhuai reached out with his large hand, twisted her arm, and pushed her back.","Gu Changhuai wished he could slaughter Hua Ruyu.","But he knew his limits; if he really killed Hua Ruyu now, he wouldn’t be able to answer to Master Xia and the Taoist Court.","His position as Supervisor would essentially be over.","Hua Ruyu staggered a few steps before regaining her balance, appearing haggard.","She knew she wasn’t a match for Gu Changhuai and the others, so she just glared at them fiercely.","Especially at that \"maliciously spiteful\" Mo Hua, she wished she could swallow him whole.","Hua Ruyu sneered coldly:","\"Alright, I’ll remember this grudge. Don’t forget, I have someone backing me, it’s his Highness.\"","\"For over a hundred years, how many girls have I trained? Among the many esteemed sons of the Qian Learning State Boundary, who hasn’t experienced bone-chilling ecstasy with me?\"","\"Now they’re all high-ranked, how could they truly abandon me? Sooner or later, I will make sure you all die without a trace.\"","After finishing, Hua Ruyu sneered and turned to leave.","Mo Hua and the other two didn’t stop her, just silently stayed in their original spots.","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment, then spoke coldly: \"I’ll go find Master Xia.\"","Xia Canonical Official held him back, shaking his head: \"No need to go.\"","Gu Changhuai looked silently at Xia Canonical Official.","Xia Canonical Official sighed: \"Uncle’s actions are always well thought out, deeply considered; whatever decision he makes, seeking him out is useless.\"","Gu Changhuai glanced at Xia Canonical Official, a hint of disappointment flashing in his eyes, and spoke softly: \"I understand.\"","Then he said nothing more and turned back inside.","Xia Canonical Official looked at Gu Changhuai, looking forlorn, then also turned and left.","Mo Hua watched the two leave in discontent and couldn’t help but sigh.","Back in his room, Mo Hua felt a bit regretful.","\"I really should have blown up Hua Ruyu, what a miscalculation...\"","If he had known, he would have arranged more Formations, blowing Hua Ruyu up with the Rouge Boat, ending it once and for all.","Since she survived by chance, not being content to hide, dare to show her face, she really has tired of living.","And he doesn’t even know which noble her \"lover\" is now.","Even Master Xia must sell his Face.","Mo Hua shook his head, feeling a bit sentimental.","The waters here are really too deep, and too dirty...","\"However, Hua Ruyu didn’t die...\"","Mo Hua pulled out Boss Jiang’s list from his Storage Bag, seeing that on the list, under Water Yama, Madam Miao’s name was indeed not faded, indicating Hua Ruyu, as Madam Miao, was still alive and well.","\"That’s a pity...\"","Mo Hua felt somewhat regretful.","Good people don’t live long, evildoers last for a thousand years.","Mo Hua was about to consider whether to eliminate Hua Ruyu but suddenly sensed something amiss.","\"Water Yama...\"","He looked at the list again, especially the name \"Water Yama,\" and couldn’t help but be shaken.","\"Why is Water Yama’s name... still on the list?!\"","\"Isn’t he dead?\"","\"What’s going on?\"","\"Water Yama... he’s not dead?\"","Mo Hua’s pupils shook, then he shook his head.","No, impossible!","He was absolutely certain Water Yama was dead.","Killed by him with the Soul-Shocking Sword, destroying his Divine Soul, a backlash from the Pupil Skill, stabbed through the heart by Senior Brother Feng’s Longsword, pierced in the forehead by Sister Qianqian’s Spirit Needle.","Even Xiao Tianquan had given a final stab.","Not only was his body dead, but his Divine Soul also completely annihilated, he couldn’t have been wrong...","\"But why?\"","\"Why is Water Yama’s title not erased from the list, not even slightly faded?\"","Mo Hua’s brow furrowed tightly, thoughts racing.","Could it be... that the \"Water Yama\" who died was not actually Water Yama, at least not the Water Yama who signed a \"soul contract\" at the altar.","The real Water Yama is someone else?","Who could this person be?","Mo Hua’s head hurt for a while.","Suspects came to mind one after the other, but he couldn’t decide.","He pondered this question the entire night, but could only speculate, unable to find an answer."]},{"number":1674,"title":"Chapter 1674 - 863: True and False (Part 4)","paragraphs":["At dawn the next day, the Spirit Boat docked at the port.","Mo Hua hadn’t slept all night, looking somewhat fatigued, but with no other choice, he just sighed and decided to return to the Sect first.","After greeting Master Xia, Mo Hua followed Gu Changhuai and the others off the Spirit Boat and onto the dock.","Xiao Tianquan was also following along.","Furthermore, it seemed that Master Xia might have told him something yesterday, as his expression was even more satisfied, and he was even more attentive to Xia Canonical Official, showing great concern for his well-being.","Xia Canonical Official remained cold in expression.","Gu Changhuai observed all of this, his gaze equally cold.","Thus, they all disembarked.","Just upon reaching the shore, Mo Hua saw a familiar face.","Ye Hong.","The Elder of the Ye family, a Third Grade family in Mistwater City, and also the father of Ye Xiu, who died on Mistwater River, and Ye Jin, who died in Hundred Flower Valley.","He seemed to have been waiting at the dock for a long time, looking somewhat haggard.","Upon seeing Mo Hua, he approached immediately, his expression full of emotion, and tremblingly asked, \"Young Master, I... Jin Er’s revenge...\"","In his eyes, there was hope, but also a hint of fear.","The matter of revenge, he couldn’t achieve himself, so he could only place his hopes on Mo Hua.","Yet he also knew this was due to his own incompetence, thus feeling ashamed in his heart.","Mo Hua’s expression was somewhat complicated, not knowing what to say, finally just nodding, \"The Rouge Boat has already been destroyed, those who deserved death are all dead.\"","Upon hearing this, Ye Hong’s eyes reddened, and he was about to kneel before Mo Hua.","Mo Hua quickly stopped him.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official, witnessing this, also seemed somewhat moved.","Ye Hong repeatedly expressed his gratitude to Mo Hua and the others, \"Thank you all, though I am merely a Foundation Establishment cultivator, with little ability, in the future, should any of you need anything, I will go through fire and water without hesitation...\"","\"Elder Ye, you speak too highly.\" Mo Hua said.","Ye Hong wanted to host the group at a nearby inn, but Mo Hua politely declined.","Uncle Gu and the others had official duties, and he himself needed to return to Taixu Gate as soon as possible.","Ye Hong, knowing his place, did not insist and again expressed his deep gratitude.","Afterwards, the group prepared to leave. Mo Hua took a few steps, then turned back to see Ye Hong still standing there blankly, so he couldn’t help but ask,","\"Elder Ye, aren’t you going back?\"","Ye Hong looked somewhat sorrowful, \"I want to conduct another ritual at the Mistwater River for my ill-fated children.\"","Mo Hua stopped walking.","He pondered for a moment and said, \"I’ll also pay my respects to Senior Sister Ye.\"","Just a simple tribute wouldn’t take much time.","Ye Hong appeared grateful, then found a secluded spot by the river and set out incense burners, liquor, offerings, paper money, all prepared for the ritual.","In addition, there were Ye Jin’s favorite daffodils.","Ye Hong burned the incense, poured the wine, and looking at the daffodils on the ground, tears of bitterness streamed down his face.","\"Jin Er, Xiu Er, your father was incompetent, unable to avenge you with his own hands.\"","\"If not for those benefactors, imparting justice and avenging you, I would have no face to meet you in the Underworld one day...\"","Ye Hong’s eyes were slightly red as he mumbled to himself nearby.","Mo Hua looked at the ground covered in daffodils, feeling somewhat conflicted.","There were things he left unsaid.","The name of Shui Yan hadn’t been eliminated, and he wasn’t even sure if he truly avenged Senior Sister Ye Jin...","But Ye Hong knew none of this.","After the ritual was completed, the group was about to set off.","Gu Changhuai and the others were returning to the Taoist Court, and Mo Hua also needed to return to Taixu Gate.","Only Ye Hong remained by the river, mourning his ill-fated children.","As the group departed, Mo Hua, preoccupied, walked a bit slower, and thus he noticed, with an indifferent, even slightly disdainful look, Xiao Tianquan.","Xiao Tianquan regarded Ye Hong with such a gaze, then followed the group, turning away.","But as he left, he suddenly took it upon himself to stamp on a daffodil at his feet, crushing the pure white flower into the dirt.","The white petals, stained with dirt, scattered into the earth.","Mo Hua saw this and was startled, suddenly saying, \"Brother Xiao...\"","Everyone halted.","Ye Hong also looked towards Mo Hua.","Mo Hua slowly raised his head, staring at Xiao Tianquan, his eyes sharp, \"Actually, you are the real... Shui Yan, aren’t you?\""]},{"number":1675,"title":"Chapter 1675 - 864: Evil Deeds Invite Retribution","paragraphs":["As these words were spoken, the expressions of everyone changed drastically.","A look of disbelief appeared on Ye Hong’s sorrowful face.","Xiao Tianquan’s face turned slightly pale, forcing a smile as he said, \"Little brother, I don’t know what you’re talking about...\"","Mo Hua recalled the moment earlier when he stepped on the daffodil, grinding it into the dust with cold indifference and pleasure. Looking at him now, sensing the fear in his divine soul, Mo Hua’s heart gradually became resolute.","\"You are the Water Yama!\"","\"Baseless accusations, you...\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"You must have known that dead ’Water Yama’ for a long time, in the bandit camp before, on the Rouge Boat, at the Dragon King Temple, you’ve tried to kill him multiple times.\"","\"And in the White Bone Maze, in such a dangerous situation, it was also you who delivered the final blow, disregarding everything.\"","\"Because as long as he died, no one would know that you are the Water Yama.\"","Xiao Tianquan sneered a few times, \"What nonsense are you spouting?\"","\"And it doesn’t stop there...\" Mo Hua’s eyes shone brightly, piecing everything together:","\"A long time ago, in the Bi Mountain Demon Cavern, when Uncle Gu and I, along with the cultivators from the Taoist Court, were besieging the Fire Buddha, you pretended to block the way, but during the fight, you deliberately let him escape.\"","\"As you passed each other, there was a subconscious exchange of glances, a look that was quite intriguing and bore a familiarity.\"","\"This shows that you know the Fire Buddha.\"","\"That look signifies a transfer of status.\"","\"And in the Dragon King Temple, I also heard your conversation with Master Xiao in the Sound Isolation Formation that night.\"","\"Master Xiao said that to elevate you, he used all his power to pave the way for you. He even personally took you onto the Rouge Boat.\"","\"You’ve been to the Rouge Boat, so you must have been involved in its affairs.\"","\"One more thing, when Water Yama massacred the Yu Family Water Fort, he used brutal punishments, including some of the interrogation methods from the Taoist Court.\"","\"Water Yama has a cruel nature, but so do you.\"","\"I have witnessed many times, how you murder and desecrate corpses behind people’s backs...\"","Mo Hua spoke in an indifferent tone, listing everything out.","Xiao Tianquan’s face gradually turned pale, twitching at the corners of his mouth as he forced a smile, \"You say I am the Water Yama, then who was that dead ’Water Yama’?\"","Mo Hua said, \"’Water Yama’ is just a title. It’s used by two people, one in the open, one in the shadows. One is the murderous water bandit on the Mistwater River, the other is a promising Enforcement Leader in the Taoist Court.\"","\"But the one who died was fake; the real Water Yama...\" Mo Hua looked deeply into Xiao Tianquan’s eyes, \"is actually you!\"","Or rather, the person who signed a \"soul contract\" with the Evil God and left a name on the altar was Xiao Tianquan.","So, the fake Water Yama died, but the name on the list was not erased.","Because the real Water Yama, who sold his divine soul to the Evil God, is still alive...","\"Utter nonsense!\" Xiao Tianquan exclaimed angrily.","But his words lacked conviction, even tinged with bluster masking fear.","Mo Hua did not intend to let him go, and in a low voice said:","\"The person who really killed Sister Ye Jin is also you, right...\"","He had found something strange before.","On the Rouge Boat, he had confronted the already dead Water Yama, asking if it was he who had forced Sister Ye Jin from the Hundred Flower Valley to her death.","The reaction from Water Yama, Mo Hua still remembered.","First, he was taken aback, then he grinned and said, \"I lost count of the women I played with. Those I got bored of and killed, I’ve also lost count. How could I know which one you’re talking about?\"","At first, Mo Hua thought it was due to his ruthless and murderous nature, but upon reflection later, he felt something was off.","Sister Ye Jin was not an ordinary woman.","Regardless of her appearance, temperament, talent, or status, she was enough to make a \"water bandit\" like Water Yama covetously desire.","If he had really laid hands on her, he wouldn’t have been indifferent to it.","When her name was mentioned, even if he had a heart of stone, he couldn’t remain completely unreactive.","Moreover, Hua Ruyu was naturally jealous.","She had an affair with the fake \"Water Yama,\" so she wouldn’t likely matchmake for her \"lover.\"","The only possibility was that the fake \"Water Yama\" didn’t even know who Ye Jin was.","The dead Water Yama was actually taking the blame for Xiao Tianquan.","Xiao Tianquan’s face looked ugly, coldly standing there, wanting to argue but finding no convincing reasons.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official’s faces gradually showed anger.","When they first heard about Xiao Tianquan being the Water Yama, they were taken aback.","But now, various signs indicated this was very likely true...","Especially Xiao Tianquan’s demeanor; in the eyes of an experienced Supervisor like Gu Changhuai, it was as good as a confession.","Ye Hong was even more incredulous, murmuring, \"Why? Mr. Xiao? Why did you, after how I treated you, kill...\"","This question seemed to affect Xiao Tianquan, causing him to twitch and reply with gritted teeth, \"No! I don’t know what you’re all talking about. What Water Yama, it’s unrelated to me...\"","As he spoke, he began to move backward, trying to escape from there.","Gu Changhuai’s face turned cold, reaching to grab his shoulder.","Xiao Tianquan quickly drew his sword in resistance, the longsword aimed at Gu Changhuai’s hand.","Xia Canonical Official’s pretty face turned cold, and a chilling Sword Qi shot out, slicing through Xiao Tianquan’s arm, causing the longsword to fall to the ground.","Seizing the opportunity, Gu Changhuai moved forward to try and seize him.","Xiao Tianquan had always detested Gu Changhuai. Now feeling Gu Changhuai’s pressure, and already agitated from having his crimes exposed, Xiao Tianquan, in a moment of desperation, reflexively showed blood-red eyes, mixed with black-gray air, looking into Gu Changhuai’s eyes."]},{"number":1676,"title":"Chapter 1676 - 864: The Wages of Sin (2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua was startled and quickly said, \"He has cultivated Evil Qi!\"","And it was that kind of gloomy and filthy Evil Qi.","Fortunately, Gu Changhuai had been ambushed by this Evil Qi many times before and had long since gained experience. Realizing something was wrong, he had already avoided looking directly.","Yet in his heart, he was furious beyond measure. Without holding back, he struck Xiao Tianquan’s shoulder with a palm.","On the other side, Xia Canonical Official’s face was as cold as frost, he pierced with his sword, slicing through Xiao Tianquan’s right leg, the chill seeping into his flesh through the wound.","Xiao Tianquan staggered a few steps and fell to the ground, disheveled and in a sorry state.","In front of Xia Canonical Official, being humiliated by Gu Changhuai, especially with the two of them working together, Xiao Tianquan was both ashamed and angry.","On the other side, Ye Hong was still in a daze, mumbling, \"Why?\"","These words were questioning Xiao Tianquan.","Xiao Tianquan’s face twisted with rage, \"Why? It’s because your good daughter didn’t know what’s good for her. A mere girl from a Third Grade family, I wanted to befriend her, it was giving her face, and yet she repeatedly refused my kindness.\"","\"I had no choice but to ask Madam Miao to use some means to trick her onto the boat.\"","\"Once on the Rouge Boat shrouded in fog, after feeding her pills, she obediently let me have my way.\"","Xiao Tianquan glanced at Ye Hong, smiling darkly:","\"But speaking of it, your daughter really is top-grade, not only beautiful in appearance but also tender-bodied, I noticed her at first sight when I visited the Ye family. On the Rouge Boat, you didn’t know how much I loved her, her fair skin, you don’t know what kind of torment it underwent by me.\"","\"It’s a pity, though, she’s too stubborn, otherwise I could have kept her outside as a concubine, occasionally visiting her, better than her passing away like that, burning into a piece of charcoal.\"","These words, each one piercing the heart.","Especially for Ye Hong, as a father, it was like having a sharp knife repeatedly gouging at his heart.","Not only Ye Hong, even Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official were shaking with anger.","\"I’ll kill you, you beast!\"","Ye Hong, his eyes red with rage, roared as he lunged at Xiao Tianquan, wishing to eat his flesh.","But he was no match for Xiao Tianquan, who dodged easily and struck back with a palm to Ye Hong’s chest, causing him to stagger back a few steps and spit blood.","Xiao Tianquan’s gaze was cold, he even wanted to secretly take out a hidden weapon from his sleeve to silence Ye Hong.","Gu Changhuai was already furious. Seeing this, he kicked and broke Xiao Tianquan’s arm, gathering a powerful wind force in his right hand and slapped towards Xiao Tianquan’s heavenly cap.","Xiao Tianquan screamed:","\"Gu Changhuai!\"","\"Gu Changhuai! You can’t kill me!\"","Gu Changhuai’s palm wind came to an abrupt halt.","Xiao Tianquan shrieked, \"Don’t forget, I’m from the Xiao family, a direct lineage of the Xiao family, loved by the Ancestor. I’m also an Enforcement Leader in the Taoist Court! Even if I’m guilty, even if I deserve to die, it should be judged by the Taoist Court, with the Taoist Law sentencing, execution by the executioner, you can’t kill me!\"","Gu Changhuai remained emotionless, \"Your crimes are heinous, whether you die sooner or later, it’s death.\"","Xiao Tianquan sneered, \"Do you want to create a blood feud between the Xiao family and the Gu family? Don’t you want your Supervisor position? And what will you tell Master Xia, Xia Canonical Official?\"","Xia Canonical Official’s face was icy, \"Do you still have the nerve to mention the Inspector?\"","At this point, Xiao Tianquan shamelessly tore off the pretense and acted brazenly:","\"I haven’t committed any crimes, why can’t I mention the Inspector?\"","Xia Canonical Official frowned, \"You admitted it yourself...\"","Xiao Tianquan smiled, blood staining his teeth, \"Where’s the evidence? I was just talking, I’m an Enforcement Leader of the Taoist Court, how could I possibly do such a thing?\"","\"Moreover, Master Xia values me, he will entrust me with heavy responsibilities, he won’t let me die.\"","\"You all know the internal rules, punishment doesn’t extend to noble families, I’m from a noble family, a direct lineage! I’m not like those with lowly lives.\"","Gu Changhuai nodded coldly, \"Fine, then I’ll cripple you first, leave you half alive, so that whether you suffer punishment in the Taoist Prison won’t matter.\"","\"Gu Changhuai!\" Xiao Tianquan turned pale.","At this moment, a voice, as deep as a bell, resounded, \"Stop!\"","Gu Changhuai’s gaze sharpened, then stopped, turning to see Master Xia, standing nearby at an unknown time, like a deep well or lofty mountain.","He was Feather Transformation, with powerful Divine Sense.","What happened here could never escape him.","Yet even he didn’t expect things to escalate to this point.","\"Uncle...\" Xia Canonical Official said.","Master Xia shook his head, \"This is not the place to talk, get on the boat first.\"","After saying that, he turned to leave, but after a few steps, Gu Changhuai called after him, \"Master Xia...\"","Master Xia turned back, seeing Gu Changhuai’s handsome face full of sternness, his gaze sharp as a sword.","Gu Changhuai said, \"Master Xia, will you act according to the Taoist Law?\"","Master Xia was slightly stunned, and then his face turned indifferent, showing no emotion.","\"The Taoist Court has its own rules.\"","After saying this, Master Xia left.","A few cultivators from the Xia family came to Gu Changhuai, bowed, and took the severely injured Xiao Tianquan onto the ship.","Gu Changhuai did not stop them either.","Mo Hua and Ye Hong stood where they were.","Xia Canonical Official glanced at everyone, tightly pressed his lips, and followed Master Xia back to the Xia family’s Spirit Boat.","In a secret room of the cabin, Xia Canonical Official directly said:","\"Uncle, Xiao Tianquan’s crimes are numerous and vile, killing him ten times wouldn’t be too much.\"","\"On the Rouge Boat, who knows how many women were harmed by them...\"","Master Xia said flatly, \"I know...\"","Xia Canonical Official frowned, \"Uncle!\""]},{"number":1677,"title":"Chapter 1677 - 864: Repeated Crimes Go Unpunished (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Master Xia raised his eyes and glanced at Official Xia, \"What do you want to do?\"","Official Xia was silent for a moment, resolutely said, \"Convict him, have him executed.\"","Master Xia breathed a deep sigh.","He looked away, gazing out the window at the mighty Mistwater River. His eyes were somewhat obscure, \"There are no others here, some things I can tell you clearly...\"","\"Xiao Tianquan must not die.\"","Official Xia bit his lip, his fingers white from strain, his voice was a bit hoarse and disappointed, \"Has committed such a serious crime and yet cannot die?\"","Master Xia replied, \"Committed such a serious crime, deserves a thousand deaths. But, his identity stands here.\"","\"If he dies, then the Xiao family, both emotionally and rationally, could not possibly follow our Xia family, serving us loyally.\"","\"Here in Qian Learning State Boundary, we are the powerful dragons, but if we want to suppress the local snakes, there must be a snake willing to serve us. The Xiao family is this snake, without them, our future plans will be hard to implement.\"","\"This is the bigger picture! Xiao Tianquan’s life or death may seem unimportant, but it involves too much power and network operations; it cannot be simply wasted away.\"","\"What about Hua Ruyu?\" Official Xia asked.","Master Xia’s eyes slightly narrowed, somewhat displeased, but still said: \"That woman has someone above her, someone with significant influence, I must return their favor.\"","Official Xia sneered coldly, said bitterly: \"Do we, these noble families, even consider the ’Taoist Law’ anymore?\"","Seeing Official Xia still not understanding, Master Xia sighed:","\"You have been with the Taoist Court for too long, only seeing the surface, not knowing power itself is just a game, and ’Taoist Law’ is only one of the rules. Since it is a rule, it’s meant to be utilized. And in this game of fame and fortune, if you want to win, the first thing to learn is ’compromise’ and ’trade’.\"","\"Then...\" Official Xia’s heart grew colder, \"Is my marriage simply for compromise, to facilitate the family in its transactions?\"","Master Xia paused, somewhat speechless.","Official Xia said, \"Uncle, at this point, you wouldn’t still want me... to be engaged to Xiao Tianquan, right?\"","Master Xia said nothing, only looking silently at Official Xia.","Official Xia’s face turned increasingly pale, increasingly disappointed.","Master Xia was somewhat unable to meet Official Xia’s gaze, said slowly:","\"A person’s life is inherently burdened with sins, and the human heart is originally filthy, only that your nature is pure, and you distinguish between good and evil, not knowing it.\"","\"You don’t know, but the behavior of someone like Xiao Tianquan is not rare among noble family’s sons.\"","\"In the Taoist State, those who appear glamorous and unparalleled, noble family Heavenly Prides, indulge in luxury in secret, possibly behaving more excessively than Xiao Tianquan.\"","\"Not only the men, those women who appear pure and beautiful, revered as ’Fairies’ and ’Goddesses’, adored by many, may equally be debauched in secret.\"","\"Judging by appearance is a foolishness humans can never rid themselves of.\"","\"Social interactions within noble families are a fame and fortune arena, also a filthy dyepot; few within it are clean.\"","\"But because the offspring of noble families often have a fine appearance, outsiders mistakenly think them beautiful.\"","\"Your mind is simple, focused solely on affairs of the Taoist Court, so you haven’t entered this dyepot, therefore you have some shallow thoughts.\"","\"In noble families, truly self-preserving men are very few.\"","\"Hence...\"","Master Xia glanced at Official Xia, \"If you understand this, you’ll find that Xiao Tianquan’s behavior is not intolerable.\"","\"These filthy acts of his, at least you knew beforehand, better than marrying a superficially glamorous, secretly more debauched noble family’s son.\"","\"Moreover, I have taught you not to act rashly but to learn to calculate and to take control.\"","\"If you know of his past, and can still marry him, he will surely be eternally grateful, never defying your will for life.\"","\"Afterwards, I will work on it, make him the next designated Family Head of the Xiao family, given time, the whole Xiao family will be under your say.\"","No matter what he said, Official Xia ignored it, with an increasingly cold demeanor and a heart filled with despair.","Previously she often heard people speak of the coldness of noble families, but did not take it to heart.","But at this moment, she personally experienced this bone-deep coldness.","The descendants of noble families are not \"people\", but have long been alienated into \"tools\", mere \"chess pieces\".","Official Xia looked blankly at Master Xia, her gaze became resolute after its initial disappointment:","\"Uncle, I will not marry a beast like Xiao Tianquan. Even if the family abandons me, I will not agree to this marriage alliance.\"","\"If compelled, I will... first kill Xiao Tianquan, then kill myself.\"","Official Xia appeared desolate.","Master Xia momentarily froze.","He knew his niece’s nature, outwardly cold but inwardly kind, with a strong sense of responsibility.","She had always respected him, never disobeyed his wishes.","But he hadn’t expected her to be able to speak such resolute words to him now.","Master Xia’s mood was complex for a while, finally he sighed deeply, \"I won’t force you, you, take care of yourself...\"","\"I’ve kept Xiao Tianquan’s people, you should no longer concern yourself with family matters...\"","Official Xia left the Spirit Boat alone.","Gu Changhuai, Mo Hua, and Ye Hong were all waiting outside the Spirit Boat.","Gu Changhuai saw Official Xia, suppressed his anger, thinking coldly of asking something, but seeing her pale, lost appearance, felt a small twinge of pain, understanding somewhat, and he refrained from asking.","\"Sister Xia...\" Mo Hua sympathetically said.","Official Xia gave a bitter smile, shook her head.","The group realized not only Hua Ruyu, even Xiao Tianquan, wouldn’t die.","Afterwards, the Xia family’s Spirit Boat carried Xiao Tianquan, leaving the dock.","Xiao Tianquan might not even enter the Taoist Court, much less the Taoist Prison.","Mo Hua and the others could only quietly return to the Qian Learning State Boundary. Passing through Mistwater City, Ye Hong mustered his spirits, bitterly smiled at them:","\"Though things did not go as wished, Ye still appreciates everyone’s kindness and virtues. Since we’ve reached Mistwater City, let Ye act a host’s duty to entertain you all.\"","Mo Hua and the others intended to decline, but seeing Ye Hong pale-faced, in poor spirits, nodded in agreement.","Ye Hong then arranged some wine and food at a tavern, hosted Mo Hua and three others.","But this banquet was dull, everyone was heavy-hearted.","Ye Hong wanted to express gratitude, but after a few cups of wine, tasting nothing, feeling unspeakable bitterness, tears welled up as he murmured:","\"Committed such a crime, yet cannot die...\"","\"Is it that once holding high positions, having power and influence, their lives are different from ours? Our lowly lives end without notice, but theirs are different, even breaching Taoist Law, there’s still protection. Committing a capital crime, yet can roam freely...\"","\"Will I spend a lifetime... never avenging?\"","Gu Changhuai felt ashamed for a moment, unable to respond.","Official Xia also looked pale.","Moments later, the ever-silent Mo Hua said, \"It’s alright...\"","Ye Hong was taken aback, Official Xia couldn’t help but look at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua said, \"Those who deserve death will die.\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"You...\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"I’m a Foundation Building Cultivator, of low realm, certainly can’t do much, but...\"","Mo Hua pointed to the sky, seriously said:","\"Man acts, Heaven watches, the Howling Celestial Dog does many injustices, maybe one day Heaven will punish, and it will suddenly die.\"","This statement was somewhat naive, somewhat presumptuous.","Gu Changhuai, Official Xia, and Ye Hong just listened at that moment, not taking it to heart."]},{"number":1678,"title":"Chapter 1678 - 865: Sudden Death","paragraphs":["Afterwards, everyone parted ways.","Ye Hong, who lost both his children, stayed alone in Mistwater City.","Xia Canonical Official returned to the Taoist Court of Qian Learning State Boundary.","Gu Changhuai also needed to return to the Taoist Court, but before that, he wanted to send Mo Hua back to Taixu Gate.","Recently, events were chaotic, and changes frequent; he would not feel at ease until he personally delivered Mo Hua to the Mountain Gate.","Fortunately, the journey was smooth, and by evening, the carriage finally arrived at Tai Xu City, and half an hour later, reached the foot of Taixu Gate.","Gazing at the mist-covered Taixu Mountain Gate, Gu Changhuai finally felt at ease.","At the Dragon King Temple, when Mo Hua was trapped in the White Bone Maze, submerged in blood, he was anxious and worried.","Afraid that he might never be able to bring Mo Hua back, he felt guilty in his heart and couldn’t account to his cousin and Taixu Gate.","Luckily, everything turned out safely.","\"Alright, go back and focus on cultivation, and don’t think about anything else.\"","Gu Changhuai advised.","\"Hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded, then waved and said, \"Uncle Gu, there’s a lot to do at the Taoist Court and it’s very busy, so I won’t keep you, you should hurry back.\"","Gu Changhuai nodded, gave a few more instructions, then drove away.","Mo Hua stood at the foot of the mountain, waving goodbye to Gu Changhuai, until his carriage disappeared around the mountain bend, then he turned around.","But instead of heading towards Taixu Mountain Gate, he changed direction and, following the mountains on both sides, stepped onto a rugged mountain path, arriving at a desolate peak nearby where few people tread.","Taixu Mountain is vast.","The land occupied by Taixu Gate is merely the main mountain range of Taixu Mountain.","Besides that, there are many remote, desolate hills on both sides, overgrown with vegetation and craggy stones, unsuitable for building halls and establishing sects.","Mo Hua reached a small mountain peak.","In front of him was a cliff, with no one around, surrounded by clouds and fog, with deep grass and precarious stones, ensuring he wouldn’t be discovered.","Mo Hua picked a large stone to sit on, then took out Boss Jiang’s list from his Storage Bag.","Mo Hua looked at the names on the list, his gaze cold.","He had said, the ones who deserve to die, will die.","He had also promised to avenge Senior Sister Ye Jin, who almost turned into a Fierce Ghost.","Therefore, this Howling Celestial Dog must die.","He’s doomed, and no one can save him.","Not even a deity.","Mo Hua placed the list in front of him, then took out a bottle of Mistwater River water collected near the Dragon King Temple.","He also took out the bloody residue he had scraped from the blank Blood Tablet in front of the Dragon King Temple altar.","He melted the residue into the river water and splashed it onto the Jade Slip list.","Then, holding the list, Mo Hua concentrated on sensing, using the list and some kind of connection of cause and effect in the unknown, to communicate with the distant altar in the Dragon King Temple.","The Great Wilderness Evil Fetus is the master of the altar.","Now the Great Wilderness Evil Fetus has merged into his subdued soul fragment, becoming one with him.","The Evil Fetus is him, and he is the Evil Fetus.","Thus, he is also the master of the altar.","And all the Sin Cultivators on the list, including Shui Yan, through the soul contract, had offered a part of their Divine Soul to the Great Wilderness Evil Fetus.","The Great Wilderness Evil Fetus controls their life and death.","And now, in some sense, Mo Hua is the Great Wilderness Evil Fetus.","In other words, he also controls the life and death of everyone on the list!","Moments later, ripples appeared over Mistwater River, eerie winds erupted in the Dragon King Temple, and dim blood-red light illuminated the altar.","It was answering the call of its master.","In the Sea of Consciousness, a blood-red list surfaced in front of Mo Hua.","The list was inscribed with bloody characters.","Each character entangled with a strand of Life Soul.","Without any hesitation, Mo Hua extended his fair hand, and crushed these Life Souls one by one, erasing them one after another.","He wanted to eradicate them, root and branch.","Not just Shui Yan, but every Sin Cultivator on this list, he intended to erase them all in one go!","This soul contract was a channel for nourishing the Evil God.","Equally, it served as a breeding ground for incubating the Evil God’s henchmen.","If not thoroughly eradicated, someday, characters like ’Fire Buddha’ and ’Water Yama’ might yet arise.","Neither Golden Yama, Wood Yama, nor Earth Yama...","Mo Hua could not be bothered to deal with them one by one, so he opted to strangle them all in the cradle, extinguishing their Life Souls completely.","The many remaining bloody characters on the list were, with Mo Hua assuming the identity of the Evil Fetus, erased one by one under the authority of being the \"master\".","The Divine Souls were also crushed one by one.","As each Life Soul was crushed, a wail sounded, and the soul disintegrated in response.","The bloody names on the list dimmed, signifying complete physical and spiritual death.","With each squeeze by Mo Hua, one died.","Thus, not knowing how long he crushed, finally, only the last name remained:","Shui Yan.","\"I said, you’re doomed.\"","Mo Hua coldly declared, then reached out and squeezed, crushing Shui Yan’s Life Soul as well.","In the mundane world, there might be fame and fortune, power to rely on, layers of barriers with spiritual power and flesh.","But in the path of the Divine Soul, life and death are equal.","Crushing to death a Heaven’s Chosen Son of noble bloodline and exalted status, who might rise to a high position in the future, is not much harder than killing anyone else.","With just one squeeze, life and death were settled.","Hence, all names on the entire list were erased.","All the Sin Cultivators who sold their Divine Soul to the Evil God were wiped out, along with their Remnant Souls, ending their lives and Dao.","This list was thus completely rendered useless.","Mo Hua conjured a Spell, shattering the Jade Slip completely, then scattered its fragments into the cliff before him."]},{"number":1679,"title":"Chapter 1679 - 865: Sudden Death (Part 2)","paragraphs":["The mountain wind passed, leaving not a trace of powder.","The abyss swallowed the evidence of sin.","The mist of Taixu obscured cause and effect.","The dazzling and splendid sunset on the horizon illuminated Mo Hua’s solitary figure standing atop the mountain, like a deity indifferent to all living beings.","Once everything was done, all cause and effect were concluded.","Mo Hua collected his thoughts, rubbed his face, dispelled the killing aura from his face, and his expression returned to being calm and gentle.","Accompanied by the mountain mist, he stepped lightly on the jagged mountain stones, moving towards Taixu Gate.","Just like an ordinary little disciple of Taixu Gate.","And as he extinguished the Divine Soul, in the Qian Learning State Boundary and its surrounding areas, various strange death omens frequently appeared.","Outside the Qian Learning State Boundary, in a secluded desolate mountain.","A dozen Sin Cultivators set up an ambush, clutching swords and runes, ready to hijack a passing caravan of cultivators dragging their families along.","But before they could act, several Sin Cultivators were suddenly as if choked, their eyes widened, full of blood threads, and they struggled and screamed like madmen. Moments later, their foreheads turned black, and they collapsed lifelessly, dying inexplicably.","And the cultivator of the caravan also noticed the anomaly.","An ambush battle thus evolved into a direct slaughter...","...","In an unknown Little Immortal City near the Qian Learning State Boundary.","An Evil Cultivator resembling a butcher grabbed a few innocent Loose Cultivators, pressed them onto a chopping board, ready to chop them up and use them to make soup.","He was at Foundation Establishment Peak, and his Evil Skills were on the brink of breakthrough.","Once the Human Slaughter Skill was perfected, everyone would have to call him \"Big Brother\".","But just as he raised the butcher’s knife, cause and effect were severed.","As if someone, in the unseen, snuffed out his Life Soul.","The Evil Cultivator’s eyes dimmed, and the blood in his eyes gradually vanished, after which his mountainous bulk of a physique collapsed with a crash, dead without a single wound.","The two door-keeping Evil Cultivators, who were also murderous, died painfully together.","Not far away, in a flower house.","A man with oily hair and powdered face had tied up several women, and was preparing for a spree of Replenishing from Others in the terrified eyes of the ladies.","But just as he finished stripping, his face suddenly turned ashen and, after a violent twitch, he collapsed beside the bed, dead.","...","Within the Qian Learning State Boundary, in the Taoist Prison.","A Sin Cultivator hiding in the corner, using Disguise Technique, was with a sinister smile marking lines on the wall, calculating the day of his \"release\", planning a big business upon release.","But suddenly, a death omen descended.","His heart vessel felt as if gripped, making it impossible to breathe, causing immense pain.","He struggled desperately, shouted desperately, his fingers scratching the wall until they were bloody and flesh blurred, and until the wall was mottled with blood marks.","Moments later, he breathed his last, without any further sound.","The lines he previously drew on the wall were completely covered by the blood marks he scratched out with his fingers.","The dates he calculated were all rendered void.","He died in the Taoist Prison. This life, he would never get out again.","...","And within the Qian Learning State Boundary, in several moderately-sized sects, some disciples also died mysteriously, shocking the elders, but investigation into the cause yielded no clues.","...","Meanwhile, on Mistwater River.","Inside the Xia family’s Spirit Boat.","Hua Ruyu was in the cabin dressing.","She used rouge to cover the burn marks on her face, borrowing these cosmetics to make herself still appear charming and beautiful.","In the brightly red room, Hua Ruyu’s pretty face was grotesque, under the red light, she looked like a ghost.","\"All men in this world are the same.\"","\"The higher the position, the more lustful they are.\"","\"The skills I have on the bed, are skills that ordinary women cannot learn, even though I’m now older and less attractive, unappealing to the young masters, but my allure tricks can still be used to train little girls, to turn them into enchanting beings in bed...\"","\"The young masters are reluctant to let me die...\"","\"Besides, after all these years, I’ve sold myself to make people laugh, and have met so many people, wanting me dead? It’s not that simple?\"","\"The rouge boat capsized, there will sooner or later be another boat, as long as the desire between men and women exists, there will be plenty of boats in this world...\"","With resentment on her face, Hua Ruyu murmured while dressing.","But as one’s expression arises from the heart, no matter how much rouge she applied, she couldn’t change the indulgent and twisted face in the mirror.","Adding the burn marks, it looked more like embroidery torn apart and then sewn back together, appearing all the more unsightly.","Hua Ruyu was furious, hatred embedded deep in her bones.","\"Gu Changhuai... it’s all because of you!\"","\"And Hua Qianqian, heart of wolf and lungs of dog, not appreciating good intentions... As your sister, I’ve done so much for you, just wanting you to enjoy the utmost pleasure between man and woman, yet you pretended with me, you despicable person...\"","\"Especially that little beast called Mo Hua!\"","\"With such a beautiful face, whether you’re male or female, there will be young masters who like you... Someday, I will make you regret it.\"","\"Before that, as long as I train more girls to satisfy those above, I...\"","Before she finished speaking, she felt a sudden chill in her heart. As if someone cut off her death penalty, set her death date.","Her Divine Soul began to wither, dwindling in the pain, she seemed to see many faces.","So many charming beauties, as if flowers clustered together, all in the best years, all lovely and beautiful.","They smiled at her, genuinely calling her \"sister\"."]},{"number":1680,"title":"Chapter 1680 - 865: Sudden Death (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Smiles like blossoms, beautiful and captivating.","But in the next moment, a cold wind blew, and blood tears flowed from all these lovely faces.","\"Sister, why did you harm me?\"","\"Why, when I trusted you so much, why did you push me into the fire pit?\"","\"Sister, do you know, I was tortured to death, a most tragic death...\"","\"Sister, do you know where my body is buried...\"","...","These voices, at first confused, then desperate, gradually turned into one after another of piercing, terrifying cries:","\"Sister, I hate you so much!\"","\"Sister, you... bring me back my life!\"","Hua Ruyu was frightened out of her wits, her face devoid of any color.","\"It wasn’t me, I didn’t harm you, I did it for your own good, I...\"","But these women refused to listen to any of her excuses, turning into fierce ghosts, rushing towards her, ripping at her.","Hua Ruyu struggled.","But what tore into her was not fierce ghosts, but herself.","She used her two hands, with the long nails on them, to claw at her own face, tear into her own flesh, reach into her heart, and ultimately, in the boundless terror and agony of being entangled by fierce ghosts, she died bit by bit.","The last thing Hua Ruyu saw before she died was the face of a woman scarred by fire.","As she slowly died, the burn marks on the woman’s face gradually faded, transforming back into a gentle and demure countenance.","It was Ye Jin.","Hua Ruyu seemed to want to say something to Ye Jin, seemed to want to explain that she did it for her good, but in the end didn’t say it, and her life soul was completely extinguished.","Ye Jin silently watched Hua Ruyu die, and then her figure gradually faded away.","Hua Ruyu died.","But no one on the Spirit Boat knew for the moment.","Meanwhile, in the great hall, a banquet was being held.","Master Xia sat at the high seat, expression solemn, and on his right sat Xiao Tianquan.","Those present were all Golden Cores from the Xia family on this journey, and elder-level figures from the Xiao family.","This was a banquet to cement the friendship between the Xia and Xiao families.","At the banquet, glasses clinked, the atmosphere on both sides was harmonious, and the conversation was delightful.","And above, a Sound Isolation Formation was set up.","Master Xia coolly advised Xiao Tianquan:","\"To accomplish great things, one must have a calm spirit, and the more unpredictable the situation, the more one should remain composed and not show emotions.\"","\"Previously by the river, that young disciple, though without evidence, caused a scene with just a few startling words, making you lose your composure.\"","\"Even Gu Changhuai and Ronger, seasoned in dealing with legal matters, could have noticed your panic at a glance. Any ordinary person with eyes could tell you were feeling guilty.\"","\"Later, to vent your frustration, you spoke out loud, revealing everything you did, which is a big taboo, too foolish.\"","\"Acting so impulsively, without the demeanor of being unruffled even if Mt. Tai collapses in front, how can you strategize and take on the major responsibilities?\"","Xiao Tianquan listened quietly, respectfully saying:","\"Yes, I am foolish, from now on I will remember the Inspector’s advice.\"","Master Xia nodded slightly.","\"But...\" Xiao Tianquan mumbled.","Master Xia saw through his concerns, slowly saying: \"In the Taoist Court, cases are about evidence, without evidence, there is naturally no crime.\"","\"Moreover, investigation and verification go hand in hand, without investigation, where would the ’evidence’ come from?\"","\"From now on, no one will investigate you anymore.\"","Xiao Tianquan was relieved, his face showing joy, and he bowed: \"Thank you, Inspector.\"","\"No need to thank me, I am just...\" Master Xia paused, \"following ’rules’ in handling matters.\"","\"Your insight is crystal clear, Master Xia,\" Xiao Tianquan said, feeling somewhat embarrassed, \"about Xia Canonical Official...\"","\"As for Ronger, it’s not for me to bring up again. But...\" Master Xia’s gaze darkened, \"Whether there is a turn for this matter depends on yourself. If you wholeheartedly work for Ronger’s good, move her, and make her change her mind, there’s still time.\"","\"Even if in the end, you two are not fated to be together, it does not matter, I will choose another direct lineage girl from the Xia family to marry you, thus forming a good connection between our two families...\"","Xiao Tianquan was overjoyed, but outwardly still said:","\"I will be sincere and do my utmost to make Xia Canonical Official change her mind.\"","\"Hmm.\" Master Xia nodded.","With this matter wrapped up, they no longer mentioned it, and instead began discussing business matters.","Master Xia said: \"The Xiao family has many disciples, among your generation, though you excel, you are not unmatched. Other lineages also have talented disciples, they are your formidable opponents for the position of Family Head.\"","\"However, now it doesn’t matter, you are favored by the Xia family, they will all be beneath you.\"","\"All the paths are paved for you, you just need to cultivate well, and move step by step upward. Once you reach the Golden Core, you may marry into the Xia family, becoming the Xiao family’s designated next Family Head.\"","\"As long as your cultivation reaches Feather Transformation, the current Family Head will unconditionally step down, putting you in position. By then you will truly be the Xiao family head, and we the Xia family will stand behind you, helping you lead the family.\"","Xiao Tianquan’s eyes were filled with excitement, his face flushed red.","Master Xia’s eyes flickered slightly, \"However, there is still one more thing...\"","Xiao Tianquan was slightly taken aback, a bit puzzled, \"You mean...?\"","\"The special Eternal Life Rune!\"","Master Xia said deeply, \"You must find a way to have the Ancestor in your clan plant a special Eternal Life Rune on you, only then will your future be considered truly secure, and the Xia family will be assured in recommending you for position.\"","Xiao Tianquan frowned, his expression somewhat hesitant.","The Xiao family is indeed a fifth-grade family, and there are Heaven Void Ancestors in the clan.","It’s just that...","The two Heaven Void Ancestors in the clan, though advanced in years, are still healthy."]},{"number":1681,"title":"Chapter 1681 - 865: Sudden Death_4","paragraphs":["Yet many matters within the family rely on these two Ancestors to strategize and make decisions.","On ordinary days, the Xiao family also depends on these two as their facade to maintain their network of Taoists and intimidate other forces.","These two Ancestors must not encounter any mishap.","Ultimately, the Xiao family is merely a weak fifth-grade house, without deep roots; every Heaven Void cultivator is exceedingly precious.","But planting a special Eternal Life Rune is too taxing on a Heaven Void cultivator.","Unless one’s life is utterly exhausted and the Great Dao is hopeless, no Ancestor would easily plant an Eternal Life Rune.","Among the families, those who can truly plant an Eternal Life Rune are, apart from the unattainably elevated sixth-grade families, only those powerful fifth-grade clans with at least five Heaven Void cultivators and profound foundations.","The Xiao family is far from having such qualification.","Therefore, Xiao Tianquan felt troubled, \"Inspector, this might not be too easy...\"","Master Xia said indifferently, \"We cultivators cultivate the way of Tao, facing innumerable difficulties and obstacles; nothing can ever be easy. This in itself is also a test for you...\"","Xiao Tianquan frowned, \"Is this special Eternal Life Rune really that important?\"","Master Xia sighed slightly:","\"You grew up in a family, enjoying peace since childhood, and do not understand that the cultivation world is filled with endless dangers and unpredictable situations. When cultivation reaches profound levels, there are all kinds of terrifying existences and unnameable methods.\"","\"Without the protection of a special Eternal Life Rune, a slight mistake could lead to unexpected death.\"","\"For ordinary cultivators, it doesn’t matter, but you are different. You bear the high hopes of the family, and the Xia family will also invest significant effort in you, paving the way and assisting your cultivation.\"","\"If you die, the future of the Xiao family is blocked, and all the efforts of the Xia family will also go to waste.\"","\"Therefore, planting a special Eternal Life Rune is of great importance!\"","\"This isn’t just a personal matter for you, nor just for your sake, but also for the Xiao family, for the Xia family, and for the future of our alliance.\"","Upon hearing this, Xiao Tianquan understood the stakes, and he solemnly nodded:","\"Ancestor has always cared for me. I will beg him by all means to plant an Eternal Life Rune for me no matter what.\"","Master Xia nodded, looking comforted.","He lifted his wine cup and said to Xiao Tianquan:","\"In the near future, you may be able to sit at the same table with me, drinking and having a good time, and I will address you as ’Mr. Xiao.’","Xiao Tianquan felt overwhelming joy, his face turning red.","\"Junior will surely not fail to live up to the favor and cultivation of the Inspector!\"","The two raised their cups and drank together.","Xiao Tianquan drained his cup in one gulp, turning even redder.","Master Xia wanted to say more to Xiao Tianquan, but seeing his appearance, he suddenly frowned.","Xiao Tianquan’s face grew redder, his expression more excited, yet, for some reason, his appearance became increasingly strange.","In just an instant, all his excitement turned to fear.","The wine cup fell to the ground, and Xiao Tianquan collapsed, as if witnessing something utterly terrifying, his face turning pale while he struggled to crawl backward.","At the same time, he muttered:","\"It was not me who killed...\"","\"Don’t come looking for me...\"","\"Jin Er, I...\"","His eyes widened, his eyeballs protruded, full of Blood Threads.","It seemed he saw countless souls he had tortured, humiliated, slaughtered, or tormented to death by various means to cultivate Evil Qi.","Now, his Life Soul was extinguished, his Divine Soul unstable, and all Evil Qi rebounded upon him.","As if enveloped by a sea of blood.","Countless souls of the dead gnawed at his soul.","The tormenting pain penetrated his marrow.","Before dying, he deeply experienced the agony of being tormented to death by others.","Fortunately, the process wasn’t long.","After struggling in horror for a moment, Xiao Tianquan bled from all orifices, his breath extinguished, dying miserably on the spot.","The feast, originally full of clinking cups and joyful guests, instantly fell into dead silence.","Master Xia’s pupils vibrated intensely.","The cultivators present were horrified.","The Xiao family’s promising Heaven’s Chosen Son died abruptly in front of Master Xia, the Feathered Immortal, and all the Elders of the Xiao family."]},{"number":1682,"title":"Chapter 1682 - 866: Deadly Calculation","paragraphs":["\"You... Young Master?!\"","Several Elders of the Xiao family, especially those who pinned high hopes on the branch of Xiao Tianquan, disregarded hierarchy and rushed to the main seat. They checked Xiao Tianquan’s breath, felt his pulse, and sensed his Divine Sense. In an instant, their faces turned as pale as white paper.","Some took out Pills and tried to stuff them into Xiao Tianquan’s mouth.","But their hands were trembling, and it took them a long time, without any effect.","Xiao Tianquan’s seven orifices bled ominously, and he had no breath left.","\"Rea... Really... dead...\"","In an instant, everyone felt a chill run through their entire body.","An elderly Elder of the Xiao family looked up at Master Xia, his gaze filled with accusation, blame, and resentment.","Yet, due to the difference in Cultivation and status, he didn’t dare show it too obviously, only saying in a grudging voice:","\"Master Xia... what on earth is going on?\"","The Golden Cores of the Xia family looked at each other in dismay.","Master Xia himself furrowed his brows deeply, losing the calm demeanor he usually maintained.","This matter was indeed too bizarre.","He never imagined that one day someone would suddenly die in front of him without his Perception picking up any clue.","There were no signs of Spiritual Power or Blood Qi, nor any traces of Spiritual Artifacts or Taoist Skills.","Just like that... he drank a cup of wine, went mad, and then died.","To outsiders, it even seemed like...","He, the Feathered Immortal, had killed Xiao Tianquan!","Master Xia approached Xiao Tianquan.","Several Elders of the Xiao family displayed wary expressions, wanting to stop him, but due to Master Xia’s profound Cultivation and imposing demeanor, they hesitated.","At this moment, the elderly Elder of the Xiao family suddenly sighed and said sincerely:","\"Our young master of the Xiao family met with misfortune and died abruptly. I ask Master Xia for a clear judgment and to give us justice.\"","\"Elder!\"","Some of the other Elders of the Xiao family were still indignant.","\"Shut up!\" The elderly Elder of the Xiao family sternly reprimanded in a low voice and shook his head, saying, \"This matter has nothing to do with Master Xia.\"","The Xia family and the Xiao family had an alliance, with Xiao Tianquan being a key figure.","Master Xia had no reason to kill the young master of the Xiao family.","Moreover, if he wanted to kill, he wouldn’t do it in such a setting, in front of so many Elders of the Xiao family.","Earlier, the incident happened too suddenly, and the Elders of the Xiao family were in shock and anger, but pondering for a moment now, they realized and no longer stopped Master Xia.","Master Xia approached the gruesomely deceased Xiao Tianquan, examined briefly, and frowned even tighter.","No trace at all...","Even with his years of experience in investigation, he couldn’t find a single clue.","It was as if, in a moment of euphoria, his mind snapped, unable to suppress the Evil Qi, rebounded, the Sea of Consciousness ruptured, bleeding from seven orifices to death...","This is impossible.","Master Xia took out from his sleeve a palm-sized blue jade Compass and was about to deduce Causality. But as soon as the Thought arose, with a flick of his finger, his pupil shrank, and he immediately covered the Compass.","Master Xia said nothing, putting the Compass back into his sleeve slowly.","But no one knew that the hand he hid in his sleeve was also trembling.","At the same time, a deep chill surged in Master Xia’s heart.","Malicious omen!","This was the most menacing omen he had ever sensed, hidden within the Cause and Effect, extremely terrifying.","Master Xia’s gaze became sharp.","The Heavenly Mechanism Technique is quite special and not all cultivators would study it, and most wouldn’t even believe it.","But he had once heard from an expert:","Do not observe the heavenly secrets, do not spy on Cause and Effect, misfortune and blessing are unpredictable, life is not controlled by oneself.","This line left a deep impression on him.","Therefore, after his Feather Transformation, he put great effort and devotion into seeking guidance from an Ancestor in his clan, spending well over a decade before gaining the Ancestor’s wisdom, learning a bit of the Heavenly Mechanism Technique.","But the Dao of the Heavenly Mechanism stands unique, vastly different from the usual spell point of cultivation.","He learned it after Feather Transformation, and to date, has only grasped bits and pieces.","But just these few bits \"pieces,\" have overturned his understanding of the entire Cultivation World.","Some things, appearing to be natural disasters, are in truth caused by humans.","Under seemingly foolish appearances lie deep and vast machinations and calculations.","The people of the world, each appearing \"independent\", are in fact puppets set on a pre-ordained Divine Sense track, wound with a \"spring.\"","And now, his understanding was overturned once more.","He personally experienced that the \"great terror\" spoken of by the Ancestor existing within the Heavenly Mechanism Causality is indeed real...","Master Xia remembered deeply that the Ancestor of the Xia family once said:","\"Heavenly Mechanism Causality, measure if you can, refrain if you can.\"","Measure if you can’ means, don’t be afraid to waste Divine Sense, don’t be lazy, check Causality more often in leisure, some apparently simple matters may hide heavenly secrets.","\"Refrain if you can\" means, once there is a premonition of danger, stop immediately to avoid calculating something that shouldn’t be calculated, drawing an unknown great disaster.","Previously he was always \"measure if you can\", but now, he encountered for the first time the situation of \"refrain if you can\".","Master Xia’s expression was extremely grave.","The Elders of the Xiao family looked at each other in panic when they saw this, and asked in a low voice: \"Lord Inspector, have you found anything?\"","Master Xia came back to his senses, his face as calm as water. After a moment, his eyes flashed with insight, and he said slowly:","\"The meridians of the flesh, the Qi Sea, and the Sea of Consciousness, all self-destructed without any sign of external force... Either there was a mistake in cultivation, or...\"","Master Xia paused slightly, then said firmly, \"A Heavenly Mechanism Great Power used the Causality Skill to sever his vitality!\""]},{"number":1683,"title":"Chapter 1683 - 866: Deadly Scheme (Part 2)","paragraphs":["As soon as these words were spoken, the elders of the Xiao family all changed color.","Heavenly Mechanism Great Power!","\"Master Xia, do you know...\"","Master Xia shook his head and sighed, \"Even though I have reached the Feather Transformation Realm, my understanding of the Way of Cause and Effect is not deep. I just calculated a little, but couldn’t figure anything out...\"","The elderly elder of the Xiao family frowned, then sighed, \"Then we can only go back and ask the Ancestor to take action.\"","Master Xia said nothing.","Elder Xiao hesitated for a moment, cupped his hands towards Master Xia, and said, \"I have another favor to ask.\"","Master Xia nodded, \"Please speak freely.\"","The Xiao family elder said, \"This matter is peculiar, and to avoid gossip, could I ask Lord Inspector to keep this matter confidential and not mention it to others.\"","Master Xia said, \"Naturally, at this point in the matter, it’s not what my Xia family wishes either. The nephew from the Xiao family was extraordinarily talented with a promising future, which I held in high regard. It’s a pity that Heaven is jealous of the talented, and I also feel very regretful.\"","After speaking, Master Xia added lightly:","\"The deceased is of great importance. Perhaps in life, he was young and impetuous with some flaws in his behavior. But now that he is dead, everything should be put to rest. If others inquire, the Taoist Court will say he died in the line of duty, giving my worthy nephew some dignity.\"","The Xiao family elders all cupped their hands in gratitude, saying, \"Master Xia is compassionate and benevolent, thank you very much.\"","As for what kind of character Xiao Tianquan was and what he did, some among these elders knew, while others did not.","But even if they didn’t know beforehand, seeing him die a sudden and tragic death, with a terrified expression, it was clear he had done something guilty and was receiving retribution.","Xiao Tianquan was at the core of the Xiao family’s direct lineage, sharing in the family’s honor and shame.","If he had truly committed some scandal, the shame would fall upon the entire Xiao family if it were exposed.","The fact that Master Xia was willing to let bygones be bygones and give face to the Xiao family was naturally the best outcome.","The Xiao family elder said, \"We will return Tianquan’s son’s remains as soon as possible and report back to the Ancestor, who also has expertise in the Way of Cause and Effect. He should be able to find out who exactly was behind the schemes against our family’s direct lineage...\"","Master Xia said with satisfaction, \"That’s very good.\"","Then, he became slightly stern and casually remarked:","\"Tianquan was cursed to death in public, which was both a provocation to my Xia family and a slap in the face to the Xiao family. The person behind this is likely an enemy of the Xiao family, unwilling for our two families to form ties, and thus laid such a sinister trap.\"","\"If the Xiao family’s Ancestor is proficient in the Way of Cause and Effect, please have the old man definitely calculate the causation here and see who is secretly attacking. Not only the Xiao family, but my Xia family will also not let this person go.\"","The Xiao family elder cupped hands saying, \"Thank you very much, Master Xia, for your good intentions. I will certainly report to the Ancestor and ask him to deliberate.\"","Master Xia nodded.","After that, the feast abruptly ended.","Originally, the guests were all merrily enjoying themselves, but no one expected bloodshed, resulting in a death, making the atmosphere somewhat eerie.","The Xiao family’s elder didn’t dare to delay, using a coffin to collect Xiao Tianquan’s body, gathering all his possessions, bidding farewell to Master Xia, and then hurriedly returning to the Xiao family.","Master Xia watched them leave, but when looking at Xiao Tianquan’s coffin, a hint of unavoidable disdain finally appeared in his eyes as he sighed softly:","\"What a pity, for the special Eternal Life Rune’s seed came too late...\"","...","Xiao Tianquan died, and the news was kept under wraps, but it couldn’t be completely concealed. At least there would definitely be some rumors from the Taoist Court.","Because Xiao Tianquan was the Enforcement Leader of the Taoist Court.","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official were dealing with the aftermath of the Rouge Boat when they received a document.","This was a document within the Taoist Court that only cultivators at the rank of Supervisor and above could see.","It contained only a few words, without any background, simple and direct:","\"Xiao family’s Enforcement Leader Xiao Tianquan, courageous and fearless, died in the line of duty.\"","Gu Changhuai and Xia Canonical Official were stunned, momentarily thinking they had misread it.","After repeated confirmations, waves of shock surged in their hearts.","Not long after parting, Xiao Tianquan, who was sheltered by the Feather Transformation Realm’s Master Xia, actually just...","Died?","The so-called dying in the line of duty was merely an excuse.","The real situation, surely, was that the cause of his death was not suitable for public disclosure.","The two raised their heads, exchanging glances, a thought simultaneously emerging in their minds:","How did he die?","Or rather... who killed Xiao Tianquan? How was it done?","Despite racking their brains, they couldn’t fathom who or by what means could kill the Xiao family’s most direct disciple right under the nose of the Feather Transformation Realm?","The room’s atmosphere fell silent for a while.","Both pondered, still clueless.","A moment later, several more official documents were delivered, all indicating that within one day, across the Qian Learning state boundary and its surrounding regions, numerous fleeing Evil Cultivators, Sin Cultivators detained in the Taoist Prison, family disciples, and even some sect disciples, had suddenly died.","They were of various identities, and died in different manners, but without exception, all were mysterious and sudden deaths.","Gu Changhuai and his companion furrowed their brows even tighter.","\"Sudden death...\"","Gu Changhuai muttered.","This term seemed somewhat familiar to him.","After a moment, he suddenly recalled the words Mo Hua had said previously at the Mistwater City tavern:","\"Heaven sees what people do. The Howling Celestial Dog, having committed many unrighteous deeds, might any day be struck down by Heaven and suddenly drop dead...\"","Not only did Gu Changhuai remember, but Xia Canonical Official also recalled.","The two looked at each other, both finding it unbelievable.","\"Mo...\"","Xia Canonical Official began but saw Gu Changhuai shaking his head, clearly indicating not to bring up that name now.","Xia Canonical Official swallowed the name \"Mo Hua,\" with a stunned expression saying:","\"This should... be a coincidence, right?\"","She thought for a moment, her eyes suddenly focusing, and asked Gu Changhuai, \"Did you yesterday...\""]},{"number":1684,"title":"Chapter 1684 - 866: Dire Divination (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai nodded: \"Sent back, sent to the mountain gate of Taixu Gate, he should be in the Sect now, practicing diligently.\"","Xia Canonical Official sighed in relief.","In that case, it should have nothing to do with Mo Hua.","After all, he just said a sentence.","It couldn’t possibly be that with Mo Hua’s \"Words Become Law,\" whoever he wants dead, dies, right?","Xia Canonical Official shook his head.","But in Gu Changhuai’s heart, he vaguely felt it wasn’t that simple.","Based on his understanding of Mo Hua, he wouldn’t say such words without reason.","If nothing had happened, it would be fine.","But now that his words have come true, they are by no means empty words.","He said Xiao Tianquan \"perished for his injustice,\" probably because he had already concluded that Xiao Tianquan was doomed at that time.","Why...","Gu Changhuai frowned, since he entered the Qian Learning State Boundary, he had known Mo Hua for five years.","During these five years, Mo Hua’s growth in stature was not obvious, but his skills improved by leaps and bounds.","Moreover, they were advances that ordinary people wouldn’t notice.","His cultivation might be unremarkable, but formations, Taoist Skills, and various other methods were emerging endlessly.","From being initially unfathomable, it now possessed an air of \"incomprehensibility.\"","Words that became prophecy, Words Become Law.","Whether Xiao Tianquan’s death had nothing to do with Mo Hua didn’t surprise him.","But if it did, he also wouldn’t be surprised.","Even if Mo Hua’s words dictated Xiao Tianquan’s life and death, such an outrageous thing, Gu Changhuai now found not so hard to accept...","But this matter, he still quietly buried in his heart, not telling anyone.","...","Meanwhile, in Mistwater City.","Ye Hong still hadn’t given up on revenge.","Even knowing it was impossible, he was now alone, having nothing left to lose.","Therefore, he was also fearless.","Three days later, he finally managed to hear some news by all means.","Xiao Tianquan, died in the line of duty...","At that moment, Ye Hong was equally incredulous, then remembered what Mo Hua said to him.","\"Man acts, Heaven watches...\"","Ye Hong chuckled bitterly, shedding two lines of clear tears.","He went to the Mistwater River again, pouring a jug of wine by the riverbank, paying tribute to his unjustly deceased children, then facing eastward, toward the Qianxue State Boundary, where Taixu Gate was, he bowed thrice and kowtowed, saying:","\"Thank you, sir, for your great kindness!\"","\"May your Great Dao succeed, saving the world, wishing for a Qian Dao to shine, with fairness and justice in Heaven and Earth.\"","...","The Xiao family.","In a certain secret and majestic cave mansion within the Forbidden Land.","The white-haired, black-clad Xiao Family Ancestor looked at the lifeless Xiao Tianquan, who died bleeding from the seven orifices, with sadness and rage, his body trembling.","This was his most beloved great-great-grandson.","He was deemed the direct lineage successor who would inherit his mantle and take the Xiao family further.","But now, this most cherished great-great-grandson died inexplicably.","The Xiao Family Ancestor, full of blood threads in his eyes, spoke in a voice as cold as a frozen pond:","\"What happened?\"","Beside him, the Xiao family Elder dared not lift his head, lowly recounting everything that happened at the banquet, then slowly said:","\"Ancestor, do you think this might be Master Xia...\"","The Xiao Family Ancestor sneered, \"He’s not a fool. Why would he kill my grandson without reason and in public? Moreover, this person is deep-minded, far from being as simple as you think, he would never do such a senseless act, forming a deadly grudge with our Xiao family...\"","\"What Ancestor says is true...\" said the Xiao Family Elder.","The Xiao Family Ancestor, with an angry expression, forcibly suppressed it and asked again: \"Quan’er died in front of him, did he say anything?\"","The Xiao Family Elder said: \"Master Xia said there were no external injuries on Mr. Tianquan, and now dead, it must be either due to cultivation errors or... a Heavenly Mechanism Great Power severed his life force through Causality Skill.\"","\"Heavenly Mechanism Great Power...\" the Xiao Family Ancestor snorted, \"Where are there so many Heavenly Mechanism Great Powers? Why would a Heavenly Mechanism Great Power, with all that effort, come to kill a Foundation Establishment direct lineage of our Xiao family? If they had such power, why not just come for me?\"","The Elder Xiao dared not respond.","The Xiao Family Ancestor’s gaze darkened, suddenly asking: \"Did that Master Xia calculate himself? Couldn’t figure it out?\"","The Elder Xiao recalled, \"He did take out a blue jade compass, calculated a bit, but quickly furrowed his brow, put the compass away, it seemed indeed he calculated, but lacked the ability, couldn’t find out anything...\"","The Xiao Family Ancestor nodded, feeling slightly relieved.","\"Give orders to set up the Heavenly Mechanism Compass, prepare items for Causality, then clear everyone out, seal the cave mansion, and do not allow anyone to disturb.\"","\"Yes.\"","The Elder Xiao knew this Ancestor of the Xiao family acquired a secret lineage of the Heavenly Secret Technique by chance and had profound attainments.","The reason the Xiao family could become a Fifth grade family was largely due to the Ancestor using this Heavenly Secret Technique to seek fortunes and avoid calamities, navigating various forces.","Their recent defection from Gui Water Sect to ally with the Xia family was also divined by the Ancestor.","It was the chance for the Xiao family to advance further.","However, this Cause and Effect now seemed to develop some \"unexpected changes\"...","The Elder Xiao felt a slight unease, but in front of the Ancestor, he dared not speak, merely arranged everything properly, then sent others away, sealing the cave mansion.","He knew the Ancestor was authoritative and regarded the Heavenly Mechanism Technique as a treasure, absolutely forbidding anyone to peek during deductions.","The grand door slowly closed, the cave mansion sealed.","The Xiao Family Ancestor sat alone in front of Xiao Tianquan’s corpse.","Not long before, this energetic, promising great-great-grandson often came to see him, sweetly calling him \"Ancestor,\" yet in a blink of an eye, they were separated by death, the elder sending off the younger."]},{"number":1685,"title":"Chapter 1685 - 866: Malignant Divination (Part 4)","paragraphs":["In his heart, the sorrow deepened.","This \"sorrow\" impacted his mind, leading him to commit a major taboo:","If the Taoist Heart is unsettled, one must not spy on heavenly secrets or deduce cause and effect.","But at this moment, he could no longer care about such matters.","He must find out who dared to commit this outrageous act, leading to the death of the Xiao family’s Heaven’s Chosen Son.","Moreover, that Inspector from the Xia family was merely a Feather Transformation, barely scraping the surface of cause and effect, and nothing happened when he calculated.","As for himself, a Heaven Void who had studied the heavenly secrets for many years, shielding the Xiao family from harm countless times—though he might not deduce anything, there shouldn’t be any serious consequences.","The Xiao Family Ancestor silently recited the Heavenly Mechanism Technique, Divine Thought swirling, and began deducing upon the bloody corpse of Xiao Tianquan.","He calculated the cause and effect of Xiao Tianquan.","Yet as he calculated, he was suddenly shocked.","Heavenly secrets circulated, cause and effect reversed.","The Xiao Family Ancestor saw his great-grandson, outside, using torture, wantonly killing.","He saw him on the Rouge Boat, indulging in revelry, depraved beyond measure.","He saw him in a water village, slaughtering cultivators, then sacrificing them all to an unknown altar...","No!","Not right!","The Xiao Family Ancestor’s expression changed.","This person, who killed without hesitation, filled with Evil Qi, and with a fierce gaze, was not the obedient and understanding great-grandson he knew!","Why?","Why had he never noticed before?","What had obscured his understanding?","Now that Xiao Tianquan was dead, the fog lifted, and the truth surfaced?","The Xiao Family Ancestor suddenly felt a chill on his back.","He continued with the deduction...","At this moment, a trace of a heavenly secret warning suddenly appeared.","But the Xiao Family Ancestor, swayed by emotions and turmoil, ignored this warning.","He wanted to know what his seemingly obedient great-grandson truly did.","And, who exactly killed him!","Even if his great-grandson’s actions were disgraceful, he was still part of the Xiao family; it was not for outsiders to condemn him.","Even if he was guilty of death, it should be the Ancestor’s duty to personally punish him, not for outsiders to have the right to kill his grandson!","Unconsciously, a blood-red hue emerged in the eyes of the Xiao Family Ancestor.","He continued deducing, and soon, saw the Dragon King Temple.","He saw a group of people in the Dragon King Temple, but all of them appeared hazy, unclear.","Especially, among them trailed a presence that seemed both present and absent, like a wraith.","He knew not if this \"little ghost\" was a living person or something else, but its presence was so unique, one could not ignore it.","As if this little ghost was the core of the group, and the deepest source of Xiao Tianquan’s resentment.","But this little ghost always had its back to the Xiao Family Ancestor.","The Xiao Family Ancestor wished for a glimpse of this little ghost’s visage, thus expending more Divine Thought, pushing his Heavenly Mechanism Technique to its limits.","But before he could calculate anything, the little ghost suddenly paused, as if sensing someone wanted to observe him.","He met the Xiao Family Ancestor’s expectations and slowly turned to face him.","In his daze, the Xiao Family Ancestor finally saw the little ghost’s face.","This was a terrifying visage, oozing Black Blood, like that of something freshly hatched from an embryo, adorned with eerie ram horns.","The little ghost grinned at the Xiao Family Ancestor, revealing an innocent yet bizarre smile.","The Xiao Family Ancestor silently drew in a cold breath.","A chill surged directly to his crown.","Anger receded, and he finally came back to his senses.","He finally realized he seemed to have committed an extremely fatal mistake.","It seemed he calculated something he should never have attempted to calculate.","The Xiao Family Ancestor forced himself to remain calm, silently averting his gaze, attempting to withdraw his Divine Thought from the little ghost’s gaze.","However, a more immense, more ancient, and deeply frightening aura gradually approached from all around.","As if due to his disturbance, some sinister \"entity\" was slowly awakening from its eternal slumber..."]},{"number":1686,"title":"Chapter 1686 - 867: Corruption","paragraphs":["The Xiao Family Ancestor was torn with grief and anger.","Threads of black mist were seeping into his Divine Thought through the seven orifices of his avatar, invading his Divine Soul, bit by bit eroding, polluting, and corrupting him.","The Xiao Family Ancestor couldn’t understand.","How on earth had his precious descendant provoked such a terrifying entity?","This monstrous presence was akin to the legendary \"Evil God\" or \"Heavenly Demon,\" a \"taboo\" even he, the Heaven Void Ancestor, feared immensely.","When did such an existence begin spreading within the Qian Learning State Boundary...","The Xiao Family Ancestor couldn’t fathom it.","But in the face of such a life-threatening crisis, there was no time for deep contemplation.","The Xiao Family Ancestor utilized all his Heavenly Secret knowledge, activating a Divine Thought Skill.","His Divine Thought avatar started to crack like shedding skin, discarding a whole layer of polluted Divine Thought in a bid to rid himself of the corruption and ensure the purity of his own Divine Soul.","Divine Shedding Skill!","This was the final and most difficult Divine Secret Skill in the Heavenly Mechanism Skill he had acquired through great fortune.","Through this secret technique, one could shed the Divine Body like a snake shedding its skin, preserving the Divine Soul.","Although greatly damaging the Divine Sense, it purged the polluted Divine Thought, retaining the purest origin.","This was a \"cutting off the arm to survive\" Divine Thought Skill, created to counter various unknown entities and strange corruptions within the Divine Thought.","It was the most challenging secret technique in his inherited knowledge.","The Xiao Family Ancestor originally thought he wouldn’t need it in his lifetime.","But unexpectedly, his beloved descendant brought him this shocking \"big surprise,\" forcing him to confront this \"great horror\" with almost no warning.","The Xiao Family Ancestor’s Divine Thought began shedding.","The skin cracked inch by inch, shedding most of the Divine Thought along with the polluted black mist.","A \"miniature version\" of the pure Xiao Family Ancestor broke out from the abdomen of the shed form, not looking back at the little demon nor at the root of the \"horror,\" fleeing directly beyond the Cause and Effect.","The situation was extremely urgent.","Time was also of the essence.","One needed the determination to \"cut off an arm,\" and grasp this rare opportunity without missing a second.","Hesitate slightly, and there would be no place to die or be buried.","The Xiao Family Ancestor’s shedded form desperately fled beyond the Cause and Effect.","The little demon no longer looked at him, seemingly captivated by the discarded grand Divine Thought of the Heaven Void Realm.","The \"horrible\" existence continued to spread the polluted black mist.","It seemed to be on the verge of awakening, missing a certain ritual or a medium to house itself; it was about to awaken but seemed not yet awakened.","If it were, just a glance could pollute a Heaven Void.","The Xiao Family Ancestor felt a sense of fortune.","His luck was bad, yet also extremely good.","Otherwise, it would have nearly meant a total disaster.","This encounter finally showed him what the \"great terror\" in the Heavenly Secret truly was.","This would greatly benefit his future cultivation in the Way of Cause and Effect.","\"First, escape out...\"","The Xiao Family Ancestor fled outward relentlessly, fleeing farther and farther, almost able to leap beyond Cause and Effect, escaping this nightmare.","Yet at this moment, suddenly a distortion surged, and the Xiao Family Ancestor seemed to run into something head-on.","A stench of rot wafted over.","It seemed like a corpse.","After the Divine Shedding, the Xiao Family Ancestor raised his head to see a \"Copper Corpse,\" eyes like a sea of blood, body like ancient bronze, towering and fierce.","The Xiao Family Ancestor tensed up.","The Copper Corpse wasn’t terrifying.","In his eyes as a Heaven Void Ancestor, a mere Copper Corpse was just a low-level Zombie in the Foundation Establishment Realm.","However, this was within the Cause and Effect, within the Heavenly Secret deduction...","Where did the Copper Corpse come from?","The Xiao Family Ancestor scrutinized slightly, seeing the Copper Corpse’s eyes, its condescending majesty, the overwhelming Blood Qi, and behind it, the faint image of Corpse Mountain and a sea of blood, sending chills to his core until his organs trembled.","\"This isn’t an ordinary Copper Corpse, this is... commanding the corpses, born with the sea of blood... Corpse King?\"","\"This damn thing is... Taoist Demon?!\"","Like the chill of winter, a basin of cold water was dumped overhead.","The Xiao Family Ancestor felt icy cold all over, face ashen.","He never thought he would encounter such a scene in his lifetime.","A bizarre Evil Embryo demon, a slumbering Ancient Evil God, a road-blocking Corpse King Taoist Demon...","The Xiao Family Ancestor didn’t know how he ultimately escaped such a scenario.","When his Divine Thought struggled back to his own Sea of Consciousness, there wasn’t a hint of relief from surviving the disaster, only endless unease and terror.","His Divine Soul bore the wounds of the Taoist Demon, the pollution of the Evil God, and the bite marks of the Evil Embryo.","His forehead was darkened, eyes empty, face white as paper, with blood threads at the corners of his eyes.","Clearly alive, he appeared like a \"living corpse.\"","His Divine Thought, already shed like a cocoon through the Divine Shedding Skill, was thus greatly weakened.","Yet despite the extreme weakness of his Divine Thought, his desires were abundant.","His heart seemed filled with countless cravings and desires.","The Xiao Family Ancestor sat numb, as if bereaved of father and mother, before Xiao Tianquan’s bloodied corpse, muttering to himself:","\"It’s over...\"","\"The Xiao family is finished, everything, all is finished...\"","\"I... am no longer me, what exactly am I...\"","The door of the cave mansion remained tightly shut, with no answer.","...","Several days later.","Aboard the Xia family’s Spirit Boat."]},{"number":1687,"title":"Chapter 1687 - 867: Contamination (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Master Xia is writing a letter.","The first letter is addressed to a powerful Elder of the Xia family, but he didn’t leave a name, only writing, \"To the Elder\":","\"There’s a change in plan.\"","\"Xiao Tianquan suddenly died, the cause is unknown. The plan to control the Xiao family needs to be re-discussed.\"","\"If it doesn’t work out, we can only try to gradually control the Taoist Court through the Gui Water Sect, using the distractions of the sect competition to scheme a major plan.\"","\"Xia Ronger is not sensible, unable to be put to good use. Henceforth, reduce the support from the family by 30%...\"","Master Xia paused for a moment, then added, \"...suspend Xia Ronger’s betrothal arrangements.\"","He then concisely summarized the recent situation surrounding the Qian Learning State Boundary and the movements of various families before sealing the letter and calling a trusted follower. He instructed the follower to send it back to the family via the Xia family’s secret Original Magnet channel.","Afterward, he began writing the second letter:","This letter, it is unknown who it is to, as there was no header and he didn’t sign his name.","\"Xiao Tianquan’s body has been returned to the Xiao family.\"","\"The Xiao Family Ancestor has closed the cave, and given his habits, he might be deducing cause and effect to find the perpetrator, but...\"","Master Xia looked rather solemn, \"Since the cave was sealed, it’s been three days without opening. Not only that, the Xiao Family Ancestor also ordered that no Xiao family cultivator is to come near the cave, and he has been in seclusion without any news ever since...\"","\"It’s very possible that the Xiao Family Ancestor has already been ’polluted.’\"","Writing down the word \"pollution,\" Master Xia felt cold sweat on his back.","\"Though unexpected, a Heaven Void from the Xiao family is as good as wasted...\"","\"The Pavilion Elder wasn’t wrong either; there is indeed an evil presence looming over the Qianxue State Boundary, with dark and sinister things growing...\"","\"It’s just that the families are xenophobic and the sects have different intentions, making it temporarily impossible to intervene or know the inside details.\"","\"If things can’t be done, it’s better to make early plans...\"","...","Master Xia finished writing, stored the letter, placed it into a Golden Sword, and with a light flick of his finger, the sword vanished.","He then breathed a long sigh of relief, still feeling apprehensive.","\"The Ancestor did not deceive me, ’better not to divine if unnecessary,’ it was almost myself that got ’polluted.’\"","No, it’s not just \"pollution.\"","The Xiao Family Ancestor, with his Heaven Void cultivation and deep grasp of heavenly secrets, ended up like this, with little hope of survival. If it were me, I might not survive the encounter.\"","Master Xia sighed and frowned.","Cultivation is perilous, especially the mysteries of heavenly secrets.","One cannot tell what terrible entity Xiao Tianquan provoked...","...","Inside the Taixu Gate.","This \"terrible\" entity is currently in the Tao Teaching Room, teaching his Junior Brother and Junior Sister the Formation.","\"Remember these Formation Patterns, the sect assessment will likely test them...\"","\"And these Formation designs, memorize them well, you’ll definitely need them when you’re out on tasks...\"","Mo Hua said in a meticulous manner.","He taught earnestly, and his Junior Brother and Sister listened attentively.","Under Mo Hua’s guidance, the disciples of this batch at Taixu Gate advanced quickly in Formations.","A fellow Junior Brother of the same term, even younger by a year or two, could teach Formations from the podium, which invisibly motivated these disciples.","Initially, the fellow disciples learned Formations from Mo Hua with the ambition of \"definitely surpassing Junior Brother.\"","Later, when they found that the more they tried to \"surpass,\" the greater the gap grew, they faced reality.","Their goal shifted from \"surpass Junior Brother\" to \"keep up with Junior Brother.\"","Then it shifted again to \"not fall too far behind Junior Brother.\"","Finally, due to circumstances, it changed to \"not fail to understand Junior Brother’s teachings...\"","And Mo Hua’s position in Taixu Gate was also quite detached.","The Ancestor favored him, the Elders indulged him, and he held significant prestige among the disciples.","Therefore, he could miss classes for quite a while when he went to the Dragon King Temple, and upon returning, continued to cultivate and attend classes normally, with no one questioning it.","There were disciples genuinely curious about where Mo Hua went and what he did, constantly inquiring.","Mo Hua assigned Formation homework, and they had no time to ask anymore.","Thus, life in the sect returned to normal.","Yet Mo Hua’s heart was somewhat bothered by a thorn.","That is the \"Evil Embryo\" of the Master of the Great Wilderness embedded within his Divine Soul.","A few days ago, the Evil Embryo in his Divine Soul was unusually excited for some unknown reason, as if it had an incredible feast from somewhere...","This startled Mo Hua greatly.","He even thought that the Evil Embryo broke through his Divine Formation and began devouring his own Divine Soul.","Upon thorough inspection, he found it hadn’t.","This \"Evil Embryo\" ate something unknown.","He does not know which unfortunate soul ended up feeding it.","Though it wasn’t himself that was \"eaten,\" it served as a warning to Mo Hua.","This \"Evil Embryo,\" even sealed by him, still possesses some unpredictable means, gradually growing stronger.","Should it grow strong enough to break through his Divine Formation one day, it could unknowingly further pollute his Divine Thought, thereby severely threatening his Divine Soul.","If his Divine Soul becomes completely polluted, he and it become indistinguishable, essentially becoming a \"little Evil God.\"","\"Troublesome...\"","\"As expected, Evil Gods are not to be trifled with.\"","Mo Hua frowned tightly.","But right now, he has no effective means to completely remove this parasite and purify its \"pollution.\"","Nor does he dare mention it to Elder Master Xun."]},{"number":1688,"title":"Chapter 1688 - 867: Contamination_3","paragraphs":["If Elder Master Xun suddenly decided to \"sacrifice his kin for righteousness,\" he would truly be left with tears in his eyes.","The future was uncertain, but for now, he could suppress the Evil Embryo and prevent it from spreading.","He remained himself, rather than becoming the embryo of the Evil God.","The problem, however, was that he didn’t know what the future held.","Mo Hua pondered for a long time, without any leads, then decided to let it go, taking it one step at a time.","When the carriage reaches the mountain, there will be a way.","The Evil Embryo was sealed, so during this time, as long as he was careful, it would be fine.","For now, the priority was to eat the \"dish\" he had ordered.","Mo Hua, in the altar at the Dragon King Temple, had marked many Demon Monsters, and what followed would be a grand feast, so he needed to prepare well.","Before this, Mo Hua specifically consulted Elder Xun Zixian, indirectly seeking clarification on the relationship between the Divine Soul and Divine Sense, and confirmed that devouring pure Divine Thought would not affect the Divine Soul or cause any changes to it, nor would it foster the growth of the Evil Embryo. Only then did he feel at ease.","But with this assurance came another issue:","He had marked too many.","All these Demon Monsters would invade Yu Er’s nightmares.","He could handle it on his own, as it’s not easy for Demon Monsters to harm him.","But if he wasn’t careful and lost control, leading to a Demon Monster rampage, Yu Er would be in danger.","He could set up a Divine Tao Array, but he felt that just a simple Divine Tao Array wasn’t secure enough.","The best solution would be if someone could help him manage the gaps on the level of Divine Thought, to hold the fort, allowing him to be completely at ease.","But this matter was difficult to explain to others.","Moreover, not every cultivator’s Divine Sense could withstand battles with Demon Monsters as well as his own.","With the \"meal delivery\" day approaching, Mo Hua felt a bit troubled.","After class that day, he pondered this matter as he walked.","Passing by the water-facing library on the north side of the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua caught a glimpse of a big white dog lying on the ground, bored.","Mo Hua paused for a moment, then his eyes lit up.","He ran to the big white dog.","The big white dog was very alert; as it sensed someone approaching, its fluffy ears perked up, and its aura suddenly shifted to a dignified one. It slowly stood up and let out a low growl.","But halfway through the growl, realizing it was Mo Hua, it let out a slightly weary \"woof,\" and lay back down, looking listless.","\"Why are you so down?\" Mo Hua muttered.","The big white dog lay on the ground, barely lifting its eyelids, gazing at Mo Hua with a touch of melancholy.","Then it drooped its eyelids again, resuming its rest.","Mo Hua leaned in closer and whispered, \"I’ll give you a big feast; will you eat it?\"","The big white dog’s ears twitched, but it still ignored Mo Hua.","It was tired of chicken drumsticks.","And truthfully, it didn’t really enjoy eating chicken drumsticks either; it only did so begrudgingly, out of regard for Mo Hua.","\"It’s not a chicken drumstick.\"","Understanding the big white dog’s meaning, Mo Hua quietly said, \"It’s something even more delicious...\"","The big white dog turned its head, its big eyes looking at Mo Hua a little confused.","Mo Hua thought for a moment, unsure of how to explain. Suddenly, an idea came to him, and he pulled out a bone sword from his storage bag.","\"This thing...\"","The big white dog was stunned, then instinctively sniffed, catching a whiff of a demonic scent from the sword.","Demon Monster!","The big white dog’s eyes lit up, and it couldn’t help but drool.","It opened its mouth wide, trying to swallow the bone sword whole.","Fortunately, Mo Hua, with quick reflexes, swiftly put the sword away.","The bone it was eyeing disappeared, and the big white dog glared at Mo Hua furiously.","Mo Hua glared back.","As it met Mo Hua’s gaze, the big white dog’s fury gradually subsided, and it lay back on the ground, but couldn’t help glancing at Mo Hua’s hand.","At this moment, the spirit inhabiting the bone sword nearly had its soul scared out of it.","It was truly afraid that Mo Hua, growing tired and seeking novelty, would whimsically decide to feed it to a dog.","This little ancestor had such unexpected antics, it was nerve-racking...","The spirit broke out in a cold sweat.","Meanwhile, Mo Hua also warned the big white dog: \"You can’t eat this bone; I still have use for it.\"","The big white dog let out a plaintive whimper, clearly unhappy.","Mo Hua then lured, \"I’ll take you for a feast, much bigger than this bone; will you go?\"","Upon hearing that, the big white dog immediately perked up and, extending its big tongue, nodded eagerly at Mo Hua.","\"Great!\" Mo Hua said happily.","He was about to lead the big white dog away when he realized it was chained with some sort of material that held it to the library, unable to leave.","Mo Hua frowned, then remembered this seemed to be the Sect Leader’s dog.","\"Sect Leader...\"","Mo Hua rubbed his chin.","He wasn’t very familiar with the Sect Leader; so far, he’d only seen him a few times at the annual opening ceremony.","And last time, when he was \"bullying\" the big white dog at the library entrance, he had been caught red-handed by him.","However, even then, the Sect Leader didn’t reproach him.","Moreover, he was gentle and elegant, with a refined temperament, appearing very approachable.","\"Should I ask the Sect Leader to borrow the dog?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and decided to give it a try.","But he didn’t know where the Sect Leader lived, so whenever he had the time, he waited near the library, hoping for a chance encounter with the Sect Leader.","Two days later, he indeed encountered him.","The Taixu Sect Master, slightly plump with a rosy complexion and a full head of thick black hair, upon arriving at the library, immediately noticed Mo Hua squatting at the entrance, causing him a brief moment of surprise.","\"Mo Hua?\"","\"Hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded.","\"What’s the matter?\" The Taixu Sect Master asked gently.","\"Sect Leader,\" Mo Hua said softly, \"I have a small request, and I wonder if you could agree to it...\"","The Taixu Sect Master was a bit surprised but also intrigued.","In all his years as Sect Leader, few disciples had ever dared to directly make requests of him.","\"Tell me.\" The Taixu Sect Master nodded.","Mo Hua pointed to the big white dog outside the door, \"Could you lend me this dog for two days? Or even a day would be fine...\"","Borrow the dog?","The Taixu Sect Master was taken aback and didn’t respond for a moment.","\"Is it not possible...\" Mo Hua said quietly.","\"It’s not that it’s impossible, it’s just...\" The Taixu Sect Master was a bit puzzled, \"Why do you want to borrow this dog?\"","\"To guard the door!\" Mo Hua said with confidence.","The Taixu Sect Master was momentarily at a loss for words.","This kid actually thinks of this exotic beast with residual divine beast bloodline as a \"guard dog\"...","He warned, \"This... dog is very dangerous.\"","\"It’s fine, I get along well with it; I even fed it chicken legs.\" Mo Hua replied.","The Taixu Sect Master gently shook his head and said, \"Fine, but I’m warning you, this beast is proud and wild, not easily tamed. Be careful...\"","Turning, he saw that the supposedly \"proud\" and \"wild\" large dog, now freed from its chain, was obediently following Mo Hua, happily wagging its tail...","```"]},{"number":1689,"title":"Chapter 1689 - 868: Stirred Up","paragraphs":["Mo Hua entered the Disciple’s Residence with a big white dog in tow, drawing astonished looks from the disciples along the way.","\"Junior Brother, according to Sect rules, disciples aren’t allowed to keep spirit pets...\"","\"This isn’t a spirit pet,\" Mo Hua corrected, \"This is the big dog the Sect Leader uses for guarding. I borrowed it for a bit.\"","\"The Sect Leader...\"","All the disciples were dumbstruck, thinking to themselves, despite claiming you have no connections, being able to borrow the Sect Leader’s dog just like that, isn’t this the treatment one would expect for the Ancestor’s direct grandson...","They whispered among themselves.","The big white dog held its head high and strutted.","Following behind Mo Hua, it trotted along happily.","Once inside the Disciple’s Residence, surrounded by a group of disciples, the big white dog became quite arrogant, raising its head high, looking at people disdainfully.","Indeed, it looked like the \"Sect Leader’s dog.\"","\"Junior Brother, why did you borrow this dog?\" A curious disciple asked.","\"I have something important to do,\" Mo Hua replied seriously.","\"Something important?\" The crowd didn’t understand.","Mo Hua found it difficult to explain to them.","Tonight was the day the Demon Monster would \"deliver takeout,\" and this big dog was invited to \"join the feast.\"","It wasn’t early anymore, he needed to hurry and prepare.","Seeing the crowd still asking questions, Mo Hua put on a stern face, \"Have you finished your Formation homework yet?\"","The disciples felt guilty at heart and quickly scattered.","Mo Hua shook his head and led the big white dog to Yu Er’s room.","Wenren Wei looked visibly startled.","\"Young Master Mo, this is...\"","Mo Hua said sternly, \"I have a premonition that Yu Er might be in danger tonight. Perhaps a Demon Monster will invade his Dream Sea in the depth of night, so we need to be on guard... I specifically brought this big dog to guard the door.\"","Wenren Wei, upon hearing this, looked shocked, \"Is this true?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"It’s true.\"","Because he was the one who invited those Demon Monsters.","Wenren Wei nodded slightly, still somewhat puzzled, \"This dog...\"","Demon Monster invasion, what did it have to do with a dog?","Mo Hua explained, \"This is the Sect Leader’s dog, it’s very powerful!\"","Taixu Sect Leader...","Wenren Wei looked solemn, clearly taken in by Mo Hua’s words.","He nodded, \"I understand now.\"","The Taixu Sect Leader’s dog certainly wasn’t an ordinary dog.","Moreover, after spending these past days together, he had developed a deep trust in Mo Hua.","What Mo Hua said, especially matters concerning Young Master Yu, almost always turned out to be prophetically accurate, never had there been a mishap.","Yu Er’s current safe, healthy, lively, and cheerful self was entirely thanks to Mo Hua’s care.","Since Young Master Mo said the dog had an important role, it surely had a special purpose.","Wenren Wei said solemnly, \"Much obliged, Young Master Mo, if there’s anything you need, please feel free to instruct me.\"","Mo Hua laughed, \"Thank you, Uncle Wei.\"","Then he naturally started instructing Wenren Wei.","He informed Wenren Wei to guard the door well, watch out for certain things, and some precautions he reiterated without growing weary.","Wenren Wei carefully memorized Mo Hua’s words without the slightest neglect, and then diligently stood guard outside the door.","Mo Hua then brought the big white dog inside the room.","Yu Er was diligently going over formations in the room.","Seeing Mo Hua, his eyes lit up, but when he saw the big white dog behind Mo Hua, his expression turned surprised, and amidst the astonishment, there was a hint of fear.","When the big white dog saw the small Yu Er, it froze for a moment, then instinctively, its eyes turned fierce, and it bared its teeth at Yu Er, growling low.","Yu Er was even more frightened and hid behind Mo Hua.","Mo Hua quickly placed his hand on the dog’s head, \"Be honest.\"","Under Mo Hua’s hand, the big white dog dared not act rashly, but it still glared at Yu Er.","Mo Hua frowned, puzzled.","This big dog, while unfriendly to others, usually wouldn’t overstep unless provoked; it typically looked down from above, indifferent.","But why did it act as though it had met an enemy when it encountered Yu Er, with such violent eyes?","Could it be...","Mo Hua looked thoughtful, paused for a moment, then shook his head.","In any case, this won’t do, he called it here to have it cover for him and protect Yu Er.","If it didn’t know its place and injured Yu Er in a fit of rage, wouldn’t that be a case of trying to steal a chicken only to end up losing the rice?","Seeing the subdued big white dog still holding hostility in its eyes, Mo Hua leaned down and whispered:","\"Do you still want to eat a feast?\"","The big white dog paused, its anger dissipated, puzzled.","Mo Hua pointed to Yu Er, \"Whether or not you can eat your fill all depends on him. If you don’t adjust your attitude, not only will you miss out this time, but you’ll also go hungry in the future.\"","The big white dog looked a bit confused, then wisely nodded.","Although it still didn’t quite understand the cause and effect, for the sake of Mo Hua and the \"feast,\" it held back somewhat and dared not be fierce to Yu Er again.","Mo Hua was fairly satisfied.","Afterward, he began to set up formations.","First, near the walls, he placed a few Divine Mist Array to obscure the perception of the Divine Sense.","This was to prevent the subsequent commotion from being detected, drawing unnecessary spying.","It was also to obscure a bit of cause and effect, to avoid Mr. Tu or other henchmen of the Evil Gods from pulling any tricks to frame him.","In the inner chamber, centered on Yu Er, Mo Hua set up three layers of Divine Formation.","The outermost was the Divine Barrier Array.","The Divine Barrier Array served as the gateway for Divine Thought.","All the Demon Monsters who invaded Yu Er’s nightmare through cause and effect nodes, along the chains of sin, would be kept out by the Divine Barrier Array.","The only opening in the gate was Mo Hua.","Thus, all invading Demon Monsters wanting to attack Yu Er’s nightmare would first enter Mo Hua’s Sea of Consciousness, thereby becoming his \"meal.\""]},{"number":1690,"title":"Chapter 1690 - 868: Disturbance (Part 2)","paragraphs":["But this time there were too many Demon Monsters, and a single layer of the Divine Barrier Array might not stop them all.","Therefore, Mo Hua set up a second layer of the Divine Barrier.","This Divine Barrier was guarded by Big White the dog.","The strength of Big White, who could spar with himself, was beyond doubt.","All the leftover Demon Monsters would end up in Big White’s mouth.","\"Steamed buns\" for the dog, never to return.","And in the innermost layer, there was a tightly woven Divine Lock Array, heavily surrounding Yu Er, protecting her in the center.","These three intricately constructed Divine Tao Arrays were like three sturdy dams.","Mo Hua personally guarded the gate, with Big White covering the rear, one person and one dog, tightly guarding, waiting to face the impending flood of Demon Monsters.","Time ticked by.","Soon, the sun set, and night fell.","Mo Hua burned incense, lulled Yu Er to sleep, and then sat alone in meditation on the cushion at the Divine Barrier, eyes closed to restore energy.","Big White, following Mo Hua’s instructions, lay down on another cushion not far away.","On the ground, Mo Hua had drawn dense Formation Patterns.","The atmosphere was tranquil, with only the candle flame flickering slightly.","After an unknown period, with its head drooping on the ground, a somewhat bored Big White suddenly opened its eyes wide with a hint of shock.","Mo Hua, who was meditating, also slowly opened his bright eyes.","The thing he had been waiting for had finally come!","A sudden cold wind filled the room, chilling to the bone, as an eerie and oppressive aura arrived.","It seemed something was secretly breeding.","And in Mo Hua’s deep black, white, and gold intertwined eyes, strange Heavenly Mechanism Patterns appeared inside the room, half filthy, half bloody, intertwined in black and red like a spiderweb, emerging from the Void, spreading across the walls.","The branches of the Divine Authority Tree appeared again like Karmic chains.","Black water condensed on the branches, forming embryos without blossoming, resulting in one Demon after another hatching from these embryos.","One by one, Demon Monsters with ox heads, horse faces, human bodies, demon heads, and grotesque features struggled to crawl out from the Void.","Big White widened its eyes.","Inside its body, there remained the Bloodline of a Divine Beast, making it a particularly unique Exotic Beast.","Things that ordinary Cultivators could not see, it could see.","Still, with so many Demon Monsters and ghosts, it was the first time it had seen such a vast number.","Like a little kid who had never witnessed the world’s grandeur, seeing the flourishing world for the first time.","It even drooled.","The atmosphere was eerie, filled with Demon Monsters, Blood Qi permeating, an overwhelmingly cold and oppressive atmosphere.","However, Mo Hua merely smiled slightly.","As if sensing Mo Hua’s disdain, countless Demon Monsters, with fierce gazes, roared and transformed into a terrifying bloody wind, rushing towards Mo Hua...","\"Finally, the feast begins...\"","...","Meanwhile, in the Forbidden Land of the Taixu Gate.","Sitting in the Sword Tomb, heavily sealed by numerous formations, the long-bearded elder suddenly opened his eyes.","\"Finally, it’s here again...\"","He had been waiting for a long time.","Waiting exactly for this day.","He wanted to see, this thing that had continuously stirred up trouble within the Taixu Gate and summoned Demons, what exactly it was.","Was it an Exotic Beast that devoured Demons?","Was it the commander of Evil Spirits,","or a scheming Evil Demon skilled in Demon Skills plotting against the Taixu Gate?","He had endured for a long time, and this time, whether it was an Evil Demon or a petty villain, none could hide!","A flash of Golden Light appeared in the long-bearded elder’s eyes.","A profound entity, crystallized, Feather Transformation and then shattered, like a sword-shaped Void, flickered in his eyes.","The Divine Sense of the Heaven Void Realm, majestic and with astonishing Sword Intent, swept over from Taixu Mountain.","This Sword Intent was so profound that ordinary disciples were completely unaware.","Only the Heaven Void Ancestor and a few exceptionally gifted mid to late Feather Transformation True Men could sense it.","Sensing this Divine Sense, everyone turned pale, with cold sweat rushing from their hearts.","This was Divine Thought transformed into sword kind of Divine Sense, inherently carrying an incredibly sharp Sword Intent; fortunately, it merely swept across, for if it carried killing intent, like a Divine Sword sweeping over Taixu Mountain, who knows how many disciples would have perished.","\"It’s the Forbidden Land’s... Patriarch Dugu...\"","\"What has happened?\"","\"Could it be... has the Ancestor’s Taoist Heart cracked again?\"","\"Is his Divine Thought unstable?\"","\"Terrible...\"","\"In the past, the Ancestor occasionally swept his Divine Sense over Taixu Mountain, but never like today, so swift, with a hint of anger...\"","\"Has the formation sealing the Ancestor failed? Can’t suppress his Evil Thoughts anymore...\"","For a moment, from above the Feather Transformation, the true high ranks of the Taixu Gate were all deeply worried.","The Taixu Sect Master, who was perusing the Classics in the library, was no exception.","But besides a solemn expression, he was also somewhat perplexed.","Patriarch Dugu willingly accepted seclusion, guarding the Sword Tomb, and had been at peace for years; no major incidents occurred recently, so why would such an astonishing Divine Sense suddenly be released?","The always composed Taixu Sect Master couldn’t help but furrow his brows.","He put down the Jade Slip, flicked his sleeve to extinguish the lamp, and stepped out of the library, just about to head outside, when he suddenly paused, turning his head towards the direction of the Disciple’s Residence.","If anything indeed happened, it was just one relatively peculiar small matter...","It’s that Mo Hua borrowed that Exotic Beast from him.","Mo Hua suddenly borrowed the Exotic Beast, and the Taixu Sect Master was a bit curious, so he quietly released his Divine Sense, following Mo Hua into the Disciple’s Residence, wanting to see what Mo Hua was up to.","Later, he saw Mo Hua bring the Exotic Beast into the Shangguan Family, into that direct lineage little kid’s room called \"Yu Er.\""]},{"number":1691,"title":"Chapter 1691 - 868: Alarm Raised (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The Taixu Sect Master felt slightly relieved in his heart.","Divine Beasts capable of repelling evil.","Partially bloodlined Exotic Beasts can also repel evil spirits.","Bringing this Exotic Beast from the family to Taixu Gate was exactly with this intention.","Mo Hua, this child, has a clever mind and strong Divine Sense, perhaps he also detected the evil-repelling property of this Exotic Beast, thus wanted to borrow this beast to protect that child of the Shangguan family.","As a Disciple, he mustered the courage to borrow something from the Sect Leader with the aim of protecting others.","Mo Hua, this child, indeed has a good disposition...","Feeling relieved, the Taixu Sect Master decided not to pursue the matter further.","However, at this time in Taixu Gate, the Divine Thought of the Ancestor from the Back Hill unexpectedly emerged, prompting him to feel that these two matters might be somewhat related.","But after pondering thoroughly, the Taixu Sect Master shook his head again.","What kind of astonishing act could a small Foundation Establishment Disciple achieve to provoke the Ancestor from the Back Hill?","Besides, this was no ordinary Ancestor...","If this Ancestor came forth, the entire Qian Learning State Boundary would tremble.","Divine Thought transformed into the sword achieved profound mastery; it was a Heaven Void, and there were hardly any who dared face his sword.","Upon this thought, the Taixu Sect Master felt even heavier in his heart, prompting him to speed up his movement technique to visit Elder Master Xun at the Elder’s Residence.","But as soon as he set foot inside, he discovered that virtually all Feather Transformation elders of note within Taixu Gate were present.","Everyone exchanged greetings, explaining their intentions.","Elder Master Xun furrowed his brow and said, \"Do not worry, the Seal is intact, Senior Brother should be fine. I’ll check the Back Hill, you stay here, do not cause a fuss.\"","\"Gentleman, it might be...\" everyone was worried.","Elder Master Xun was uneasy, yet he waved his hand, saying, \"No worries.\"","With that, he swipes his fingers through thin air, tearing a rift in the void, entering the Forbidden Land of the Back Hill through it.","Upon arrival at the Forbidden Land, stepping into the Sword Tomb, Elder Master Xun saw the long-bearded elder, immediately assuming a vigilant demeanor as he examined that solitary, fierce, yet fragmented sword-like forlorn silhouette.","After a moment, Elder Master Xun sighed and relaxed as he slowly began to speak:","\"Senior Brother...\"","The long-bearded elder said, \"Why have you come?\"","With some helplessness, Elder Master Xun said, \"Senior Brother, haven’t I advised you, do not use your Divine Sense casually...\"","The long-bearded elder’s gaze deepened.","He initially intended to conclude matters swiftly without restraining his Divine Thought Power, believing that a single sweep over Taixu Mountain would reveal the scheming miscreant’s tracks.","Unexpectedly, the sweep yielded nothing.","The long-bearded elder surmised that the one causing \"chaos\" in secret had likely employed some kind of formation to conceal their aura and shielded their presence from Divine Sense.","This formation was extremely ingenious.","He hadn’t anticipated that such a quick scan would allow him to be deceived.","However, he was in Heaven Void, with powerful Divine Thought; these means couldn’t fool him. He needed only to unrestrainedly scan once more, to definitely unearth flaws and seize the mastermind.","Yet, just as he contemplated using Divine Sense to search Taixu Mountain again, someone came to him.","Elder Master Xun passionately advised:","\"Senior Brother, you clearly know your own condition. Your Divine Soul...cannot endure any more setbacks. Your Divine Sense must not be used carelessly again.\"","\"Moreover, your Divine Thought was cultivated with the Divine Thought into Sword True Technique; once things go awry, and the Sword Intent loses control, the consequences are unimaginable.\"","The long-bearded elder was silent.","Elder Master Xun suddenly realized something, frowning as he asked:","\"Senior Brother, is it... has there been some upheaval within the Sect?\"","Understanding his Senior Brother, if not for some change within the Sect or an emergency situation, he would never so rashly release his Divine Sense.","The long-bearded elder’s gaze slightly narrowed, intending to speak, though ultimately held back.","His nature was proud and his temper stubborn, preferring not to rely on others for his issues.","Moreover, he hadn’t even deciphered the intricacies involved himself.","And his junior, with a head of white hair, had already labored enough for the Sect.","The long-bearded elder merely said, indifferently, \"Nothing...\"","And then closed his eyes, saying nothing further.","Seeing this, Elder Master Xun felt somewhat helpless, but fortunately, his Senior Brother was unharmed, and the Sword Tomb appeared normal.","Elder Master Xun sighed in relief, then tore open the void again, leaving using the Void Escape Skill.","Upon returning to the Elder’s Residence, Elder Master Xun informed everyone, \"No worries, perhaps Senior Brother was tired, momentarily careless, and couldn’t restrain his Divine Sense, it’s no big issue...\"","Hearing this, everyone felt relieved.","\"That’s good then...\"","\"A false alarm...\"","\"Let’s disperse,\" Elder Master Xun said.","\"Then we’ll take our leave, Gentleman.\"","The Taixu Sect Master bowed, then departed with everyone.","Leaving only Elder Master Xun in the room.","Elder Master Xun stood for a moment, eyes reflecting doubt, feeling increasingly suspicious, sensing that something was surely amiss, with his Senior Brother hiding it from him.","But if the Senior Brother wouldn’t speak, he couldn’t possibly ask.","Also...","Glancing at the desk stacked full of various Jade Slips, documents, and Flying Sword messages, Elder Master Xun saw...","The Compass was only half deduced...","With less than a year until the Dao conference after the Sect’s reform, dark currents were surging from all sides, complicating matters.","And this Dao conference could very well determine the survival and future of Taixu Gate.","There were too many affairs with scarce time for attention...","Elder Master Xun sighed deeply, sitting down once more, burying himself in the endless flow of Jade Slip messages, trying to deduce that invaluable sliver of vitality from the tangled web of cause and effect...","...","Meanwhile, in the Forbidden Land of the Back Hill.","After Elder Master Xun left, the long-bearded elder opened his eyes once more.","He remained unsatisfied.","Everything his junior said was correct, yet he couldn’t avoid investigating this matter.","He even had a premonition, feeling that this might be the final opportunity.","If the truth behind the Demon Monster cause and effect wasn’t cleared now, who knew how many years until the next chance arises?","Yet, clear in his mind was the realization that no large-scale use of Divine Sense could be risked.","Nothing could garner attention; others couldn’t be disturbed, and his Divine Thought couldn’t waver.","Thus, he discreetly released a small strand of Divine Thought, imperceptibly beginning to search from the back to the front of the mountain.","This approach, however, was much slower.","...","In Yu Er’s room at the Disciple’s Residence.","Unaware, Mo Hua was in blissful satiation.","Thousands of Demon Monsters poured into his Sea of Consciousness, killed by him one by one."]},{"number":1692,"title":"Chapter 1692 - 869: Sword Tomb","paragraphs":["Because the Fushi Soul among the Seven Souls of the Life Soul was parasitized by the Evil Embryo, Mo Hua did not dare to be too arrogant. Therefore, he manifested various Five Elements Spells and numerous Bagua Formation Methods to obliterate these Demon Monsters one by one.","Wave after wave of Demon Monsters died at his hands, instantly refined by him, transformed into pure Telekinesis, and absorbed into his mouth.","Outside his Sea of Consciousness, Big White Dog was also \"eating\" with glee.","The Demon Monsters that escaped from the gap guarded by Mo Hua naturally ended up in front of Big White Dog, following the blockade formed by the Divine Barrier Array and Divine Lock Array.","Big White Dog widened its eyes, a majestic virtual image manifested in its eyes, intimidating a group of Demon Monsters.","Then, taking advantage of this gap, it immediately pounced forward, crushing them all in one bite before swallowing them into its stomach.","It appeared to be biting randomly at the air, not actually \"eating\" any flesh and blood.","But Big White Dog ate very joyfully.","This kind of Demon Monster Telekinesis, for it, was a rare supplement.","This \"two-legged beast\" Mo Hua didn’t trick it; this truly was a \"feast.\"","And Big White Dog, being an Exotic Beast rather than a Cultivator, with no complex human motivations, coupled with the Divine Beast bloodline in its body, was not at all afraid of Evil Thoughts polluting its Taoist Heart. Therefore, the Demon Monsters it swallowed whole were absorbed, leaving not even a trace of Evil Thoughts.","The night deepened, and Yin Qi permeated the room, with Demon Monsters dancing wildly.","Wenren Wei stood outside the house, perceiving the eerie atmosphere inside and felt a chill in his heart, anxious and uneasy.","But he remembered Mo Hua’s instructions, patiently kept his composure, and firmly stood guard outside the door.","The battle inside continued.","Mo Hua stood at the forefront, using Spells and Formations to kill wave after wave, simultaneously recovering the consumed Divine Thought through battle.","Big White Dog was extremely excited, running around wildly, slaughtering the Demon Monsters that Mo Hua missed.","After an unknown amount of time, the torrent of Demon Monsters gradually receded.","In the end, the Divine Authority Tree began to wither, the Black Water Embryo dried up, and fewer Demon Monsters hatched.","These Demon Monsters were numerous, but not individually strong.","The truly strong ones were not a match for Mo Hua.","Those Sheep-Horned Enforcers and elite Demon Monsters like Goat-Headed Generals were already considered \"small fry\" in front of Mo Hua, who had reached the Realm of Nineteen Patterns and Divine Sense Sublimation.","After all, in some sense, he was already an existence comparable to the Evil Embryo of the Master of the Great Wilderness.","Such minor Demon Monsters could be defeated in one move; if not, then two moves.","When the last Demon Monster General was crushed by Mo Hua with his bare hands, refined by Formation, and absorbed into his stomach, this fierce battle finally came to an end.","Meanwhile, in the Back Hill Forbidden Area,","the long-bearded elder still released his Divine Sense, searching quietly.","But this time, he was full of concerns, searching slowly.","Moreover, because he did not dare to fully release his Divine Sense, fearing it might cause a disturbance and attract his junior brother, his perception was very vague.","Coupled with the Divine Mist Array laid by Mo Hua, the long-bearded elder searched for a long time but found nothing.","And just now, he noticed that the Cause and Effect of the raging, rampant Demon Monsters was already gradually dissipating.","It was unclear whether the source of these Demon Monster torrents was cut off.","Or if these Demon Monsters were all exterminated.","But in any case, with the dissipation of the Cause and Effect, the traces would also gradually disappear...","Patriarch Dugu frowned, slightly angry.","He was still not resigned, continuing to release his Divine Sense, scanning back and forth on Taixu Mountain.","But search as he might, he found only vague traces...","...","Inside the Disciple’s Residence.","With the slaying of the last Demon Monster General, the eerie and sinister Qi in the room was swept away.","Amidst the curling smoke, Yu Er was still sleeping soundly, and, dreaming of something, began sucking her thumb.","The atmosphere was tranquil and peaceful.","Mo Hua nodded, taking Big White Dog and leaving the inner room.","Upon seeing Mo Hua, Wenren Wei’s eyes lit up, and he asked, \"Young Master Mo...\"","Mo Hua nodded and said, \"It’s all resolved. Yu Er is sleeping very well.\"","Wenren Wei clasped his hands gratefully and said, \"Thank you, Young Master.\"","\"Uncle Wei, there’s no need to be so polite.\"","After exchanging a few more pleasantries, Mo Hua was about to return to his room.","However, he thought for a moment and decided to leave Big White Dog behind, saying, \"This Big White Dog should stay here to keep watch, just in case anything unanticipated happens tonight.\"","Wenren Wei thanked Mo Hua again, feeling moved in his heart by the young master’s meticulous and thoughtful actions.","And Big White Dog didn’t refuse.","It had eaten its fill, with a round belly that needed digesting.","At this time, it was too lazy to move, so upon hearing Mo Hua’s words, it lay down and closed its eyes, starting to refine the Demon Monsters it had just swallowed.","Mo Hua then returned to his own room.","The battle, overall, was within his expectations; there were no fluctuations or unexpected incidents.","The Demon Monsters were killed, the Evil Embryo didn’t act up, and Yu Er was unharmed.","He had also consumed many Evil Spirits and now needed to thoroughly refine them, cleanse away the evil filth, and absorb their pure Telekinesis to further advance his Divine Sense.","In the simple and tranquil room,","Mo Hua held his breath, concentrated, and sat down in meditation.","Strands of Telekinesis were being refined.","His Divine Sense gradually strengthened, the Realm of Divine Thought began to rise from Nineteen Patterns.","The Sea of Consciousness expanded, the Divine Thought became robust, and his perception of the world became increasingly clear.","A large amount of Telekinesis was refined, and Mo Hua’s Divine Sense initially grew rapidly.","But soon, he encountered a bottleneck.","It seemed his Divine Sense had reached the limit of a Foundation Building Cultivator, an almost insurmountable Heavenly Chasm blocking his path."]},{"number":1693,"title":"Chapter 1693 - 869: Sword Tomb (Part 2)","paragraphs":["This heavenly chasm, is the limit set by the Heavenly Dao for Foundation Establishment cultivators.","Across the heavenly chasm, lies the Golden Core.","Mo Hua had devoured a large number of demon monsters, yet the enhanced divine sense before this \"heavenly chasm\" seemed akin to a drop in the bucket.","The speed of his divine sense growth also sharply slowed down, eventually halting at the peak of Nineteen Patterns.","Mo Hua opened his eyes and sighed.","As expected...","Just like breaking through Foundation Establishment with artifact refining, breaking through a great realm requires immense effort and years of accumulation.","The amount of divine sense needed for growth almost doubled.","It wasn’t the difference from Nineteen Patterns to Twenty Patterns that seemed like just one pattern.","But roughly equivalent to cultivating from One Pattern to Nineteen Patterns again, a full nineteen patterns of difference.","It wasn’t something that could be replenished with a grand feast.","Although Mo Hua had anticipated this situation, he was still somewhat regretful.","Mo Hua smacked his lips.","\"If only I could reach the Golden Core in one go...\"","Mo Hua fantasized in a somewhat wishful manner.","But the gap between Foundation Establishment and Golden Core was even greater; he couldn’t figure out what he could consume to ascend.","Eating a real Evil God?","Mo Hua shook his head.","Not to mention an Evil God, he couldn’t even afford an Evil Embryo.","Now, an Evil Embryo was parasitizing within his divine soul, and he had no means to deal with it.","\"Forget it, the peak of Nineteen Patterns is still sufficient, you can’t become fat in one gulp...\"","Moreover, the peak of Nineteen Patterns...","Mo Hua pondered, suddenly realizing that he had reached the limit of divine sense for Foundation Establishment.","Almost all Foundation Establishment cultivators thereafter couldn’t surpass him in divine sense, as he proved the Dao with divine sense.","And he was only in the Foundation Building Middle Stage.","Considering this, it was quite remarkable.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel a bit smug.","Furthermore, from now on, all Second-grade Arrays, except for the genuine Ultimate Formations above Twenty Patterns, would be easy for him to learn, without any pressure on divine thought.","Mo Hua was content and a little excited.","He was so excited that he couldn’t sleep—even though he usually didn’t need much sleep.","Mo Hua wanted to practice with a few formations, to see whether with his peak divine sense of nineteen patterns, learning formations would be faster and setting them up would be stronger...","Mo Hua thought for a moment, then took out paper and ink.","He spread the paper on the ground, placed the ink on the table, and then, using his divine thought as a brush and controlling ink with divine sense, began drawing formations on the ground.","This time, he wanted to see how fast he could draw formations with his peak divine sense at full strength.","So he poured out his divine thought without reservation.","But what he didn’t know was that the divine thought he released happened to touch a powerful and enigmatic Heaven Void divine sense silently wandering the Taixu Mountain...","And there was no Divine Mist Array set up in Mo Hua’s room to obscure perception.","He had just \"consumed\" an Evil Spirit, and there were still traces of impurities in his external divine thought.","As a result, he exposed himself.","In the Back Hill Forbidden Area.","An elder with a long beard suddenly opened his eyes, his gaze sharp.","\"Finally, I caught you...\"","His divine thought carried a tinge of evil qi.","It was clearly a method to strip away the Evil Spirit’s surface, trying to disguise itself as a serious cultivator and escape detection.","But this \"mask\" wasn’t completely off, thus exposing the flaw.","\"You... can’t run away!\"","The elder’s withered hand suddenly slashed, reaching into the void.","Meanwhile, in the Disciple’s Residence.","The still clueless Mo Hua was diligently drawing his formation.","But as he drew, suddenly, an unexpected change occurred.","A terrifying fluctuation came forth.","A stark black, mottled spatial rift inexplicably tore open in the void before him.","Mo Hua was dumbfounded, his mind momentarily stalled.","Before he could react, a bony hand reached out from the spatial rift, grasped Mo Hua, and yanked him in.","Then, the spatial rift slowly closed.","Within the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua’s figure vanished, leaving behind an unfinished formation he was working on...","...","Back Hill Forbidden Area.","The spatial rift flashed, revealing a figure.","The elder with the long beard tore open the void and reached down, unsure of what he had captured, focused solely on pulling it in front of him.","\"I want to see what kind of demon monster you are...\"","The elder coldly snorted, then abruptly stopped speaking.","He was clearly stunned.","Now he discovered that what he had thought to be an Evil Spirit from a heretical path, an aberrant scoundrel, was what led him to shatter the void and reach out.","But what he pulled over was a young, handsome, clear-eyed... little disciple?","Moreover, based on his appearance and attire, he seemed to be a Taixu Sect member?","The unaware Mo Hua, held by the elder, blinked in confusion.","The old and young faced each other like this, the atmosphere momentarily silent.","After a moment, the elder slowly spoke, the voice hoarse and low:","\"You... are you a Taixu Sect member?\"","Mo Hua slightly came to his senses and glanced around, realizing he was in an unfamiliar place, surrounded by darkness, eerie tombs everywhere, the moonlight bleak and desolate.","And the elder before him seemed to be bound by formations and chains, though Mo Hua was unsure of his identity and realm, it was evident he was terrifying.","By instinctual perception, he was the kind of terror that could crush Mo Hua with a mere finger twitch."]},{"number":1694,"title":"Chapter 1694 - 869: Sword Tomb (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The direct sensation, even more powerful than Uncle.","Far more powerful than any cultivator I have ever seen, including those Demon Path Feather Transformation cultivators who died at Uncle’s hands, and Summer Inspector from the Taoist Court’s Feather Transformation Realm.","Heaven Void Ancestor?!","Mo Hua immediately calmed down and nodded:","\"Yes.\"","The long-bearded elder frowned slightly, \"What were you doing just now?\"","Upon hearing this, Mo Hua’s heart tightened.","Oh no, have I been \"caught\"?","Has what I did been discovered by this elder?","Does this mean that this elder might be the ancestor of my Taixu Gate?","He detected something unusual and thus brought me here?","Mo Hua was extremely nervous, but also secretly breathed a sigh of relief.","Nervous, because what he \"snacked on\" might have been discovered.","Relieved, because since this elder is from Taixu Gate, he probably wouldn’t kill me for no reason.","And if I’m correct, Elder Master Xun is also from the ancestor’s generation.","This long-bearded elder might know Elder Master Xun, so he shouldn’t make things difficult for me.","If push comes to shove, I can bring up Elder Master Xun’s name, and perhaps this elder might let me go.","Seeing the long-bearded elder’s displeased expression, Mo Hua respectfully said:","\"To answer the elder, I have a young little brother who often has nightmares, troubled by demon monsters in his dreams and unable to sleep. I borrowed a big white dog from the Sect Leader to guard my brother.\"","\"Just finished watching the door tonight, and after returning to my room, I thought I’d practice formations since it was still early, and for some reason, I suddenly found myself... caught by you...\"","Mo Hua picked and chose some \"truths\" to tell.","The elder frowned, pondered for a moment, and then asked, \"What is your brother’s name?\"","\"Shang Guanyu.\" Mo Hua said.","\"Shangguan?\" The elder was a bit surprised, \"You’re from the Shangguan Family?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"No, my surname is Mo.\"","The elder’s gaze turned slightly cold, \"Your surname is Mo, and your brother’s is Shangguan?\"","Mo Hua explained, \"Not a blood brother, we met by chance, I saved him, and he calls me brother.\"","A life-saving grace?","The elder nodded slightly and then said in a deep voice, \"Since your surname is Mo... which Mo Family are you from? Near the Qian Learning State Boundary, there’s no Mo Family, are you from Kun State, or Kan State...\"","Mo Hua shook his head and said, \"I come from Li State, I’m a Loose Cultivator, without a family.\"","\"A Loose Cultivator...\" The long-bearded elder was startled.","He did not expect that after so many years, Taixu Gate could still recruit a Loose Cultivator, which was indeed peculiar.","Loose Cultivators, with no family or power, can hardly be traced.","\"You say... you borrowed a dog from the Sect Leader?\" the elder asked again.","Mo Hua nodded.","\"What kind of dog?\"","\"White, big, long-haired, with a bit of golden fur, haughty eyes, somewhat arrogant...\"","Mo Hua described the big white dog.","The long-bearded elder’s heart stirred, and his expression became a bit understanding.","\"It’s that thing...\"","He gradually understood.","The child of the Shangguan Family is prone to attracting evil spirits, so this Mo-surnamed kid couldn’t bear to see his brother suffer and sought an exotic beast to suppress the evil spirits.","Borrowing an exotic beast to suppress the evil spirits, but this child also carried a trace of the evil spirit’s aura.","This aura was detected by me, mistaken for an \"evil demon,\" so I grabbed him.","The long-bearded elder’s gaze tightened slightly.","There are still some oddities here, but on the whole, it makes sense.","This child spoke in detail, with names and specifics, even mentioning the Sect Leader, which can be easily verified with a simple investigation.","And with my nearly thousand years of people’s insight, this child, although somewhat uneasy, did not seem to be lying on the whole.","The long-bearded elder sighed slightly.","Although he did not lie, it appears I have... caught the wrong person...","This is just an ordinary disciple, unrelated to the cause and effect involving evil demons.","But thinking about it, it’s indeed so; a mere twenty-year cultivation age disciple, unless reincarnated from a Taoist or possessed by an Old Demon, how could he provoke cause and effect and draw so many demon monsters and evil spirits...","Since he is an ordinary disciple, the elder naturally wouldn’t make things difficult for Mo Hua.","Lacking interest, he simply waved his hand and said:","\"You can go back now...\"","Mo Hua sighed with relief.","Talking to such a mysterious and powerful elder, whose background is unknown, he was on edge with every word.","But fortunately, he managed to get through it.","Mo Hua performed a bow meticulously and respectfully said, \"Elder, then the disciple takes his leave.\"","The long-bearded elder said nothing.","Mo Hua began to walk out, but after a few steps, he came back, scratched his head, and softly asked:","\"Elder, how... do I get out?\"","This place was full of graves, desolate and eerie, and the formations nearby were advanced, far beyond his current understanding.","He had never been here before, completely unfamiliar with the path.","Should he get lost, or inadvertently trigger some mechanism or formation, bumping into things, a small Foundation Establishment like him might lose his life...","The long-bearded elder sighed slightly, realizing his oversight, and said: \"I will send you back.\"","He stretched out his hand to grab Mo Hua.","Mo Hua did not dodge, of course, with a Heaven Void Ancestor’s grasp, even if he wanted to dodge, he couldn’t.","But just as he was about to be grabbed and sent away, Mo Hua caught a glimpse out of the corner of his eye, seeing the blackened graves scattered on the ground and the broken swords stuck between them, he suddenly remembered something and hurriedly said:","\"Elder, wait!\"","The long-bearded elder paused his hand and couldn’t help frowning, \"What’s wrong?\"","Mo Hua asked, \"Elder, is this the Sword Tomb?\""]},{"number":1695,"title":"Chapter 1695 - 869: Sword Tomb (Part 4)","paragraphs":["The elder with the long beard’s gaze slightly tightened, \"Yes.\"","As expected!","Earlier, the night was too deep and being suddenly brought here, he was somewhat nervous and didn’t dare to examine carefully, thinking he was merely amidst a field of barren graves.","It wasn’t until now, under the moonlight, that he saw the broken swords on the graves, and he remembered that Elder Xun Ziyou had once mentioned a Sword Tomb in the Back Hill Forbidden Area of the Taixu Gate.","And there was something he had always wanted to do.","Mo Hua felt slightly relieved in his heart, and requested:","\"Elder, I know of a senior who also practiced swordsmanship, and it’s very possible that he is buried in this Sword Tomb. I wish to return this senior’s relics to their rightful owner. May I?\"","Buried in the Sword Tomb...","The elder with the long beard was startled.","In this Sword Tomb, those buried were from the generations of Taixu Gate who, having practiced Divine Thought into sword, sacrificed their lives, slaying demons and resisting evil, thus damaging their Life Soul and dying suddenly.","This child, does he have such roots? Could he also be... a descendant of a Divine Way Sword Cultivator?","The elder looked at Mo Hua with a much warmer expression.","He nodded, sighed, and said, \"Alright, go on.\"","Mo Hua’s expression brightened with joy and he immediately cupped his hands in gratitude, \"Thank you, elder!\"","Then he proceeded toward the surrounding Sword Tombs.","What he wanted to return was Senior Dugu Xuan’s broken sword.","According to Senior Xun Zixian, practicing Divine Thought into sword harms others and oneself, especially as it injures the Life Soul; therefore, once injured, it is very hard to heal.","In the Taixu Gate, those who practiced Divine Thought into sword mostly met unfortunate ends, either dying young or ending in distress.","And Senior Dugu Xuan once fought a life-and-death battle with the fallen River God, the incarnation of the Great Wilderness Evil God, in the blood-colored fishing village. Though he eventually subdued the Evil God’s spirit, his own Lifebound Sword unfortunately broke during the battle.","This meant he suffered grave injuries, wounding his foundation.","Since then, Mo Hua hadn’t found any other clues related to Senior Dugu Xuan.","Thus, he speculated that this genius of Taixu Gate, who had also practiced Divine Thought into sword, likely \"died young.\"","And those Sword Cultivators practicing Divine Thought into sword who died mostly were buried in the Sword Tomb Forbidden Land.","Mo Hua had obtained his broken sword and deduced Cause and Effect from it, learning the Transforming Sword Skill and Soul-Shocking Sword, acquiring this senior’s mantle, so he thought of repaying this kindness by finding a day to come to the Sword Tomb and return the broken sword to its rightful owner.","After all, Sword Cultivators regard their swords as their second life.","Returning the broken sword, allowing it to accompany its master buried in the grave, also settles a Cause and Effect.","Senior Xuan, if aware, should feel gratified.","Mo Hua searched back and forth among the Sword Tombs nearby.","But the Sword Tombs only had swords and graves, no markers or names, so Mo Hua had no idea which Sword Tomb belonged to Senior Xuan.","He thought to ask the long-bearded elder guarding the Sword Tomb.","But this elder’s cultivation was too strong, his aura intimidating, he was like a sign saying \"strangers keep away,\" and Mo Hua, unfamiliar with him, didn’t dare to ask much, so he could only search on his own.","But after searching repeatedly, he still found nothing.","Perhaps having spent too long, the long-bearded elder became evidently impatient.","Mo Hua had no choice, after thinking for a moment, he dug up some soil himself, built a simple little mound, as a \"new grave.\"","Then he secretly retrieved from the Storage Ring the broken sword suppressed at the bottom of the Blood Pool in the blood-colored fishing village and placed it on the new grave he just made, forming a new \"Sword Tomb.\"","Just as Mo Hua withdrew the broken sword, the previously impatient long-bearded elder suddenly sensed a mysteriously familiar aura.","He raised his eyes and saw the broken sword Mo Hua had placed on the mound, his expression changed drastically, and his entire body was visibly trembling.","\"This is...\"","Xuan Er’s sword?!"]},{"number":1696,"title":"Chapter 1696 - 870: I Want to Learn the Sword","paragraphs":["The elder’s heart suddenly surged like a raging sea.","Yet Mo Hua remained unaware.","His two hands, dirty and grimy, continued to scrape the soil and stones on the ground, burying the broken sword deeper, making it stand more upright, to prevent it from being blown askew by the wind.","Until he sensed a terrifying aura from behind him, which made his heart palpitate with fear.","Moreover, this aura was becoming extremely unstable due to emotional fluctuations.","Only then was he startled, turning back to see that long-bearded senior, whose eyes were bloodshot, with what seemed like tens of thousands of Sword Qi roaring past in his eyes, converging into a boundless ocean of swords like the vastness of the Taixu.","The aura around him was also filled with a fierce murderous intent, terrifying to the extreme.","Black light flickered, and even the void seemed unstable, with cracks appearing everywhere.","Mo Hua’s pupils shook with astonishment.","This was his first time directly facing the terrifying momentum of a Heaven Void Cultivator.","Only now did he realize just how powerful a true high-rank cultivator could be if they didn’t suppress their strength and went all out...","The gap in realms was too wide, and under such majesty, he had almost no power to resist.","Fortunately, the long-bearded elder had been diligently cultivating his mind for many years. Realizing things were going wrong, he was also trying his best to control his emotions.","No one knew how much time passed before all the Sword Intent receded, the cracks in the void healed, and the elder’s expression returned to that of an ancient well, calm and without ripples.","But his heart was not calm.","\"This broken sword... where did you get it?\"","The long-bearded elder’s voice was old and hoarse, with even a hint of sorrow in his tone.","Mo Hua’s heart skipped a beat.","He immediately realized that this broken sword likely had an extraordinary origin.","Moreover, the Senior Xuan and this elder, whose cultivation was powerful and Sword Intent astonishing, very possibly had some unknown connection...","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then cautiously said:","\"I once went to a small fishing village outside the Qian Learning State Boundary, by the Yanshui River. In the village, there was a hidden, abandoned River God Temple. Inside the temple, there was a Blood Pool, and this broken sword was suppressed at the bottom of the pool, corroded by Blood Qi.\"","\"River God Temple, Blood Pool...\" The long-bearded elder frowned slightly, \"How did you find yourself there?\"","Mo Hua replied: \"I went there to fulfill a sect reward. Some human traffickers had kidnapped two children from the small fishing village. The Taoist Court issued a reward for disciples skilled in formations. I happen to be good at formations, so I joined them, entered the River God Temple, captured those traffickers, and happened to find something in the Blood Pool. When I fished it out, I discovered it was a broken sword...\"","Human traffickers, small fishing village, Taoist Court reward.","These matters were all on the surface, and the Taoist Court had records of them, which could be verified easily.","However, the evil spirits like leech evil, water monsters and demon creatures, and the fallen River God, these matters, no one else knew except himself.","The elder pondered for a moment and asked again, \"Then how did you know that the owner of this broken sword was buried in this Sword Tomb?\"","Mo Hua had nothing to hide about this point.","\"I inquired about the rumors in the small fishing village, and from the attire of the broken sword’s owner, I guessed he must have been a senior of my Taixu Gate.\"","\"I also consulted the elders in the sect, but could not find out who the owner of this broken sword was, only that he might have learned a very powerful swordsmanship, and...\"","Mo Hua paused, secretly glanced at the elder before him, and softly said:","\"Lifebound Sword broken, foundation damaged.\"","\"Therefore, I assumed that the owner of this broken sword might have faced an unknown formidable enemy, experienced a great battle, and then succumbed to his injuries, buried here in the Sword Tomb with other seniors of the Taixu Gate.\"","The long-bearded elder’s expression was indifferent, his gaze desolate.","Then he forced himself to think through Mo Hua’s words carefully and found nothing incongruent from his intuition.","This implied that these words were likely not far from the truth.","Even if there were some concealments, they probably weren’t much.","The long-bearded elder turned his head, deeply looked at Mo Hua, especially observing his pure temperament and clear eyes, and sighed deeply in his heart.","This matter had many coincidences.","But to put it another way, it could also be a kind of fate.","Heaven, through these coincidences, brought this child to him, perhaps out of pity for his solitude and hardship, thereby bringing this item of Xuan Er’s relic and this Lifebound Sword that had accompanied him in cultivation since childhood to the elder.","This might be the Heavenly Dao’s compassion.","Heaven still somewhat cared for this half-buried old bone, allowing him to have a remembrance in his remaining days.","The long-bearded elder sighed softly.","He looked at Mo Hua again and said:","\"This broken sword is extremely important to me. Since you could bring it to the Sword Tomb, there must be some providence at work.\"","\"I am a person who clearly differentiates between gratitude and grudge. If there is a grudge, I repay it, and if there is gratitude, I would never wish to owe anyone.\"","\"I give you a promise to repay this cause and effect. Within the bounds of morality and law, I will grant you one wish.\"","\"Speak, what do you wish for?\"","The long-bearded elder’s tone was solemn and weighed heavy as gold.","Mo Hua was stunned, his heart shaken.","Could this powerful yet sealed Heaven Void Ancestor of the Taixu Gate fulfill one of his wishes?","He didn’t expect that this broken sword was so precious.","But, what request should he make?","Mo Hua was completely unprepared, caught off guard, and was in a bit of a dilemma.","The long-bearded elder did not rush Mo Hua either.","Indeed, this matter needed careful consideration.","A disciple’s wish is nothing more than entering the Inner Gate, learning the inheritance, becoming an instructor, or even being promised an Elder’s position in the future, as long as he reaches the Golden Core."]},{"number":1697,"title":"Chapter 1697 - 870: I Want to Learn the Sword (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Of course, if Mo Hua were truly driven by greed and wishful thinking, making a request to become the Taixu Sect Master, the elder would immediately grab him by the neck and throw him out of the back mountain.","In Mo Hua’s heart, it’s naturally impossible for him to not have a clue.","Although this senior did not specify the exact restrictions on this wish, it is very clear that not every wish can be granted.","If he is blind and truly makes an outrageous demand, he won’t get away unpunished.","He needs to align with the identity of a disciple, be positive and progressive, yet not make the senior feel dissatisfied, thinking he is overreaching, nor ask for an \"empty pie\"—beautiful in the future but unattainable now.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then solemnly said:","\"Ancestor, I wish to learn the sword!\"","Patriarch Dugu slightly furrowed his brows.","As a disciple, wanting to learn the sword is normal.","His own accomplishments in sword dao integrate the strengths of various schools, comprehensively fused, vast as the sea. Though not unprecedented, his achievements are rare across the whole Qian Learning State Boundary.","However...","Patriarch Dugu glanced at Mo Hua, especially noticing his frail body, scant spiritual power, and the almost non-existent swordsmanship aura surrounding him.","\"Have you ever had any sword dao heritage since childhood?\" Patriarch Dugu asked.","\"No...\" Mo Hua answered honestly.","His background is impossible to hide.","\"Do you have any sword dao foundation?\"","\"No.\"","\"Have you ever nurtured a spirit sword?\"","\"No.\"","\"Have you ever devotedly cultivated sword qi for more than ten years?\"","\"No.\"","\"Then... have you ever tempered a sword heart?\"","Mo Hua still shook his head, \"No...\"","And now, not only does he lack this knowledge, he doesn’t even know what a \"sword heart\" is...","Patriarch Dugu was silent.","With this background... he still wants to learn the sword?","The elder remained silent for a moment, finally sighing.","Although with this child’s dull aptitude, wanting to achieve in sword dao might be a \"wishful thinking,\" the idea of \"learning the sword\" itself is correct.","Aptitude, talent, high or low, cannot be an excuse.","As long as one is willing to strive, with a heart to learn diligently, encouragement is deserved.","In the thousands of years of history within the cultivation world, there are cases of dull aptitude, yet achieving supreme sword cultivation through postnatal effort.","Moreover, there is this cause and effect opportunity.","He sends the sword here, and I teach him swordsmanship.","This fulfills a cause and effect.","This child has low cultivation and weak sword dao accomplishments; teaching him even a bit would be enough to benefit him for a lifetime.","Patriarch Dugu paused in thought, glanced over Mo Hua’s adept Taoist skills and magic battle methods, then said:","\"I will teach you the ’Hanxu Piaomiao Sword Skill,’ blending sword and movement technique into one, able to attack or defend, advancing or retreating with ease.\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment and shook his head.","His movement technique is already good enough. Integrating a killing move, using Mini Meteorite Skill is better, and learning a sword technique blending with movement seems somewhat redundant.","\"Then I will pass on to you the Chongling Six Veins Swordsmanship, aligned with the Rushing Void Sect, specializing in sword qi cultivation. Its power is weaker, yet the sword qi is gentle, reducing the load on the flesh.\"","Mo Hua still shook his head.","His current sword qi is weak; cultivating it might be in vain.","\"Then I will teach you the Tai Xu Dragon Sword Skill. This sword technique is immensely powerful, not evident in the Foundation Establishment Realm, but once cultivated to the Golden Core and even Feather Transformation, it can control swords for a thousand miles, sword qi like a dragon. It is one of the core heritages of our Taixu Gate, not teachable to non-inner gate direct lineage. Given your special circumstances, I can make an exception, teaching you this one time.\"","Tai Xu Dragon Sword Skill...","Mo Hua looked shocked.","The name alone sounds grand.","But similarly, it also sounds difficult to learn, likely requiring immense spiritual power, fine sword weapon, and profoundly deep sword dao foundation.","None of these things are within his grasp.","Though the sword technique is good, it’s evidently not something he could learn.","Mo Hua still shook his head.","The elder with a long beard was somewhat impatient, frowning and saying:","\"Not learning this or that, then tell me, which swordsmanship do you want to learn?\"","Mo Hua felt a bit guilty.","He initially thought the senior would mention that sword technique, so he wouldn’t have to bring it up and wouldn’t seem \"malicious.\"","But now it seems impossible.","The Divine Thought Sword Skill has been listed as taboo by the Taixu Gate; it will likely not be taught again, and this senior probably won’t actively teach it.","And the Taixu Sect’s Divine Thought into sword is buried within the Sword Tomb.","Within the Sword Tomb, there’s only this senior.","This means that within Taixu Gate, the one truly capable of this sword technique might only be this ancestor here.","Given the circumstances, I cannot be courteous.","I must seize this opportunity.","While presenting my broken sword, this ancestor still feels a thread of gratitude in his heart; how about demanding boldly and resolving it in one stroke.","Once hesitant and missing this rare opportunity, it might never come again in the future.","\"Ancestor, I wish to learn...\" Mo Hua’s expression gradually became resolute, his gaze bright, speaking word by word:","\"Taixu Divine Thought into sword True Jue!\"","His voice was clear, resounding in the silent night, echoing between the Sword Tomb.","The atmosphere suddenly became somewhat stagnant.","The elder with a long beard was silently thoughtful, momentarily dazed.","In a brief recollection, he seemed to remember...","Several hundred years ago, it seemed to be in a similar forest, his most beloved grandson watched him like that, eyes steadfast, saying he wanted to learn Taixu Gate’s... Divine Thought into sword True Jue.","He softened then and also held tremendous expectations for him, so he broke the sect’s prohibition and secretly taught him."]},{"number":1698,"title":"Chapter 1698 - 870: I Want to Learn the Sword_3","paragraphs":["And then...","I was wrong, terribly wrong.","A trace of helpless bitterness surfaced in the old man’s heart.","He forced himself to suppress all past memories and thoughts, looking deeply at Mo Hua with a faint sense of pressure:","\"Inside the Taixu Gate, a gag order has been issued. Where did you learn the name of this sword technique?\"","Mo Hua felt a bit guilty, \"I... overheard it from an Elder...\"","\"Why do you want to learn this sword technique?\"","\"Because... it sounds very powerful...\" Mo Hua whispered.","And indeed, it is powerful.","The long-bearded elder listened to his somewhat naive response and could not help but pause, no longer tangled in whether Mo Hua had ulterior motives.","But he still coldly refused:","\"Other sword techniques from the Taixu Gate, including parts from the Tai’a and Chongxu factions, if you want to learn, I can teach you. But this particular sword technique is an exception; you cannot learn it.\"","\"Is it because it’s too dangerous?\" Mo Hua asked.","The long-bearded elder’s eyelids twitched, \"You already know?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"I heard that this sword technique primarily cultivates sword intent, contending with Divine Sense, using Divine Soul to kill, thus having great lethality and also immense risk. If you’re not careful, you could possibly damage your Divine Soul, and it could be impossible to recover.\"","Even the matter of the Divine Soul is known...","The long-bearded elder’s gaze slightly condensed.","He would have to check later to see which Taixu Gate Elder was so loose-tongued, telling everything to the disciples.","\"You know all this, and you still dare to learn?\" The long-bearded elder asked.","\"Precisely because I know, that’s why I want to learn!\" Mo Hua replied matter-of-factly, \"Senior, you should have seen, my Spiritual Root is not good, and coupled with being innately weak, whether it’s Blood Qi or Spiritual Power, I’m far behind others.\"","\"But such is the Heavenly Dao, what is lacking also has its benefits. My Blood Qi and Spiritual Power are lacking, but I have one thing...\"","Mo Hua’s expression was humble, with a hint of pride, \"My Divine Sense is strong!\"","\"Because my Divine Sense is strong, that’s why I thought of cultivating the Divine Thought Sword Skill!\"","The long-bearded elder’s gaze slightly condensed.","Playing to one’s strengths and avoiding one’s weaknesses, in this way, it does make sense.","However, for a Foundation Building Cultivator, no matter how strong the Divine Sense, how strong can it actually be...","The long-bearded elder was indifferent, released his Divine Sense to perceive the aura of Mo Hua’s Divine Thought, suddenly his gaze trembled, after a moment he asked slowly:","\"Your Divine Sense, what realm is it?\"","\"Peak of Nineteen Patterns.\" Mo Hua replied.","For a moment, the long-bearded elder thought he misheard, he furrowed his brows, and said: \"Release your Divine Sense fully.\"","Mo Hua nodded and did so without any concealment, releasing the Peak of Nineteen-Pattern Divine Sense externally.","The long-bearded elder sensed this Divine Sense near the limits of Foundation Establishment, and his gaze gradually became sharp.","Before, he hadn’t scrutinized, only vaguely feeling that Mo Hua’s Divine Sense was somewhat special.","But no matter how special, it’s merely a Foundation Establishment junior disciple.","He was the Heaven Void Ancestor, having seen great winds and waves, he’s seen everything in his lifetime.","But this...","Mid-stage Foundation Establishment Cultivation, Nineteen-Pattern Peak Divine Sense?","That, he had truly never seen before...","The long-bearded elder was momentarily incredulous.","\"You...\"","Mo Hua then slightly revealed his bottom line, \"Ancestor, I am on the path of Divine Sense Proving the Dao.\"","\"Divine Sense Proving the Dao...\"","The long-bearded elder listened to this somewhat distant, rarely mentioned path, and his expression was somewhat wistful.","No wonder...","But he pondered for a moment, then still shook his head, \"Divine Thought into sword is a sword technique, which is different from simple Divine Sense Proving the Dao. You lack understanding in the Sword Dao, I still can’t teach you. Even if I did, you wouldn’t be able to learn it.\"","Mo Hua immediately said, \"I have learned it!\"","\"Learned it?\" The long-bearded elder was surprised.","Mo Hua was just about to say he had already learned the Transforming Sword Skill and the Soul-Shocking Sword but suddenly remembered that the Evil Embryo was residing within him, his Divine Soul was sealed, Soul-Shocking Sword could not be used, and Transforming Sword Skill couldn’t be displayed outside.","If he said he learned it but couldn’t use it, he would certainly be regarded as a fraud.","What’s more, his \"Divine Thought into sword\" was self-taught, which meant \"stealing from the master,\" and he wasn’t sure if it might offend this senior’s taboo.","So Mo Hua vaguely said, \"I mean... I can definitely learn it!\"","The long-bearded elder looked deeply at Mo Hua, then slightly shook his head, \"This sword technique is not child’s play.\"","\"Disciple understands.\"","\"If there’s an error in cultivation, at best the Divine Thought is damaged, at worst the Sea of Consciousness shatters.\"","\"It doesn’t matter.\"","\"In a confrontation, a slight mistake could shatter one’s Life Soul, or even get polluted by an Evil Spirit...\"","\"I’m not afraid.\"","...","No matter what the long-bearded elder said, Mo Hua was resolute, determined to learn.","The long-bearded elder did not blame Mo Hua, on the contrary, he felt a bit wistful.","Back then, Xuan Er had the same \"stubborn\" attitude, pleading with him to teach the Divine Thought into sword, and no matter how much he persuaded, it was of no use.","The elder’s heart softened a bit.","Perhaps... he should just teach him?","But this child’s Sword Dao foundation was too poor, if taught, how could he learn? Could he rely solely on Divine Sense Proving the Dao to comprehend the sword technique?","At this thought, a sudden realization dawned within the elder’s mind.","Divine Sense Proving the Dao!","Divine Sense!","Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue encompasses two paths, one is the Dao of Divine Thought, the other the Dao of Swordsmanship.","Because cultivators of Divine Sense Proving the Dao were rare, almost all within Taixu Gate had previously practiced this Divine Thought Sword Technique purely as a \"sword technique.\"","Thus neglecting the \"Divine Thought\" aspect in this sword technique.","Divine Thought into sword indeed cultivates sword intent, but should not merely reduce Divine Thought to \"sword intent.\"","The scope contained within the words Divine Thought is far deeper than \"sword intent.\"","And without cultivating Divine Thought, how could one properly practice Divine Thought into sword?"]},{"number":1699,"title":"Chapter 1699 - 870: I Want to Learn the Sword_4","paragraphs":["The old man felt a tremor in his heart.","He understood that the path of the Sword technique cultivated at the Taixu Gate might have deviated from the start.","Only cultivating Sword Intent, without emphasizing Divine Thought.","They were almost like \"severing an arm\" to cultivate the Divine Thought into sword True Jue.","Perhaps... if a cultivator who has proven the Divine Sense could cultivate the Divine Thought into sword, it might open up a whole new world?","The old man couldn’t help but look at Mo Hua, and the once dead silent emotion within him seemed to come back to life.","More than anyone, he wished to pass down this inheritance.","Yet this idea had been forcibly suppressed by him for hundreds of years.","He silently watched Mo Hua and finally let out a sigh.","He knew in his heart, truly teaching this child the Divine Thought into sword would undoubtedly harm him.","This Sword technique is a double-edged sword.","The sharper it kills others, the more fiercely it can harm its user.","Over the years, because of this Sword technique, countless Sword Dao geniuses with all sorts of extraordinary talents have perished unexpectedly.","He didn’t want to add another to that list.","Mo Hua seemed to see through the old man’s thoughts and said, \"Old Master, people are bound to die...\"","The long-bearded old man was slightly bewildered, wondering what Mo Hua meant by this.","Mo Hua’s gaze was bright and he continued:","\"Just because one will eventually die, doesn’t mean one shouldn’t live.\"","\"Similarly, no matter how dangerous the Sword Dao is, one shouldn’t stop cultivating because of its danger.\"","\"The Great Dao is vast and far-reaching. Many cultivators might spend their entire lives never achieving the Dao and die along the way, but those truly aspiring for immortality won’t give up on seeking the Great Dao.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes were bright and brilliant, like stars.","The heart of the long-bearded old man was shaken.","This child...","Where did he cultivate such a clear \"Taoist Heart\"?","The old man pondered for a moment, gradually calming his emotions, looked seriously, and slowly asked:","\"What is your name?\"","Mo Hua respectfully said, \"Replying to the old master, my name is Mo Hua.\"","Mo Hua...","The old man silently repeated the name in his heart and nodded:","\"Alright, I agree to teach you Divine Thought into sword!\"","Mo Hua was overjoyed and quickly said, \"Thank you, old master!\"","The old man said, \"It’s getting late today, you should go back. From now on, every seven days, I will bring you to the Sword Tomb of the back mountain to learn Divine Thought into sword True Jue with me.\"","\"How well you learn will depend on your own understanding and fortune.\"","\"However, let me preface by saying, if one day I find out that this Sword technique has led you astray, or if you use it to bully others, recklessly wielding a sword, or do evil with this Sword technique, I will abolish your Divine Thought Sword Skill and expel you from the Taixu Gate without hesitation.\"","Mo Hua’s expression became solemn, nodding seriously:","\"Old Master, the disciple remembers.\"","The long-bearded old man glanced at Mo Hua, seeing the seriousness and correctness in Mo Hua’s gaze, he nodded slightly:","\"Good, I will send you out now. After you leave, you must remember not to mention anything about this place to anyone.\"","\"Remember, it’s anyone, including your parents, relatives, brothers, and anyone within the Taixu Gate.\"","\"Yes!\" Mo Hua nodded seriously.","The long-bearded old man said no more, his withered arm tore through the void and then grabbed Mo Hua, throwing him inside.","Mo Hua was this way, a world spinning, and bewilderedly returned to the Disciple’s Residence.","On the ground, the Formation he had half-drawn still remained.","And everything just now, now thinking back on it, felt like a dream.","Mo Hua pinched his cheek, which hurt a little, obviously not dreaming, and then his eyes couldn’t help but shine.","Finally...","He could learn authentic Divine Thought into sword!","...","Meanwhile, at the Sword Tomb in the back mountain.","After sending Mo Hua away, the long-bearded old man continued to sit silently, his mind filled with thoughts.","He did not know whether this decision was right.","But perhaps, this was indeed his last chance, and his last attempt in this lifetime...","To take a different path, using the path of proving the Divine Sense to cultivate the spell point of Divine Thought into sword.","Cultivators who have proven the Divine Sense are as rare as phoenix feathers and unicorn horns.","And seedlings with such overwhelmingly powerful Divine Sense are even rarer.","If he missed this chance, he might not encounter another in this lifetime, no, even if he lived for two more lifetimes.","\"Mo Hua...\"","The long-bearded old man whispered the name again, then took out a bamboo strip, shaved it into a bamboo sword, and engraved the words \"Mo Hua\" on it.","With a heavy heart, he placed this bamboo sword on a Sword Tomb in front of him.","This particular Sword Tomb was quite special, with many bamboo swords stuck into it, each bearing the name of a cultivator.","These names are known only to him, and will be buried in the earth with him, utterly forgotten.","The bamboo sword engraved with \"Mo Hua\" was an ordinary bamboo sword, and placed at the end.","The long-bearded old man did this merely as a formality.","But the moment the bamboo sword was inserted into the Sword Tomb.","The Sword Qi in the Forbidden Land suddenly surged, and the broken swords buried within the Sword Tomb let out a low hum.","An ancient Sword Intent seemed to awaken, transforming into wisps of white smoke, rising from the withered-grave Sword Tombs, intertwining into a magnificent sword cloud.","Patriarch Dugu’s pupils contracted sharply, momentarily forgetting to breathe.","For the first time in hundreds of years, a strand of unbelievable shock stirred within his placid heart."]},{"number":1700,"title":"Chapter 1700 - 871: Expectations","paragraphs":["In the days that followed, Mo Hua was somewhat absent-minded.","The experiences in the Sword Tomb were still vividly etched in his memory.","The pitch-black night, the desolate grave, the scattered broken swords, the terrifying ancestor—all these bits and pieces often resurfaced in his mind.","Of course, most importantly, the enigmatic Ancestor of the Forbidden Land had promised to teach him the True Sword Art of Divine Thought!","Yet, within Mo Hua’s heart, there was some unease.","He wasn’t sure whether the ancestor would truly fulfill the promise to teach him the Divine Thought Sword Skill.","\"Could this ancestor be deceiving me?\"","\"Probably not...\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"He’s an ancestor, at the Heaven Void Realm, why would he have the leisure to trick a mere Foundation Establishment disciple for amusement...\"","\"But what if this ancestor reneges on his word...\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","Divine Thought Sword Transformation was close at hand.","Yet it seemed as distant as the horizon, elusive and uncertain.","In the following days, Mo Hua lived with a mindset of wavering gain and loss.","Until seven days later.","Mo Hua, dressed neatly, sat upright in the Disciple’s Residence, waiting for the ancestor to \"fetch\" him.","But he waited and waited, yet the anticipated void rift still didn’t appear.","Mo Hua felt a little restless.","Nonetheless, it was still early, so he held his temper and continued to wait.","Finally, approaching midnight, a terrifying wave suddenly came.","The void was torn apart from thin air.","A space fissure appeared, from which a dry, emaciated large hand reached out.","Mo Hua, more experienced this time, was not nervous but obediently let the large hand grasp him and pull him into the void rift.","The surroundings were dark yet brilliant, the void continually creating and annihilating, laws colorful and magnificent.","Upon opening his eyes, the night was as dark as ink, with the bright moon hanging high, the surroundings filled with desolate graves and scattered broken swords, the woods black and tranquil.","This was precisely the Back Hill Forbidden Area.","And the Tai Xu Ancestor, sealed by numerous formations and chains, sat alone in the mountains.","Mo Hua breathed a sigh of relief.","It seemed this powerful ancestor had kept his word; he really was going to teach him Divine Thought Sword Transformation.","The long-bearded elder silently watched Mo Hua, once again recalling the scene seven days before, the bamboo sword engraved with \"Mo Hua\" returning to the tomb, the Sword Qi surging, the broken swords humming, ancient Sword Intent awakening, white smoke rising within the tomb, and the remarkable phenomenon of a sword cloud forming.","\"Was the cause of the sword tomb’s smoke...this little kid?\"","The long-bearded elder’s gaze was stern.","Why?","This indicated...the inheritance of the True Sword Art of Divine Thought should indeed rest upon this child.","Is this a sign of the revival of Divine Thought Sword Dao in our Taixu Gate?","Mo Hua greeted the elder, saying, \"Greetings to the ancestor.\"","The long-bearded elder slowly spoke, \"My surname is Dugu.\"","Mo Hua, taken aback, hurriedly cupped his hands, \"Greetings to Patriarch Dugu.\"","The elder nodded slightly, \"From today onwards, I will pass to you this technique, which has been classified as a ’Forbidden Technique’, the Tai Xu Gate’s secret transmission...the True Sword Technique of Divine Thought Transformation!\"","Mo Hua’s spirit was invigorated, he cupped his hands in deep respect, saying:","\"Disciple thanks the ancestor for the grace of imparting the Dao.\"","Patriarch Dugu nodded solemnly, directly speaking:","\"Taixu Divine Thought Sword Transformation, begins with the sword and ends with the divine.\"","\"Refine Qi with the sword, nurture the heart with Qi, enter the soul with the heart, refine the divine with the soul, emerge the divine, and transform Divine Thought into Sword Intent, only then can you execute the killing.\"","\"When accomplished, sword, Qi, and divine become one entity, flesh, Spiritual Power, Divine Thought—none is uncuttable, Evil Demon, monster kind, ghosts—none is unkillable...\"","...","None is uncuttable, none is unkillable...","Mo Hua’s heart trembled.","This Sword Technique seemed much stronger than he had previously imagined.","\"Did you understand?\" questioned Patriarch Dugu.","Mo Hua nodded.","He memorized Patriarch Dugu’s words deep in his heart, then reflected upon his own understanding of Divine Thought Sword Transformation, pondered for a moment, and slowly spoke:","\"Ancestor, what you just mentioned about the method in Divine Thought Sword Transformation between ’refining Qi with the sword,’ refers to learning swordsmanship and condensing Sword Qi, right?\"","\"’Nurturing the heart with Qi’ means that after practicing the sword for a long time, and the Sword Qi is well-honed, through ceaseless tempering, naturally, the heart will also contain the sword, and this is nurturing the Sword Heart;\"","\"And ’enter the soul with the heart’ implies turning your Sword Dao into Heart Image and merging it with your Divine Soul...\"","Just like the Gui Water Sect’s method of cultivating the Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil, where a ’Penalty Prison Map’ is used as the Heart Image, incorporating it into the Divine Soul, thus enabling the cultivation of Pupil Skills that can intimidate the minds of others.","\"Merging Heart Image into Divine Soul is ’refine the divine with the soul’. \"","\"If you want to unleash the power of Divine Thought Sword Transformation, you naturally need to ’emerge the divine’, transforming Divine Thought into Sword Intent...\"","Mo Hua spoke with clarity and coherence.","Patriarch Dugu was amazed.","This child’s understanding of the Path of the Divine Soul, especially his grasp of converting Sword Qi into Sword Intent, was so transparent, it was almost self-evident...","Yet he couldn’t help but feel a little suspicious, asking Mo Hua: \"Have you learned this before...?\"","Mo Hua’s heart slightly flinched, and he immediately shook his head, saying: \"No!\"","Mo Hua’s mind slightly stirred, he continued, \"Disciple has merely studied the Path of Divine Sense extensively, asked around about it before, pondered on his own, hence he has a rough understanding of the basic principles of Divine Thought Sword Transformation...\"","Patriarch Dugu neither affirmed nor questioned further.","\"Since you could understand, it puts my mind at ease. You are walking the road of Divine Sense Proving the Dao, thus learning to convert Sword Qi into Sword Intent, and even eventually emerge the divine should be relatively easier.\"","\"Emerging the divine is a bit challenging, yet Divine Soul emergence is not something you can learn now, it awaits the Golden Core stage...\"","Mo Hua actually wanted to say, he could already perform the Soul Emergence, but upon reflection, realizing that his method of Divine Soul emergence is still rather superficial, it might not be deemed worthy by someone of the ancestor’s level, he chose not to disclose it, lest he appear ridiculous."]}]);
